window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS=(window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2401,"title":"Chapter 2401: Corpse Mountain","paragraphs":["\"You know where we can find the Abyssal Council?\" Yuan looked at Supreme Ruler Dena with a raised eyebrow, wondering what sort of connection she had with this shady organization.","\"I had a run-in with them before,\" she said, almost as if she could read his mind. \"However, I don’t know if they’ll still be at the same place.\"","\"We’ll know once we get there,\" said Yuan. \"Where can we go to find them?\"","\"Corpse Mountain,\" she said.","\"Oh?\" Yuan was familiar with this location, but he’d never personally visited it before.","\"I wanted to visit that place in the past but never got the chance,\" he remarked.","\"Corpse Mountain, huh? Fortunately it’s not far.\" Lev sighed. \"But it’s as dangerous as the Deprived Crimson Valley since the Forsaken like to hide there.\"","Yuan knew this. When Tian Chenyu had visited last time he’d heard that many Forsaken favored the mountain’s vast, treacherous terrain that made it easier for them to remain hidden, and he had planned to visit to hunt them. But alas, he never got the chance.","\"Let’s go.\"","Yuan and his group left the city shortly after and began their journey to the Corpse Mountain.","Meanwhile, a large group of demons gathered at the Demise Ravine.","\"The Supreme Ruler was right! There are signs of her power being used here! That woman has really escaped the Deprived Crimson Valley!\"","\"Oh my god... to think that crazy bitch is out of the Deprived Crimson Valley again... this is a total nightmare.\"","Suddenly, these demons felt a powerful presence descending on them, and it was none other than the Queen Wraith of Demise.","\"What are the Supreme Ruler’s lackeys doing in my territory?\" Queen Wraith of Demise questioned them with an army of Nether Wraiths by her side.","\"Queen Wraith of Demise! We are not here to cause trouble! We are here under the Supreme Ruler’s command to investigate a certain individual, and I am certain that you have information that will help us!\"","\"And how are you so certain that I have such information?\" Queen Wraith of Demise inquired.","\"As the ruler of this land, there’s no way you wouldn’t notice someone causing such a disturbance here! Please help us! We just want to know about the individual who was here!\"","The Queen Wraith of Demise sneered, \"Let’s say I have such information. Why the hell should I help you? I have no obligation to assist the Supreme Ruler, either.\"","\"Of course, we’re not asking you to help for free. If you help us, the Supreme Ruler will definitely reward you handsomely.\"","The Queen Wraith of Demise fell silent for a minute before responding, \"If I recall correctly, the Supreme Ruler has a certain treasure in his possession called the Spectral Jewel. If he gives me that treasure, I’ll tell you everything I know.\"","\"That... we will relay your demands to the Supreme Ruler.\"","Some time later...","\"Queen Wraith of Demise, the Supreme Ruler has agreed to your demands! If you tell us everything you know, he’ll give you the Spectral Jewel! However, your information must actually be helpful and real!\"","\"In that case, ask away. I’ll answer to the best of my knowledge,\" she said.","\"Did a petite woman about this height with crimson hair and eyes appear here in the last few years?\"","\"Yes, there was someone like that.\"","The group of demons trembled after hearing the Queen Wraith of Demise confirm Supreme Ruler Dena’s presence. Even though they were already certain that she’d escaped the Deprived Crimson Valley, having it confirmed was a different story.","\"Was... she alone? Or did she have company?\"","\"There were two other individuals with her.\"","\"Can you describe them?\"","The Queen Wraith of Demise proceeded to describe Lev and Yuan’s appearance.","\"She’s being followed by two first-level False Gods?\" The demons were puzzled by this information.","\"That’s not correct,\" the Queen Wraith of Demise suddenly said. \"From how I saw it, she was the one following them—or more precisely, that noble-looking one.\"","\"That woman following someone? That doesn’t sound right at all. You must’ve been mistaken.\"","The Queen Wraith of Demise didn’t say anything else and allowed them to believe whatever they wanted.","\"Is there anything else you can tell us about these two people with her? Tell us everything you know about them.\"","\"There was nothing notable about the red-skinned one. He was a coward and a weakling. The other one, however...\" The Queen Wraith of Demise shuddered just recalling Yuan’s prowess.","\"I don’t know why you’re looking for them, but I wouldn’t mess with that man if I were you.\"","The demons were bewildered at the Queen Wraith of Demise’s random remark, as it sounded like she was fearful of this individual.","The Queen Wraith of Demise continued to reveal some information on Yuan without going into depth or telling them everything, only doing the bare minimum.","\"Anyway, that’s all I know about them.\"","\"One last thing. Which direction did they go?\"","\"Towards the Bloody Expanse.\"","\"Thank you, Queen Wraith of Demise. We will have the Spectral Jewel delivered to you as soon as possible once we verify your information.\"","The group of demons left the Demise Ravine shortly after and chased after their lead.","A few months later, Yuan and his group arrived at Corpse Mountain.","Despite its ominous name, the place was not formed from actual corpses. Rather, the mountains bore grotesque, unnatural shapes that, from a distance, resembled piles of bodies heaped upon one another.","Their surfaces were a pale, bone-like white, while their peaks were stained a deep crimson, giving the chilling impression that they had been drenched in fresh blood.","\"This is actually my first time coming here, too,\" Lev commented.","Yuan then asked Supreme Ruler Dena, \"So, how do we find these people now?\"","\"Follow me.\"","Without any explanation, Supreme Ruler Dena entered the region. Yuan and Lev quickly followed.","The moment they entered the Corpse Mountain territory, Yuan could sense several gazes watching them from afar."]},{"number":2402,"title":"Chapter 2402: Abyssal Council","paragraphs":["\"We’re being watched already? We just entered...\" Lev shook his head when he sensed the gazes as well.","\"Let them watch,\" said Yuan. \"We won’t have a problem unless they attack us.\"","A few days later, they were attacked for the first time. Unsurprisingly, it was a Forsaken, one at the 7th level False God.","\"Devour.\"","Yuan wasted no time retrieving the Demon Devouring Sword and feeding the Forsaken to it.","\"That sword’s ability terrifies me no matter how many times I see it,\" Lev commented as his body trembled. \"Where the hell did you acquire that sword, anyway?\"","\"This used to be an ordinary sword, but after being soaked in demon blood for so long, it evolved into a treasure.\"","\"What? Is such a thing possible? We barely use weapons, so I had no idea.\"","He also wanted to ask how many demons Yuan killed in order for the sword to transform, but he was too afraid to do so and decided against it.","After traveling for another two days without any incident, Yuan and his group were suddenly ambushed by a group of eight Forsakens.","\"How foolish of you to enter this domain with your puny cultivation!\"","\"Three first-level False Gods? Talk about a free meal!\"","\"Hahaha! That woman is mine!\"","Supreme Ruler Dena had suppressed her cultivation to the first-level False God, so the Forsaken were unaware of her true cultivation, not that it really mattered in any way.","Yuan retrieved the Demon Devouring Sword, but before he could make a move, Supreme Ruler Dena spoke, \"Let me handle them.\"","In the next instant, her hair lashed out with terrifying speed, piercing through every demon like a volley of spears in the blink of an eye.","Though caught off guard by her sudden assault, the demons showed no signs of panic.","However, in the very next moment, their bodies began to contort and coil unnaturally, as though being drawn in—being devoured by Supreme Ruler Dena’s hair.","\"W-What is this?!\"","\"She’s devouring us!\"","The demons struggled and tried to cut her hair, but their efforts were futile. Within mere seconds, their bodies withered, shriveling into wrinkled husks, as though all their blood and bones had been drained from them, looking like dried raisins.","Lev swallowed nervously at their horrific state. It was also at this moment that he recalled Supreme Ruler Dena’s second name—Crimson Goddess of Gluttony.","\"Ugh. Disgusting.\" Supreme Ruler Dena stuck her tongue out and complained with a deep frown on her face, looking like someone who accidentally ate rotten food.","\"I need some of your blood to cleanse this bad taste in my mouth,\" she turned to Yuan and said, her eyes glistening with anticipation.","Yuan had a faint suspicion that this had been her intention all along, but he chose to play along nonetheless and fed her some of his blood.","\"I’ll take care of the trash from now on. You need to reserve your strength for when we really need it,\" he then said.","\"That took as much effort as breathing,\" she replied with a shrug.","\"You can keep killing them if you want, but don’t expect me to feed you blood every time.\"","\"...Fine, you can take care of them.\"","A few weeks later, Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly came to a halt.","\"We’ve arrived,\" she said.","She pointed toward a concealed valley nestled between two mountains and continued, \"They should be there.\"","\"I don’t sense any presence,\" Lev remarked.","\"That’s because there’s a powerful concealment formation enveloping that entire area,\" Yuan said.","He turned to Supreme Ruler Dena and asked, \"How should we approach them?\"","\"They’re an annoying bunch that will try to intimidate you at any opportunity. However, they’re also prone to it. In simpler terms, just act like you own the place and they’ll listen.\"","\"Sounds simple enough.\" A cold smile tugged at Yuan’s lips.","\"I’ll lead the way.\"","In the next moment, Yuan shot forward, flying straight toward the concealed area and entering the formation without a hint of hesitation.","The instant he passed through it, the illusion unraveled, revealing rows of towering structures that seemed to materialize out of thin air before his eyes.","Then, he unleashed both his Chaotic Essence and Demon Sealing Aura, their oppressive might sweeping across the entire valley like a storm.","Almost instantly, hundreds of silhouettes poured out from the buildings, converging toward him, and within moments, Yuan found himself completely surrounded.","\"Who the fuck are you?! And what are you trying to pull with such an offensive announcement?!\"","Yuan looked at the demon who just spoke and said in a cold voice, \"My identity does not matter. All you need to know is that I am here to buy information.\"","\"Then you can screw right off! We don’t do business with—\"","Before the demon could even finish his sentence, Yuan appeared before him like a ghost, his movement imperceptible.","In the next instant, he seized the demon by the throat and infused just enough Demon Sealing Aura into his body to seal half of his body.","\"My hearing hasn’t been the best lately, so can you repeat that?\" Yuan said, exuding real killing intent.","\"T-That power! He’s a Sealer?!\"","\"What?! That’s impossible! They were all executed long ago!\"","Some of the demons there recognized Yuan’s power and exclaimed, alerting the others.","\"So what if he’s a Sealer?! He dared to attack us, the Abyssal Council! Let’s get him!\"","\"That’s right! There’s no way he can handle all of us! He’s just a first-level False God, too!\"","Just as some of the demons prepared to attack, a loud voice boomed, echoing throughout the entire valley.","\"Enough! None of you will move a single muscle from this point forth, unless you want to die!\"","The next moment, a lone figure emerged from one of the buildings and flew toward Yuan, stopping just before him.","Yuan narrowed his eyes at the newcomer. He was a tall man with short white hair, bearing no visible demonic traits and appearing entirely human.","The demon then spoke in a somewhat nervous voice, \"You... Does your name, by any chance, start with ’Tian’?\""]},{"number":2403,"title":"Chapter 2403: Crimson City’s Massacre","paragraphs":["Hearing the white-haired demon’s question, Yuan raised an eyebrow and spoke with an amused smile on his face, \"Oh? You recognize me?\"","The next second, he removed his disguise, revealing his true appearance.","Several gasps of shock could be heard throughout the group of demons there. It clearly wasn’t just the white-haired demon that recognized Yuan.","\"Heavens! Tian—!\" The white-haired demons exclaimed in shock, his entire being trembling in disbelief, but he hastily covered his mouth before he could finish Tian Chenyu’s name for some reason.","\"How do you know me?\" Yuan removed the seal and released the demon in his grasp before asking.","A nervous smile appeared on the white-haired demon’s face as he responded in a somewhat hesitant voice, \"I... I was at the Crimson City’s Massacre. In fact, I was nearly killed there.\"","\"Cimson City’s Massacre?\" Yuan mumbled, finding this term to be quite familiar but couldn’t pinpoint where he’d heard it.","\"That’s the day you first appeared in our world and started massacring everyone without mercy like a madman,\" Supreme Ruler Dena’s voice resounded as she and Lev finally made an appearance.","\"Oh, right.\" Yuan muttered with a stiff smile on his face.","The massacre had occurred in the Crimson City, one of the largest and most populated areas in the Demonic Realm, and Tian Chenyu had caused so much destruction that the entire city was dyed in blood and reduced to ruin by the end.","Yuan looked at the white-haired demon and said, \"So I almost killed you back then, huh?\"","\"It’s not just him! A lot of us were there that day!\" Someone in the crowd suddenly remarked.","\"Let’s not reminisce about the past, unless you want to take revenge or something,\" Yuan’s gaze shifted to the demon who just spoke, causing their body to shake in terror.","\"No, we don’t want to fight you.\" The white-haired demon hastily said. \"It happened long ago, and you had a fair reason behind your actions...\"","He took a deep breath before continuing, \"Please, follow me. I’ll tell you whatever you want to know.\"","Yuan nodded and followed the white-haired demon to one of the buildings in the distance.","As they traveled, Yuan asked, \"How did you know it was me?\"","\"It was a guess based on how powerful your Demon Sealing Aura was, as well as the fact that every other Sealer should be dead by now.\"","\"...Why are they dead?\" Yuan asked with a slight frown.","\"They were hunted, of course.\"","\"By whom?\"","\"The previous Supreme Ruler.\"","\"I see...\"","Yuan fell silent.","Though Tian Chenyu had never formed any deep attachment to the Demon Sealers, having taught them on a mere whim to test whether demons could wield Demon Sealing Aura, it still left a faint bitterness in his heart to learn they had been hunted to extinction.","As for the results of his experiment, a small number of demons had indeed managed to wield Demon Sealing Aura, albeit only in trace amounts, comparable to a human who had just begun learning it. Moreover, only those demons whose appearance closely resembled humans—those of so-called noble bloodlines—were capable of using it at all.","Once they were inside the building and seated in a private room, the white-haired demon spoke, \"What information are you looking for?\"","\"Everything you know about Dena—Supreme Ruler Dena’s situation.\"","\"?!?!\"","The white-haired demon’s eyes widened with bewilderment when Yuan uttered Supreme Ruler Dena’s name aloud without hesitation.","He jumped from his seat and used his divine sense to look at the sky, as if he was anticipating the Demon God’s Wrath to strike them soon.","\"Relax, the rules of this world have no effect on me, who is from another world.\" Yuan calmly said to him.","\"So the Demon God’s Wrath... won’t appear?\" The white-haired demon swallowed nervously.","\"Not for me.\"","\"I see...\" The white-haired demon muttered as he took a seat again.","\"Oh, by the way, I forgot to introduce myself. I am the Grand Abyssal Elder, the current head of this organization.\"","\"You may know me as Tian Chenyu, but you can call me Yuan now. That way, you won’t invoke Dremon God’s Wrath by saying my name,\" Yuan said.","\"I understand, Yuan.\" The Grand Abyssal Elder nodded.","\"Now, regarding... ’her’. What is it specifically that you want to know? I don’t know where to begin.\"","\"Let’s start with why she was removed from her position and exiled to the Deprived Crimson Valley.\"","\"So we’re starting with the most difficult ones, huh?\" said Grand Abyssal Elder with a bitter smile on his face.","He fell silent to ponder for a moment before responding, \"Let’s begin with who exiled her to the Deprived Crimson Valley. It was the 10th Supreme Ruler, so the one who replaced her.\"","\"As for why...\"","The Grand Abyssal Elder fell silent again, looking like he was hesitant to continue. He knew that Tian Chenyu and Supreme Ruler Dena had a good relationship, so he was worried that the information might not be something he’d want to hear.","\"Just tell me. I can handle it.\" Yuan said, almost as if he knew what the Grand Abyssal Elder was thinking.","\"I understand.\"","The Grand Abyssal Elder took a deep breath before revealing in a grim voice, \"That woman... she was exiled because she devoured every living being in the City of Blood...\"","\"WHAT?!\"","Both Yuan and Supreme Ruler Dena exclaimed in shock after hearing this.","The City of Blood was the largest and most populated city in the entire Demonic Realm, where tens of billions of demons lived. Moreover, it was also where the main headquarters for the Supreme Ruler was located.","If Supreme Ruler Dena had truly devoured everyone there, that meant she’d killed tens of billions of demons, a crime worthy of execution. Yet, she was merely exiled to the Deprived Crimson Valley because she was too powerful to be killed.","\"She devoured everyone in the City of Blood...? That’s...\" Yuan’s gaze shifted to look at Supreme Ruler Dena, who stood behind him with a dazed expression on her face."]},{"number":2404,"title":"Chapter 2404: Devouring the City of Blood","paragraphs":["\"I... devoured everyone in the City of Blood...?\" Supreme Ruler Dena muttered in a voice of disbelief.","\"Hmm?\" Grand Abyssal Elder raised his eyebrows after hearing her mumbling.","Since Supreme Ruler Dena was still in her disguise, he had no way of knowing of her true identity.","Seeing how depressed she looked, Yuan placed a hand on her head and said, \"I’m sure there’s a good explanation for it. Like it was caused by that curse. So, you don’t need to feel too guilty about it.\"","\"But it won’t change the fact that I devoured them...\" she sighed.","\"Wait... what are you two...?\"","Yuan looked at the Grand Abyssal Elder and revealed, \"Oh, I forgot to mention. She’s Supreme Ruler Dena.\"","\"She’s—?!\"","The Grand Abyssal Elder jumped from his seat again and kissed the wall with his back.","Seeing his reaction, Yuan smiled and assured him, \"Don’t worry, she won’t devour you.\"","\"...\"","The Grand Abyssal Elder’s mouth was agape with shock and disbelief. He couldn’t believe that two of the worst murders in history were currently inside his room at this moment.","His gaze shifted to Lev, silently wondering about his identity.","Noticing that the Grand Abyssal Elder’s gaze on him, Lev smiled and said, \"You don’t have to worry. I am just a nobody.\"","Of course, his reassurance didn’t calm the Grand Abyssal Elder even in the slightest.","Yuan then asked, \"When did it happen? When did she devour the entire city?\"","\"It happened shortly after she returned from her trip to the Boundless Expanse.\" Grand Abyssal Elder said.","\"So it happened after she devoured the Eternal...\" Yuan rubbed his eyes and sighed.","The Grand Abyssal Elder continued, his tone growing more solemn, \"When she returned from her trip, a troubling rumor began to spread. They said something had changed within her—that she was barely responsive, often lost in a daze.\"","\"Once the rumor became widespread, people began to worry that she might have turned into a Forsaken.\"","\"Then, a few years later, the entire population of the City of Blood vanished overnight, with ’her’ being the only presence left. With that, people could only come to a single conclusion—that she’d devoured everyone.\"","Yuan raised his eyebrows at this new information and said, \"Wait... so nobody actually witnessed Dena devouring the people?\"","The Grand Abyssal Elder shook his head.","\"No, but there is no other logical explanation for why everyone in the city vanished, as only she had the capability to erase such a massive population overnight without anyone noticing.\"","Yuan fell silent to ponder.","Since Supreme Ruler Dena had been under the curse’s influence—unconsciously devouring demons within the Deprived Crimson Valley—it wouldn’t be far-fetched to assume she had done the same to the people of the City of Blood.","However, something about the situation didn’t sit right with Yuan.","’If she had only just returned after consuming the Eternal, would it have truly developed into a curse so quickly—enough for her to devour an entire city?’","’No... the Eternal didn’t become a curse until after she was exiled to the Deprived Crimson Valley. So that likely wasn’t the cause.’","’In that case... what could have driven Dena to devour an entire city... assuming she was even responsible to begin with?’","’Moreover, if the curse was really responsible, nobody would’ve been able to stop it, much less toss her into the Deprived Crimson Valley.’ Yuan pondered inwardly.","After all, he was only able to wake up Supreme Ruler Dena because he wielded Eternal Essence. Had it been anyone else, they would’ve been devoured long before they could even get close to her.","The more he thought about it, the less convinced he was that Supreme Ruler Dena was responsible for the disappearance of the people of the City of Blood.","\"I don’t believe Dena is responsible,\" he announced some time later.","\"Based on what evidence?\" Grand Abyssal Elder inquired with intrigue.","\"I have no evidence, just as there’s no solid evidence that Dena is responsible. It’s my gut feeling,\" he calmly replied.","\"I’m glad you trust me so much, but it won’t change the fact that everyone in the City of Blood had vanished without a trace, and I don’t have any recollection of anything that happened after I consumed that crystal,\" Supreme Ruler Dena sighed. \"Most importantly, the people of this world believe that I have done it.\"","\"...\"","Yuan then asked the Grand Abyssal Elder, \"Do you have any more information on the subject? Any detail related is fine, too.\"","\"Hmm... give me a moment to think about it.\"","A minute later, the Grand Abyssal Elder said, \"Well, the one who discovered the incident first was the Supreme Adviser at the time, who also became the 10th Supreme Ruler after replacing her.\"","\"The Supreme Adviser?\" Yuan mumbled.","The Supreme Adviser was a position that was only below Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"He was also the first to accuse her of devouring the people of the city.\" the Grand Abyssal Elder added.","Yuan glanced at Supreme Ruler Dena and said, \"I don’t remember much about the Supreme Adviser, but I do recall disliking him. He always struck me as... ambitious—and not in a good way.\"","\"Because he was,\" Supreme Ruler Dena replied calmly. \"He often spoke of surpassing me one day, even in my presence. Personally, I found it rather amusing.\"","Yuan turned to the Grand Abyssal Elder and asked, \"What became of the Supreme Adviser? Who succeeded him? And which generation of Supreme Ruler are we currently on?\"","\"The current Supreme Ruler is the 14th. As for the 10th Supreme Ruler... he actually disappeared after only just a few thousand years of being in power. Nobody knows where he went, nor have we heard or seen from him since then.\"","\"He disappeared?\" Yuan wore a suspicious expression on his face.","A few thousand years in the Demonic Realm was akin to a few months to humans in the Nine Heavens. For the Supreme Adviser to disappear so shortly after becoming the Supreme Ruler was simply too suspicious no matter how he looked at it."]},{"number":2405,"title":"Chapter 2405: Consuming the True Emperor of the Seas’ Blood Essence","paragraphs":["\"There’s a good chance the Supreme Adviser had something to do with the disappearance of the people in the City of Blood, even pinning the blame on you,\" Yuan said to Supreme Ruler Dena after pondering for a moment.","\"Even if that is true, what could he have done to the people? Where did they disappear to?\" she wondered out loud.","Yuan then asked the Grand Abyssal Elder, \"What’s the City of Blood like now?\"","\"Well, the population has recovered about thirty percent since then.\"","\"Only thirty percent?\" Yuan remarked, as it sounded a little low for how much time has passed since then.","\"Many are afraid of getting close to the City of Blood because they believe it might be cursed after what happened. They Moreover, the current Supreme Ruler actually prefers the lower population, so it’s also much harder to live there nowadays.\"","\"Speaking of the current Supreme Ruler, what kind of person are they?\" Yuan then asked.","\"The current Supreme Ruler is the son of the previous generation,\" the Grand Abyssal Elder began. \"Much like his father, he is a devout fanatic of the Demon God, and... well... how should I put this...?\"","He paused briefly before continuing, \"He is utterly obsessed with solving our food shortage... as well as our overpopulation.\"","\"What’s so bad about that? You made it sound like he was about to do something horrific,\" Yuan said, shaking his head.","\"There’s nothing wrong with wanting to solve such problems,\" the Grand Abyssal Elder replied, his tone turning grave. \"The issue lies in his solution, and it concerns you the most. He intends to make use of your world, which, according to him, is rich in both space and resources.\"","Yuan’s brows rose at those words.","\"The current Supreme Ruler... plans to invade my world?\" he muttered, stunned at this revelation.","\"Though he never stated it outright,\" the Grand Abyssal Elder said, \"the implication was unmistakable.\"","\"And what do the residents of this world think of his plan?\" Yuan asked.","\"Well, as with most things, there are those who oppose it,\" the Grand Abyssal Elder replied. \"However, I would say the majority welcome the idea. After all, many have grown weary of their current way of life and long for something better.\"","Yuan rubbed his eyes and let out a deep, weary sigh. His worst fear had finally come to pass.","Even back then, Tian Chenyu had foreseen that things would inevitably reach this point if left unresolved, which was why he had always intended to return one day and find a solution.","\"Don’t worry. Once I reclaim my position, I will ensure that no invasion takes place,\" Supreme Ruler Dena said.","\"Easier said than done,\" Yuan replied with a bitter smile.","\"Still... given your situation, and the current Supreme Ruler’s intentions, I suppose our next destination will be the City of Blood.\"","She nodded.","\"But before we head out, I will need some time to cultivate the Blood Essences I recently acquired. We might need to fight, so it’s best we prepare for it.\"","Yuan turned to look at the Grand Abyssal Elder and said, \"We’d like to stay here for a little longer if you don’t mind.\"","The Grand Abyssal Elder nodded and laughed, \"Even if you decided to stay here forever, who’d be able to stop you? I will prepare a suitable and quiet dwelling for you immediately. Wait here a little.\"","The Grand Abyssal Elder left the room for several minutes before returning.","\"Your living quarters are ready.\"","Yuan and his group followed the Grand Abyssal Elder to a small residential area only about ten minutes away.","\"There will only be the three of you living in this place, and I have warned the others not to approach this area, so there should be no disturbance at all. If you need anything, there will be someone stationed nearby.\"","\"Thanks for the hospitality. You’re not too bad for a group of hired assassins.\"","A stiff smile tugged at the Grand Abyssal Elder’s face as he spoke, \"We’re not limited to assassinations. In fact, it’s a minor part of our whole organization, and we specialize in information gathering.\"","Under normal circumstances, they would not extend hospitality to anyone—not even the Supreme Ruler, much less to this extent.","However, they were now dealing with someone they deemed even more terrifying than the Supreme Ruler—or at least, that was how they viewed Yuan, having witnessed firsthand just how horrifying he could be.","\"How long will you be in seclusion?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked Yuan once the Grand Abyssal Elder left them alone.","\"Hmm... hard to say since I have two drops of Blood Essence to absorb, but it probably won’t take longer than twenty years.\"","\"Then I will also use this time to really focus on my recovery.\"","Yuan nodded before turning to look at Lev.","\"You don’t have to worry about me. There’s really nothing for me to do, so I’ll just wait for you to be done. Hell, I’ll even stand guard to make sure nobody will disturb you two.\"","\"Alright. Then I’ll see you two later.\"","Yuan entered his living quarters and immediately prepared to consume the blood essences.","Since the True Emperor of the Seas was no doubt weaker than the Primal Sovereign of the Seas, Yuan decided to absorb its blood essence first, as it would prepare him for the next one.","Yuan stared at the True Emperor of the Seas’ blood essence and mumbled, \"I have finally avenged you guys...\"","The next moment, he poured the blood essence into his mouth, and it disappeared into his tongue.","<You have consumed True Emperor of the Seas’ Blood Essence>","The moment Yuan absorbed the True Emperor of the Seas’ Blood Essence, it felt as though he had been dragged into the deepest abyss of the ocean, engulfed in darkness, with crushing pressure bearing down on him from all sides, as if intent on compressing him into nothing more than a formless mass.","He could also feel the True Emperor of the Seas’ anguish and seething hatred in its final moments, like a lingering echo of its dying will, desperately clawing at him in a last attempt at vengeance.","\"If you couldn’t defeat me while alive, what makes you think you can affect me while being dead?! Scram!\"","In an instant, Yuan blew away the True Emperor of the Seas’ last effort and focused on absorbing its blood essence.","A year later—","<You have successfully refined the True Emperor of the Seas’ Blood Essence>","<Immortal Monarch’s Bloodline is reacting to the True Emperor of the Seas’ Blood Essence!>","<Immortal Monarch’s Bloodline evolution has progressed slightly!>","<You have acquired the power of the True Emperor of the Seas’ through its Blood Essence>","<Your Absolute Regeneration has evolved into Transcended Renewal>","<You have acquired the ability to breath in water>","<You have acquired the ability ’Perfect Water Manipulation’>","<You have acquired the ability ’Sea Emperor’>","Yuan slowly opened his eyes, and for a brief moment, his dark pupils churned like a violent maelstrom—deep and unfathomable, like a storm raging within a black sea.","\"So the True Emperor of the Seas’ had a Supreme-grade bloodline, huh? That made hunting it even more worth it!\" Yuan smiled at the results.","He was also pleasantly surprised that his Absolute Regeneration still had room for improvements, but he couldn’t fathom how much better his regeneration could have gotten when he could already regrow his entire body with ease.","Then there was his new ability Perfect Water Manipulation, which basically allowed him to control water as if it were part of his own body.","As for the ability ’Sea Emperor’, it was a passive skill that boosted his damage against sea creatures by a tremendous amount.","After taking a brief break, Yuan retrieved the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ Blood Essence and stared at it in silence.","Unlike the True Emperor of the Seas, he hadn’t yet grasped the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ prowess.","In fact, he had no idea who it could even be compared to.","’Is it near the Primordial Phoenix’s level, or perhaps similar to the Dragon God? No... there’s no way it could be near the Dragon God’s level...’","Although the Primal Sovereign of the Seas was definitely powerful, Yuan couldn’t imagine it being anywhere near as strong as the Dragon God, as it simply made no sense.","’A goldfish being at the level of the Dragon God? That would be hilarious.’ Yuan shook his head with a smile.","Yuan tempered his expectations, assuming the Blood Essence would be on par with the Primordial Phoenix’s, and took a deep breath before consuming it.","<You have absorbed the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ Blood Essence!>","The very next instant, his eyes widened in shock. \"Son of a—! That damn goldfish is even stronger than the Dragon God!\"","Completely caught off guard by the sheer disparity, Yuan hurriedly steadied himself, bracing for the unbearable pain he knew was about to follow."]},{"number":2406,"title":"Chapter 2406: Consuming the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ Blood Essence","paragraphs":["’Primal Sovereign of the Seas... just what the hell are you?!’ Yuan cried inwardly after realizing that its Blood Essence was even stronger than the Dragon God.","When he recalled how he nearly died from absorbing the Dragon God’s Blood Essence, only surviving because of Dragon Goddess Yeyou, Yuan prepared for a similar if not even worse experience.","Shortly after consuming the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ Blood Essence, Yuan once again found himself plunged into the abyss of the ocean.","Yet, despite the familiar sensation from when he had absorbed the True Emperor of the Seas’ Blood Essence, there was something fundamentally different about these waters—something far deeper, far more profound.","Moreover, instead of crushing him beneath unbearable pressure, Yuan was stunned to find the water gently embracing him. There was not a trace of pain, only a soothing warmth, as though he were being cradled within a soft, flowing blanket of liquid.","Suddenly, images began flashing within Yuan’s mind—fragments of memories that did not belong to him, but to the Primal Sovereign of the Seas.","Within those memories, Yuan witnessed the very beginning of the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ existence.","At the moment of its birth, it was no larger than a speck of dust, and standing before it loomed a colossal, beastly silhouette, its presence vast and incomprehensible... likely its creator.","Over the passage of millions of years, the Primal Sovereign of the Seas grew in both strength and size. Yet its form bore no resemblance to the one Yuan recognized.","Rather than a goldfish, it appeared as something amorphous and undefined—a shifting mass of colorless, formless substance, like a living sphere of translucent slime.","Eventually, the Primal Sovereign of the Seas encountered its first prey, and with it, felt the instinct to hunt for the very first time.","When it successfully claimed its prey, it also experienced something entirely new... the sensation of satisfaction, and the intoxicating thrill of delight.","After consuming its prey, the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ formless body began to shift, reshaping itself into the very form of the creature it had just devoured.","With this new appearance, it pursued its next hunt. The sensation of teeth tearing into flesh, the warmth of blood flooding its mouth—everything felt far more vivid, far more intoxicating than its first kill.","From that moment onward, the Primal Sovereign of the Seas hunted without end, relentlessly shifting its form into that of its prey, all in pursuit of ever greater sensation.","Eventually, it came to understand what it truly enjoyed—what brought it the greatest satisfaction—and thus settled upon a form that fulfilled those desires, becoming the figure Yuan had come to recognize.","’So it didn’t start its life as a goldfish...’ Yuan was somewhat disappointed to learn this. However, what truly surprised him was the beastly silhouette in the beginning of the memory.","’Was that... the Primal Monarch?’","Though not even Tian Yi had ever witnessed the Primal Monarch’s true form, Yuan somehow knew just from that memory that the being before it was none other than the Primal Monarch.","Does this mean the Primal Monarch had created the Primal Sovereign of the Seas? Would that make the Primal Sovereign of the Seas the Primal Monarch’s child? Is that why they bore similar names?","Yuan had a lot of questions but no answers.","<You have successfully refined the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ Blood Essence!>","Before he realized, Yuan had refined its blood essence without experiencing any pain, which was a first.","<Immortal Monarch’s Bloodline is reacting to the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ Blood Essence!>","<Immortal Monarch’s Bloodline evolution has progressed slightly!>","<You have acquired the power of the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ through its Blood Essence>","<Your ability ’Sea Emperor’ has evolved into ’Sovereign of the Sea’>","[Sovereign of the Sea]","[Rank: Celestial]","[Description: When you are in combat, your damage to sea creatures increases by 700,000%. When you are fighting in or surrounded by water, your overall combat prowess will increase by 300,000%]","<Your ability ’Perfect Water Manipulation’ has evolved into ’Absolute Water Manipulation>","[Absolute Water Manipulation]","[Rank: Celestial]","[Description: The highest level of Water Manipulation! The ocean and all water in this world is at your beckoning!]","<You have acquired the ability ’Water Tunnel’>","[Water Tunnel]","[Rank: Celestial]","[Description: Allows you to traverse between seas that you have visited(after acquiring this ability), regardless of their distance.]","’Water Tunnel? So I can traverse between worlds through the sea like the Primal Sovereign of the Seas?’ Yuan was pleasantly surprised to acquire this ability, as this essentially allowed him to traverse anywhere at will.","However, since it only worked with places he’d been to after acquiring the ability, this meant that he wouldn’t be able to return to the Nine Heavens or the Primal Expanse until he visited those places again.","Regardless, Yuan was delighted to have this ability due to its conveniences in the future.","<You have acquired ’Mark of the Seas’>","’Mark of the Seas? What is that?’ Yuan raised an eyebrow at this notification.","Since the system showed no details of it, Yuan had no idea what it was or its purpose.","Afterward, Yuan contemplated whether he should absorb the True Emperor of the Seas’ Monster Core, but after some consideration, decided to wait to see if there were some other uses since he wasn’t in a hurry to increase his cultivation.","Some time later, Yuan decided to end his seclusion there and went outside.","\"How long have I been in seclusion?\" Yuan asked Lev, who was sitting outside like a statue.","\"A hundred twenty years,\" Lev responded.","\"That took a hundred twenty years?!\" Yuan exclaimed with a shocked face, as it only felt like a few hours had passed since he started.","\"What about Dena?\" he then asked.","\"She emerged from her seclusion earlier, but seeing that you weren’t done, she decided to continue. She also said to wake her up once you are finished.\"","\"I see. Then let’s wake her up now.\""]},{"number":2407,"title":"Chapter 2407: Execution Squads","paragraphs":["Yuan approached Supreme Ruler Dena’s building and loudly knocked on it.","\"Hey, Dena, I am done with my seclusion.\"","A few moments later, the door opened, and Supreme Ruler Dena stepped outside with a nonchalant look on her face.","\"Less than twenty years, huh?\" she mumbled in a low voice.","A stiff smile tugged at Yuan’s lips as he said, \"I underestimated the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ Blood Essence. Sorry.\"","Although a hundred years was nothing to demons, especially one as ancient as Supreme Ruler Dena, Yuan felt bad making them wait so long.","\"How is your recovery, by the way?\" Yuan then asked her.","\"I recovered about 5 percent of my strength, I guess,\" she calmly replied.","\"...\"","Although five percent might seem insignificant given the time that had passed, one had to remember just how powerful Supreme Ruler Dena truly was, because even a mere five percent of her strength was enough to utterly dominate multiple True Gods at once.","\"What about you? Are you satisfied with your cultivation?\" Supreme Ruler Dena then asked him.","Yuan nodded, \"Yes.\"","\"Or do you want to consume some of my blood before we head to the City of Blood?\" she continued.","Yuan raised an eyebrow, as he’d forgotten about her offer.","\"I don’t even know if I will benefit from absorbing your blood since I am not a demon. I have tried demon blood before out of curiosity, but nothing happened. A demon’s core, on the other hand... not that I am asking for yours.\"","\"My blood is different from your ordinary demon’s blood. You won’t know what effects it will have on you until you try it.\"","\"In that case...\"","However, before Yuan could finish his sentence, he suddenly noticed a presence quickly approaching their location.","Soon, this presence revealed himself to be the Grand Abyssal Elder.","\"We have a situation!\" the Grand Abyssal Elder shouted before he could even land.","\"What happened?\" Yuan asked.","\"We’re surrounded!\"","\"Surrounded?\" Yuan repeated with a raised eyebrow.","Then, he spread his divine sense until he could see a large group of demons surrounding their valley, all of them being True Gods.","\"Who are they?\" Yuan asked, narrowing his eyes. \"Their attire... it looks somewhat familiar.\"","This time, it was Supreme Ruler Dena who answered instead of the Grand Abyssal Elder.","\"The Elite Execution Squad and the Special Execution Squad,\" she said. \"They are specialized enforcers tasked with handling the most extreme cases—situations beyond the capability of ordinary forces. And they answer only to the Supreme Ruler.\"","\"Is that so? I guess the current Supreme Ruler sent them here after learning of your escape from the Deprived Crimson Valley,\" Yuan said with a calm smile.","\"What should we do?\" she asked.","Yuan looked at the Grand Abyssal Elder and asked, \"I should’ve probably asked earlier, but did they say what they wanted? There’s a slight chance that they aren’t here for us.\"","However, the Grand Abyssal Elder shook his head and said, \"No, they are definitely here for you. They first inquired about your group, and when we denied any knowledge, they immediately surrounded us without a word.\"","\"What do you think?\" Yuan asked Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"They know they can’t defeat me, so they’re probably going to try and stall for time until the current Supreme Ruler shows up.\"","\"Oh? So the Supreme Ruler will show up without needing us to travel to the City of Blood? How convenient,\" Yuan smiled.","\"What do you want to do? Wait for him to show up, or leave this place before he arrives?\" she then asked.","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"Let’s have a chat with this special squad.\"","The next moment, he flew out of the valley to confront the Execution Squads.","When the Execution Squads initially saw Yuan, they didn’t think much of him and thought he was from the Abyssal Council. However, their expressions and attitude changed when Yuan asked them, \"So, how did you figure out Supreme Ruler Dena was here?\"","\"?!?!?!\"","Their eyes widened in disbelief the moment Yuan uttered Supreme Ruler Dena’s name so casually. They froze in place, as though their minds refused to process what they had just heard. Then, realization struck.","Without hesitation, they distanced themselves from him, panic flashing across their faces as they anticipated the Demon God’s Wrath.","\"This lunatic! He’s trying to drag us down with him!\"","The Execution Squad members fled as though their lives depended on it despite being True Gods.","Yet, after putting a great distance between themselves and Yuan, and as time passed with no sign of divine retribution, confusion began to set in.","\"Huh? Where’s the Demon God’s Wrath?\"","They looked toward the still sky with raised eyebrows.","Meanwhile, Yuan continued to mess with them and shouted loudly, \"DID YOU NOT HEAR ME? I ASKED HOW YOU KNEW SUPREME RULER DENA WAS HERE! SUPREME RULER DENA, I SAID!\"","\"This crazy son of a bitch!\"","The Execution Squads distanced themselves from Yuan even more.","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"What the hell is going on?! Where is the Demon God’s Wrath?! Why isn’t it striking him down?!\"","Seeing this puzzling situation, the demons felt an urge to say Supreme Ruler Dena’s name to see if something was wrong with their law.","\"Supreme Ruler Dena! Supreme Ruler Dena! Supreme Ruler Dena!!!\" Yuan started repeating her name over and over again like a broken recorder.","Eventually, one of the demons from the Execution Squad could no longer contain their curiosity and uttered her name.","\"Supreme Ruler Dena...?\"","The demon felt a wave of excitement course through his body from uttering a forbidden word, feeling like a child who’d purposefully done something mischievous.","However, that excitement vanished the next moment when the sky above him began to twist.","\"D-Demon God’s Wrath?!\"","\"What the hell?! Why did it activate for me but not that bastard?!\" The demon exclaimed in disbelief.","The demon wanted to complain more, but it had no time, as the Demon God’s Wrath struck the next second, instantly vaporizing it."]},{"number":2408,"title":"Chapter 2408: Execution Squads(2)","paragraphs":["\"Bree! That bastard killed Bree!\"","After a stunned silence, the demons of the Execution Squad erupted into anguished cries for their fallen comrade, directing their grief and fury toward Yuan, despite the fact that Bree’s death had ultimately been brought about by his own reckless curiosity.","They quickly flew toward Yuan and surrounded him.","\"I don’t care who you are, but you will pay for killing our comrade!\" one of them shouted at him.","Yuan raised an eyebrow and replied, \"How was his death my fault? It’s not like I forced him to speak or anything like that.\"","\"Bastard! It’s because you kept shouting Supreme Ruler Dena that caused—\"","The demon hastily covered his mouth when he realized his own mistake, but alas, it was already too late.","The sky above the demon swirled, and the Demon God’s Wrath fell shortly after, instantly vaporizing it.","The demons around that individual scrambled away in the last second, barely avoiding the Demon God’s Wrath.","\"J-Jean!\"","The demons cried out once more, but this time their expressions were filled with disbelief rather than grief, as it was clear that the demon’s fate had been sealed by his own careless words.","\"You’re not going to blame that one on me too, right?\" Yuan remarked.","The demons immediately snapped their heads to glare at him with intense killing intent exuding from them.","They had no idea who Yuan was or why the Demon God’s Wrath wasn’t affecting him, but it was clear that he’d indirectly caused the death of two of their comrades.","Seeing the way they glared at him, like a pot on the verge of boiling over, Yuan spoke again, utterly unfazed, \"So... care to answer my question? How did you know Supreme Ruler Dena was—\"","\"I SWEAR TO THE DEMON GOD, IF YOU UTTER THAT NAME ONE MORE TIME!!!\"","The demons stood on the brink of attacking Yuan, their restraint hanging by a thread.","The only reason they had not already made their move, despite losing two of their own, was the Supreme Ruler’s strict command to hold off until his arrival.","Moreover, Supreme Ruler Dena’s presence weighed heavily on them. If she chose to intervene, they knew with absolute certainty that none of them would survive.","\"What name? Supreme Ruler Dena?\" Yuan inquired with a genuine-looking puzzled face.","\"FUCK! LET’S KILL THIS BASTARD!\"","Just as the demons began to move, a terrifying pressure descended upon them, freezing their bodies in place.","\"T-This pressure! It’s her! She’s really here!\"","Their expressions darkened, color draining from their faces as the realization settled in. Until now, her presence at the Abyssal Council had only been a suspicion—an educated guess formed after their exchange with the Crimson Broker whom Yuan had questioned. But now there was no doubt.","The next moment, before any of them could even react properly, a figure appeared beside Yuan like a ghost.","It was Supreme Ruler Dena in her original appearance.","Her crimson gaze calmly swept the demons, as if trying to memorize their faces. Then, she muttered in a nonchalant voice, \"I heard you were looking for me? Did the current Supreme Ruler send you here?\"","\"S-Supreme—!\"","The demons nearly uttered her name at her sudden appearance.","\"What’s wrong? You were looking for me, right? Well, here I am. What are you going to do now?\"","Supreme Ruler Dena slowly approached these demons. Yet, none of them dared to move, almost as if they were frozen in fear.","Even when she was a step away from one of them, they merely hovered there in silence like stone statues.","Supreme Ruler Dena quickly lost interest and turned to look at Yuan, asking, \"What now?\"","\"Hmm...\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"Although having the Supreme Ruler come here would save us some time, if we fought here, this entire place would be destroyed. Moreover, we need to head to the City of Blood regardless, so we might as well just meet him there.\"","He then turned to the Execution Squad and said, \"Tell your Supreme Ruler to stay put in the City of Blood because we’ll go to him.\"","\"Shut up! Who the hell do you think you are to command—?!\"","The demon’s words died abruptly in his throat when he sensed that a gaze had fallen upon him.","It was calm—eerily so—but the moment he felt it, his entire body stiffened, and a suffocating chill crept up his spine as instinct screamed at him.","Yuan sighed and said, \"Even if we want to leave, what can you do to stop us? Do you really think you can stall us long enough for the Supreme Ruler to come? Even without Dena’s help, I can kill all of you before your Supreme Ruler arrives.\"","\"...\"","The demons wanted to argue against Yuan’s claims but decided to remain silent.","They exchanged glances, speaking through voice transmission with each other before one finally spoke. \"We will inform the Supreme Ruler. However, you must allow one of us to remain here—to ensure you don’t attempt to flee.\"","\"Run away?\" Yuan let out a soft chuckle, his tone laced with amusement. \"Very well. If leaving one of you behind to spy on us spares us a meaningless fight, we’ll indulge you.\"","The Execution Squad quickly gathered as they contemplated who to leave behind.","It didn’t take long for them to reach a decision.","Their gazes slowly shifted toward a single figure among them... a purple-skinned female demon.","No one voiced it aloud, but everyone understood why. If something were to go wrong and she were to perish, their loss would matter the least.","The purple-skinned demon didn’t complain and silently nodded her head, quietly accepting her fate.","Then, without another word, both the Special Execution Squad and the Elite Execution Squad left the scene, leaving behind the purple-skinned demon.","\"They really left you behind, huh?\" Yuan suddenly appeared behind the demon like a ghost and remarked, startling her greatly.","\"Get away from me, you freak!\" she exclaimed as she distanced herself."]},{"number":2409,"title":"Chapter 2409: Evacuating the City of Blood","paragraphs":["\"A freak? That’s a little rude,\" Yuan said with a calm smile on his face. \"Aren’t you worried that I might kill you for that offense?\"","The purple-skinned demon trembled slightly before responding with clenched fists, \"K-Kill me if you want! The Supreme Ruler will definitely avenge me!\"","She spoke with such confidence in her voice that it would’ve likely convinced even Buddha himself.","\"I wouldn’t be so sure if I were you,\" Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly joined in on the conversation. \"Even I was not able to kill him, after all.\"","\"What?\"","The demon looked at her with a dumbfounded look on her face.","She wanted to ask for Yuan’s identity, but before she could do so, Yuan spoke, \"Anyway, a purple-skinned demon, huh? Even I have never seen a demon with your color before. Where are you from?\"","Although the majority of demons were red-skinned and grey-skinned, there were occasionally demons born with rare skin colors, such as yellow, green, and even blue. However, Yuan had never heard of a purple demon before.","\"You can ask me all you want, but I won’t tell you anything,\" she sneered.","\"If you tell me, I’ll tell you my name,\" Yuan said with a faint smile.","\"...\"","The demon’s body went rigid.","Though she had been left behind to watch them, she knew that wasn’t her only purpose. The others hadn’t said it aloud, but their expectations were clear. She needed to observe, probe, and extract whatever information she could from them.","\"Fine, I’ll tell you,\" she quickly agreed.","\"I’m from a small, remote land called the Violet Hollow.\"","Yuan turned to look at Supreme Ruler Dena and asked, \"Ever heard of it?\"","Supreme Ruler Dena fell silent for a moment, sifting through her memories before finally responding, \"I have. It’s a peculiar place where almost everything there is dyed in shades of purple, from the trees to even the waters surrounding it.\"","\"As for the island itself, there’s a massive hole at its center, hence the name.\"","\"I have answered your question, Now, tell me your name.\"","\"My current name is Yuan, but I used to go by a different name in this place,\" he said with a smile.","\"What were you called before?\" she continued asking.","\"That’s not important, and I have already given you my name.\" Yuan shrugged.","\"Anyway, I will let the Grand Abyssal Elder know that we’ll be leaving now.\"","He left the next moment while Supreme Ruler Dena stayed behind with the demon.","When Yuan returned to the valley, he was surprised to find thousands of demons gathered at the entrance, presumably the entire Abyssal Council, and they appeared to be ready to defend the place.","\"Relax,\" Yuan said to them. \"The Supreme Ruler’s lackeys have already left.\"","\"But they will definitely come back!\" Someone loudly shouted.","\"No, they won’t.\"","\"How can you be so sure?!\"","\"Because they are only here for us, and we’ll be leaving now for the City of Blood to meet the Supreme Ruler there,\" Yuan calmly revealed.","The Grand Abyssal Elder appeared at the scene the next moment and said, \"Even if that is true, it doesn’t change the fact that we have sheltered you and lied to them. They will definitely return to punish us later. However, since they left and won’t be coming back soon, we can use this time to relocate.\"","\"Sorry for the trouble,\" Yuan said.","The Grand Abyssal Elder shook his head and said, \"There is no need for you to apologize, as such is the fate for people like us. I have barely escaped death once, and I will not allow it to get near me for a second time.\"","\"It was an honor to meet you again, Demon Sealer surnamed ’Tian’.\"","The Grand Abyssal Elder turned to face the others and loudly commanded, \"We’re leaving! Pack your shit and return here within half an hour!\"","\"Yes!\"","The demons immediately scrambled.","Yuan didn’t interrupt them and left without another word.","\"Hey, we’re leaving.\" Yuan used voice transmission to speak to Lev, who was still back at their living quarters.","Lev hastily followed Yuan back to Supreme Ruler Dena and the purple-skinned demon.","\"What’s your name?\" Yuan asked the demon when he returned.","\"I’m not telling you until you tell me your other name,\" she sneered.","\"Then I’ll just call you Purple,\" Yuan shrugged.","\"Let’s go, Purple. Lead us to the City of Blood,\" he then said, treating her like a guide dog.","Purple wanted to complain, but since that was her job, she decided to suck it up.","Shortly later, she started guiding them toward the City of Blood.","Meanwhile, in the City of Blood, the current Supreme Ruler received news of the situation.","\"Supreme Ruler, we must evacuate the city immediately and prepare to fight her!\" The current Supreme Adviser said with urgency in his face and voice.","\"Fight her?\" The Supreme Ruler scoffed. \"She’s called the most powerful demon in history for a reason. Even I am not confident I could defeat her if we clashed directly without any preparations.\"","\"Prepare the Demon God’s Formation. We’ll need to weaken her first before we confront her. I will also attempt to seek guidance from the Demon God, so I will be gone for some time.\"","\"Yes!\" The Supreme Adviser nodded before hurrying away.","Before he started preparing for the Demon God’s Formation, the Supreme Adviser made sure to send out an evacuation order to the entire City of Blood.","Of course, he didn’t reveal the real reason behind the evacuation, as he was certain people would panic if they knew Supreme Ruler Dena had escaped the Deprived Crimson Valley and was returning to the city soon.","Within days, the entire City of Blood became as empty as a ghost town, resembling a certain incident that shocked the entire world, and the people started to speculate the reason for the evacuation.","Meanwhile, the Supreme Ruler attempted to contact the Demon God at the Demon God’s Altar."]},{"number":2410,"title":"Chapter 2410: The Demon God’s Assistance","paragraphs":["The Supreme Ruler knelt before a crimson altar centered in a pond of blood, kowtowing as he murmured, \"O Demon God, creator of this world, your loyal child seeks your enlightenment.\"","Moments passed with no response from the altar or the Demon God. Still the Supreme Ruler kept kowtowing. Hours stretched into days, and weeks passed without any sign or answer.","Yet, the Supreme Ruler remained as still as a statue. When trying to communicate with the Demon God, it was normal for the Supreme Ruler to wait for years, even decades.","Throughout history the Supreme Rulers attempted contact with the Demon God hundreds—if not thousands—of times, yet the responses were so rare they could be counted on one hand, or even just three fingers.","The only time a Supreme Ruler is guaranteed to hear the Demon God’s voice is during the Succession Ritual where they become the Supreme Ruler, when they receive its guidance and blessing.","After nearly three months of waiting, the Supreme Ruler’s ears twitched at the sound of popping bubbles. The blood pond before him began to boil without warning with countless bubbles forming and bursting.","’There’s a response?! But what is this? I have never heard of such a reaction before!’ The Supreme Ruler cried inwardly.","But despite his curiosity, he did not dare to lift his head or even use divine sense to look at the phenomenon.","Soon, the blood pond fell eerily still once more.","A few moments later, a ripple spread across the blood pond, though nothing visible had disturbed it, as if an invisible drop of liquid had fallen into its depths.","At this moment, the Supreme Ruler could not sense or hear anything. In fact, he wasn’t even aware of the ripple that appeared on the surface of the blood pond.","\"Speak.\"","A voice suddenly commanded.","\"?!?!\"","At the sound of that voice, which sounded so close it seemed to come from right before him, the Supreme Ruler instinctively began to lift his head, then hastily stopped and bowed even lower.","\"...\"","The Supreme Ruler was stunned, his thoughts overheating as he wondered if the Demon God had actually manifested before him. If so, it would be unprecedented, as never once in history had the Demon God appeared in person.","\"Why aren’t you speaking? You were the one who summoned me,\" the Demon God said, his tone faintly annoyed.","\"M‐My deepest apologies!\" the Supreme Ruler stammered. \"I blanked out for a moment, as I never imagined you would appear in person, Demon God! You must be here because you already know of ex-Supreme Ruler Dena’s escape from the Deprived Crimson Valley and have guidance for me!\"","However, the Demon God’s response left the Supreme Ruler utterly speechless.","\"No, I showed up because I happened to be in the area. As for that child Dena, I couldn’t care less about her situation or how you intend to deal with her.\"","\"Then...\" The Supreme Ruler didn’t know how to respond or if he should even ask the Demon God for its assistance.","The Demon God continued, \"That being said, I didn’t come here just to do nothing.\"","The next moment, the Supreme Ruler sensed the Demon God’s presence drawing near until it loomed directly before him. Then, he felt something like a drop of blood descended onto the crown of his head, and an unfathomable power instantly surged through his entire body.","\"T‐This is—?!\" The Supreme Ruler trembled with excitement.","\"I have just bestowed you some power. Do what you will with it,\" the Demon God said casually before his presence faded away, leaving without any explanation.","Even though the Supreme Ruler could no longer sense the Demon God’s presence, he spent the next several days thanking it nonstop.","Meanwhile, somewhere in the starry sky, the Demon God watched with an amused smile.","\"Though I swore never to intervene directly in my own world—even if its people destroyed it—I’ll make an exception this time. Not only did that monster break our agreement, but it wouldn’t be fair to that child to face him without any assistance.\"","Once the Supreme Ruler was finished, he immediately entered seclusion to better understand his new powers.","Meanwhile, Yuan and his group were still traveling to the City of Blood.","\"Yuan, I’m hungry.\" Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly said to him.","\"I guess it’s been a while...\" Yuan didn’t say anything else and loosened the clothes around his neck. Since there was a good chance they might have to fight the Supreme Ruler, it would be wise to help Supreme Ruler Dena recover as much strength as possible before they arrived.","When she saw Yuan’s smooth, tempting neck, Supreme Ruler Dena couldn’t help but drool inwardly before latching onto his back and biting into his neck like a bloodthirsty fiend.","’What the hell are they doing?!’","Purple, who had never seen such a scene before, stared in bewilderment at Supreme Ruler Dena sucking on Yuan’s neck with a blissful expression like a baby with a pacifier.","Then the scent of Yuan’s blood reached her, and her mouth instantly began to water.","’Why does his blood smell so damn good?!’ Purple was shocked to find herself craving a taste of Yuan’s blood even though she’d never liked the taste of demon blood.","Seeing Purple’s expression, Lev shook his head and warned her, \"You can forget about it. That blood is reserved for her.\"","\"Don’t tell me his real identity is being her livestock?\" Purple inquired with a weird look on her face.","It wasn’t weird for demons to keep livestocks, especially those with power and influence. However, these people usually kept their livestocks at home.","’But that doesn’t explain why he could bypass the Demon God’s Wrath...’ she thought inwardly.","\"Hey, your blood is even more delicious than before,\" Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly stopped consuming his blood and remarked.","\"Did your seclusion have anything to do with this?\" she then asked.","Yuan raised an eyebrow at her comment, wondering if enhancing his regeneration had somehow made his blood taste better to demons. Until now, he’d assumed it was related to the Immortal Monarch’s Bloodline."]},{"number":2411,"title":"Chapter 2411: Void Manipulation Training","paragraphs":["’The Immortal Monarch’s Bloodline makes my blood a delicacy for beasts, but demons aren’t beasts, so it shouldn’t taste any different to them,’ Yuan mused. ’If my regeneration ability affects how my blood tastes to demons, though, that would explain why Dena thinks it’s gotten better...’","In the past, Tian Chenyu had gained regeneration on par with demons simply by consuming their cores, and even then Supreme Ruler Dena claimed his blood tasted better than demon blood. Yuan’s regeneration had long since surpassed Tian Chenyu’s peak, so it made sense that his blood now tasted even better than before.","Moreover, stronger demons had stronger regeneration and thus, stronger blood techniques.","\"How long until we arrive at the City of Blood?\" Yuan asked.","\"About a thousand five hundred years at our current pace,\" Purple replied calmly, as though such a span of time were nothing out of the ordinary.","After all, with their limitless longevity, their perception of time had long since become skewed.","\"There must be a faster way to get there. Can’t we just use teleport formations?\" Yuan asked.","\"Teleport formations? Do you have any idea how tiring it is to use those? We will also need to use them several times, so I’ll pass on that.\" Purple sneered.","Since the Demonic Realm lacked spirit stones, teleportation formations had to be powered by one’s own energy. As a result, such methods of travel were rarely used and were typically reserved for emergencies.","As for the Abyssal Council’s concealment formation, it was maintained by a dedicated group of demons whose sole purpose was to keep it active, supplying it with energy at all times.","There were, of course, resources that could power formations, but they were considered far too valuable to waste on such uses.","In truth, though, neither of these was Purple’s real reason for avoiding the teleport formations. She knew the Supreme Ruler was already aware of their situation and likely preparing for their arrival, so she simply wanted to stall for time.","\"Aren’t you worried about upsetting the Supreme Ruler for making him wait too long?\" Yuan asked.","\"The Supreme Ruler is a very understanding person, so we’ll be fine,\" she said.","\"...\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before speaking again, \"Oh, I know. We can just travel using Void Manipulation.\"","\"What?\" Purple and Lev turned to look at him with wide eyes.","\"Do you have any idea how far the City of Blood is? Nobody can cross that kind of distance with Void Manipulation in a single jump!\"","Supreme Ruler Dena wanted to say that she could do exactly that, but it was only if she was at her full strength.","Yuan shook his head.","\"Who said anything about doing it in one go? We can just keep hopping short distances until we get there.\"","\"That’s even more ridiculous! You make Void Manipulation sound easy, but can you even use it? We’d spend more energy than if we just used teleport formations!\" Purple sighed, feeling like she was talking to someone unreasonably ignorant.","Of course, Yuan was aware that it wasn’t easy using Void Manipulation. However, he saw this as an opportunity to train his Void Manipulation.","He also knew that Purple was trying to stall them, but he couldn’t care less.","\"Umm... I cannot use Void Manipulation...\" Lev suddenly said.","\"Don’t worry, I’ll take you with me,\" Yuan said with a smile.","Bringing others into the void would cost more energy, which would only accelerate his training.","\"I don’t even trust you to watch my back, so what makes you think I’ll trust you not to screw up using Void Manipulation with us?!\" Purple exclaimed in disbelief.","Yuan looked at her and shrugged, \"You don’t have to come with us if you don’t want to. And just so we are clear, we’re not following you. We’re allowing you to follow us.\"","\"If you don’t want to come with me, then you’re free to chase after us.\"","Purple gritted her teeth in frustration, but Yuan was right. If they went ahead and left her behind, there was nothing she could really do about it.","Still, she wasn’t willing to trust Yuan’s Void Manipulation and said, \"You can go without me. I want to see how long you’ll be able to keep using it before you run out of energy!\"","Yuan nodded and, without hesitation, used Void Manipulation while carrying Lev and Supreme Ruler Dena, traversing several dozen miles in the blink of an eye.","Although Supreme Ruler Dena could easily use Void Manipulation herself, she was still feasting on Yuan’s blood, and he’d rather let her conserve her energy.","Meanwhile, Purple also used Void Manipulation to follow them.","<Void Manipulation>","<Void Manipulation>","<Void Manipulation>","Yuan would only emerge from the void for a brief second before entering it again, making it look as though he was teleporting constantly.","<Your understanding of Void Manipulation has increased slightly!>","The more Yuan’s proficiency with it increased, the further he was able to traverse in the void.","In just a few short years, Yuan’s Void Manipulation improved so much that he went from traversing several dozen miles to several hundred miles.","’This guy has been using Void Manipulation nonstop for six years straight while carrying two people, but he doesn’t seem tired in the slightest! Just how much energy does he have?!’ Purple cried inwardly as she was starting to feel exhausted from constantly using Void Manipulation to chase after them.","Using Void Manipulation didn’t just require spiritual energy. It also required Soul Strength, and most people cannot recover Soul Strength as fast as they could recover spiritual energy.","Of course, there was no way for Purple to know about Yuan’s unfathomably powerful Soul Strength, as well as his soul cultivation technique that constantly strengthens it.","After another ten years, Purple was completely exhausted and could no longer continue using Void Manipulation.","\"W-Wait!\" she shouted at them.","\"What is it?\" Yuan casually used Void Manipulation to teleport in front of her and asked in a nonchalant voice."]},{"number":2412,"title":"Chapter 2412: Void Manipulation Training(2)","paragraphs":["\"I...I...\" Purple hesitated, struggling to ask Yuan to carry her. After all, she had rejected his offer earlier, and now the thought of asking for his help felt somewhat embarrassing.","\"Are you tired?\" Yuan asked with a smile on his face, and he continued, \"I don’t mind carrying you, but you’ll need to ask nicely, considering how rude you were before.\"","\"Wha—! I wasn’t being rude! I was merely being realistic!\" she exclaimed, defending herself. \"Who in their right mind would trust a first-level False God to use Void Manipulation properly?! Not a single True God out there! Especially when we’re enemies!\"","\"You see me as an enemy?\" Yuan remarked with a chuckle. \"Unfortunately, you don’t qualify.\"","\"I don’t qualify? Big talk for some who is just livestock!\"","\"Livestock?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","Yuan had been so focused on his training that he completely forgot about Supreme Ruler Dena, who had been feasting on his blood this whole time.","\"You’re still drinking my blood? Aren’t you satisfied by now?\" Yuan asked her, who was still sucking away without a care in the world.","Supreme Ruler Dena removed her lips from his neck and licked it clean before replying, \"The more I drink your blood, the tastier it tastes. It is like I am having a different meal with each mouthful, and I cannot get enough of it!\"","\"But is it helping with your recovery?\" he asked.","\"Yes. If I continue drinking your blood, I should recover at least 70 percent of my strength by the time we arrive at the City of Blood.\"","Purple raised an eyebrow after overhearing their conversation and thought to herself, ’She’s injured...?’","That’s when Purple realized she had made a grave mistake. Had she not attempted to stall them, Supreme Ruler Dena would have arrived at the City of Blood in a weakened state, making her far easier to deal with.","Unfortunately, it was a misstep she could no longer correct without raising suspicion. If she suddenly urged them to use a teleportation formation to hasten their arrival, it would only make her intentions all the more questionable.","Purple felt like kicking herself in the butt over her mistake, unaware that Yuan was already expecting an ambush in the City of Blood.","\"In that case, drink as much as you want.\" Yuan said to her before looking at Purple again and resuming their conversation in a nonchalant manner, \"So, do you want me to carry you or not?\"","Purple gritted her teeth and silently nodded her head.","Yuan tilted his head slightly, turning his ear toward her as he cupped a hand behind it. \"What was that? I didn’t quite catch it.\"","Purple clenched her fists in frustration before speaking loudly, \"Can you take me with you?! Please!\"","Without another word, Yuan activated Void Manipulation and resumed his training with an additional training load.","Although a single additional individual may not seem like a lot, Yuan could instantly feel a difference, and he was no longer able to traverse as much distance as before.","However, it also sped up his progress, so he didn’t complain and even welcomed it.","’At the rate he’s improving and our pace, we will arrive at the City of Blood in less than five hundred years!’ Purple thought to herself.","A few years later—","<Your Void Manipulation mastery has reached a new level>","The moment Yuan’s Void Manipulation reached a new level, he could instantly traverse ten thousand miles with a single leap through the void.","However, even with his Void Manipulation reaching a new level, his Advanced Void Understanding has barely approached the next level.","\"Hey, Dena, how do you train your Void Manipulation?\" Yuan suddenly asked her.","She stopped feasting on his blood to respond, \"Do you want to see it?\"","He quickly nodded.","Supreme Ruler Dena then got off his back and said, \"Watch carefully.\"","She activated Void Manipulation and vanished into the void. Yet, even after several moments had passed, she did not return.","Yuan raised a brow and followed after her, stepping into the void to see what she was doing.","Within that formless expanse, he was met with a shocking sight—Supreme Ruler Dena stood utterly defenseless, allowing the void itself to tear her body apart.","Normally, one would manipulate the void carefully, ensuring it never came into contact with their body, as the void itself was inherently destructive, capable of eroding anything it touched.","However, Supreme Ruler Dena did the opposite. She allowed it to ravage her freely, relying on her superior regeneration to outpace the damage and continuously restore her body.","\"I find it easier to understand it when I am touching it,\" she calmly explained. \"But it might be different for you.\"","\"Heavens... how did I never think of such a simple training method before?\" Yuan muttered in a daze. Sometimes the simplest ideas are the easiest to overlook.","The next moment, Yuan stopped pushing away the void and allowed it to ravage his body. The instant it touched his skin, he felt himself being torn apart, and not just his flesh ripping, but his entire body being destroyed and vaporized by an unstoppable force.","Even with his immense tolerance for pain, the agony was almost unbearable. Still, the results were worth it, as his Void Manipulation and Void Comprehension advanced at a remarkable pace.","However, since Yuan’s Void Manipulation was nowhere near Supreme Ruler Dena’s level, he was only able to remain in the void for about half an hour before he had to exit and enter again.","\"I am going to train like this for a few years,\" Yuan suddenly declared.","Supreme Ruler Dena then asked, \"Does that mean I won’t be able to drink your blood?\"","\"It’ll only be for a few years.\"","\"Fine...\" Supreme Ruler Dena muttered, but then her eyes flickered, as if she thought of something.","\"In that case, I’ll use this time to prepare my blood for you.\"","\"Oh?\"","\"I promised that I’d let you taste my blood if you let me drink yours, after all.\""]},{"number":2413,"title":"Chapter 2413: Consuming Supreme Ruler Dena’s Blood","paragraphs":["’What in Demon God’s name did she just say? That she’ll let him drink her blood?’ Purple stared at Supreme Ruler Dena in disbelief, her eyes as wide as saucers.","’Why the hell would a being like her let someone taste her blood, let alone a mere livestock?!’","Even though Supreme Ruler Dena was no longer in power, it didn’t change the fact that she had once held the title and remained one of the most powerful demons in the world. For a Supreme Ruler to share their blood was akin to an emperor bestowing their own power on a subject. It was simply unthinkable, especially for a loyal subject like Purple.","\"Then I’ll start my training now. The two of you can do whatever.\" Yuan said to Lev and Purple before entering the void to resume his training.","<Your understanding of the Power of the Void has improved moderately>","<Your understanding of Void Manipulation has improved significantly>","Not long after beginning his training, Yuan realized that this training method felt all too familiar, as he was already used to training himself in similar ways, repeatedly pushing his body to the extreme through pain and destruction.","For example, when he trained in the Primal Expanse by poisoning himself in the Baneful Dragon’s Poisonous Swamp, when he roasted himself like a chicken in the Nine Levels of Hell, and when he constantly destroyed his body at the Sky Splitting Dragon’s Tribulation.","If one had to describe Yuan’s training methods in one word, it would definitely be masochistic.","In just a few short months, Yuan was able to extend his time within the void without leaving from half an hour to almost six hours.","After another year, that six hours became nearly a full day.","<Your Void Manipulation mastery has reached a new level>","Then another five years passed in the blink of an eye.","<Your Void Manipulation mastery has reached a new level>","By now, Yuan could remain inside the void for nearly three days without coming out.","In the blink of an eye, another ten years passed.","<Your Void Manipulation mastery has reached a new level>","Satisfied by the results, Yuan decided to stop his training for now.","\"Are you done?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked him when she noticed that he didn’t immediately return to the void.","He nodded, \"Yes, I’ll stop here for now.\"","\"Then here is my blood.\"","Supreme Ruler Dena produced a fist-sized crimson orb of her own blood and offered it to him.","Yuan accepted the crimson orb and inspected it out of curiosity. However, it appeared to be ordinary blood.","He didn’t really think much of it and consumed it.","<You have consumed Supreme Ruler Dena’s blood>","\"...\"","\"...","\"...\"","\"Anything?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked him.","Yuan shook his head, \"No.\"","\"In that case...\"","Without delay, Supreme Ruler Dena retrieved something else, as if she’d had prepared it in advance.","\"I made this in case my regular blood had no effect,\" she said, handing him a crimson crystal shaped like a teardrop, about the size of a peanut.","\"What is this?\" Yuan asked.","Even at a glance, he could sense the immense energy sealed within it. In fact, it resembled the crystals embedded in every Lower Demon’s body—their cores.","\"I just copied what you did with the True Emperor of the Seas, as well as what the Primal Sovereign of the Seas gave you,\" she said calmly.","\"I couldn’t replicate it exactly, so I improvised and adjusted it.\"","\"You what?!\" Yuan exclaimed and stared at her with wide eyes, looking absolutely bewildered.","Supreme Ruler Dena had essentially claimed to have created her own Blood Essence, something only beasts were supposed to be capable of.","\"In order for beasts to form their Blood Essence, they have to sacrifice a tremendous amount of energy and even some of their lifespan,\" Yuan said. \"Just how much did you give up to make this?\"","Supreme Ruler Dena gave a casual shrug. \"I’m not sure how much longevity I sacrificed, but I used about half of my power. I’m essentially back to the state I was in when we first left the Deprived Crimson Valley.\"","Yuan nearly facepalmed, exasperated by her usual tendency to act without much thought, a habit she picked up after being invincible for so long. In her head, the word consequence was almost nonexistent.","\"We’re about to confront the Supreme Ruler, and you use up all of your powers to create this when there is no guarantee it will benefit me?\" Yuan sighed.","\"Don’t worry about me. I’m sure it’ll work out somehow,\" she replied.","\"Forget it.\" Yuan shook his head.","Meanwhile, both Lev and Purple stared at the crimson crystal in Yuan’s grasp with dazed expressions, as though their minds had been thrown into utter disarray.","Suddenly, Lev’s body jolted as if struck by lightning. In the next instant, he lunged toward Yuan, arm outstretched and fingers curled into a claw, attempting to snatch the crystal from his grasp.","\"The heck?\"","Although he was surprised by Lev’s sudden action, Yuan reacted instantly and subconsciously used Void Manipulation, teleporting behind Lev like a ghost.","Then, with his free hand, grabbed Lev in the back of his neck, restricting him.","\"What are you doing?\" he questioned as Lev struggled to break free.","\"Have you finally lost your mind and become a Forsaken?\" Yuan frowned at his crazed behavior that resembled a Forsaken.","However, Yuan doubted Lev had actually turned into a Forsaken, as it seemed too sudden, and he looked more like a mindless beast acting on pure instinct.","While Yuan contemplated this phenomenon, Purple suddenly sprang into action, lunging at him in the same fashion.","Seeing this, Supreme Ruler Dena extended her crimson hair, swiftly binding Purple’s limbs and restraining her in an awkward position with her arms and legs secured behind her back.","Afterward, she turned to Yuan and asked, \"What’s wrong with them?\"","\"I was going to ask you the same thing,\" he said while shaking his head."]},{"number":2414,"title":"Chapter 2414: Supreme Ruler Dena’s Refined Life Essence","paragraphs":["\"While I don’t know what happened to them, it looks like they’re aiming for your blood,\" Yuan said when he noticed that both Lev and Purple were staring daggers at the crimson crystal in his grasp, looking like predators instinctively watching its prey.","\"Can demon blood make other demons go crazy?\" he then asked.","\"Not literally,\" she shook her head.","\"Perhaps it’s because of what you’ve done to it. Anyway, let’s try this...\"","Yuan put the crimson crystal into his spatial ring and waited to see the results.","Lev and Purple immediately calmed down, but it took several minutes before they fully returned to their normal self.","\"W-What the hell is this?!\" Purple exclaimed in shock when she woke up and saw that she was being restrained by Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"Kill me if you want because I won’t beg for my life! The Supreme Ruler will definitely avenge me!\" she shouted while trying to act tough, but her terrified expression betrayed her.","\"Uh... why am I suddenly being choked like this?\" Lev asked in a puzzled tone.","Yuan raised an eyebrow and asked them, \"You don’t remember what just happened? That both of you tried to steal Dena’s blood from me?\"","\"What?! I definitely have no recollection of doing anything like that!\" Lev immediately replied, sounding genuinely shocked by Yuan’s accusation.","\"I remember watching you drink her blood, and the next thing I know, I was being choked by you!\"","\"The same with me...\" Purple muttered.","\"I thought you had turned Forsaken for a second and was prepared to kill you, you know?\" Yuan lied with a straight face, messing with them.","However, neither of them commented on it, as it was only normal—even the right thing to do when one turns Forsaken.","\"Anyway, the two of you should distance yourselves from me for the time being since I will be consuming that blood soon,\" Yuan said a moment later.","They silently nodded and flew far away, until they were tens of thousands of miles away from Yuan.","Once they were gone, Yuan retrieved the crimson crystal again and quickly consumed it.","<You have consumed Supreme Ruler Dena’s Refined Life Essence>","’Refined Life Essence...?’","Yuan wondered how it differed from Blood Essence, but before he could dwell on the thought, a sudden sensation washed over him, forcing him to clear his mind and focus on it instead.","A sharp, searing pain erupted in his chest, as though a blade were being driven into his heart again and again. With each passing second, the agony only intensified, and the pain focused in a single point, magnifying the torment severalfold.","Supreme Ruler Dena noticed the agony contorting Yuan’s face and swallowed nervously. If he were to die from consuming her blood... she had no idea how she would respond.","\"AH!\"","Yuan suddenly released a deafening roar, his voice erupting with such force that the very earth beneath him and the sky above split apart.","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has activated>","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has begun to refine Supreme Ruler Dena’s Refined Life Essence>","A few moments later, Supreme Ruler Dena’s brows furrowed. Without warning, she grabbed Yuan by his clothes and pulled them open, exposing his upper body.","Then, her eyes narrowed as her gaze fixed on the center of his chest.","A thin slit had appeared there, slowly spreading open, as though something beneath his skin was forcing its way out, tearing him apart from within.","Soon, Supreme Ruler Dena saw a crystal-like object emerge from the hole. It appeared colorless at first, but when sunlight touched it, the crystal gleamed with majestic prismatic colors.","\"This... is a core...?\" Supreme Ruler Dena muttered at its resemblance to a demon’s core.","However, Yuan’s transformation did not end there. His skin turned ghostly pale, as though his blood had been drained, and his hair became silver. His once-brown eyes now gleamed like the crimson crystals he’d consumed. But most surprisingly of all, two black, symmetrical horns emerged from the top of his head.","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has successfully refined Supreme Ruler Dena’s Refined Life Essence>","<Due to Supreme Ruler Dena’s Refined Life Essence, you have acquired the ability to use ’Demonic Awakening’>","[Demonic Awakening]","[Rank: ???]","[Description: Abandon your humanity and unleash unimaginable terror upon the world! While in Demonic Awakening, your regeneration abilities will be improved significantly, and you will acquire the ability to use ’Blood Manipulation’! When using Chaotic Essence in this form, its power will increase by 100,000%]","Supreme Ruler Dena’s jaw dropped at Yuan’s transformation, and despite her shock, she did not fail to notice the strange, unfamiliar emotion stirring within her.","She had always admired Tian Chenyu, but only as an equal and never in a romantic way. But now, with Yuan’s aura and even his scent completely changed, her heart began to race, and her blood—usually under perfect control—grew restless, heating against her will as she gazed at his current form, looking like a young maiden experiencing love at first sight.","Supreme Ruler Dena rubbed her eyes and tried to regain control over her blood, but each attempt only made her blood burn hotter, the complete opposite of her intention.","The Yuan right now radiated an unfathomably dreadful aura so potent that even Lev and Purple felt it from afar, as though they were sensing a being of unimaginable viciousness.","Not realizing it was Yuan, they trembled uncontrollably in fear, much like how Lev once shook before Supreme Ruler Dena before she suppressed her presence, only several times worse.","Yuan lowered his head, staring in disbelief at the star-shaped crystal embedded in the center of his chest.","In the past, Tian Chenyu had often wondered if consuming too many demon cores would eventually turn him into a demon, but in the end, he’d only managed to acquire their regeneration ability.","One might expect Yuan to loathe this transformation, given his former hatred for demons, yet to his surprise he felt no disgust at all. If anything, what he felt most was the immense energy surging within him."]},{"number":2415,"title":"Chapter 2415: City of Blood","paragraphs":["Yuan looked at Supreme Ruler Dena, who was still gawking at him with a dazed look on her face.","\"Looks like I can turn into a demon now,\" he remarked with a smile on his face, which only made her flustered even more.","\"C-Can you return to your original form?\" she asked in a nervous voice. \"Or are you stuck like that permanently?\"","Yuan deactivated his Demonic Awakening and said, \"It is not permanent. It’s similar to my Dragon Awakening.\"","\"Oh...\" she mumbled, sounding a little disappointed.","\"Then how long can you maintain that form for?\"","Yuan pondered for a bit before responding, \"It’s not too tiring, so I can probably maintain it for as long as I want as long as I don’t use all of my energy in one go.\"","\"By the way, what’s with that look on your face? I have never seen such an expression from you before,\" he suddenly addressed the elephant in the room.","\"I-I have no idea what you’re talking about!\" Supreme Ruler Dena hastily responded in a flustered manner, and her hair started moving by itself to cover her face.","\"...\" Yuan raised an eyebrow at her unusual reaction.","Although Supreme Ruler Dena was acting like a lovestruck maiden, it never occurred to Yuan that was actually the case, as in his mind, she was incapable of feeling such emotions.","Suddenly, Lev and Purple returned to them, breaking the awkward atmosphere.","\"What was that just now?! Who did that terrifying presence belong to?!\" Lev asked nervously.","Had Yuan not already deactivated his Demonic Awakening, Lev wouldn’t have even dared to return.","\"You mean this presence?\" Yuan abruptly activated Demonic Awakening again.","\"My god! That was you?!\" Lev cried out loud, his eyes widening with disbelief.","Supreme Ruler Dena’s hair subtly moved just enough for her to peek at Yuan’s violent appearance.","As for Purple, she was left utterly speechless. And despite her naturally purple complexion, a faint flush of red crept across her face.","’What the hell happened to him in such a short time?!’ she cried inwardly, unable to trust her own eyes, and even more shocking, the fact that she found herself drawn to him.","Yuan deactivated his transformation a moment later, and an audible ’aw...’ could be heard coming from Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"Alright, let’s continue heading to the City of Blood,\" Yuan said.","He activated Void Manipulation, and they instantly traversed over a hundred thousand miles.","\"How long do you think it’ll take us to reach the City of Blood at this pace?\" Yuan asked Purple a few minutes into their journey.","\"Uhhh... a few years?\" she said, sounding uncertain.","Meanwhile, at the City of Blood, the Demon God’s Formation had recently been completed. However, the Supreme Ruler was nowhere to be seen.","\"Supreme Adviser! Have you seen or spoken to the Supreme Ruler lately? All preparations are completed!\"","\"No, the Supreme Ruler hasn’t returned since he left to communicate with the Demon God,\" the Supreme Adviser shook his head.","\"We have received information from our scouts that they could sense ’their’ presence quickly approaching our city!\"","\"It would be great if the Supreme Ruler returns before they arrive, but if he doesn’t, we’ll have to face her on our own and hopefully stall her for long enough for his return.\"","Despite the urgent situation, none of them even considered disturbing the Supreme Ruler, as nothing took priority over the Demon God, even if the entire city were to be burnt down.","Two years later, Yuan stopped using Void Manipulation.","\"We have arrived at the City of Blood,\" he said aloud as they hovered a few hundred miles away, just enough to see the city on the horizon.","\"Why did we stop here?\" Purple asked, trying her best not to sound off or nervous.","Yuan didn’t respond and merely stared at the city in silence.","\"As I thought, they’ve prepared an ambush for us,\" he said out loud without a care if Purple could hear him or not.","\"?!\" Purple’s eyes widened.","Yuan turned to look at her and smiled, \"They could’ve made it less obvious by not evacuating the entire city. That being said, the formation surrounding the city is just as obvious.\"","\"What do you want to do, Dena?\" Yuan turned to ask her.","\"Are you afraid?\" she suddenly asked.","\"Why would I be?\"","\"Then there’s no reason not to go, even if it’s a trap.\"","Yuan nodded with a smile, \"Oh, Lev, you should probably—\"","\"Stay here, right? No problem.\" Lev immediately said without hesitation.","Purple looked at him with a weird gaze.","’Is he really just a nobody?’ she wondered inwardly.","\"You are coming with us, right?\" Yuan suddenly asked Purple, snapping her out of her thoughts.","\"Of course!\"","Moments later, Yuan and Supreme Ruler Dena approached the City of Blood while Purple followed them from behind, keeping a certain distance from them.","\"How does it feel to finally return home after spending so long in the Deprived Crimson Valley?\" Yuan asked Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"I was basically asleep during my entire duration there until you woke me up, so it doesn’t feel that long. However, this place definitely feels foreign,\" she said.","\"Perhaps it’s the lack of presence, or maybe it’s how much the place has changed, but it really feels different.\"","\"Well, considering how long you’ve been gone, it’s normal.\"","Soon, they arrived at the city walls, and almost instantly, Yuan felt thousands of gazes fall upon them.","\"Seriously... could they be any more obvious?\" he muttered, slightly dumbfounded by their apparent lack of stealth.","However, unbeknownst to him, these individuals were in fact concealing their presence. It was simply that Yuan’s Soul Strength had grown so formidable that he perceived them as clearly as if they weren’t hiding at all.","Eventually, they arrived at the heart of the city, where a colossal tower soared into the heavens, its peak seemingly piercing the sky itself.","\"Where’s the Supreme Ruler? Why isn’t he showing up?\" Yuan turned to ask Purple."]},{"number":2416,"title":"Chapter 2416: Demon God’s Formation","paragraphs":["\"Uh... I’m not sure...?\" Purple responded to Yuan’s question about the Supreme Ruler’s whereabouts.","Suddenly, Yuan noticed a figure emerging from the tower and quickly approaching them.","\"Are you the Supreme Ruler?\" Yuan asked the human-looking demon hovering before them.","\"Not even close,\" he responded. \"I am the Supreme Adviser, second in power within the Crimson Continent.\"","\"Then where is the Supreme Ruler?\" Yuan asked.","\"The Supreme Ruler will appear soon, but first...\" The Supreme Adviser turned his gaze to Supreme Ruler Dena and continued speaking, \"Why did you leave the Deprived Crimson Valley and return here? Have you forgotten about the indescribable crime you’ve committed against the people here? If I were you, I’d be too ashamed to show my face here again.\"","\"There is no place besides the Deprived Crimson Valley that welcomes a Forsaken, especially one as heinous as you!\"","Despite the Supreme Adviser’s harsh words, Supreme Ruler Dena’s expression remained as calm as a still pond.","\"How does one forget something they have no recollection of in the very beginning?\" she spoke a moment later.","\"What...?\" The Supreme Adviser frowned.","\"As for me being a Forsaken... I have no clue where you got such information, but that’s nothing more than slander,\" she continued before the Supreme Adviser could say anything else.","\"Are you claiming to be innocent despite the overwhelming evidence against you? Do you really expect me—expect anyone to believe that?\" The Supreme Adviser responded with a deep frown, looking like he’d been mocked.","\"Whether you believe me or not is none of my concern,\" Supreme Ruler Dena calmly said. \"I am just here to reclaim my position.\"","\"Reclaim your position?! And how are you going to do that? With force, like you usually do?!\" The Supreme Adviser shouted, his face and voice full of anger. \"Even if you force your way back into being the Supreme Ruler again, nobody would trust you!\"","\"I couldn’t care less if nobody trusts me. Even if everyone hates me, as long as they do their job properly—\"","\"Alright, let’s stop there.\" Yuan interrupted her.","He then turned to the Supreme Adviser. \"You claim there’s overwhelming evidence she’s responsible for this city’s disappearance, but from what I’ve heard, your so‐called proof is flimsy at best and proves nothing.\"","\"...\"","The Supreme Adviser frowned at Yuan in confusion.","\"I should have asked this sooner, but who in the hell are you? Are you the one responsible for the deaths of our two soldiers?\" he asked after a brief silence.","\"You make it sound like I personally killed them,\" Yuan sighed while shaking his head. \"They were the ones who invoked Demon God’s Wrath.\"","\"That’s not what I heard from those who were present.\"","\"I don’t know what those idiots told you, but they definitely lied.\"","\"Lie? To me? There’s no way.\"","\"You’re a bit too trusting—borderline gullible. No wonder you were so quick to believe those false accusations against Dena,\" Yuan said.","’He can really utter her name without triggering Demon God’s Wrath!’ The Supreme Adviser cried inwardly after confirming the information the others had given him, as he refused to believe such outrageous claims.","\"You... Why can you utter her name without triggering Demon God’s Wrath? Why are you able to ignore the laws of this world, something even I cannot do?\"","\"Isn’t it obvious?\" Yuan remarked with a smile. \"It’s because you’re not me.\"","\"...\"","The Supreme Adviser trembled at Yuan’s humorless joke and shouted, \"Regardless of who you are, your very existence defies the laws of this world and the Supreme Ruler who made it! This is not acceptable!\"","\"And what are you going to do about it? Kill me?\"","\"Don’t worry, we will deal with you later. As for now...\" The Supreme Adviser’s gaze returned to Supreme Ruler Dena before narrowing slightly.","After a brief silence, he shouted, \"We will not allow you to terrorize our people a second time! Activate the Demon God’s Formation!\"","At his command, the people overseeing the formation sprang into action. A crimson barrier instantly rose to envelop the entire city, turning it into a prison.","On closer inspection, the barrier was actually woven from countless crimson swords, each radiating the might of a True God.","\"Demon God’s Formation, huh?\" Supreme Ruler Dena muttered, gazing at the barrier with a calm expression.","Though she’d never deployed it herself, it was something she knew well. After all, the Demon God’s Formation was the most powerful formation available and their final line of defense—their trump card, and its power was overwhelming enough to threaten even a Supreme Ruler.","Even at her full strength, she wouldn’t escape the Demon God’s Formation unscathed, much less her current weakened state.","Yet, despite the seemingly dire situation, Supreme Ruler Dena kept calm and showed no sign of panic, nor was she putting on a brave face. She was genuinely unconcerned.","As for Yuan, he was actually admiring the formation, as it was unfathomably powerful and far beyond even the strongest formations within the Nine Heavens.","\"This is your last chance to return to the Deprived Crimson Valley,\" the Supreme Adviser warned as he lifted his arm, pointing it toward the crimson sky.","\"I refuse,\" Supreme Ruler Dena replied without hesitation.","\"Then die.\"","The Supreme Adviser swung his arm in a downward motion, as if trying to split the space before him, and in the next instant, the countless crimson swords forming the barrier locked onto Supreme Ruler Dena and shot toward her.","The scene resembled Yuan’s Swords of Eternal Torment, but on a massive scale.","In response, Supreme Ruler Dena sprang into action, meeting the storm of blades head‐on with her crimson hair.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","Although Supreme Ruler Dena managed to destroy the swords for a time and seemed to be holding her own, her weakened state gradually began to show. Her movements slowed, and she started failing to block some of the blades.","The blades she failed to block impaled her body and started draining even more of her strength.","Soon, Supreme Ruler Dena had grown so weak that she could no longer control her hair. However, the Demon God’s formation remained active and continued its relentless assault until her body was riddled with countless strikes, leaving her looking like a porcupine bristling with quills."]},{"number":2417,"title":"Chapter 2417: The Appearance of an Absolute God","paragraphs":["\"Hahaha! The Demon God’s Formation is much stronger than I anticipated! To think it would subdue the strongest Supreme Ruler in history with such ease!\" The Supreme Adviser laughed out loud with a delighted expression on his face, misunderstanding the situation.","Since Purple never had the chance to tell him about Supreme Ruler Dena being in a weakened state, he thought the Demon God’s Formation was powerful enough to overwhelm her with ease.","Meanwhile, Yuan watched the whole thing without moving and with a calm expression on his face.","Perhaps the Supreme Adviser didn’t see Yuan as a threat and wanted to focus all of their efforts on Supreme Ruler Dena, but the Demon God’s Formation completely ignored him, so not a single sword flew at him.","\"To think we worried over nothing! Or maybe her strength was exaggerated. Either way, we handled her without the Supreme Ruler’s help!\" the Supreme Adviser laughed merrily.","However, Yuan then spoke aloud, \"I wouldn’t celebrate so early if I were you.\"","\"What?\" The Supreme Adviser’s laughter died as he narrowed his eyes at Supreme Ruler Dena.","Only then did he notice the swords impaled in her body were moving, slowly being drawn into her flesh.","\"The Demon God’s Formation... is being devoured?!\" he exclaimed in disbelief.","Without hesitation, he reactivated the Demon God’s Formation, resuming the assault.","Before the swords could reach her, however, a crimson barrier suddenly materialized around Supreme Ruler Dena, enveloping her entire body like an egg.","When the swords struck the barrier, they sank into it without a trace, as though hurled into a bottomless sea.","Yuan watched the scene with a nostalgic smile on his face.","\"This is the second time I have seen her in this state...\" he mumbled.","\"What the hell is going on?! What in god’s name is she doing?!\" The Supreme Adviser shouted at Yuan in confusion, demanding an explanation.","However, Yuan merely shrugged in silence.","Quickly realizing that Yuan wasn’t going to explain the situation, the Supreme Adviser decided to continue attacking her with the Demon God’s Formation.","\"I refuse to believe that you can remain in that state forever! Whatever technique you’re using, I bet it consumes a lot of energy!\"","Yet, even after striking her crimson barrier with tens of millions of swords, it remained unscathed.","Suddenly, Supreme Ruler Dena’s voice resounded, \"This is the second time I have been pushed to this extent.\"","A moment later, the crimson barrier began to melt away, revealing a transformed Supreme Ruler Dena. Her petite frame had grown a few inches taller; crimson star-shaped tattoos now circled her biceps and thighs, and her hair had become noticeably thicker and longer. Most striking of all, a single white horn now protruded from the right side of her head.","\"W‐What is that form?!\" the Supreme Adviser cried out, stunned. He never thought she was capable of transformation since nobody has ever seen or heard of it before.","\"This? I don’t know, but it only happens when I exhaust all of my excess energy,\" Supreme Ruler Dena calmly replied.","\"E-Excess energy?!\" The Supreme Adviser couldn’t believe what he was hearing.","She nodded and explained, \"I’m simply so powerful that I hardly need to use any energy to defeat anyone. Because of that, I gain far more energy than I spend. As a result, my ’core’ is always full, and the excess builds up in other parts of my body. It’s like drawing water from rivers that were created from an overflowing lake.\"","\"The last time I was forced to transform was when I had to confront a certain Demon Sealer,\" she reminisced with a subtle smile on her face, her gaze briefly glanced at Yuan.","\"T-That’s ridiculous...\" The Supreme Adviser trembled as an overwhelming wave of fear crashed over him.","\"Now then...\"","Supreme Ruler Dena slowly turned her head from left to right, her crimson gaze sweeping over the surroundings.","\"Supreme Blood Arts, Crimson Storm.\"","In the next instant, a pair of crimson wings unfurled from her back—formed not of feathers, but of countless crimson swords resembling the Demon God’s Formation. Then the sword-like feathers shot forth in every direction like a machine gun on steroids, clashing into the Demon God’s Formation like an endless rain.","Although the Demon God’s Formation could regenerate endlessly as long as it had energy, Supreme Ruler Dena shattered it faster than it could repair itself. In mere moments she completely annihilated the formation, forcing those supplying it with energy to cough up mouthfuls of blood.","\"I’ve destroyed your trump card. Now what?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked calmly as the Supreme Adviser unconsciously backed away.","He caught himself and stopped retreating, then shouted angrily, \"So what if you destroyed the Demon God’s Formation?! We’re far from finished!\"","His body began to twist and change, shedding its human semblance as he transformed into something far more demonic.","Much like how some Forsakens would transform when enraged, humanoid demons also possessed a demonic form they could assume, which would greatly enhance their prowess at the cost of consuming more energy.","Of course, the Supreme Adviser had no intention of facing Supreme Ruler Dena alone, as that would be no different from stepping into his own grave.","\"Plan B!\" he shouted.","In the next moment, tens of thousands of demons who’d been lying in ambush surged forth like a tidal wave, surrounding Supreme Ruler Dena on all sides.","These demons were all True Gods who served directly under the current Supreme Ruler, including members of both the Special Execution Squad and the Elite Execution Squad.","But they weren’t the only reinforcements. Soon, another presence descended—a lone demon whose aura eclipsed everyone else’s.","An Absolute God had appeared.","Yuan focused all of his attention on the Absolute God, wondering if the Supreme Ruler had finally chosen to reveal himself.","\"We greet the Supreme Ancestor!\" The Supreme Adviser and the demons greeted the Absolute God.","\"Supreme Ancestor?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"That’s the title given to someone who used to be a Supreme Ruler,\" Supreme Ruler Dena explained. \"He’s probably the 13th generation Supreme Ruler.\""]},{"number":2418,"title":"Chapter 2418: Supreme Ancestor","paragraphs":["\"The Supreme Ancestor showing up before the Supreme Ruler, huh? This feels backwards for some reason,\" Yuan muttered as he narrowed his gaze at the human-looking Supreme Ancestor.","\"So he’s the one responsible for annihilating the Demon Sealers...\"","Supreme Ruler Dena sensed a hint on killing intent within his voice and asked, \"Do you want to take care of him? I’ll let you have him.\"","However, Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, it’s fine. You can deal with him.\"","Meanwhile, the Supreme Ancestor moved to the front and approached Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"This is your last chance to back down, you fiend,\" he said to her in a cold voice.","But despite his tough-looking appearance, he was actually screaming inwardly, feeling absolutely terrified of her presence.","Although he had once been the Supreme Ruler, not all Supreme Rulers were created equal. Supreme Ruler Dena was widely acknowledged as the strongest in history for a reason, and she had earned that title without ever revealing her transformation, which was several times more powerful than anything others had witnessed.","If he had the choice, he would have remained in seclusion and avoided making an appearance altogether. Unfortunately, as the Supreme Ancestor, he had a reputation he could not afford to ignore, and his absence would tarnish it.","However, Supreme Ruler Dena ignored him and asked, \"I heard you were responsible for killing all of the Demon Sealers. Why did you do such a thing?\"","\"Isn’t it obvious?\" the Supreme Ancestor replied. \"Demon Sealers wield power that preys on our kind and is a direct insult to the Demon God, our creator.\"","\"I don’t see how it insults the Demon God,\" Supreme Ruler Dena said, shaking her head. \"If anything, it’s a marvelous power that deserves respect, not scorn. No one’s managed to recreate anything like it, even after all this time.\"","\"Why the hell would anyone even try to recreate such a power?\" The Supreme Ancestor sneered in disdain.","\"Because it’s highly effective, and we’re essentially powerless against it. Who wouldn’t want such overwhelming power that would make them near untouchable? I bet if given the chance, most would jump at the opportunity to learn Demon Sealing Aura. Unfortunately, only very few people can learn it, much less wield it.\"","A cold smile suddenly appeared on Supreme Ruler Dena’s face as she continued, \"Are you sure you didn’t annihilate them out of jealousy because you weren’t able to learn it yourself?\"","The Supreme Ancestor trembled at her words and accusation.","\"That’s a baseless accusation! Nothing but slander!\" he shouted in an enraged voice, his face flushed with redness.","\"You’re pretty terrible at controlling your emotions for someone who used to be a Supreme Ruler. No wonder you couldn’t restrain your jealousy and killed them.\"","The Supreme Ancestor trembled nonstop, fists clenched so tightly that blood dripped from his knuckles. Yet even as rage pushed him to the brink, he didn’t dare attack Supreme Ruler Dena.","Supreme Ruler Dena sighed, \"I think it’s pretty obvious that none of you will be able to defeat me, so let’s not waste any time or energy fighting.\"","After a brief pause, she added, \"To be frank, since this is only my second time in this form, I won’t be able to control my strength properly, so there will be a lot of casualties if we fight.\"","Yuan then spoke up, \"In fact, we came here to speak with the Supreme Ruler. You were the ones who set up this ambush and attacked us first.\"","\"You...\" The Supreme Ancestor finally noticed Yuan and narrowed his eyes, finding his face strangely familiar for some reason. \"Who the hell are you?\"","\"My name’s Yuan, and I am just her livestock,\" Yuan introduced himself as Supreme Ruler Dena’s livestock.","\"Her... livestock?\" The Supreme Ancestor repeated in a dumbfounded voice.","Eventually, he snapped out of his daze and said to Supreme Ruler Dena, \"Even if we cannot defeat you and will likely perish by your hands, we will not allow a fiend like you to exist outside the Deprived Crimson Valley!\"","He raised his arm, pointing it straight at the sky.","\"This is our final warning! Return to the Deprived Crimson Valley and stay there for an eternity, or face our wrath!\"","\"Then... all of you can die.\" Supreme Ruler Dena calmly responded.","The Supreme Ancestor gritted his teeth and started swinging his arm down, shouting, \"Att—\"","\"Wait.\"","A calm voice suddenly resounded.","Hearing this voice, the Supreme Ancestor immediately closed his mouth and froze his movements.","\"Supreme Ruler!\" The Supreme Adviser nearly cried tears of joy after sensing his presence.","The next moment, a male figure descended from the sky, and all of the demons there lowered their heads to bow toward him.","Yuan narrowed his eyes at the newcomer—a tall, muscular demon. Unlike the Supreme Ancestor or the Supreme Adviser, he bore no human resemblance. His skin was a dark gray, his eyes pitch black, and six black horns sat on his head like a jagged, demonic crown.","\"All of you stand down and leave. There is no need for pointless deaths, and I alone will be more than enough to deal with her,\" said the Supreme Ruler in a cold tone.","Heeding his commands, all of the demons, except the Supreme Ancestor and the Supreme Adviser, left the scene.","\"This is our first time meeting, Ninth. I am the 14th Supreme Ruler, Grant.\"","Supreme Ruler Grant narrowed his gaze at her and continued, \"I understand why you were called the strongest Supreme Ruler in history. With such an overwhelming aura, you truly deserve such a title.\"","Despite Supreme Ruler Dena’s aura clearly surpassing his own, Supreme Ruler Grant did not show any hint of worry on his face.","When the Supreme Adviser noticed this, he wondered if Supreme Ruler Grant had successfully contacted the Demon God and received some kind of guidance.","\"If you’re going to tell me to return to the Deprived Crimson Valley, then you can save your breath,\" Supreme Ruler Dena then said."]},{"number":2419,"title":"Chapter 2419: The Demon God’s Power","paragraphs":["\"Return to the Deprived Crimson Valley...?\" Supreme Ruler Grant gave a weak chuckle, almost as if he found it amusing.","Then, he said in a cold voice, \"The only reason you were banished to the Deprived Crimson Valley was simply because nobody could kill you.\"","Supreme Ruler Dena narrowed her gaze at his ominous words and asked, \"Are you implying that someone is capable of killing me now? Who might that individual be? You?\"","\"There’s no need for implications because I am outright saying that I can kill you, so there’s no need for you to return to the Deprived Crimson Valley.\"","\"Bold words for someone who is only somewhat stronger than the Supreme Ancestor,\" she sneered. \"Where is your confidence coming from?\"","A smile slowly appeared on Supreme Ruler Grant’s face as he responded, \"Before I answer that question, let me ask you how many times you have spoken with the Demon God?\"","\"The Demon God?\" Supreme Ruler Dena frowned, wondering if his confidence had something to do with it. \"I have only ever heard his voice, so I can’t say that I have spoken with the Demon God before. Are you claiming that you have?\"","\"Not only have I spoken with the Demon God, but he even appeared before me!\"","\"What?!\"","Not just Supreme Ruler Dena, but even the Supreme Ancestor and Supreme Advisor exclaimed in shock at his claims.","The Demon God has never appeared before them before, so this was an unprecedented event!","\"W-What did the Demon God look like?\" The Supreme Ancestor asked.","\"I didn’t dare to look at him, so I cannot say,\" he said while shaking his head.","\"You didn’t see him, yet you claimed he appeared before you?\" Supreme Ruler Dena wore a suspicious expression on her face.","\"Just because I didn’t look at him doesn’t mean I couldn’t sense his presence right before me!\"","\"Then what did you talk about?\"","\"Honestly, not much—if anything at all. However, he did grant me... something.\"","Supreme Ruler Grant slowly raised his right arm, and a profound, otherworldly energy began to surge from his clenched fist.","\"Behold! This is the power the Demon God bestowed upon me!\"","\"That’s...\" Supreme Ruler Dena narrowed her eyes at the familiar energy.","Then, she looked at Yuan to see his reaction.","\"Eternal Essence...? No, it’s similar but fundamentally different. It’s also similar to what Dena replicated but much more refined.\" Yuan mumbled to himself as he analyzed the energy.","It was not real Eternal Essence, and compared to Supreme Ruler Dena’s replication, it was much more complete and powerful.","\"It’s similar, but it’s not the same,\" Yuan said to Supreme Ruler Dena a moment later.","Supreme Ruler Dena then said to Supreme Ruler Grant, \"That’s some fancy new power you acquired from the Demon God, but that doesn’t automatically mean you’ll be able to kill me.\"","\"Why don’t we put that to the test?!\"","Supreme Ruler Grant suddenly sprang into action, unleashing his new power against her.","\"Hmph.\" Supreme Ruler Dena sneered coldly and counterattacked, meeting his strike with her own might. Unfortunately, she couldn’t use her replicated Eternal Essence like the curse did while controlling her body, so she could only respond with the strength of an Absolute God.","When their energies clashed, Supreme Ruler Dena’s attack managed to last a full second against Supreme Ruler Grant’s fake Eternal Essence before falling apart.","Seeing this, Supreme Ruler Dena, who wasn’t using her full strength, unleashed even more power.","During their next clash, Supreme Ruler Dena was able to cancel out Supreme Ruler Grant’s fake Eternal Essence, greatly surprising him.","\"So it won’t be easy to kill you even with the Demon God’s powers, huh? As I thought. You truly deserve to be called a monster!\" Supreme Ruler Grant, who was also using only a portion of his newfound power, started to increase his output.","Meanwhile, the Supreme Adviser and the Supreme Ancestor turned their attention toward Yuan, who had been a spectator this entire time.","\"What are you looking at? Don’t tell me you want to fight me,\" Yuan noticed their gazes and turned to speak to them.","\"You’ve been irritating me for some time now, you little bastard...\" the Supreme Ancestor growled, clenching his fists.","\"I have? I don’t recall doing anything to bother you,\" Yuan remarked with a raised eyebrow.","However, it wasn’t Yuan’s words that provoked him. Rather, it was that oddly familiar face that made his skin crawl for some reason.","\"I still haven’t forgotten about the two subordinates of mine that you’ve killed,\" said the Supreme Adviser.","\"How many times do I have to say they perished because of their own actions before it gets through that thick skull of yours?\" Yuan sighed, shaking his head.","\"You’re extremely arrogant for a mere first-level False God. Without that fiend protecting you, I’m surprised that you still dare to open your mouth,\" the Supreme Ancestor sneered with disdain.","\"I may be a first-level False God, but that’s more than enough to deal with an ant like you,\" Yuan said with a calm smile.","\"What?\" The Supreme Ancestor frowned.","Without another word, he pointed a finger at Yuan and muttered, \"Blood Manipulation.\"","A concentrated jet of blood burst from his fingertip, lancing toward Yuan like a high‐pressure water stream.","An overwhelming aura abruptly exploded from Yuan’s body as he activated Demonic Awakening, his dreadful presence instantly engulfing the entire area.","<Blood Manipulation>","Just as the Supreme Ancestor’s blood beam was about to pierce Yuan’s brow, it abruptly split into two streams and moved around his head, missing completely.","\"What?!\" the Supreme Ancestor cried out when he saw Yuan’s transformation.","He had met countless demons in his lifetime, but never one with an appearance like Yuan’s, not to mention his dreadful presence that surpassed even Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"W-Who the hell are you?!\" The Supreme Adviser asked.","\"I’m just livestock,\" Yuan calmly said.","He then turned to stare at the Supreme Ancestor and said, \"I wasn’t going to do anything to you, but since you went out of your way to attack me first, I might as well avenge the Demon Sealers you murdered out of jealousy.\""]},{"number":2420,"title":"Chapter 2420: Fighting an Absolute God","paragraphs":["Despite saying he wanted to avenge the Demon Sealers killed by the Supreme Ancestor, in truth, it was just an excuse for Yuan to test out his new demon form.","\"Arrogant bastard, let’s see if you’ll still dare to talk once I beat the shit out of you!\" The Supreme Ancestor roared as he lunged at Yuan.","\"Blood Manipulation!\" The Supreme Ancestor summoned a long spear with his own blood.","<Blood Manipulation>","A crimson sword formed of blood appeared in Yuan’s grasp.","Since he wanted to test the limits of his new transformation, as well as his new ability ’Blood Manipulation’, Yuan decided to fight the Supreme Ancestor without using any Demon Sealing Aura.","\"Hahaha! How foolish of you to challenge me, who used to be a Supreme Ruler, with Blood Manipulation!\" The Supreme Ancestor laughed as he thrust his crimson spear straight at Yuan’s face.","\"Foolish?\" Yuan murmured, swinging his crimson sword to meet the strike.","Sha!","In the next instant, Yuan’s blade sheared the spear cleanly in two.","\"Haha—hah?!\"","The Supreme Ancestor almost choked on his own laughter as he stared at his destroyed weapon in disbelief.","\"What?! His Blood Manipulation is even stronger than the Supreme Ancestor’s?! How is that possible?!\" The Supreme Adviser’s eyes nearly bulged from their sockets.","In the Demonic Realm, Blood Manipulation was the most basic and widespread technique, turning one’s own blood into power. It was akin to cultivators using Qi Manipulation, but instead of controlling the spiritual energy in the air, they would control the blood in their body, which is made possible only because of their regeneration.","However, its power depended heavily on the strength of one’s bloodline, and those with the stronger lineage naturally wielded the stronger art.","As a former Supreme Ruler, the Supreme Ancestor naturally possessed one of the strongest bloodlines in the world, and every Supreme Ruler’s bloodline was further strengthened during their succession ritual. For that very reason, he was utterly stunned to see a nobody overpower him in Blood Manipulation.","\"I... I refuse to believe that his Blood Manipulation is stronger than mine! It must have been a fluke!\"","The Supreme Ancestor immediately summoned another spear, one that looked different. Its color was a darker crimson, and its surface was glossy and hardened like forged steel.","Clang!","When they clashed again a moment later, neither weapon shattered. To onlookers it may seem like a draw, but the Supreme Ancestor knew he had lost. Even after refining his Blood Manipulation with another technique, he still couldn’t overpower Yuan’s ordinary Blood Manipulation.","Unbeknownst to the Supreme Ancestor, this was Yuan’s first time using Blood Manipulation, so he was essentially fighting a complete novice.","\"That’s a neat trick. Let me see if I can do it...\" Yuan said.","In the next instant, his crimson sword turned glossy and far more refined.","\"You—!\"","Before the Supreme Ancestor could finish speaking, Yuan’s blade sliced clean through his spear and then through his body, severing his head from his neck.","The Supreme Ancestor quickly distanced himself from Yuan as his body regenerated.","\"So you can strengthen your Blood Manipulation with Celestial Qi in such a manner, huh? Thanks for the guidance,\" Yuan remarked with a smile afterward.","The Supreme Ancestor went silent for a heartbeat, then began to tremble with rage. Then, an overwhelming aura erupted from his body, surging with a force reminiscent of Celestial Qi yet clearly far superior.","\"This is the power of an Absolute God, huh?\" A faint, excited smile tugged at Yuan’s lips.","After fighting and killing many True Gods—and even clashing with Eternals—Yuan had a solid grasp of an Absolute God’s capabilities. He estimated the Supreme Ancestor’s strength at roughly thirty percent of Saaruk’s true power, far from enough to contend with an Eternal, but more than sufficient to annihilate anything below them.","’I couldn’t even contend with Saaruk at twenty percent of his power back then, even while using Eternal Essence. Let’s see how well I fare against thirty percent now... without Eternal Essence or Demon Sealing Aura,’ Yuan thought as he braced for the Supreme Ancestor’s attack.","However, the Supreme Ancestor didn’t attack immediately. Instead, he used Blood Manipulation to encase himself in crimson armor from head to toe, taking on the appearance of a blood‐red knight.","\"I went easy on you because of your cultivation, but it seems I have severely underestimated you, so I will be fighting you with my full strength now.\" The Supreme Ancestor declared as he pointed his spear at Yuan.","\"I’m so scared.\" Yuan remarked in a sarcastic voice.","\"DIE!\"","Without warning, the Supreme Ancestor used Void Manipulation to initiate his attack.","Fortunately, Yuan had trained his Void Manipulation before arriving at the City of Blood, or else he wouldn’t have been able to keep up with the Supreme Ancestor’s movements.","Clang!","Yuan managed to block the Supreme Ancestor’s strike from the void, but his sword shattered after the exchange.","Without flinching, he simply formed another blade with Blood Manipulation. That, too, would break during their next clash, but with each repetition his proficiency grew, and every new sword emerged stronger than the last.","However, after hundreds of exchanges and swords later, Yuan realized that his Blood Manipulation refined with Celestial Qi was nowhere near competing with the power of an Absolute God, so he tried something else.","<Absolute Dragon Awakening!>","For the first time, Yuan activated two awakenings at once.","His aura vanished for a heartbeat, then surged back several times stronger. The prismatic crystal in his chest flared with golden light, his right eye turned gold, and glistening scales spread across his body, forming a radiant golden armor.","\"What the hell did he just do?!\" The Supreme Ancestor froze mid‐attack, staring at Yuan in bewilderment. His aura now carried a distinctly beastly ferocity, as though he’d transformed into a beast himself.","Yuan examined his body with delight and satisfaction.","’This worked out better than I thought it would... No, I wasn’t even sure if this would work,’ he smiled inwardly."]},{"number":2421,"title":"Chapter 2421: Fighting the Supreme Ancestor","paragraphs":["\"You! What the hell are you really?!\" The Supreme Ancestor shouted at Yuan after seeing the drastic change in his aura.","\"I’m... human,\" Yuan calmly replied.","\"Wha—\"","The Supreme Ancestor’s eyes widened with disbelief, but before he could even process what he heard, Yuan attacked him.","\"Did you just say you’re a human?!\" The Supreme Ancestor questioned, asking for confirmation. \"How is that even possible with the gateway to the Divine Heaven sealed? You must be pulling my leg!\"","He refused to believe Yuan’s claim. After all, Yuan had been messing with him nonstop.","When they clashed again, Yuan’s sword no longer shattered after a single exchange, and it endured ten to twelve blows before breaking.","The Supreme Ancestor’s spear, meanwhile, remained intact. However, cracks had begun to appear across its surface.","’His prowess increased by this much?! This is my first time seeing someone with two stages of transformation!’ The Supreme Ancestor cried inwardly after the clash.","Meanwhile, Yuan was wondering if he could combine three forms into one.","’If I can use two different awakenings at once, what’s stopping me from using three—even four at once?’","Without hesitation, Yuan proceeded to test his limitations.","<True Phoenix Awakening!>","Suddenly, a pair of prismatic, flame-wreathed wings burst from Yuan’s back, while his horns were engulfed in the same dazzling, multicolored fire.","\"This feels... incredible!\" Yuan laughed, each breath spilling out flickers of flame.","\"This... damn monster...\" The Supreme Ancestor swallowed nervously, struggling to comprehend the unprecedented existence standing before him.","Although Yuan’s aura was undeniably terrifying, that alone wasn’t what unsettled the Supreme Ancestor.","It was the sheer absurdity of Yuan’s existence—like facing a being that could evolve without limit—that filled him with a deep, instinctive unease.","’Why don’t I use my Heavenly White Tiger Transformation while I am at it?!’","The mere thought of wielding four forms at once sent a thrill through Yuan, his body trembling with excitement. Yet, the moment he tried, he felt an invisible barrier halt him, preventing him from taking that final step.","’Is three forms my limit now? I guess I’ll try again later...’ Yuan sighed inwardly.","Though he wasn’t certain what conditions he needed to meet to activate more transformations simultaneously, Yuan had a strong feeling that such a feat was not only possible, but it was inevitable.","Yuan turned to look at the Supreme Ancestor, who was waiting to see if he was going to transform any more, and said, \"Sorry for the wait.\"","Yuan activated Blood Manipulation, but this time, it emerged a little different.","A radiant golden aura shimmered around its blade, while silver flames coiled along its length, giving it an otherworldly presence.","\"Is that all you’ve got?! Any tricks left?!\" the Supreme Ancestor roared as he clashed with Yuan once more.","The moment their weapons met, a surge of flames erupted from Yuan’s blade, instantly engulfing him.","\"Damn it! What kind of fire is this?! It won’t go out no matter what I do to them!\"","To rid himself of the flames, the Supreme Ancestor was forced to tear away his own burning flesh again and again, as he was unable to act quickly enough before the fire spread.","Unwilling to endure such torment in close combat, he immediately shifted tactics, retreating into long-range attacks and unleashing a barrage of bloody techniques from afar.","\"Supreme Blood Arts, Endless Crimson Barrage!\"","The Supreme Ancestor summoned millions of spear-like projectiles and threw them all in Yuan’s direction simultaneously.","<Blood Manipulation>","To generate blood at a sufficient rate, Yuan drove his hand straight into his own chest, punching a hole into it without hesitation.","From the wound, he drew out his blood in a grotesque yet controlled manner, harvesting it directly from his own body.","Then, using that blood, he erected a crimson barrier around himself, shielding his body from the relentless barrage, each projectile carrying enough power to slay a Cultivation God.","However, midway through the assault, Yuan’s eyes flickered with a sudden resolve. Without warning, he dismissed the barrier, allowing the Supreme Ancestor’s attacks to strike him head-on.","This greatly puzzled the Supreme Ancestor, but he had no issues with Yuan willingly stepping into his own grave.","The projectiles tore into him without mercy, riddling his body with countless holes, destroying his flesh faster than it could regenerate.","However, even when his entire body was reduced to nothing, with every cell annihilated, Yuan did not die.","In the very next instant, he regenerated, his body restored in perfect condition as though he had never been harmed at all.","\"What in Demon God’s name? How did he survive even after his heart was completely annihilated?!\" the Supreme Ancestor exclaimed, disbelief etched across his face.","By ’heart,’ he was referring to the crystal embedded within Yuan’s chest—the very core that served as a demon’s greatest weakness.","While some powerful demons like the Supreme Ancestor could survive having their heart shattered into many pieces, not even he would survive having his heart completely annihilated.","\"I told you why already. It’s because I am human!\"","\"Can it really be...? Is he really a human from the Divine Heavens?\" The Supreme Ancestor wondered to himself aloud.","Yuan suddenly turned his head, his gaze snapping toward a distant direction where another battle raged.","He had been so focused on his clash with the Supreme Ancestor that he had all but forgotten about the confrontation between Supreme Ruler Grant and Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"I expected it to be intense... but to erase half the city this quickly...\"","While his own battle with the Supreme Ancestor had already devastated the surroundings and reshaped the terrain, it was nothing compared to the destruction caused by the two Supreme Rulers, where entire sections of the city, along with the very ground beneath them, had been utterly vaporized.","Yuan shifted his gaze back to the Supreme Ancestor, a faint smile tugging at his lips.","\"Let’s not let them steal all the spotlight,\" he said calmly. \"Shall we go all out, too?\""]},{"number":2422,"title":"Chapter 2422: Divine Paragon Unleashed","paragraphs":["\"Go out all...? So you’re claiming that you’re still hiding some strength?\" The Supreme Ancestor narrowed his eyes at Yuan, his gaze filled with anger.","Without another word, Yuan unleashed his Chaotic Essence, and his already terrifying aura twisted into something utterly incomprehensible, as though the Demon God himself had descended upon the world.","Due to his Demonic Awakening, which increased his Chaotic Essence when in his demon form, his already powerful Chaotic Essence only became even more powerful.","\"Ready or not, here I come!\" Yuan shouted as he charged at the Supreme Ancestor, who continued trying to keep his distance from Yuan because of his flames.","Although the flames caused him no physical pain, they still melted his body and hindered his movements. However, their most troublesome trait was their ability to burn away his energy.","In an attempt to keep Yuan away, the Supreme Ancestor used Void Manipulation and attacked at the same time.","Unfortunately for him, Yuan could also use Void Manipulation at a similar level, and none of his attacks were effective against Yuan, who could easily recover from any damage he received.","For the first time, the Supreme Ancestor experienced what it was like for humans to face demons in their earliest encounters—battling an incomprehensible existence that simply refused to die.","It wasn’t that Yuan had surpassed the Supreme Ancestor in strength, either. Even with his Chaotic Essence, he still fell slightly short. What made him so troublesome was his absurd resilience, which turned the battle into a never-ending ordeal for the Supreme Ancestor.","Seeing the Supreme Ancestor struggle against Yuan, the Supreme Adviser—who had initially chosen not to intervene, confident his presence wouldn’t be necessary—finally decided to step in and assist the Supreme Ancestor.","\"Supreme Blood Arts, Grand Severance!\"","The Supreme Adviser unleashed a crimson arc of blood, aiming directly at Yuan’s back.","Yet Yuan didn’t even spare it a glance, much less attempt to block it.","A moment later, the attack struck him squarely, but to no one’s surprise, it caused no damage. Yuan didn’t so much as flinch, continuing to chase after the Supreme Ancestor as if the Supreme Adviser didn’t exist at all.","The Supreme Adviser, who had never suffered such blatant disregard, trembled with fury, his rage boiling over as he unleashed an even more relentless barrage of attacks upon Yuan.","\"This... goddamn monster!\" The Supreme Ancestor cursed out loud as he stopped running away and unleashed his most powerful techniques at Yuan.","\"Supreme Blood Arts, Crimson Mirage!\"","The Supreme Ancestor severed one of his own arms, letting his blood pour freely into the air.","From that flowing crimson, many figures began to take shape, molding itself into a perfect replica of him, creating multiple clones in seconds.","<God of War’s Astral Arts!>","Yuan created a massive avatar, but he also used Blood Manipulation on it, turning it into a crimson giant.","With one swing of its sword, the avatar completely annihilated the Supreme Ancestor’s clones.","\"What is that ridiculous technique?!\"","The Supreme Ancestor stared at the giant behind Yuan with widened eyes.","In the next moment, the Supreme Ancestor chose to imitate Yuan, conjuring a crimson giant of his own. However, unlike Yuan’s avatar, his creation lacked refinement, its form crude and unstable.","Not long after, the two towering figures collided, their clash shaking the heavens.","Though the Supreme Ancestor’s construct was inferior in form, it compensated with raw might, fueled by the overwhelming energy of an Absolute God.","Still, it fell short and ultimately lost to Yuan’s avatar after a couple of exchanges.","After shattering the crimson giant, Yuan’s avatar went straight for the Supreme Ancestor.","<God of War’s Final Execution!>","The crimson avatar unleashed a relentless barrage, each strike growing heavier and more devastating than the last.","\"This... irritating bastard!\" the Supreme Ancestor roared, his defenses finally breaking under the overwhelming assault. In the next instant, his entire body was obliterated.","However, for demons, the heart was not merely a vital organ. It served as their heart, Dantian, and even their soul. As such, it was far more resilient than a human’s soul refined with Soul Strength, making it exceedingly difficult to destroy.","At Yuan’s current level, even with his overwhelming strength, he could not shatter the heart of an Absolute God without resorting to Eternal Essence.","Such a core was comparable to roughly thirty percent of Saaruk’s power, and considering Saaruk stood among the upper echelon of Eternals, an Absolute God could realistically rival nearly half the strength of an ordinary Eternal.","Since Yuan couldn’t destroy the Supreme Ancestor’s core, he regenerated back to full seconds later.","\"Looks like you cannot kill me, either.\" The Supreme Ancestor remarked with a cold smirk on his face.","\"I wouldn’t be so sure about that if I were you,\" Yuan replied with a profound smile.","The Supreme Ancestor’s brows furrowed as he wondered if Yuan was just bluffing or really had more tricks hidden in his sleeves.","\"So, when are you going to fight seriously?\" Yuan suddenly asked him.","\"What do you mean? I have been fighting seriously this whole time.\"","\"I mean, you haven’t really displayed the power of an Absolute God besides infusing some of your energy into your blood. Surely, you can do more than that as an Absolute God, or you’re no different from a True God.\"","The Supreme Ancestor narrowed his eyes. Yuan was right—he had been holding back the power of an Absolute God.","However, it wasn’t out of arrogance or because he deemed it unnecessary. Rather, it was a force so dangerous that it was reserved only for true life-and-death situations.","Although he couldn’t kill Yuan, the reverse was equally true.","The battle had reached a deadlock with neither side able to truly end the other, so his life was not in genuine danger.","\"I am not foolish enough to use a power that could destroy myself when my life is not in any danger,\" remarked the Supreme Ancestor.","\"Oh? It’s that powerful?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, his interest piqued.","\"What the hell would you know when you’re not even a True God, much less an Absolute God?\" The Supreme Ancestor sneered in disdain.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan spoke, \"In other words, you’ll only use that power when your life is threatened, huh?\"","In the next moment, Yuan summoned the Demon Devouring Sword, a cold smile spreading across his lips.","\"I had hoped to defeat you without relying on this power... but it seems that was too much to expect at my current level.\"","\"What... What is that sword?\" the Supreme Ancestor muttered, his body trembling at the ominous aura it exuded.","\"Bastard! How many have you slaughtered with that weapon?!\" the Supreme Adviser shouted, his voice filled with alarm.","The sword exuded a terrifying presence perceptible only to demons—a malignant aura akin to killing intent, forged through the slaughter of countless lives.","<Demon Sealing Zone>","Without offering a response, Yuan activated the Demon Sealing Zone, erecting a barrier around himself and the Supreme Ancestor, as though he intended to fight to the death within it.","\"This blasphemous power!!! You were a Demon Sealer this entire time?!\" the Supreme Ancestor recoiled in shock, his face twisted with disbelief.","\"You wanted to learn Demon Sealing Aura, right? Why don’t I teach you... just like how I taught the others?\"","A vicious light flickered in Yuan’s eyes as an immense amount of Demon Sealing Aura exploded from his body.","\"Against someone who used to be a Supreme Ruler, I guess it’ll be fine to go all out for once...\"","Yuan closed his eyes and recalled Tian Chenyu’s memories.","\"Demon Annihilation Array.\"","The Demon Sealing Zone suddenly shifted, its surroundings warping as it transformed into a massive structure—one that closely resembled the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library.","At the same time, the Supreme Ancestor felt his strength being steadily siphoned away by the array. The entire space was saturated with overwhelming Demon Sealing Aura, and under its influence, his power was not only being drained but actively suppressed.","However, Yuan wasn’t done yet.","<Swords of Eternal Torment>","Countless shimmering swords materialized out of thin air, blanketing the entire space like a gleaming storm ready to descend.","\"Demon Annihilation Legion.\"","The swords formed by the Swords of Eternal Torment began to expand and reshape, contorting into humanoid figures—each one taking form as a warrior, armed with a shimmering sword in hand.","Each of these warriors exuded immense Demon Sealing Aura, enough to instantly seal a ninth-level False God with a single strike.","Yuan then lowered himself, taking a seat upon the demon that was summoned using the Demon Devouring Sword, his presence towering over the field like an unrivaled sovereign.","\"You son of a... You can’t be...\" The Supreme Ancestor’s eyes trembled as a long-buried memory of a figure who had once plunged their world into terror countless eons ago surfaced.","\"Allow me to reintroduce myself,\" Yuan said calmly, his gaze unwavering. \"I am called Yuan now, but I was once known as Tian Chenyu—\"","He paused, his presence deepening as the air itself seemed to grow heavier.","\"—or, as others liked to call me, Divine Paragon.\""]},{"number":2423,"title":"Chapter 2423: Divine Paragon Returns!","paragraphs":["\"Divine—?! That maniac has returned?!\" the Supreme Adviser cried out, his voice trembling as though his greatest nightmare had come to life.","\"No way!\" Purple, who was watching from afar, nearly fell from the sky after learning of Yuan’s true identity.","\"What did he just say?\" Even Supreme Ruler Grant halted his clash with Supreme Ruler Dena, his gaze snapping toward Yuan as his eyes widened in disbelief.","\"That’s the lunatic from the other world—the one who went on a killing spree the moment he arrived?!\"","The demons observing from a distance erupted into chaos, their voices rising in a storm of shock and fear.","\"What were the people from the other world called again? Hymen?\"","\"I swear they were called hyumen.\"","\"They’re called humans, you idiots!\"","\"Blasphemer! Why the hell have you returned to our world?! Are you trying to collude with that fiend to take over our world?!\" The Supreme Ancestor questioned Yuan.","\"I heard you were quite close with her, after all!\"","\"Taking over your world? Isn’t that what your current Supreme Ruler is plotting against my world?\" Yuan sneered.","\"T-That’s—!\"","The Supreme Ancestor opened his mouth to speak, only to fall silent a second later, realizing he had no excuse to offer.","\"Not even going to try and defend yourselves, huh?\" Yuan shook his head.","\"We are only doing what must be done!\" the Supreme Adviser suddenly shouted. \"Otherwise, our world will fall into chaos!\"","\"So, to resolve your crisis, you intend to plunge another world into chaos... for the second time?\" Yuan’s voice rang out, carrying for miles.","\"In that case...\" his gaze turned cold as he continued, \"I now have every reason to resume my former goal—the complete eradication of demons!\"","Yuan’s already ridiculous Demon Sealing Aura surged even more violently.","He pointed at the Supreme Ancestor and commanded, \"Bring me his core, then annihilate every single demon in this world!\"","At his command, the warriors surged forward in unison, each one moving with the precision and mastery of seasoned veterans, striking the Supreme Ancestor from all directions.","Even at this point, the Supreme Ancestor refused to use his powers as an Absolute God.","\"Look at what you’ve done...\" Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly remarked while shaking her head.","\"What do you mean?\" asked Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"Do you have any idea how much effort I had put into changing his mind about annihilating our kind?\" she sighed. \"And you just undid all of my effort with your foolish ambition.\"","Supreme Ruler Grant sneered in disdain, \"Do you really believe that a single mere human can wipe out our entire race? As I expected, you’ve gone crazy after becoming a Forsaken.\"","\"What do you know? It’s not like you’ve ever fought him,\" Supreme Ruler Dena said. \"If I hadn’t stopped him that day, none of you would even be alive right now. And that was ages ago. He’s far stronger now than he was then. If you can’t even defeat me, you can forget about defeating him.\"","\"In that case, there won’t be any problem!\" Supreme Ruler Grant laughed as he dove back into battle, assailing her with his fake Eternal Essence.","Despite her overwhelming strength, Supreme Ruler Dena was nearly helpless against the Eternal Essence, even if it was an inferior version. Not only did Grant’s control improve with every exchange, she also had to expend a tremendous amount of energy just to defend against it.","One might assume she could simply endure his blows and regenerate the damage, but Eternal Essence was fundamentally different. It was a power that could erase existence itself, damage that no regeneration can repair.","That being said, this didn’t mean Supreme Ruler Dena couldn’t regenerate an arm lost to Eternal Essence. But if the same spot took too much of that damage, the existence of that limb could be erased entirely and become impossible to recover.","Suddenly, as if struck by enlightenment, Supreme Ruler Dena began recalling the sensation of wielding Eternal Essence—or at least what she wielded while under the curse’s control.","\"Y-You! Why the hell do you have that power?!\" Supreme Ruler Grant shouted, eyes and mouth agape. \"Don’t tell me the Demon God bestowed it on you too! Did he give it to me because he knew you could wield it?!\"","\"Who knows?\" Supreme Ruler Dena replied with a cold smile, refusing to elaborate just to mess with him.","However, although she could wield Eternal Essence again, it was nowhere near the level she’d commanded in the past. Even so, it was more than enough to level the battlefield, allowing her to fight Supreme Ruler Grant on equal footing, and like him, her mastery improved with every exchange.","Meanwhile, the Supreme Ancestor had all his limbs, and even half his body, turned into stone after enduring hundreds of thousands of strikes from Yuan’s Demon Annihilation Legion.","\"What do you think? Are you able to grasp the Demon Sealing Aura in your body? Think you can wield it?\" Yuan asked the Supreme Ancestor.","\"I—\"","The Supreme Ancestor opened his mouth to respond, but Yuan immediately interrupted.","\"You don’t need to tell me because I already know the answer. You know, there’s a reason why you cannot wield Demon Sealing Aura.\"","\"The reason I cannot wield that power...?\" The Supreme Ancestor fell silent, listening intently. He had always wondered why he couldn’t wield Demon Sealing Aura despite his superior talent and bloodline compared to those who could.","Yuan pointed at him with the Demon Devouring Sword and spoke with a look of disdain, \"Among those few demons who could wield Demon Sealing Aura, all of them had incredibly pure hearts. In other words, your heart is too corrupted to use Demon Sealing Aura.\"","\"What kind of bullshit reasoning is that?!\" the Supreme Ancestor roared, his aura suddenly skyrocketing toward the heavens.","\"Enough of this farce! I’ll kill you, even if my entire body falls apart!\"","In the next instant, an unfathomable, profound energy erupted from him, filling the entire battlefield and collapsing on Yuan like an invisible mountain.","<You have discovered the existence of Refined Celestial Essence>"]},{"number":2424,"title":"Chapter 2424: Refined Celestial Essence","paragraphs":["’Refined Celestial Essence, huh...’ Yuan mused calmly as the Supreme Ancestor’s overwhelming aura bore down on him.","In that moment, he finally understood why the Supreme Ancestor had refrained from using this power until now, as the sheer destructive force it carried was so intense that it even surpassed Chaotic Essence itself.","From the pressure alone, Yuan could feel his bones creaking and beginning to crack. Had his physique not been tempered to such extremes, that overwhelming force would have crushed him to death on the spot.","’Looks like it might really be impossible to fight him without Eternal Essence...’ Yuan sighed inwardly.","Even so, he decided not to use it immediately, as he wanted to gauge his own limit.","\"Die for me, you blasphemer!\" the Supreme Ancestor roared as he unleashed his Refined Celestial Essence in a violent surge, wielding it as pure, unrestrained power without the need for any technique.","An invisible but overbearing energy washed over the Demon Annihilation Array, creating cracks throughout the structure. However, it was unable to destroy the array, and any damage was quickly restored.","As for the Demon Annihilation Legion, they were unable to bear the pressure and were all destroyed simultaneously.","When the Refined Celestial Essence slammed into Yuan, it felt as though his entire body was being shattered into countless fragments, like a jar being smashed over and over again, even after it had already been reduced to pieces.","As for his soul, it too was vaporized. But as long as Yuan’s will remained unbroken, it could not be truly extinguished, and moments later, it reformed. Then, his body regenerated completely.","\"He can still regenerate even with his soul destroyed...? I thought that was his kind’s one true weakness!\" the Supreme Ancestor cried out in disbelief.","Unbeknownst to him, although Yuan was technically human, he had long since transcended the limits of humanity.","<Eternal Constitution(Incompleted) has activated>","<Your understanding of Refined Celestial Essence has improved slightly>","\"Is that all you’ve got?\" Yuan scoffed. \"I was curious what kind of power you were hiding... but this is rather disappointing.\"","The Supreme Ancestor became even more enraged and began unleashing even more Refined Celestial Essence without regard for his own well-being, as the energy was so destructive that it harmed its own user.","The Demon Annihilation Array eventually collapsed, and Yuan’s body and soul were destroyed multiple times.","<Eternal Constitution(Incompleted) has activated>","<Your understanding of Refined Celestial Essence has improved slightly>","Yet, Yuan regenerated fully moments later.","\"Why?! Why won’t you fucking die?!\" the Supreme Ancestor roared, unleashing his most powerful attack yet.","This time, however, Yuan did not remain still to endure it. An otherworldly energy erupted from his body, surging forth to meet the incoming Refined Celestial Essence head-on.","For a brief moment, the two forces clashed in a violent stalemate before Yuan’s Eternal Essence suddenly surged, overwhelming the Refined Celestial Essence entirely.","It tore through the attack without resistance and crashed into the Supreme Ancestor, annihilating most of his body in an instant.","\"This energy is...?!\" Supreme Ruler Grant halted his fight with Supreme Ruler Dena for a second time to shift his attention to Yuan.","\"How the hell is a human wielding the Demon God’s power?!\" he exclaimed in a sharp, bewildered tone.","Although he could tell that Yuan wielded Eternal Essence, he couldn’t discern the difference between his own and Yuan’s true, authentic Eternal Essence.","\"Do you now understand why you won’t be able to stop him if he wants to eradicate our existence?\" Supreme Ruler Dena said with a smile on her face.","\"The... The Demon God would never allow such a thing to happen!\"","\"I wouldn’t be so sure about that,\" Supreme Ruler Dena shook her head.","\"What the hell do you know when you’ve never even spoken to him! He bestowed me this power for a reason! Because he cares!\"","\"Whatever you say...\" Supreme Ruler Dena said before launching an attack at him, resuming their fight.","Meanwhile, the Supreme Ancestor regenerated the damage caused by Yuan’s Eternal Essence with difficulty.","\"You... that power... it’s what the Supreme Ruler is using! How did you acquire it?! Did the Demon God bestow it upon you as well?!\"","The Supreme Ancestor’s disbelief deepened. In his eyes, Yuan’s very existence was an affront to the Demon God, so the thought of him wielding such power felt like a direct insult to everything he believed in.","Moreover, this essentially meant that Yuan had the direct approval of the Demon God, something even he lacked as someone who once held the title of Supreme Ruler.","Yuan silently shrugged in response, refusing to satisfy his curiosity.","\"Damn it...\" The Supreme Ancestor felt perplexed, his thoughts in turmoil as he weighed whether to continue the fight. To stand against Yuan now after learning of the truth meant willingly opposing someone acknowledged by the Demon God—an act no different from blasphemy.","\"What’s wrong? Are you out of energy already? Or are you simply giving up?\" Yuan suddenly remarked.","A provocative smile tugged at his lips as he continued, \"What a pathetic little bitch.\"","\"!!!\"","Hearing Yuan’s insult, something snapped within the Supreme Ancestor.","\"AAAAAHHHH!\"","A violent surge of energy erupted from the Supreme Ancestor, his aura twisting and distorting as it transformed into something entirely unrecognizable.","\"Oh...? Is he...?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow as a familiar smell—a stench started emitting from the Supreme Ancestor.","\"Bastard! So what if you received the Demon God’s approval?! Even if you were the Demon God himself, I would still dare to devour you!\" The Supreme Ancestor roared like an unrestrained beast.","\"Supreme Ancestor?! What are you—?!\" The Supreme Adviser’s eyes widened with bewilderment as the Supreme Ancestor had suddenly turned into a Forsaken.","\"To think you’d turn into a Forsaken just like that...\" Yuan said, his tone calm as his eyes observed the transformation. \"This is my first time witnessing it firsthand, and it’s quite disappointing. Then again, you’ve done nothing but disappoint me since the beginning.\"","He paused briefly before continuing, his voice turning indifferent.","\"Oh well. I suppose there’s no longer any reason to spare you now... not that I had such intentions, anyway.\""]},{"number":2425,"title":"Chapter 2425: Devouring the Supreme Ancestor","paragraphs":["\"T-There must be a misunderstanding! The Supreme Ancestor can’t have turned into a Forsaken!\" The Supreme Adviser tried to reason with Yuan, but he wasn’t having any of it.","\"The foul stench coming from him, there’s no mistaking it,\" Yuan remarked as he stopped holding back and attacked the Supreme Ancestor with his Eternal Essence.","Despite the Supreme Ancestor’s superior cultivation as an Absolute God, it was nowhere near enough to handle Yuan’s Eternal Essence. After he devoured the curse that had taken control of Supreme Ruler Dena’s body in the Deprived Crimson Valley, his Eternal Essence improved tremendously, which was stronger than Supreme Ruler Grant and Supreme Ruler Dena... combined.","\"If you kill the Supreme Ancestor, you’ll truly become the enemy of this world!\" The Supreme Adviser continued.","Yuan sneered, \"If you don’t shut up, I’ll kill you too.\"","The Supreme Adviser trembled at his cold words.","Yuan continued, \"You tossed Dena into the Deprived Crimson Valley without solid evidence that she’d turned into a Forsaken, yet you’re going to spare this asshole? There’s really something wrong with your logic!\"","\"That’s...\" Unable to refute Yuan’s words, the Supreme Adviser turned silent and lowered his head in shame.","\"Die, you insufferable bastard!\" the Supreme Ancestor roared, hurling everything he had at Yuan.","\"I should be saying that to you,\" Yuan sneered as he coated the Demon Devouring Sword.","<Heaven Splitting Sword Strike>","Instead of using spiritual energy, Yuan activated Heaven Splitting Sword Strike using pure Eternal Essence, something he’d never done before due to a lack of Eternal Essence.","An unstoppable beam of Eternal Essence shot toward the Supreme Ancestor, who tried to run but was suddenly restricted by the Demon Annihilation Array Yuan had set up again shortly after his last one was destroyed.","\"You—!\"","The beam completely engulfed the Supreme Ancestor, and his silhouette was almost instantly vaporized. However, even with such a powerful attack, it was not able to completely destroy his heart.","Seeing this, Yuan tossed the Demon Devouring Sword at it.","\"Devour it!\" he commanded.","The instant the Demon Devouring Sword’s tip touched the Supreme Ancestor’s heart, the illusion of a colossal jaw manifested, snapping shut around the crystal and devouring it.","<The Demon Devouring Sword has consumed the Supreme Ancestor’s Core>","<The Demon Devouring Sword has begun to refine the Supreme Ancestor’s Core>","<The Demon Devouring Sword has fulfilled all conditions for its evolution>","<The Demon Devouring Sword has begun to evolve>","\"Hm?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow when he saw these notifications, looking pleasantly surprised by it.","He never knew the Demon Devouring Sword could evolve, much less that it was already in the process of its evolution.","’Looks like I still haven’t recalled all of Tian Chenyu’s memories...’","However, now that he thought about it, the fact the Demon Devouring Sword could evolve wasn’t too surprising, as it was originally an ordinary sword that evolved into a powerful treasure specifically meant to kill demons.","And while the Demon Devouring Sword has devoured countless demons throughout the years, including high-ranking demons like Demon Emperors, it had never tasted the core of a Supreme Ancestor, a demon that once ruled the Demonic Realm as a Supreme Ruler.","Moments later...","<The Demon Devouring Sword has evolved into ’Demon Annihilation Sword’>","<The Demon Annihilation Sword has gained new Unique Abilities!>","[Unique Ability: When wielding the Demon Annihilation Sword, all Demon Sealing Techniques will have their power amplified by 666,666% -> 6,666,666%]","[Unique Ability(5): All demons below the rank of ’Supreme Ruler’ that are struck by this sword will be instantly annihilated. All annihilated demons will be considered devoured.]","[Unique Ability(6): The Demon Annihilation Sword can transform into a Sword Spirit, possessing a will of its own.]","\"Oh? It can also transform now?\" Yuan muttered after seeing its new ability.","Without hesitation, he immediately tested the ability out.","In the next moment, the Demon Annihilation Sword began to change. Its blade extended and reshaped into a humanoid torso and limbs, while the hilt twisted and formed into a human head.","However, it didn’t fully become human—only a rough approximation. It had no facial features or hair, appearing as a smooth, human‐sized mannequin.","\"Uhhh...\"","Just as Yuan thought the Demon Annihilation Sword had finished transforming, it suddenly trembled, and new details began to emerge. Long black hair spilled from its head, and distinctly feminine features formed on its face. Its body also became taller and more slender.","\"Y-You...\"","Yuan’s eyes nearly bulged from their sockets at the Demon Annihilation Sword’s final form, his heart pounding like war drums.","Meanwhile, the Demon Annihilation Sword stared back at Yuan with her clear, hazel-colored eyes.","After a moment of silence, she muttered in a low voice, \"Chenyu...\"","Yuan swallowed nervously before subconsciously responding, \"Ai... Rong?\"","The Demon Annihilation Sword had shockingly taken the form of Tian Chenyu’s sweetheart, Ai Rong!","’No... there’s no way that’s the real Ai Rong. It must have taken the form of the person it believes Tian Chenyu loved most...’ Yuan thought.","Suddenly, the Demon Annihilation Sword turned away from Yuan to look at the Supreme Adviser, who was hovering not too far away with a bewildered expression on his face.","\"Demon...\"","The Demon Annihilation Sword muttered in a cold voice, then her expression twisted into a sadistic grin.","\"I’ll eradicate all of the demons in this world!\" she shouted, suddenly charging at the Supreme Adviser, who let out a piercing scream like a man haunted by a vengeful ghost before turning around and running away.","\"H-Hey! Stop! He’s not a target!\" Yuan hastily said to the Demon Annihilation Sword.","The Demon Annihilation Sword stopped chasing the Supreme Adviser.","However, before Yuan could even say anything else, she turned to look in the direction where Supreme Ruler Grant and Supreme Ruler Dena were fighting and flew toward them.","\"Wait!\"","Yuan shouted at her again, but instead of stopping, she actually quickened her pace.","\"Damn it! How do I even undo her transformation?!\" Yuan exclaimed as he chased after her."]},{"number":2426,"title":"Chapter 2426: Demon Annihilation Sword","paragraphs":["’Heavens! She can use Void Manipulation?!’ Yuan exclaimed inwardly when he saw the Demon Annihilation Sword using Void Manipulation to travel.","Meanwhile, Supreme Ruler Grant and Supreme Ruler Dena remained locked in a stalemate, neither able to gain the slightest advantage over the other.","Although Supreme Ruler Dena had a much better understanding of Eternal Essence, Supreme Ruler Grant’s Eternal Essence was naturally stronger since it was created by a real Eternal—a Prime Eternal, no less. This allowed him to match Supreme Ruler Dena’s prowess despite having a weaker... barely any understanding of Eternal Essence.","It was like a talentless cultivator wielding a priceless treasure against a true genius armed with nothing more than a broken blade.","Suddenly, they halted mid-clash, their attention snapping toward a powerful, unfamiliar presence rapidly approaching.","Not only was its aura overwhelmingly strong, it also carried an insane amount of the very energy all demons feared—Demon Sealing Aura.","\"It’s not Yuan... who is that?\" Supreme Ruler Dena was shocked to see someone with as much Demon Sealing Aura as Yuan.","\"What a monster...\" Even Supreme Ruler Grant was surprised by her overwhelming presence.","Soon, the Demon Annihilation Sword appeared before them with an excited look on her face.","\"Foul demons, I will annihilate all of you!\"","The Demon Annihilation Sword suddenly appeared in her grasp. Then, without hesitation or warning, she attacked, lunging at Supreme Ruler Grant, who happened to be the closest to her.","\"This crazy little—!\"","Supreme Ruler Grant raised his arm that was coated in Eternal Essence to block her strike.","However, to his absolute surprise, the Demon Annihilation Sword tore right through it and severed his arm.","\"?!?!\"","Seeing this, Supreme Ruler Grant subconsciously distanced himself from her with a bewildered expression on his face.","It wasn’t as though she was using Eternal Essence, so how had she cut through it? Studying his severed arm more closely, he realized the Eternal Essence remained intact, and it was only the limb that had been cleaved away, as if her attack had passed straight through his Eternal Essence.","When Supreme Ruler Grant ran away, the Demon Annihilation Sword immediately turned her attention to Supreme Ruler Dena, who was now the closest to her.","\"Die, demon!\"","Witnessing what happened to Supreme Ruler Grant, Supreme Ruler Dena didn’t attempt to block her attack with Eternal Essence. Instead, Supreme Ruler Dena created a crimson barrier, but rather than using it to defend herself, she used it to trap the Demon Annihilation Sword.","Yet, not even a second after it enveloped the Demon Annihilation Sword, it was sliced in half by her.","\"So effortlessly?!\" Supreme Ruler Dena almost couldn’t believe her eyes.","The Demon Annihilation Sword had no cultivation base either, and her entire being seemed to be formed purely from Demon Sealing Aura.","While she was in a daze, the Demon Annihilation Sword teleported in front of Supreme Ruler Dena like a ghost.","\"Die!\"","The Demon Annihilation Sword brought her sword down, aimed at Supreme Ruler Dena’s head.","However, the Demon Annihilation Sword’s attack was halted by Yuan, who just caught up and blocked her attack with Number One Under Heaven.","\"Stop!\" Yuan shouted at her.","The Demon Annihilation Sword immediately withdrew her sword and stood still.","\"Why?\" she suddenly asked.","\"I thought you wanted to kill all demons? I am only following your will, Master.\"","Yuan rubbed his eyes and sighed, \"That was ages ago when I was still Tian Chenyu. I don’t have such ambitions nowadays.\"","\"Then what is my purpose? If I cannot kill demons, then I am worthless,\" she said in a cold voice.","\"I never said we won’t be killing a demon ever again,\" Yuan shook his head and clarified, \"I am just saying that we no longer kill every demon in sight, especially now that we know there are two different kinds of demons, and it was the Forsaken that wreaked havoc in the Nine Heavens.\"","\"What about those two?\" The Demon Annihilation Sword pointed at the Supreme Rulers behind him.","\"They look delicious,\" she added.","\"The one behind me is not a target. She’s a friend,\" Yuan said.","\"As for that one...\" Yuan’s gaze shifted to Supreme Ruler Grant, their eyes locking.","After a brief silence, he smiled calmly. \"You know what? You can go ahead and kill him.\"","\"This son of a bi—!\"","\"Yay!\"","Supreme Ruler Grant couldn’t even finish cursing at Yuan before the Demon Annihilation Sword lunged at him.","’Fuck! Why the hell is my arm regenerating so slowly?!’ he cried inwardly.","After the Demon Annihilation Sword severed his left hand earlier, it still hadn’t fully regenerated. Even when he focused on healing it, the process didn’t improve and continued to recover at a snail’s pace.","\"Die, demon, die!\"","The Demon Annihilation Sword attacked like a madman while Supreme Ruler Grant focused on avoiding her attacks, not daring to clash with her for obvious reasons.","After some time, the Demon Annihilation Sword stopped chasing after him and mumbled, \"Arise.\"","The next moment, thousands... even millions of demons appeared out of thin air.","\"What the fuck is this?! She can create demons?!\" Supreme Ruler Grant exclaimed, unaware that they were all demons that she’d devoured in the past.","\"Kill him!\"","At the Demon Annihilation Sword’s command, the demons rushed at Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"Stop! As the Supreme Ruler, I command all of you to stop!\" Supreme Ruler Grant tried to command them using his Power of Authority as the Supreme Ruler, but the demons completely ignored him and continued to lunge at him.","Seeing this, Supreme Ruler Grant immediately gave up on trying to control them and resorted to killing them instead.","\"Get out of my way, you damn ants!\"","Just by releasing his aura, he instantly vaporized almost all of the demons that surrounded him. After all, these demons retained their original strength at the time they were devoured and not strengthened in any way.","However, not even a second later, the Demon Annihilation Sword summoned even more demons to attack him."]},{"number":2427,"title":"Chapter 2427: One of Three Supreme Rulers","paragraphs":["\"Hey, bastard! Get your rabid mutt off me! I thought you were only killing Forsaken! I’m clearly not one!\" Supreme Ruler Grant shouted as he clashed against the relentless tide of demons summoned by the Demon Annihilation Sword.","\"Did I ever say that?\" Yuan replied, tilting his head with a puzzled expression. \"I may not kill ordinary demons without reason... but that doesn’t mean I won’t. If they’ve done something worthy of death, then I won’t hesitate to kill them.\"","He narrowed his gaze and continued, \"And you, who intends on invading my world, deserves death.\"","\"But I am not the only one with such ambitions! In fact, it was the other two Supreme Rulers who proposed this idea in the first place!\" Supreme Ruler Grant shouted, revealing a startling piece of information.","\"The other two Supreme Rulers?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow after hearing this.","He suddenly remembered that Supreme Ruler Grant was only one of three existing Supreme Rulers in this world, each ruling a part of the Demonic Realm.","The Demonic Realm was unfathomably massive, even larger than the entirety of the Nine Heavens combined, and currently, they were in the Crimson Continent, one of three major regions.","Even in the past, Tian Chenyu had never visited the other two regions, as it was simply too far away. Each region was so massive that they were essentially considered their own world, and unless war broke out, the three regions never interacted with one another. Even the Supreme Rulers rarely spoke with each other.","\"Who are the current Supreme Rulers for the Bone Atoll and the Death Paradise?\" Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly asked.","\"The Supreme Rulers for those two regions haven’t changed since you were last in power!\" said Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"So it’s still Supreme Ruler Exosso and Supreme Ruler Umbra, huh?\"","Yuan then remarked, \"You’ve mentioned those names to me before, but you never went into detail about them.\"","\"Supreme Ruler Exosso is the ruler of the Bone Atoll, a region that is ninety-nine percent water, and their people live on scattered islands there. Supreme Ruler Umbra is the ruler of Death Paradise, a world shrouded in darkness.\"","\"The demons from these places are fundamentally different from the demons in the Crimson Continent because of their environment, even wielding different powers. While we specialize in Blood Arts, those from the Bone Atoll use Bone Techniques. As for those at Death Paradise... honestly, even I am not sure about their powers.\"","\"Now that I think about it, I’ve met a few unusual demons who fought with their bones instead of blood, but they were incredibly rare compared to those from the Crimson Continent. Out of the millions of demons I’ve encountered, I’ve probably only seen a dozen like that. As for demons from Death Paradise, I don’t think I’ve ever seen any of that type,\" Yuan wondered out loud.","\"Why were there so few of them compared to demons from the Crimson Continent?\" Yuan then asked.","\"For the most part, it’s because the Crimson Continent has the largest population by far, while Death Paradise has the smallest. Another reason was because the gateway to your world was located in the Crimson Continent, so they’d have to traverse a tremendous distance.\"","Yuan turned to look at Supreme Ruler Grant, who was still clashing with the army of demons and the Demon Annihilation Sword, and asked, \"Hey, instead of invading my world, why don’t you just go to the other regions?\"","\"If that was a choice, we would’ve already done it long ago!\" Supreme Ruler Grant exclaimed.","\"The Bone Atoll barely has any land, and Death Paradise is only habitable by its residents because of their unique constitution!\"","A surprised look crossed Yuan’s face at the response.","\"What kind of place is Death Paradise,\" he asked, \"that even demons—creatures who survive the harshest environments—cannot endure?\"","\"There is something there that messes with our blood—wait a second!\" Supreme Ruler Grant suddenly interrupted himself. \"I will tell you everything you want to know, but you have to stop this beast first!\"","With the help of her army of demons, the Demon Annihilation Sword managed to land two more attacks on Supreme Ruler Grant, each one successfully severing a limb. Now, Supreme Ruler Grant had one... and a half limbs left.","\"I’ll only tell her to stop if you swear that you will give up on invading my world,\" Yuan said. \"Otherwise, you can die here.\"","Supreme Ruler Grant gnashed his teeth in frustration. As much as he hated to admit defeat, he realized there was no path to victory for him. He could barely contend with the Demon Annihilation Sword alone, let alone Supreme Ruler Dena and Yuan. If the three of them ganged up on him, he would surely perish—even with the Demon God’s power.","\"Fine! I swear on my title as Supreme Ruler that I will give up on invading the human world!\" Supreme Ruler Grant shouted in a defeated voice.","\"Demon Annihilation Sword, you can stop now. He’s no longer a target,\" Yuan said to her.","However, the Demon Annihilation Sword did not instantly halt her attacks and only slowed down slightly.","\"Why?! I want to devour him!\" she complained.","Yuan rubbed his eyes and sighed, \"You know what’s even more worthless than something without purpose in my eyes? A sword that doesn’t listen to its master.\"","Hearing his words, the Demon Annihilation Sword immediately halted her attacks and stiffened, remaining as still as a statue.","\"I’m sure there’ll be plenty of demons for you to devour later. For now, just be patient,\" Yuan said a moment later.","The Demon Annihilation Sword nodded and slowly returned to his side.","Seeing this, Supreme Ruler Grant released a deep sigh of relief.","\"What do you want to know?\" Supreme Ruler Grant asked him shortly later.","\"Continue what you were just saying,\" Yuan said.","He nodded.","\"The air in Death Paradise is corrupted—poisonous to any demon lacking the unique constitution possessed by its original inhabitants.\""]},{"number":2428,"title":"Chapter 2428: Bone Atoll","paragraphs":["\"If any demon that lacks the required constitution is exposed to the air in Death Paradise, their blood will lose its power and eventually die if their exposure is prolonged,\" Supreme Ruler Grant explained. \"Fortunately, the poison is confined to Death Paradise and won’t spread outside. If it did, we would have been wiped out long ago.\"","’I will need to investigate this further myself later...’ Yuan thought to himself.","\"Now tell me about the other two Supreme Rulers and why they want to invade my world,\" he then inquired.","\"Their reason for wanting to invade your world?\" Supreme Ruler Grant stared at Yuan with a blank expression for a moment before muttering, \"I have no idea.\"","\"What?\" Yuan frowned.","\"I-I swear!\" he hastily continued. \"They have never mentioned anything like that to me!\"","\"And you accepted it without question? Are you really that stupid?\" Yuan asked.","Supreme Ruler Grant shook his head and admitted, \"To be frank, I didn’t. After all, the idea made sense back then... and it still does even now! Not to mention, it would resolve our issue, even if it’s only a temporary one. At least, it would give us some more time to find another solution.\"","Yuan looked at Supreme Ruler Dena and asked, \"Do you have anything to add?\"","She shook her head","\"No, I barely spoke with them before.\"","\"In that case, I’ll have to figure it out myself when I visit them,\" Yuan sighed. \"Unless I stop them, they will definitely invade my world later.\"","\"Where do you want to go first?\" Supreme Ruler Dena then asked.","\"What’s the closest?\"","\"The Bone Atoll.\"","\"The Bone Atoll, it is.\"","She nodded.","\"Then I’ll take us there now.\"","\"Wait.\" Yuan said before turning to look at Supreme Ruler Grant. \"You’re coming with us.\"","\"What?!\" Supreme Ruler Grant exclaimed. \"Why do I have to come with you?! This is your problem, not mine! And I’ve already agreed not to invade your world, so just leave me alone!\"","\"You can either come with us, or you can go to hell. Which do you prefer?\" Yuan glared at him.","\"You...! Do you have no shame?! How can you still threaten me after our agreement?! Are all humans as despicable as you?!\"","\"No, some are even worse.\" Yuan smiled.","\"Anyway, even if you already promised not to invade my world, it doesn’t change the fact that you’re still involved in this whole situation and my world is still in danger, so until we completely resolve this issue, our agreement is on hold.\"","\"What about him?\" Supreme Ruler Dena’s gaze shifted to Lev, who was waiting for them in a safe area with Purple beside him.","\"I’ll let him decide.\"","A moment later, Yuan asked Lev, \"We’re going to meet the Supreme Ruler of Bone Atoll right now. Do you want to come along or stay here? Once again, I cannot guarantee your safety.\"","\"I doubt it’ll be more dangerous than what I’ve already experienced on our way here,\" Lev said with a stiff smile. \"In fact, I’m beginning to think the safest place in this world is by your side, so I’ll follow you even to the end of this world!\"","Yuan nodded.","\"Then let’s go.\"","\"At least let me heal first—\" Supreme Ruler Grant requested, but was interrupted when Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly used Void Manipulation, teleporting them millions of miles in the blink of an eye.","However, the distance from the City of Blood to the Bone Atoll was so immense that it required several more teleportations to reach their destination.","\"So this is the Bone Atoll, huh?\" Yuan muttered as they returned to the Bloody Expanse.","\"We’re still in the Crimson Continent,\" Supreme Ruler Dena corrected, then moved forward a few paces.","\"Come here,\" she then said.","Yuan nodded and flew to her.","The moment he crossed an invisible threshold, the air shifted. It wasn’t just the scent or atmosphere that changed, either. The gravity also grew several times heavier, as if he’d walked into another world. But when he looked around, the landscape remained unchanged.","\"Wow...what an odd feeling,\" Lev said as he entered the Bone Atoll for the first time.","\"Though we all share the same plane, the three regions are separated by invisible barriers—each one a bubble with its own rules and environment,\" explained Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"This also means that the rules from one continent don’t apply to another continent,\" he added.","\"Isn’t that right, Supreme Ruler Dena?\" Supreme Ruler Grant uttered her name without fear.","\"You can’t utter her name in the Crimson Continent even as the Supreme Ruler?\" Yuan asked.","\"Of course not. A rule that doesn’t apply to everyone isn’t a proper one,\" he sneered.","\"Wow, I didn’t think you were capable of saying such a thing,\" Yuan said with a surprised face.","Supreme Ruler Grant frowned at his comment.","\"Are you implying that I am evil and have no sense of justice?\"","Yuan silently shrugged.","\"Umm... if the rules in this region are different... how do we know what’s against the rule and what isn’t? What if we accidentally invoke Demon God’s Wrath?\" Lev suddenly asked.","\"Unfortunately, there’s no way to know unless you ask the residents of this region. This is also why people avoid traversing to other regions,\" said Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"No way... then how do we avoid breaking the rules by accident?\"","\"It’s quite simple. Don’t talk unless necessary, and don’t make unnecessary movements.\"","\"...\"","Lev was speechless, and he was beginning to regret following them to another region, where he could die by uttering a forbidden word by accident.","Yuan looked at Supreme Ruler Grant and said, \"As the Supreme Ruler, you should be familiar with the rules of this place, no?\"","\"Nope.\"","\"And you expect me to believe that?\" Yuan refused to believe that a Supreme Ruler would not know the rules of a neighboring region even if he rarely visited them.","Supreme Ruler Grant shrugged.","\"Believe it or not, this is actually my first time leaving the Crimson Continent. When we have our meetings, we would meet at the tripoint, where the borders for all three regions are connected.\""]},{"number":2429,"title":"Chapter 2429: Bone Atoll(2)","paragraphs":["\"You know surprisingly little for a Supreme Ruler,\" Yuan sighed. \"Why did we even bring you?\"","\"You’re more than welcome to send me back,\" Supreme Ruler Grant sneered.","\"Too much work,\" said Supreme Ruler Dena, completely denying his wishes.","\"So, where should we go now?\" Yuan then asked her.","\"I’ve visited the Supreme Ruler’s territory a few times, but I doubt that knowledge will be of much use now. The islands within Bone Atoll are constantly drifting with the natural currents, and only its residents understand their movements well enough to track them,\" she said.","\"So we need to find some residents to ask them.\"","\"I will lead the way.\"","Instead of using Void Manipulation, Supreme Ruler Dena just flew normally.","A few days later, they arrived at a certain island.","Although it was called an island, it was quite massive, nearly the size of a medium-sized city in the Nine Heavens that could easily fit millions of people. However, despite the spacious land, Yuan could only sense a few thousand presences from it.","\"Let’s go.\"","\"Wait!\" Supreme Ruler Grant suddenly shouted.","\"Are you seriously going to let the public see me in this state?! I am still the Supreme Ruler, you know!\"","He gestured at his mangled body with his only remaining arm—his legs still severed, the other arm only halfway regenerated.","Yuan glanced at him and smirked, \"Don’t worry, we have another Supreme Ruler here. You can just pretend to be our livestock or something.\"","\"Me?! Livestock?!\" He exclaimed with a bewildered expression, as if he couldn’t believe his ears.","Never had he been humiliated to such an extent.","But before he could express his displeasure, Yuan descended to the island with Supreme Ruler Dena and Lev following behind.","Supreme Ruler Grant had intended to stay behind, but a sharp, pointy sensation suddenly pressed against his back.","When he turned around, he was met with the sight of the Demon Annihilation Sword, her blade already raised in her grasp.","\"What do you want?\"","\"If you don’t follow my master, I’ll devour you,\" she calmly replied, her indifferent tone sending chills down his back.","’To think I’d be treated like a slave and threatened like this!’ he gritted his teeth in frustration.","\"Listen here, you little—\"","He wanted to retaliate, but when he sensed the Demon Annihilation Sword’s Demon Sealing Aura slowly surging, he swallowed his words and reluctantly chased after Yuan’s group.","Meanwhile, Yuan landed upon the island and extended his divine sense, sweeping across the residents ahead.","Instead of ordinary buildings, every structure was constructed from bones, casting a grim and unsettling atmosphere over the entire place.","Moreover, unlike ordinary bones, these bones were naturally black, resembling charcoal.","Shortly after their arrival, several demons emerged from their bone-crafted dwellings, each gripping a spear fashioned from the same dark material.","\"Who are you people?\" one of them demanded.","These demons looked identical to those from the Crimson Continent. However, unlike their counterparts, the inhabitants of Bone Atoll rarely ventured beyond their own islands, spending most of their lives within their territory.","As a result, visits from outsiders were uncommon, and more often than not, they ended in conflict, which explained the wariness and hostility in their expressions.","\"I am the Supreme Ruler of the Crimson Continent, and I have some questions for you,\" said Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"The Supreme Ruler?!\" They all expressed shock at her introduction, but they didn’t immediately believe her.","\"Why would the Supreme Ruler come to a place like this? Show us proof of your identity.\"","Supreme Ruler Dena didn’t say anything and revealed the Power of Authority on her forehead.","Upon sensing the unfathomable energy exuding from her symbol, they quickly lowered their weapons and bowed to her.","\"We greet the Supreme Ruler of the Crimson Continent. If you have any questions, we will answer them to the best of our ability.\"","They may hail from a different region, but the authority and reverence commanded by a Supreme Ruler did not diminish simply by crossing into another territory.","\"Where can I find Supreme Ruler Exosso?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked.","\"The Supreme Ruler can be found at the Weeping Ossuary.\"","\"And where is that? I am unfamiliar with your territory.\"","\"In that case, it would be in your best interest to find a guide who can take you there.\"","\"Can I just have one of you take us there?\"","The demons immediately fell silent as they became hesitant. Although they wanted to refuse, they didn’t dare to say no to a Supreme Ruler, fearing the consequences.","Noticing their reluctance, Yuan asked, \"Where can we find a guide? If we’re going to look for one, we might as well find a proper one.\"","The demons quickly became at ease upon hearing his words, and one of them said, \"There’s actually a well-known guide not too far from our atoll. I can bring you there if you’d like.\"","\"Let’s do that.\"","Without any delay, the demon led Yuan and his group to another island nearly two weeks away.","Soon, they arrived at another atoll—this one far smaller, resembling a solitary island—with a single, lonely structure standing at its center.","Before Yuan’s group even touched the ground, a figure emerged from the building to meet them.","\"If it isn’t my neighbor. Looking for a guide?\" Asked the guide, a grey-colored male demon. \"Where are ya trying to go?\"","\"I am not the one looking for you. They are.\" The demon who led Yuan’s group there said. \"She’s the Supreme Ruler of the Crimson Continent, and they are trying to reach the Weeping Ossuary to meet with our Supreme Ruler.\"","\"What?\"","The guide looked at Supreme Ruler Dena with a suspicious gaze.","\"Are you sure about that? From what I heard, their most recent Supreme Ruler is male,\" he remarked.","\"What?! Are you saying that she’s an imposter?! But she has the Power of Authority, which can only be possessed by Supreme Rulers!\"","Supreme Ruler Dena then spoke in a calm voice, \"If you’re talking about that weakling Supreme Ruler Grant, then I killed him not long ago and took over his position.\""]},{"number":2430,"title":"Chapter 2430: Bone Atoll(3)","paragraphs":["\"You... killed him...?\"","The guide swallowed nervously after hearing Supreme Ruler Dena’s claim.","Even though he was right beside her, Supreme Ruler Grant didn’t dare to correct her, mostly because it’d harm his reputation more if he revealed that he was actually alive and was being dragged around like some kind of slave.","\"Are you going to call me a liar next?\" Supreme Ruler Dena narrowed her gaze at him.","\"N-No...\" The guide hastily shook his head before continuing, \"Let’s talk about your destination. The Weeping Ossuary, correct? It’s a little far from here, but that’s not the issue. The currents have been rough and nearly unpredictable for several thousand years now, so only an experienced guide would be able to take you there safely. Fortunately for you, I am an experienced guide.\"","\"As for your rates... Since you’re the Supreme Ruler, I’ll give you a discount. How does thirty thousand Grand Bone Calx sound? Or three Supreme Bone Calx?\"","\"...\"","Supreme Ruler Dena fell silent.","\"Is that too expensive? Normally, I would charge a hundred thousand Grand Calx or ten Supreme Bone Calx...\"","Lev then spoke, \"Uh... we don’t have such currency in the Crimson Continent.\"","\"...\"","It was the guide’s turn to fall silent.","\"Don’t tell me... you want me to guide you for free?\" he asked after a moment of silence.","\"...\"","Yuan then spoke, \"How about this? Rather than an upfront payment, we’ll pay you upon arrival at our destination, and we’ll even pay you your original—no, double your normal rates.\"","\"Even if we get there, how do you intend to pay when you don’t have any money?\" The guide inquired with a puzzled face.","\"Although we don’t have any money, we won’t be the ones paying you. Supreme Ruler Exosso will be footing the bill, after all,\" Yuan elaborated with a nonchalant face.","\"Uhh... do they know that they’ll be paying me, or are you just...\" the guide’s confused face turned into a doubtful one.","\"Trust me, they’ll definitely pay you. The Supreme Ruler here will make sure of that.\" Yuan said while pointing at Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"Alright! I will trust you!\"","Despite his enthusiasm, the guide was lying about trusting them.","However, there was really nothing he could do but accept his fate and guide them to their destination even if they couldn’t pay him.","After all, if he refused and offended them, death would be the least of his worries.","\"When would you like to go?\" The guide then asked.","\"Can we depart immediately?\"","\"Not immediately since I will need some time to study the currents.\"","\"How much time do you need?\"","\"A few days should be enough.\"","\"Then we will leave once you’re ready.\"","Some time later, the guide left the island to study the current while the demon who led them there returned to his own island.","\"What if he just leaves us here?\" Lev asked as they watched the guide disappear.","\"Then we will sink this place,\" Supreme Ruler Dena calmly said.","Three days later, the guide returned and said, \"Alright, we can start traveling.\"","Yuan nodded, and they started following him into the water.","\"By the way, my name is Gutou.\"","\"We can use Void Manipulation, you know?\" Lev remarked shortly after their journey began.","\"So can I, but if I want accurate reading, I must constantly study the currents. Normally, it doesn’t require this much effort, but like I said earlier, the currents have been chaotic and unpredictable recently.\"","Lev then asked, \"If the currents are unpredictable, how can you accurately pinpoint our destination? By the time we arrive, it will likely have drifted somewhere else entirely.\"","\"Although the atolls move with the currents, those currents aren’t entirely random,\" Gutou explained. \"They all circulate within the same region, so the atolls never stray beyond a fixed area.\"","He continued, \"I’m not reading the currents to pinpoint the Weeping Ossuary itself, but to chart a path toward its area. Without doing so, we’d easily lose our way.\"","\"Can’t we just head in one direction? Even without reading the currents, we should eventually reach that area.\"","Gutou shook his head. \"It’s not that simple. While the atolls themselves don’t leave their region, the regions shift—so what is east now could become west later.\"","\"Wouldn’t it be impossible to even begin if you’re not constantly reading the currents? If you ignore them for too long, you wouldn’t even know where to start,\" Lev said, raising an eyebrow.","\"No,\" Gutou replied. \"We can roughly determine our location—and what surrounds us—by the scent of the water. Each region has a slightly different smell. That’s why I said only an experienced guide can navigate these waters.\"","\"Oh, and each region also has its own unique landmarks,\" he added. \"We use those as reference points as well.\"","\"What a pain in the ass... no wonder the people here prefer to stay on their own island and rarely venture out.\" Supreme Ruler Dena sighed out loud.","\"How long do you think it’ll take us to reach our destination?\" Yuan finally asked.","\"Hard to say, but a few thousand years if we’re lucky.\"","Yuan sighed, \"I knew it was something ridiculous, so I was afraid to even ask...\"","\"Wait a second...\"","Yuan suddenly stopped moving and remained still with a pondering look on his face.","\"What’s wrong?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked him.","Yuan glanced at the crimson sea below and muttered, \"Let me try something.\"","He descended onto the surface and pressed his palm against the water.","In the next instant, the raging sea fell into complete stillness—its currents silenced, as though the ocean itself had been subdued.","\"T-The Bloody Expanse became still?!\" Gutou exclaimed in shock and bewilderment. \"What in Demon God’s name did you do?!\"","\"I commanded it to stop moving, that’s all,\" Yuan calmly said.","\"That’s all?! THAT’S ALL?!?!\" Gutou shouted hysterically, his voice cracking as if on the verge of madness. \"Who the hell are you?! The king of the seas?!\"","\"No, I’m Yuan,\" he replied, looking as nonchalant as possible."]},{"number":2431,"title":"Chapter 2431: Bone Atoll(4)","paragraphs":["’Absolute Water Manipulation... what a powerful technique.’ Yuan thought to himself, as he never anticipated he would be able to literally command the sea.","However, while it may have seemed as though he had frozen the entire Bloody Expanse in time, in reality, he had only stilled a portion of it.","Even so, that ’portion’ spanned several hundred thousand miles of the sea.","\"How much faster can we arrive at our destination now?\" Yuan asked Gutou.","\"Uhh...\"","Gutou stared at Yuan in shock, stunned speechless.","After a moment of silence, Gutou spoke, \"If you can keep the currents frozen, we can travel with Void Manipulation and speed up our pace tremendously. Still, we’ll need at least several years.\"","Yuan nodded and turned to Supreme Ruler Dena, \"Can you follow his directions and move us to the edge of my ’territory’?\"","She calmly nodded.","\"This direction.\" Gutou pointed east a few moments later.","Supreme Ruler Dena then used Void Manipulation to teleport them to the edge of Yuan’s territory, where the sea wasn’t under his command.","When Yuan uses Absolute Water Manipulation, anything within his control is considered his territory.","After arriving, Gutou said, \"Please give me a few days to read the currents, then you can freeze it.\"","A few days later, Yuan used Absolute Water Manipulation, freezing the Bloody Expanse as far as their eyes could see.","\"That direction.\"","They would repeat this process for multiple times throughout the next two years.","Eventually...","\"Seeing that atoll with the skull mountain? We have officially entered the region with the Weeping Ossuary. Honestly, we got lucky with its location.\" Gutou said as he pointed to an island on the horizon that had a lone white mountain shaped like a skull.","\"So the Weeping Ossuary is somewhere around here?\" Yuan asked.","\"Somewhere, yes,\" Gutou replied. \"Unfortunately, this is the largest region within the Bone Atoll. It may take us even longer to locate the Weeping Ossuary than it did to reach this place... even if we know the general location and head straight there.\"","\"Then let’s not waste any more time and get going—\"","Suddenly, a massive bubble swelled beneath Yuan’s feet, distorting the surface of the water, before erupting upward like a volcanic blast.","Supreme Ruler Dena quickly reacted and used Void Manipulation to teleport them all to safety.","The next instant, a massive sea serpent with crimson scales jumped out of the water and flew into the sky.","\"Which bastard is responsible for disturbing my cultivation?!\"","It glared at Yuan’s group with immense killing intent.","\"Huh? What are you talking about?\" Yuan questioned.","\"The bastard that stopped my currents! Identify yourself!\" The red sea serpent roared.","\"You’re the cause of the abnormal currents?!\" Gutou exclaimed with surprise.","With his vast experience as a guide, Gutou could proudly claim that he knew most of, if not all, sea devils within the Death Atoll. Yet, he has never seen or heard of this red serpent.","Moreover, like other guides, he believed that the unpredictable current was a natural phenomenon, not something caused by a sea devil.","\"Are you responsible?!\" The crimson sea serpent snapped to glare at Gutou.","\"N-No!\" he hastily refused while shaking his head.","\"Then is it you?!\"","It turned to look at Lev next.","\"Th-That’s right! I am responsible! So what?!\"","For some reason, Lev admitted to a crime he didn’t commit.","\"So... you will pay for your crime with death!\" The crimson serpent roared as it lunged at Lev, who immediately hid behind Yuan.","Without a word, Yuan retrieved Number One Under Heaven and swung it at the incoming sea devil.","Sha!","Not only did Yuan cleave the crimson sea serpent in half with a single strike, but he also split the sea in half.","\"Huh.\" Yuan stared at the sea devil’s mangled corpse with a raised eyebrow.","\"It’s a lot weaker than I expected, considering that it was able to affect the Bloody Expanse to such an extent,\" he remarked.","As if he had jinxed it, the severed Sea Devil’s corpse suddenly reconnected, its mangled body stitching itself back together before rising from the surface of the sea.","\"Hahaha! If you think you can kill me with such a weak—\"","Before the sea devil could even finish its sentence, Yuan unleashed Heaven Splitting Sword Strike at it, completely vaporizing its body until not even a single scale of it was left behind.","\"Surely, it won’t be able to regenerate from that, right?\" Lev mumbled.","However, the moment Lev closed his mouth, a crimson orb suddenly materialized out of thin air, quickly expanding in size until it formed the crimson sea serpent again.","\"What the hell?! To regenerate from that, its regeneration is on par with yours!\" Lev exclaimed as he turned to look at Yuan.","Yuan narrowed his eyes at the crimson sea serpent.","Then, without a word, unleashed Heaven Splitting Sword Strike again. This time, he used Eternal Essence.","However, not even half a minute later, the sea devil returned.","\"It’s useless! You will never kill this Everlasting Crimson Dragon!\"","\"You? A dragon?\" Yuan sneered. \"You’re barely a sea serpent, much less a dragon.\"","\"And I doubt you’re really immortal.\"","\"Then how is it coming back to life even after its entire body is vaporized?\" Gutou asked.","\"That’s probably not its real body,\" Yuan remarked with a profound smile.","\"?!\" The Everlasting Crimson Dragon’s body visibly stiffened when it heard Yuan’s words.","The smile on Yuan’s face widened.","\"Looks like I am right. I bet its real body is somewhere in the Bloody Expanse.\"","\"I’ll give you credit where it’s due,\" the Everlasting Crimson Dragon said. \"You’re the first to see through the truth.\"","\"However, even if you know the truth, there’s nothing you can do about it unless you know where my real body is! Hahaha!\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan said, \"So what? It’s not like you can kill us, either.\"","\"A bold claim! I may be unable to kill you now, but there’s no such thing as forever! I’ll wear you down and then kill you, no matter how long it takes!\"","\"Wear me down?\" Yuan chuckled. \"Good luck with that. I am guaranteed to find your real body before you can exhaust me.\"","\"It would be nice if the Primal Sovereign of the Seas was still with us. I bet he’d be able to find its real body in a heartbeat,\" Lev remarked.","Suddenly, another bubble swelled across the water’s surface nearby, and a massive figure surged forth from the sea in the next instant.","\"Primal Sovereign of the Seas?!\" Lev cried out loud in disbelief.","\"I heard this majestic one’s name being mentioned, so here I am!\" the Primal Sovereign of the Seas laughed, its voice echoing across the sea.","Yuan narrowed his eyes before speaking in a suspicious tone, \"Don’t tell me you’ve been stalking us this entire time.\"","\"Me? Stalking?\" the Primal Sovereign of the Seas echoed, its expression turning incredulous, as if the very notion offended it.","He continued, \"I just happened to be in the area.\"","\"...\"","Despite his clear-sounding voice, Yuan did not believe him one bit.","Meanwhile, the Everlasting Crimson Dragon trembled in fear.","\"P-Primal Sovereign of the Seas?! What the hell are you doing here?!\" It exclaimed, looking like it just saw a ghost.","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas turned to face it and spoke, \"Hm? If it isn’t Little Red. What are you doing here?\"","\"I came to this world to evolve because I didn’t want to disturb the seas in the Primal Expanse!\" He cried out loud.","\"And yet, here you are!\"","\"It’s just a coincidence.\"","\"You two know each other?\" Yuan suddenly interjected.","\"Yes, we’ve clashed a few times in the Primal Expanse.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and remarked, \"It survived not one but several clashes with you? It must be quite formidable.\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas burst out laughing and said, \"That’s because I never fought her seriously.\"","\"She’s female?\"","\"Not only that, but she has a crush on this majestic one. Unfortunately, we are not fated to be—\"","\"Shut the fuck up!\" The Everlasting Crimson Dragon suddenly roared. \"Who the hell has a crush on you?! That’s just your own made-up fantasy!\"","\"If you don’t have a crush on me, then why are you always coming after me and picking fights with me?\"","\"Because I am trying to surpass you!\"","\"There’s no need to be ashamed. This majestic one has plenty of admirers across the three worlds, after all.\"","\"Screw you, you fat bastard!\"","\"You’ve become more feisty since I last saw you.\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas returned to Yuan and said, \"Anyway, why did you call for me?\"","Yuan sighed, \"Nobody called for you.\"","\"Then why was this majestic one’s name mentioned?\"","Lev raised his hand and said, \"Um... I was the one who called your name.\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ gaze immediately shifted to him, who proceeded to explain their situation to him."]},{"number":2432,"title":"Chapter 2432: Weeping Ossuary","paragraphs":["After hearing Lev’s explanation, the Primal Sovereign of the Seas nodded repeatedly, as if everything had finally clicked—acting as though it hadn’t already known all along.","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas turned to the Everlasting Crimson Dragon the next moment and said to her, \"I won’t stick my nose into your business, but before you proceed to fight to the death with him, you should know that he’s the Primal Monarch’s son.\"","\"He’s what?!\" The Everlasting Crimson Dragon cried out loud, her eyes bulging from their sockets from shock.","\"Oh, I mean he’s the Primal Monarch’s adopted son. He also possesses the Primal Monarch’s powers.\" The Primal Sovereign of the Seas corrected himself and added another detail, leaving her absolutely speechless.","The Everlasting Crimson Dragon slowly turned to look at Yuan, a terrified glint flickering in her eyes.","\"I...I am willing to forgive you for disturbing my evolution,\" she said a moment later.","Yuan rubbed his eyes and sighed aloud, \"I’ve lost the desire to fight the moment this goldfish appeared.\"","\"Hey, that’s quite rude, especially when I gave you my Blood Essence,\" he remarked.","\"You gave him your Blood Essence?!\" The Everlasting Crimson Dragon exclaimed.","\"Well, I did owe the Prima Monarch a—\" the Primal Sovereign of the Seas suddenly halted his speech, his round eyes slowly shifting to glance at Yuan.","\"I knew it.\" Yuan muttered. \"You would’ve given me your Blood Essence even if I didn’t get rid of the True Emperor of the Seas.\"","\"That’s...\"","Yuan sighed out loud before speaking, \"I planned to get rid of the True Emperor of the Seas, anyway. However, it doesn’t feel good knowing that I had been fooled. I’ll make sure to let my father know about this.\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ eyes widened with disbelief.","\"You’re going to complain to the Primal Monarch?! That is petty as hell!\" he cried out loud.","\"Well, I nearly died because of you.\"","\"The hell are you talking about?!\"","Yuan revealed what the Demon God said shortly after his departure.","\"To think his master would seek vengeance so quickly...\"","After a brief pause, the Primal Sovereign of the Seas continued, \"But I fail to see how any of this is my fault. If you were going to kill the True Emperor of the Seas regardless, you would’ve offended her sooner or later.\"","\"True,\" Yuan replied, his voice calm, \"but I would’ve done so in the Nine Heavens—where she couldn’t touch me. You dragged it into the Demonic Realm, where Eternals can interfere.\"","\"That’s...\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ round body stiffened at Yuan’s words, as if struck by their undeniable logic.","Sure enough, had it not dragged the True Emperor of the Seas into the Demonic Realm and urged Yuan to kill it, Prime Morveth would have had no opportunity to personally attack him.","\"Not only did I nearly perish alongside this world, but I even owe the Demon God a favor for saving us,\" he sighed.","’What the hell is he talking about? Why did he mention the Demon God?’ Gutou and Supreme Ruler Grant listened to their conversation with confused looks on their faces.","\"Fine, I get your point,\" said the Primal Sovereign of the Seas. \"I have already given you my Blood Essence. What more do you want from me? The only thing even more valuable than my Blood Essence would be my life.\"","\"Is that it? Do you want my life? You might as well have it if you’re going to tell the Primal Monarch about what happened.\"","Yuan looked at him with raised eyebrows.","\"Are you that afraid of the Primal Monarch? What even is your relationship with him? Seeing how you’re even stronger than the Dragon God, I doubt you’re a nobody. Of course, I also saw some of your memories when I consumed your Blood Essence.\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas stared at him in disbelief.","\"You... saw my memories? So you know my true appearance? How embarrassing!\" The Primal Sovereign of the Seas started fidgeting around.","\"What is there to be embarrassed about?\"","\"You won’t get it...\" he sighed. \"Anyway, let’s not continue this topic.\"","He fell silent for a moment before speaking again, \"For your assistance with the True Emperor of the Seas and your trouble, I’m willing to do the same thing for you. By that, I mean I will kill any one being for you. Of course, this is limited to beings I can actually kill, so don’t expect me to kill Eternals... or the Primal Monarch for you.\"","\"Now why the hell would I want you to kill the Primal Monarch?\" Yuan shook his head. \"As for Eternals, I will deal with them myself.\"","\"That’s relieving to hear.\"","\"Unfortunately, I don’t need you to kill anyone for me right now, so I’ll keep this favor in my pocket for now.\"","\"That’s fine, too.\"","The next moment, the Primal Sovereign of the Seas removed one of its own scales and handed it to Yuan.","<You have obtained Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ Prismatic Scale>","\"If or when you have someone you want me to kill, you may tell me through that. It works like a communication jade slip, but I will only be able to hear your voice through that, so I won’t be able to respond to you.\"","Yuan tossed the scale into his spatial ring before asking, \"I should ask you this before I use it, but how strong are you actually? So I know what you can and cannot handle beforehand.\"","A prideful smile tugged at the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ lips as it responded, \"My title ’Primal’ isn’t for show, you know? Besides Eternals and the Primal Monarch, I am essentially unmatched.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before asking, \"So you’re strong enough to defeat the Dragon God?\"","\"If you mean the Dragon God in his current state, then yes, I can deal with him no problem. If you’re talking about his complete form, however... that might be an issue.\"","\"I understand.\" Yuan nodded, having a decent grasp of the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ capabilities.","\"Oh, I should also clarify. It’s not that I cannot defeat Eternals. I am just unable to kill them. There’s a big difference.\"","\"Good to know.\"","\"Then I’ll return to my feast now.\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas turned to look at the Everlasting Crimson Dragon, but he did not say anything, and after a moment of silence, dived into the Bloody Expanse, submering its massive body without causing even a single drop of water to splash.","\"So, what do you want to do now?\" Yuan asked the Everlasting Crimson Dragon. \"Do you still want to fight?\"","The Everlasting Crimson Dragon hastily shook her head. Even without Yuan saying it, she knew that he wouldn’t hesitate to make the Primal Sovereign of the Seas kill her for him.","While she wasn’t worried that Yuan might find her true body, the Primal Sovereign of the Seas was an entirely different story, as he could locate anything within the seas, regardless of their distance and location.","Yuan then said, \"If you’re going to return to your evolution or whatever, wait until we’re done here because I will only disturb you again.\"","\"That’s fine. It’s not like I can immediately return to my cultivation after being disturbed,\" she sighed.","\"Sorry for disturbing you, by the way. It really wasn’t on purpose.\"","The Everlasting Crimson Dragon didn’t say anything else and disappeared into the water shortly later.","A moment later, Yuan turned to look at Gutou and said, \"With the waters returning to normal, you should no longer have any issues guiding us to the Weeping Ossuary, right?\"","Gutou silently nodded his head.","Without another word, he resumed their journey.","With the currents returning to normal, Gutou swiftly located the Weeping Ossuary, and within five years, guided them to their destination.","\"Dear esteemed guests, we have finally arrived at our destination—the Weeping Ossuary!\" Gutou announced out loud the moment he saw its silhouette on the horizon.","\"That’s the Weeping Ossuary? What an ominous-looking place,\" Yuan remarked after seeing the island.","The island lay under a blanket of ash, dominated by a massive castle of bone that took up about seventy percent of the land’s space. There were no trees or plants—only desolation, the castle being the island’s only feature.","Without hesitation, Yuan used his divine sense to examine the castle’s interior.","\"I can only sense a single presence inside. Is this normal?\" Yuan turned to Gutou.","\"Uhh... I have never actually been inside, but no, I don’t think it’s normal,\" he replied.","Hearing this, Yuan quickly approached the Weeping Ossuary without uttering another word.","Supreme Ruler Dena and the others quickly followed.","Some time later, Yuan stopped right outside the castle. Or more precisely, he was forced to stop by the powerful formation that enveloped the entire place.","\"What should we do about—\"","Before Gutou could even finish his sentence, Yuan retrieved Number One Under Heaven and swung it at the formation."]},{"number":2433,"title":"Chapter 2433: Supreme Ruler Exosso","paragraphs":["Upon being struck by Yuan’s overwhelming strength, the formation that surrounded the castle on Weeping Ossuary collapsed like a sheet of fragile glass after being struck by a hammer.","\"Let’s go.\"","Yuan immediately entered the castle, but instead of entering through the front gate, he went through the window that was closest to the presence.","Clang!","He smashed through the window and stepped into a vast, dim chamber fit for an emperor of death—pillars hewn from bone, a solitary throne carved of the same material.","Meanwhile, seated on the throne was a silhouette... or more precisely, a skeleton.","Even though whoever the skeleton belonged to appeared to have perished long ago, it still had a presence somehow.","Yuan turned to ask Supreme Ruler Dena, \"What’s going on here?\"","However, she shrugged her shoulders and replied, \"I don’t know.\"","Suddenly, Gutou stepped forward and exclaimed in a shocked voice, \"T-That’s the Supreme Ruler!\"","\"You can recognize him in that state?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, seemingly impressed by it.","Gutou nodded and explained, \"As Bone Demons, everyone’s bones and structures are unique.\"","\"It’s like how we can identify a demon purely by their blood,\" Supreme Ruler Dena remarked.","\"Oh? I didn’t know you could do that, either,\" Yuan muttered. He thought that he’d already known everything about demons, but turns out that wasn’t the case.","\"Anyway, why is the Supreme Ruler in that state?\" he then asked. \"And is he still alive?\"","Gutou approached the throne, where the Supreme Ruler was seated, and examined it for a moment before shaking his head, \"It may seem like he’s alive, but he’s already dead. As for his cause of death... sorry, but I don’t know. It looks like he had all of his lifeforce consumed, leaving his bones behind—\"","Gutou suddenly halted his speech, and his eyes widened with shock.","\"S-Something’s wrong!\" he exclaimed.","\"What is wrong?\"","In the next moment the Supreme Ruler’s skeleton shuddered, then slowly rose to its feet.","\"Uh... I thought you said he was dead?\" Yuan said.","\"That’s what I thought, but his bones suddenly returned to life!\"","Suddenly, a yellow orb of light emerged in each empty eye socket.","\"I wasn’t expecting any visitors,\" the skeleton spoke in a stiff voice.","\"Are you Supreme Ruler Exosso?\" Yuan questioned it.","\"Indeed, I am. Who are you, and why did you break into my territory?\"","Supreme Ruler Dena stepped forward and said, \"Remember me?\"","Supreme Ruler Exosso’s flickering eyes dimmed slightly as he turned to look at her.","\"Supreme Ruler Dena... I thought you had been imprisoned within the Deprived Crimson Valley.\"","Then he noticed Supreme Ruler Grant, who was standing not far away.","\"You are Supreme Ruler Grant... What is going on here?\"","\"We should be asking you that,\" said Supreme Ruler Dena. \"Why are you in that state? And why are you alone?\"","Supreme Ruler Exosso raised an arm and silently gazed at it.","\"It appears that I have been betrayed,\" he muttered in a nonchalant voice.","\"What?\"","Supreme Ruler Exosso then spoke, \"I do not have time to explain everything, so I will just say this—I will be dying soon, but if you promise to kill Owen for me, I will use what little power I have left to preserve my bones and gift them to you.\"","\"Owen? Who is that?\" Yuan asked.","\"He was the Supreme Adviser... my advisor,\" Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly said. \"In other words, the 10th Supreme Ruler.\"","\"You mean the one who suddenly disappeared after he became the Supreme Ruler and hasn’t been seen since then?!\" Lev exclaimed.","\"To think he was hiding in the Bone Atoll...\" Yuan muttered, before continuing, \"Alright, we’ll kill him for you. That bastard framed Dena for something she didn’t do, anyway.\"","Supreme Ruler Exosso nodded, then fell silent. Without another word he collapsed back onto the throne, his presence completely extinguished.","Yuan collected his bones a moment later and asked, \"So, what can we do with this?\"","Gutou swallowed nervously at the sight of the Supreme Ruler’s bones before responding, \"A Bone Demon’s bones are exceedingly valuable since it’s the source of our powers. As for the Supreme Ruler’s bones... it’s simply priceless. Any Bone Demon would kill even for one of his bones, much less his entire body.\"","\"So it’s valuable, huh?\"","Yuan stared at the heap of bones for a moment, then plucked a pinky bone and tossed it at Gutou.","\"?!\" Gutou hastily caught the bone and proceeded to stare at Yuan in disbelief.","\"Consider that as payment for bringing us here,\" Yuan said.","\"Really?!\" Gutou shrieked, unable to contain his excitement.","Yuan quietly nodded.","\"T-Thank you! Thank you very much!\" Gutou bowed to Yuan repeatedly.","Even a tiny pinky bone from the Supreme Ruler could easily start a war in the Bone Atoll and was countless times worth more than what Gutou could earn in his lifetime.","\"What should I do with the rest of his bones?\" Yuan mumbled before turning to ask Supreme Ruler Dena. \"Do you want it?\"","\"I have no use for it,\" she said, shaking her head.","\"I want it!\" An eager voice resounded.","Yuan shifted his gaze to the Demon Annihilation Sword, who had her hands raised.","He wondered why a girl like her wanted the bones for a second before remembering that her true form was the Demon Annihilation Sword and that she could consume demons to strengthen herself.","\"You can have it.\"","Without hesitation, Yuan handed the whole skeleton to the Demon Annihilation, who immediately began chewing the bones as if they were a crispy snack.","Instantly, he could sense her aura surging even higher.","The Supreme Ruler Grant swallowed nervously when he saw this, as a monster was growing even more terrifying right before his eyes.","One would expect the Demon Annihilation Sword to swiftly devour the whole skeleton, but surprisingly, she was taking her sweet time with it, only eating a single piece of bone at a time, as if trying to savor the moment.","While she enjoyed her snack, Yuan turned to ask the others, \"Alright. What now?\""]},{"number":2434,"title":"Chapter 2434: Supreme Ruler of the Demonic Realm","paragraphs":["\"This didn’t go how I expected, especially the fact that Owen is somehow involved,\" Supreme Ruler Dena said, \"but with Supreme Ruler Exosso dead, all we can do is find Supreme Ruler Umbra and hope he’s alive—and can explain the situation.\"","\"Then we’ll immediately head to Death Paradise,\" Yuan said.","\"What about Bone Atoll?\" Lev suddenly asked. \"With their Supreme Ruler now perished, who will replace him?\"","Supreme Ruler Grant then spoke, \"In normal circumstances the Supreme Adviser would assume command if the Supreme Ruler died unexpectedly... unless a successor was already named. But we can assume the Supreme Adviser is dead too, and that we’re likely the only ones in the Bone Atoll who know the Supreme Ruler has perished.\"","Supreme Ruler Dena continued, \"If there’s no rightful successor, anyone can claim the title. In other words, it’s a free-for-all, and the strongest will become the new Supreme Ruler.\"","\"But since nobody knows that the throne is empty...\" She pointed at Gutou and said, \"He can technically become the next Supreme Ruler if he desires.\"","Gutou shook his head vigorously and said, \"Oh, no! No, no, no! As tempting as becoming the next Supreme Ruler sounds, there’s no way in hell I will be able to keep the position for long! It’s not like I can keep this a secret forever, either. The moment the rest of the world finds out the truth, I will become nothing but a vulnerable prey, hunted by everyone in the Bone Atoll!\"","Supreme Ruler Dena shrugged and casually said, \"In that case, I’ll become Bone Atoll’s next Supreme—\"","She suddenly halted her speech and turned to look at Yuan with a profound smile on her face.","\"Actually, why don’t you become their next Supreme Ruler?\"","\"What?\" Yuan pointed at himself with a dumbfounded face. \"Me? Can a human even become the Supreme Ruler?\"","\"A human...?\" Gutou stared at Yuan in shock and doubting, wondering if he’d heard correctly.","\"We won’t know for sure until you try. Since you can technically turn into a demon, it’s worth giving it a shot.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before nodding his head.","\"You know what? Why not? How do I become—try to become the Supreme Ruler?\" he then asked.","\"You’ll need to participate in the Supreme Ruler Ritual,\" Supreme Ruler Dena answered as she swept the entire castle with her divine sense.","\"Follow me, I’ll take you to the location.\"","Yuan nodded and began following her.","Lev and the others also followed.","Some time later they entered a spacious chamber where a large pile of bones lay arranged in a circle with a solitary bone totem rising from its center.","’Fuck... are we really going to do this?’ Supreme Ruler Grant wondered inwardly.","To let a human become a Supreme Ruler would be an immense humiliation to their entire world and race, but he was in no position to protest against it.","’No... I’m sure the Demon God would not allow such a thing to happen!’ He then convinced himself.","Supreme Ruler Dena proceeded to explain the process to Yuan.","\"Stand in front of the altar and repeat the incantation after me.\"","After taking a deep breath, Supreme Ruler Dena recited the incantation aloud, \"Demon God...\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","Even though Supreme Ruler Dena was still reciting the incarnation, Yuan could not hear her voice, as his consciousness was no longer in the room with them.","Shortly after Yuan stood before the altar, his consciousness was summoned to a different realm, where the Demon God was present.","\"What do you think you’re trying to do?\"","The Demon God asked Yuan.","He calmly shrugged, \"Don’t look at me. This wasn’t even my idea. If you’re not going to let me become the Supreme Ruler, then just say so and I’ll be on my way.\"","\"...\"","The Demon God fell silent, almost as if wondering about it.","Soon, he spoke, \"The residents of my world believe that only those chosen by me can become the Supreme Ruler. In truth, I have no control over such a thing... or rather, it would be more accurate to say that I have no desire to intervene with the world. If you want to become the Supreme Ruler, then so be it.\"","\"Seriously?\" Yuan muttered as he wore a surprised expression on his face.","Given his history with the Demon God, he never imagined he would be permitted to become a figure of absolute authority in this world. After all, it would be like allowing someone who once tried to kill you to become a general in your own army.","\"Are you sure you won’t regret it later?\" Yuan remarked.","\"Hahaha! Regret? What is there for me to regret? It’s not like I am handing over my world to you! And don’t think you’re allowed to do anything just because you’re the Supreme Ruler. If you dare try to destroy my world, I’ll kill you.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and asked, \"I thought you swore to never intervene with your world?\"","\"That rule only applies to the residents of my world. You, who came from another world, clearly doesn’t belong in that category.\"","\"What about the Primal Sovereign of the Seas, who is feasting in your seas? The same goes with the Everlasting Crimson Dragon, who is causing major disturbances in your territory?\"","\"Snitching on your friends, huh? I wasn’t expecting this from you,\" the Demon God mocked.","Yuan shook his head.","\"I am only using them as examples. And I already know you’re allowing them to act. If not, you would’ve killed them long ago.\"","\"Indeed. Not only are they aware, but they act within the laws of my world. As long as they do nothing that drastically disturbs it, I will not intervene,\" said the Demon God.","\"What they’re doing doesn’t count as drastic in your eyes?\" Yuan was speechless.","Then, without warning, the Demon God returned Yuan’s consciousness to the Weeping Ossuary.","<You have become Bone Atoll’s Supreme Ruler!>","<You have acquired the title ’Supreme Ruler of the Demonic Realm’!>","<You have learned the skill ’Demon God’s Inferior Authority’!>"]},{"number":2435,"title":"Chapter 2435: Super Bone","paragraphs":["\"Yuan? What’s wrong?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked him when he became as still and silent as a statue even though she’d already finished reciting the incantation for the Supreme Ruler Succession Ritual.","Yuan blinked a few times before turning to look at her and responded, \"Don’t worry, nothing’s wrong. I have already acquired the title Supreme Ruler.\"","\"What? Really? You didn’t even recite the incarnation,\" she remarked.","He confirmed with a slight nod, \"Yes, I have even spoken with the Demon God.\"","\"You mean you received the Demon God’s message?\" Supreme Ruler Grant said, not wanting to believe Yuan had a real conversation with the Demon God.","\"Something like that,\" Yuan shrugged, not even going to bother with correcting him.","\"If you’ve really become a Supreme Ruler, you should be able to use Power of Authority now,\" said Supreme Ruler Dena.","<Demon God’s Inferior Authority activated>","\"You mean this?\" Yuan said as a crimson symbol glowed on his forehead.","\"Wow... you actually became a Supreme Ruler...\" Lev stared at him with a dumbstruck face.","He never expected to be in the direct presence of a Supreme Ruler, much less three at once.","’A human... being the Supreme Ruler? What has our world become?!’ Supreme Ruler Grant cried inwardly.","\"Now that we are done here, let’s head to Death Paradise,\" Yuan said a moment later.","He turned to Gutou and asked, \"Can you bring us to its borders?\"","\"I will bring you wherever you want me to, even if it’s the other side of the world, esteemed Supreme Ruler!\" Gutou instantly replied with a serious expression.","\"Of course, I won’t need a single bone from you,\" he added.","\"Sounds good. But before we leave...\"","Before they left the Weeping Ossuary, Yuan went through the entire castle to make sure they didn’t leave anything behind, such as the previous Supreme Ruler’s treasury.","But unsurprisingly, even after looking through every nook and cranny, he was unable to find a single treasure.","\"I guess I shouldn’t have expected to find anything in a place made of literally nothing but bones...\" he sighed out loud once they returned to the throne room.","\"That’s odd,\" Gutou suddenly remarked.","Yuan looked at him with a raised eyebrow and asked, \"Why would you say that?\"","\"Because Supreme Ruler Exosso wielded a famous weapon known as the Super Bone.\"","\"...\"","Yuan’s expression stiffened upon hearing the name.","\"Super Bone...? Who the hell gave it such a terrible name?\" he asked.","\"That would be the Supreme Ruler himself.\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan shook his head, \"Regardless, it’s not in the castle—\"","Yuan’s entire body abruptly stiffened as he sensed something amiss.","He turned to look at the throne where Supreme Ruler Exosso had perished and muttered, \"That wasn’t there before I became the Supreme Ruler.\"","\"What do you see?\" Lev inquired, as he was unable to sense anything himself.","Yuan activated Demon God’s Inferior Authority and focused his attention on the throne.","Then, without a word, pointed at it.","A moment later, a slit opened up at the center of the seat, and the surface collapsed inward, revealing a small portal within.","\"I’ll be damned...\" Yuan immediately thrust his arm into the portal and drew out a fist-sized piece of bone that fit his grip perfectly, as if it had been crafted for his hand.","<You have acquired ’Super Bone’>","[Super Bone]","[Grade: Celestial]","[Quality: Peak]","[Description: A treasure forged from the corpse of a Bone Leviathan, enforced with Supreme Ruler Exosso’s bones.\"","\"This is the treasure? What’s a Bone Leviathan?\" Yuan mumbled aloud.","\"Bone Leviathan?! That’s the most terrifying sea devil you can find within the Bloody Expanse! At least, within the Bone Atolls’ territory.\" Gutou explained in a scared voice.","He continued after a brief pause, \"Nobody has successfully been able to hunt a Bone Leviathan except Supreme Ruler Exosso since the beginning of time. In fact, it was such a feat that made him into the Supreme Ruler.\"","\"Is that so?\"","Yuan looked at the bone in his grasp and channeled his spiritual energy into it.","In the next instant, it began to swell and reshape, transforming into a sword.","\"What’s with that shape? It’s supposed to be much longer,\" Gutou suddenly commented.","\"Longer? Like a spear?\"","The second Yuan imagined a spear in his mind, the Super Bone transformed again, turning into a spear.","\"A shapeshifting treasure, huh? That’s pretty neat. However, I have no idea what special power it contains,\" he said, as not even the system had much information about it.","Gutou then spoke, \"I couldn’t tell you, either. Nobody has actually seen the Supreme Ruler use it in action.\"","\"I’ll figure it out later,\" Yuan said as he tossed the treasure into his spatial ring.","\"Let’s go. To Death Paradise.\"","They left the Weeping Ossuary shortly later with Gotou guiding them.","A few years later...","\"We will arrive at the Death Paradise in three months,\" Gutou said.","\"Honestly, this is my first time being so close to Death Paradise.\"","\"Because of the phenomenon, huh?\"","\"We call it the Decaying Poison. It’s so powerful that even the previous Supreme Ruler couldn’t endure it...\" After a brief pause, Gotou asked, \"I must ask, how do you intend on dealing with the poison? Surely, you’re not going to Death Paradise without any preparations, right?\"","\"That is exactly what we’re doing...\" Lev sighed.","Gutou came to an abrupt halt and stared at them in disbelief.","\"Seriously?\"","\"Seriously.\"","\"...\"","\"I’ll figure something out,\" Yuan said, breaking the awkward silence.","\"He’ll figure something out.\" Supreme Ruler Dena confirmed.","Meanwhile, Supreme Ruler Grant and Lev remained silent.","\"Whatever you might do... good luck...\" Gutou said before resuming their journey. After all, he had no plan on entering Death Paradise with them, so it was none of his problem.","A few days later, Supreme Ruler Dena spoke out loud, \"Something is coming.\"","\"This overwhelming presence...! It can only belong to one being!\" Gutou trembled at the approaching presence.","\"A Bone Leviathan!\" he exclaimed."]},{"number":2436,"title":"Chapter 2436: Death Paradise","paragraphs":["\"A Bone Leviathan, huh? To think we’d actually come across one,\" Supreme Ruler Dena calmly remarked.","\"The Bone Leviathan rarely appears, and there have only been a dozen sightings since we learned of its existence!\" Gutou explained, his voice edged with panic.","The only thing keeping him from fleeing was the presence of the two Supreme Rulers. If he knew Supreme Ruler Grant’s true identity, he likely wouldn’t be trembling at all, much like Lev, who had barely reacted to its appearance.","Moments later, the Bone Leviathan came into view. As its name suggested, it was a long, serpent-like sea devil composed entirely of bone, its form resembling an enormous human spine, each segment like a grotesque vertebra.","Seeing the Bone Leviathan, Yuan was reminded of the Flying Leviathan.","’Am I cursed to keep encountering their species or something?’ he wondered inwardly.","He retrieved Number One Under Heaven and prepared to confront it, but Supreme Ruler Dena stepped forward and said, \"Let me fight it.\"","She was curious about its strength after hearing that only Supreme Ruler Exosso had been able to slay one.","\"Be my guest.\"","Yuan moved back, putting away his sword.","Without another word, Supreme Ruler Dena shot forward to confront the Bone Leviathan.","Seeing someone as tiny as her charge in without fear, the Bone Leviathan felt only disdain, and if it could make facial expressions, its face would surely be twisted into a mocking smile at her recklessness.","Once she was close enough, Supreme Ruler Dena’s crimson hair shot forth, coiling around the Bone Leviathan and instantly sealing its movements.","Then, she began to squeeze, steadily increasing her strength.","The Bone Leviathan thrashed, trying to break free, only to be stunned when it couldn’t snap even a single strand of her hair.","Minutes later, it could no longer endure the crushing force and shattered into countless fragments.","\"...?\"","Supreme Ruler Dena gazed at the Bone Leviathan’s shattered remains with a puzzled expression, then fell silent, hovering in place as though waiting for it to regenerate. However, minutes passed by without the slightest sign of recovery, and its scattered bones had already sunk out of sight into the crimson sea below.","She turned to look at Gutou with a slight frown and complained, \"You call that weak thing the most terrifying sea devil in the Bone Atoll? What an exaggeration. It couldn’t even withstand half of my strength.\"","\"...\"","Gutou’s jaw dropped, falling so far down that it nearly touched the surface of the sea below.","\"The Bone Leviathan wasn’t weak! You’re just absurdly powerful!\" he cried out loud.","\"What a disappointment,\" she sighed as she returned to them.","\"W-What about its corpse? Its bones are priceless!\" Gutou asked her without averting his gaze from the spot where the Bone Leviathan’s corpse had sunk into.","\"I don’t care about it. You can have it if you want,\" she shrugged.","Without hesitation, Gutou dove into the crimson water.","Moments later, he resurfaced with the Bone Leviathan’s corpse—and several sea devils clinging to him, their jaws clamped viciously into his flesh.","He would be a fool not to retrieve the Bone Leviathan’s corpse, as this was only the second time one had ever been successfully hunted.","\"Can I really have it?\" he asked Supreme Ruler Dena in a nervous voice.","Instead of answering him, Supreme Ruler Dena turned to ask Yuan, \"Do you want it?\"","\"Not really,\" he said with a slight shake of his head. \"It seems like a durable material, but it’s nothing to go crazy about, and I already have a treasure made from the same material.\"","Supreme Ruler Dena nodded before responding to Gutou, \"You can keep it.\"","\"Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!\" Gutou repeated these two words a dozen times like a broken record.","They resumed their journey shortly later, and a few months later, they arrived at their destination.","\"We’ve arrived,\" Gutou said as he came to a complete halt, his gaze staring toward the horizon, where it looked like night had fallen.","Meanwhile, at the Bone Atolls and even on the Crimson Continent, the sky remained crimson even at night, only getting slightly darker at night.","\"I’m getting chills just looking at it,\" Lev remarked as his body literally trembled uncontrollably.","\"Let me take a look at it first,\" said Yuan. \"The rest of you stay here until I figure out the situation and whether I can safely bring you guys with me.\"","\"I know you’re human, but what if it’s also poisonous for you?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked with a slightly worried face.","He smiled and calmly replied, \"I am immune to poison, so even if it’s poison, I will be fine.\"","Without another word, he left them to approach Death Paradise.","\"I’ll come with you,\" said the Demon Annihilation Sword.","Knowing that she was a treasure and not truly living, Yuan had no objections and allowed her to follow him into the Death Paradise.","Soon, Yuan arrived at the border, being only a few inches away from Death Paradise.","\"Let’s see what we have here...\"","He extended his arm, pushing it into Death Paradise’s territory.","Instantly, Yuan could feel a numbing sensation.","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has activated>","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has begun to refine ’Demon God’s Ordeal’>","Yuan raised his eyebrows at the notification.","’Demon God’s Ordeal? It’s not a natural phenomenon?’ he thought to himself.","<Eternal Constituion(Incomplete) has refined ’Demon Godms Ordeal’>","<Your Demonic Awakening has strengthened!>","Just by staying inside Death Paradise for a few minutes, Yuan’s Demonic Awakening improved.","He turned to the Demon Annihilation Sword and asked her, \"Do you feel anything?\"","\"No,\" she replied as she continued chewing on Supreme Ruler Exosso’s bones.","\"You’re really taking your time with those bones, huh? How much do you have left?\" Yuan asked.","The Demon Annihilation Sword showed him the rest of her supply—a single index finger.","\"Go tell the others that I will be staying here for a few days to see if anything else happens,\" he then said.","She nodded before flying back to the group."]},{"number":2437,"title":"Chapter 2437: A Small Experiment","paragraphs":["\"My master said he’ll be staying in there for a few days to test the waters,\" said the Demon Annihilation Sword the moment she returned to the others.","Gutou then spoke, \"Umm... do you still need me? If not, I’ll return home.\"","Lev then said, \"Why don’t you wait for Yuan to return before leaving? Don’t worry, we won’t tell you to come into Death Paradise with us.\"","Gutou nodded, and they patiently waited for Yuan to return. In the meantime, they fought off the Sea Devils that attacked them. Or more specifically, Lev dealt with the Sea Devils while the others watched.","Of course, nobody asked him to be the guard, but he didn’t want to feel like pointless luggage and volunteered to fight.","As for the Sea Devils that he couldn’t deal with, Gutou would help out, as he was a True God.","One might assume that remaining within the water would shield the Sea Devils from the Demon God’s Ordeal, but even they were not spared from the phenomenon.","Fortunately, very few Sea Devils dared to venture so close to Death Paradise, and they would only encounter two to three of them a day.","Meanwhile, Yuan continued to strengthen his Demonic Awakening through Demon God’s Ordeal. Of course, he wasn’t completely focused on cultivation and also tried to understand it.","’The Demon God’s Ordeal... it completely kills one’s blood. No wonder it’s so deadly to demons...’","Yuan finally understood why demons couldn’t survive it despite their regeneration, as this phenomenon directly seals their power.","Although it may seem as though demons possess limitless blood, in reality, they are merely duplicating it, and their bodies generate new blood at a rate several times faster than that of humans.","Their blood also possesses an innate self-duplication ability, automatically replicating when it senses imminent destruction, almost like a passive skill. Because of this, attempting to destroy it is futile unless one can annihilate every last trace of their blood in an instant, or seal their passive skill, exactly what the Demon God’s Ordeal does.","As for why Yuan wasn’t being affected... In truth, the phenomenon definitely affected him, so it was constantly destroying his blood.","However, Yuan’s regeneration was not ordinary, and after achieving Transcended Renewal, it was able to bypass even Demon God’s Ordeal.","’In a sense, this power is similar to Demon Sealing Aura, but instead of sealing their blood, it directly destroys them.’","Suddenly, Yuan suddenly felt lighter, as if his mind was ascending, and a second later, he entered a trance-like state... or what cultivators called enlightenment.","As the creator of Demon Sealing Aura, nobody in this world understood such powers better than him.","A few days later—","<Your understanding of Demon Sealing Aura has transcended>","Yuan opened his eyes, and a profound light flickered within.","He unleashed some of his Demon Sealing Aura, and the same energy coming from Demon God’s Ordeal emanated from it.","\"With this power, I no longer need to completely overwhelm the demons or use Eternal Essence to kill them...\" he muttered with a smile on his face.","Although Yuan wanted to cultivate his Demonic Awakening more, the process was painfully slow, and he anticipated that he’d need to cultivate hundreds of years before he would see any real improvement.","Thus, he decided to leave for now and return to the others.","\"How was it?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked when Yuan returned to them.","He proceeded to explain his discovery with them.","\"The phenomenon is not natural but caused by the Demon God?!\" Suprem Ruler Grant cried out loud, his voice full of disbelief.","\"That’s impossible! Why would the Demon God create something harmful to his own creation and put it here?!\"","Yuan shrugged, \"How would I know? If you’re curious, you should ask the Demon God himself.\"","\"I...!\" Supreme Ruler Grant immediately fell silent.","\"So, do you think we will be able to follow you into Death Paradise? Or is it impossible after all?\" Lev suddenly asked.","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"Although the poison is strong, it won’t immediately kill you. At your level, you’ll be dead in a few weeks. At Dena and Grant’s level, they will definitely be able to survive long enough for us to do whatever we need to do.\"","\"So I have to stay behind, huh?\" Lev sighed, looking disappointed that he couldn’t follow them into Death Paradise, unaware that he no longer feared danger, even welcoming it.","\"You are more than welcomed to stay at my island until they return,\" Gutou suddenly offered Lev a place to stay.","Lev nodded, \"Thanks. I’ll do just that then.\"","However, Yuan said a second later, \"I might be able to shield you from the poison.\"","\"Really?!\" Lev’s eyes immediately started glowing with hope.","\"Come with me. I want to test it out first.\"","Lev nodded and eagerly followed Yuan into Death Paradise to participate in his experiment.","\"So this is Death Paradise, huh? I never even imagined myself being anywhere near this place, yet here I am...\" Lev muttered.","\"How does it feel?\" Yuan asked him.","\"Well, I can feel myself slowly dying, if that’s what you meant,\" he responded in a somewhat joking tone.","\"Let’s wait a few days before we start the experiment.\"","\"Alright.\"","Yuan proceeded to spend an entire week examining Lev’s condition, watching his health deteriorating at a rapid rate.","\"This is my first time seeing a demon looking sick,\" Yuan remarked. \"How are you feeling now?\"","\"Like shit,\" Lev sighed. \"I feel incredibly weak and sluggish, as if I am wearing mountains as a vest. Are we going to wait longer before you do anything?\"","\"No, we can begin now.\"","Yuan placed a hand on Lev’s shoulder and closed his eyes.","\"I am going to seal your blood now,\" he said.","\"Wait, what are you—?\"","Before Lev could even finish his sentence, Yuan used Demon Sealing Aura on his blood.","Lev’s entire body stiffened, feeling like he’d turned into a statue without actually turning into stone.","After sealing Lev’s blood, Yuan spent the next few minutes analyzing it.","\"Looks like sealing your blood won’t stop it from being destroyed by the poison...\"","Yuan unsealed his blood and tried something else, encasing Lev in the Demon Sealing Zone.","Unfortunately, that did not work, either.","A few days and multiple more experiments later—","\"Looks like it’s impossible to stop the poison from destroying your blood.\"","\"I guess it’s impossible for me to follow you into Death Paradise, after all.\" Lev shook his head with a bitter smile. \"Well, it’s not like it’s a life or death situation, so I don’t have to follow you. Just remember to pick me up after you’re done.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes and said, \"Actually, I have one more method, but it might be a little crazy.\"","\"What do you have in mind?\" Lev asked, his interest piqued.","\"If we cannot stop your blood from being destroyed, we can replenish it... with my blood.\"","\"What?!\" Lev cried out loud.","\"However, I must warn you that I cannot guarantee it will succeed. Hell, it might even kill you. I am making this suggestion purely because of my own curiosity,\" he admitted.","Lev swallowed nervously and fell silent.","Eventually, he responded with an excited smile, \"I want to try it, even if it might kill me!\"","\"Risking your life just to follow us when you don’t need to. You’ve become bold, Lev. Reckless, even.\"","\"Considering what I have experienced with you, it’s only normal. Also, I learned from the best.\"","Yuan chuckled.","\"Then let’s begin.\"","The next moment, Yuan pointed a finger at Lev and created a ball of blood on his fingertip.","\"Ready?\"","\"Ready!\"","Yuan unleashed his blood, shooting it directly at Lev.","Once it penetrated his flesh and entered his body, Yuan used Blood Manipulation to spread it throughout his veins and the rest of his body.","Lev clenched his teeth as veins bulged throughout his entire being, looking like he was experiencing cramps in every inch of his body.","\"Ahhh!\" Lev released a deafening roar, but it wasn’t from pain.","Rather, he was feeling the opposite of pain as an overwhelming amount of energy that he had never felt before surged within him.","\"What unfathomable prowess! I have never felt this powerful before!\" Lev laughed out loud.","Suddenly, his appearance began to change, and his crimson skin and hair slowly turned as white as a piece of white paper.","\"What the...?\" Yuan watched Lev transform with wide eyes.","Ding!","Suddenly, a notification appeared before him.","<’Lev’ has evolved after receiving your blood!>","<’Lev’ has accepted your blood!>","<You have turned ’Lev’ into a Demonic Servant!>","<You can now transfer your blood to your Demonic Servants indirectly, granting them incredible power briefly!>","Yuan wore a shocked expression after realizing he had inadvertently turned Lev into his servant.","However, he was the only one surprised by this outcome. Lev had already known this would happen the moment he accepted Yuan’s blood. In fact, within the Demonic Realm, it was common knowledge that when a demon consumed a significant amount of another’s blood, it was tantamount to pledging servitude to them.","Such an act was known as a ritual—the Blood Servant Pact—and because it was rarely performed, Yuan had never heard of it.","He hadn’t even considered the possibility of turning Lev into a servant, especially since he had given Supreme Ruler Dena far more of his blood without any such outcome.","Of course, consuming someone’s blood and directly accepting it into one’s body were entirely different matters, but such minor details tend to be overlooked."]},{"number":2438,"title":"Chapter 2438: Demonic Servant","paragraphs":["\"I wasn’t expecting much when I accepted your blood, but to think it would evolve my bloodline and boost my power this much!\" Lev laughed out loud, his cultivation now at the 4th level False God after accepting Yuan’s blood.","Yuan looked at him with a raised eyebrow and remarked, \"You’re awfully excited for someone who just turned into a servant.\"","\"Is it so weird? I agreed to be your servant without any guarantees, you know?\" He replied.","\"Huh? You knew you’d become my servant after accepting my blood?\"","\"Why do you look so puzzled? Don’t tell me you gave me your blood without knowing about this?\" Lev stared at him with a dumbfounded face.","Yuan nodded and admitted, \"I won’t lie. I had no idea it’d turn you into my servant.\"","\"Oh...\" Lev immediately lowered his head, looking disappointed.","\"So you wouldn’t have given me your blood if you knew? I mean, I knew it was too good to be true—that someone as powerful as you would ask a nobody like me to be your servant.\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"That’s not it. I would’ve asked you properly if I knew.\"","\"You mean you don’t mind having a coward like me as your servant?\" Lev’s eyes widened, looking somewhat dazed.","\"Although you were definitely one when we first met, you’ve changed a lot.\"","\"But we’ve just met...\"","In Lev’s eyes, even spending a few decades together was no different than meeting only a few days ago.","\"It may seem short to you, but in my eyes, we’ve known each other long enough. If you don’t want to be my servant, just say so, and I’ll release you... if that’s even possible.\"","\"No way!\" Lev hastily shook his head in response, even distancing himself from Yuan. \"Please allow me to be your servant! I promise I will not disappoint you!\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"I can keep giving you my blood indefinitely as long as you are my servant, so you’ll be able to traverse Death Paradise without any issues.\"","Some time later, they returned to the others.","\"What’s with that appearance?\" Supreme Ruler Dena immediately inquired about Lev’s transformation.","Lev rubbed his nose in a prideful manner and opened his mouth, but before he could speak, Supreme Ruler Dena approached him and remarked while sniffing the air around him, \"Why do you smell like Yuan?\"","\"I accepted his blood and performed the Blood Servant Pact, which resulted in my bloodline growing stronger and my evolution,\" Lev explained.","\"...\"","Supreme Ruler Dena stared at him with a stunned expression on her face, as did Gutou and Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"You... performed the Blood Servant Pact with Yuan...?\" Supreme Ruler Dena mumbled in a low voice, sounding a little in disbelief.","\"Give me some of your blood,\" Supreme Ruler Grant suddenly said.","\"What? Why?\"","\"I want to examine it.\"","Lev looked at Yuan for his permission, who responded with a nonchalant shrug, basically saying he doesn’t care.","Lev proceeded to give a drop of his blood to Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"What the hell is this?! Your bloodline is comparable to a noble!\" Supreme Ruler Grant exclaimed in shock a moment later.","\"What?!\" Lev cried out loud after hearing this, looking just as shocked as Supreme Ruler Grant, if not even more.","In the Demonic Realm, having a noble-grade bloodline was akin to being a Demon Emperor in the Nine Heavens, with Supreme Rulers being Ancient Demons.","\"But I was born with an ordinary bloodline...\" Lev swallowed nervously.","Lev was born as a Lower Demon, the lowest ranking demon. However, his bloodline evolved and is now comparable to a Demon Emperor after accepting Yuan’s blood. This much growth was unprecedented.","\"For your bloodline to have advanced this much... it’s honestly terrifying.\" Supreme Ruler Grant turned to Yuan, his gaze filled with dread.","Yuan could now, in essence, create as many Demon Emperors as he wished simply by sharing his blood. With such power, he could effortlessly raise an army of Demon Emperors and seize dominion over the entire Demonic Realm.","Meanwhile, a very different thought flashed through Supreme Ruler Dena’s mind as she wondered what might happen if someone like her—a Supreme Ruler—were to accept his blood.","When Yuan saw Supreme Ruler Grant’s worried face, he smiled and said, \"I know what you’re thinking. However, I have no interest in raising an army of demons. That being said, if you piss me off, I might do it just to spite you.\"","Supreme Ruler Grant trembled at such words, and he quietly swore inwardly that he’d never offend Yuan.","\"Um... may I shamelessly ask if I can also be your servant?\" Gutou suddenly asked with an awkward smile on his face.","Yuan looked at him and said, \"I’ll think about it.\"","\"Thank you!\" Gutou immediately bowed.","\"What about me?\" Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly asked.","\"What? You must be joking,\" Yuan said.","However, when he turned and saw her serious face, he immediately became perplexed.","\"I am not joking,\" she calmly said.","\"You’re a Supreme Ruler, you know? And I know you’re not the type of person who’d willingly lower your head to another, regardless of their identity.\"","Supreme Ruler Dena shook her head and replied, \"I don’t know where you got that information since I have never said such a thing. While it’s true that I have never once considered being beneath someone, it’s simply because there is nobody even close to being worthy of my admiration.\"","\"In fact, you’re the first person to ever earn my admiration and respect, and that was ages ago when you were Tian Chenyu. If it’s you right now, I don’t mind lowering my head for you, not to mention how much stronger you’ll get in the future.\"","\"...\"","Everyone there stared at Supreme Ruler Dena with their mouths agape, as they’ve never thought she was capable of uttering such words.","After a long moment of silence, Yuan cleared his throat and spoke in a stiff voice, \"I will... think about it.\""]},{"number":2439,"title":"Chapter 2439: Entering Death Paradise","paragraphs":["’He’ll think about it?! That’s insane!’","Everyone there turned to look at Yuan with wide eyes, clearly in disbelief by his response.","If someone as powerful as Supreme Ruler Dena offered to be their servant, they’d accept in a heartbeat. Yet, for some reason, Yuan did not do such a thing, even saying he’d only consider it.","However, due to personal reasons, none of them said anything.","Supreme Ruler Grant didn’t want Yuan to become even more ridiculous with Supreme Ruler Dena at his beckoning, while Lev wanted to enjoy being Yuan’s only servant for a little longer, Moreover, he’d immediately be outranked by her.","\"Fine...\" Supreme Ruler Dena responded in a somewhat disappointed tone.","\"Anyway, let’s talk about how we’re going to find Supreme Ruler Umbra before we enter Death Paradise,\" Yuan then said.","\"Don’t look at me because I have never been to Death Paradise,\" Supreme Ruler Grant said.","Supreme Ruler Dena then spoke, \"I have briefly visited Death Paradise several times out of curiosity, but I have not once encountered a single individual during my visits. I have met Supreme Ruler Umbra a few times, but it was always at the tripoint like Supreme Ruler Grant.\"","\"You’ve not met a single individual? Just how small is their population?\" Yuan remarked with a pondering expression.","Gutou then spoke, \"This is just a rumor, but I’ve heard that it’s likely there are fewer than a hundred people living in Death Paradise.\"","\"If we consider their environment, it’s not surprising they have so few people,\" Lev said.","\"So what should we do? Wander Death Paradise until we hopefully encounter someone?\" he then asked.","\"That could take forever,\" Supreme Ruler Grant said. \"And we don’t have unlimited time in that place.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before retrieving a certain scale from his spatial ring and speaking into it.","\"Hey, you got some free time?\"","Not even three seconds later, a familiar figure emerged from the sea surface to greet him.","\"Have you already got someone you want me to kill?\" Primal Sovereign of the Seas asked after answering Yuan’s summoning.","\"Nope,\" Yuan immediately shook his head. \"I was just wondering if you can find someone for me. I’m looking for the Supreme Ruler of Death Paradise.\"","\"...\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas stared at Yuan with a dumbfounded face for a moment before responding, \"Do I look like a freaking search dog to you?!\"","Yuan silently shrugged, not willing to respond to his question.","\"I gave you that scale so you could give me a target, not so you could summon me on a whim and order me around like a servant...\" the Primal Sovereign of the Seas sighed. Despite its irritable tone, it wasn’t truly enraged.","Yuan then said, \"If you do me this favor, I’ll give you some of my blood.\"","\"?!\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ body visibly stiffened at Yuan’s words.","\"Your blood...?\" It muttered in a low voice, unable to hide the smile that was slowly creeping onto its round face.","When the Primal Sovereign of the Seas realized it was smiling, it quickly adjusted its expression to become nonchalant and spoke, \"I have just scanned the entire sea within Death Paradise, but I was unable to find the individual you’re looking for. After all, I can only sense what’s within or touching my water. Even if they’re an inch away from the surface of the sea, I won’t be able to sense them.\"","After a brief pause, it continued, \"With that being said, I was able to sense someone. This individual appears to be cultivating on a pond six million, nine thousand, and fifty miles north of here.\"","\"That’s good enough,\" Yuan said as he drew out three drops of his blood and offered them to the Primal Sovereign of the Seas.","\"That’s it? Three measly drops? Do you not see how magnificently vast this majesty is? How could I possibly be satisfied with so little?\" The Primal Sovereign of the Seas shook its head.","\"If you expect me to give you blood in proportion to your size, you might as well devour me whole,\" Yuan sighed. \"Three drops. Take it or leave it.\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas snickered before somewhat begrudgingly accepting Yuan’s stingy offer.","Of course, it wasted no time and immediately consumed all three drops of blood at once.","\"Th-This taste is...!\" The Primal Sovereign of the Seas trembled, its eyes widening in shock and disbelief.","Then, its massive body collapsed into the sea.","Moments later, it resurfaced while shouting, \"How magnificent! Utterly sublime! I have never savored anything so exquisite in all my existence!\"","It fixed Yuan with a ravenous gaze and muttered, \"I can’t help but wonder how much better it would taste if you’d given me several more drops...\"","Yuan shook his head, then revealed a detail that left the Primal Sovereign of the Seas utterly speechless and deeply regretful.","\"The taste won’t change even if I gave you a mouthful. In fact, a single drop would have given you the same experience, so you basically wasted two, as you could’ve stretched them into three separate meals.\"","\"No way!!!\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas screamed in agony as it toppled back into the water, sending massive tsunamis surging in all directions.","A moment later, its eyes slowly peeked out of the water as it mumbled, \"Would you be so kind as to give me two more—no... just another drop of blood?\"","Yuan smiled inwardly after seeing the Primal Sovereign of the Seas getting addicted to his blood, as he could use this to his advantage in the future.","\"Sorry, but I’m tired now. Maybe later,\" he said, pretending to look exhausted.","\"...\"","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas instantly realized what Yuan was doing and sighed, \"Fine. If you ever need my help again, don’t hesitate to contact me. However, besides that one favor I owe you, I won’t become your personal assassin, so don’t even consider it.\"","\"I’ll keep that in mind,\" Yuan replied with a smile.","The Primal Sovereign of the Seas didn’t say anything else and silently disappeared into the crimson sea again.","Some time later, Yuan and the others entered Death Paradise, following the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ direction to the unknown individual it sensed."]},{"number":2440,"title":"Chapter 2440: Demon of Death Paradise","paragraphs":["\"W-Wait!\" Gutou suddenly called out to them right as they started leaving.","\"What about me? Do I have to enter Death Paradise with you?\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"Your job has ended the moment you led us here. You can return home now. Thanks for your help.\"","\"I see...\" Gutou nodded, and after a moment of silence, turned around and flew away, sighing inwardly that they didn’t even attempt to ask him to follow them.","Time passed swiftly, and after traveling for six million miles with Void Manipulation, Yuan and the others slowed to a halt when they sensed an unfathomably powerful aura in the distance.","They were still in the Bloody Expanse, surrounded by crimson water and a night sky.","\"What a powerful presence!\" Supreme Ruler Grant was the first to comment on it.","Even though this aura clearly belonged to an Absolute God like him, its presence was several times stronger than his own.","\"I may be wrong, but this individual seems to be on par... if not even stronger than her...\" Lev spoke in a nervous voice as his gaze pointed at Supreme Ruler Dena, who remained as calm as ever.","\"How should we approach them?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked.","However, before she could receive a response, the overwhelming aura vanished into thin air, and the presence completely disappeared half a second later.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, an unfamiliar voice resounded right behind them.","\"Three who bear the Demon God’s Authority, a tool, and one insignificant being,\" the voice remarked, its tone laced with intrigue. \"What an odd gathering.\"","\"?!\"","Supreme Ruler Grant and Lev were startled by the voice and hastily flew away while Yuan, Supreme Ruler Dena, and the Demon Annihilation Sword calmly turned around to face the voice.","Hovering just behind them was a tall, strikingly beautiful woman with a bountiful figure and ghostly pale complexion. Her pitch-black hair flowed freely behind her, and her eyes—dark as abyssal depths—lacked both emotion and light, like twin black holes that swallowed all they beheld.","Though she appeared human, there was something about her presence that clearly transcended one.","\"We’re here to speak with Supreme Ruler Umbra, do you know where we can find him?\" Yuan asked her.","The woman’s void-like eyes shifted to Yuan, and a small smile tugged at her lips as she responded, \"Are you human? One that isn’t from this world.\"","Yuan was not surprised by her question and calmly replied, \"Yes, I am.\"","The woman closed her eyes and released a low sigh, \"How long has it been since I last saw a human? Ever since the Great Cataclysm, I suppose.\"","\"The Great Cataclysm?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow at this unfamiliar term.","He turned to Supreme Ruler Dena, only to find her equally unresponsive to the term, suggesting she had no idea what it meant either.","\"What is the Great Cataclysm?\" Yuan decided to ask the woman.","\"...\"","The woman remained silent for a moment before speaking, \"It’s been so long since I’ve had visitors... it would be a shame if you left so soon.\"","Hearing such ominous words, Yuan prepared to enter battle at any second.","However, the woman continued, \"Let’s play a game. If you win, I’ll tell you everything you wish to know—including Umbra’s whereabouts.\"","\"And if you win?\" Yuan asked.","\"If I win...\"","She slowly raised a finger and pointed it at him.","\"You will remain here... and accompany me for eternity.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow. \"That hardly seems fair. If we win, you merely answer a few questions. But if we lose, I forfeit my freedom—my life—to you?\"","\"So what?\" the woman replied indifferently. \"The strong dictate the rules.\"","\"I admit that you’re pretty strong, but we won’t know—\"","Supreme Ruler Dena opened her mouth to speak, but before she could even finish her sentence, the woman unleashed her aura again.","An unfathomable pressure instantly enveloped their area—one that was several times stronger than what they sensed before.","\"This is insane!\" Lev cried out loud. Although he had been uncertain whether the woman surpassed Supreme Ruler Dena in strength, that doubt had now completely vanished, and he was certain she did.","\"For an incomplete being to reach your level of strength is indeed impressive,\" the woman said calmly. \"However... even if you spent your entire life trying, you would never come close to touching my shadow.\"","\"An incomplete being...?\" Supreme Ruler Dena frowned at the woman’s choice of words, wondering why she used such a term.","\"You know nothing despite carrying the Demon God’s Authority? Well, I can’t blame you for the Demon God’s incompetence.\"","Supreme Ruler Grant’s eyes widened with shock when he heard the woman openly scoff at the Demon God, something that was unthinkable in the Crimson Continent.","\"To call the Demon God incompetent... that’s blasphemous!\" Supreme Ruler Grant subconsciously shouted.","\"Hm?\" The woman shifted her attention to him.","Suddenly, she vanished without a trace, only to reappear directly before Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"You should consider yourselves fortunate,\" she said calmly, her gaze cold. \"Had you encountered the others instead of me, they would have torn you apart without a word for being the Demon God’s dog.\"","\"Demon God’s dog? We’re Supreme Rulers!\"","\"What’s the difference?\" The woman shrugged.","\"But you also have a Supreme Ruler. Umbra.\" Yuan suddenly pointed out.","The woman looked at him and smiled, \"Enough with the chatter. If you want me to answer any questions, you will need to win my game.\"","\"And if we refuse to play?\"","\"Then I’ll kill all of you,\" she calmly said.","\"...\"","Despite the woman’s arrogant claim, Yuan couldn’t say with certainty that he could defeat her. Her aura was simply that overwhelming—perhaps even on par with the Dragon God’s eldest daughter at her full strength.","However, even if he could defeat her, it would likely take all his effort and a tremendous amount of time.","In such a situation, he’d rather avoid an unnecessary fight and see what kind of game she wanted to play.","\"Alright. What is this game that you want to play?\" Yuan asked.","The woman then said, \"You will have to choose one person out of your group to participate. For the game itself... you simply need to endure a trial.\"","\"I will do it,\" Yuan said without hesitation.","However, the woman slowly shook her head and said, \"No, this trial won’t work on you or that tool. The participant must be originally from this world.\"","Yuan frowned at her words.","\"You’re telling me that I cannot participate in a game where my own life is at stake? This is beyond unreasonable.\"","\"What other choice do you have?\" The woman chuckled, clearly proud of herself.","Yuan sighed but said nothing.","Although the situation appeared unfavorable, it wasn’t truly dire. Even if they lost the game, he had no intention of remaining in Death Paradise for the rest of his life, and if they proved unable to defeat this woman, he could always call in the favor owed to him by the Primal Sovereign of the Seas.","\"What does the trial entail?\" Supreme Ruler Dena asked.","The woman suddenly swept her slender arm through the air, and at her gesture, the air—or more precisely—the poison within it, surged toward her.","Everyone stared in bewilderment, as none of them had expected her to be able to manipulate the poison itself.","\"The participant must accept this and survive. Quite the simple game, right?\"","\"How is that a game?\" Yuan said as he stared at the overwhelming amount of Demon God’s Ordeal gathered around the woman with a deep frown on his face. \"You’re basically just asking one of them to die.\"","\"Anything can be a game if you put your mind to it,\" she calmly replied. \"That being said, if they survive this game, they will be greatly rewarded.\"","’Rewarded...?’ Yuan thought to himself.","\"Um... I can participate.\"","Lev suddenly spoke aloud.","Yuan turned to look at him and asked, \"You’ll die, you know? This is nothing more than a death sentence.\"","\"That’s precisely why I am stepping up. If anyone has to be sacrificed here, it should be me. It’s a pity since my life had just changed for the better,\" Lev responded with a bitter smile on his face.","\"Or, we can just make him do it.\" Supreme Ruler Dena said while pointing at Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"What?! I am not going to sacrifice myself for you, even if you kill me!\" he cried out loud.","\"I am just joking,\" Supreme Ruler Dena suddenly said, dumbfounding them.","With a slight turn of her head, she looked at Yuan and continued, \"Let me do it.\"","\"But—\"","\"I have no intention of sacrificing myself,\" she interrupted Yuan, who had just opened his mouth.","\"Since your life is on the line, I can’t entrust it to anyone else. Moreover, out of everyone here, I have the highest chance of surviving that much poison.\"","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent at her logical reasoning.","’There’s no need to risk your life like this. Let’s fight her. If we cannot defeat her, we can just have the Primal Sovereign of the Seas to kill her for us,’ Yuan then said to her through voice transmission.","However, Supreme Ruler Dena shook her head and replied, ’I am not only doing this for you. That woman looked down on me—belittled me. I will win this stupid game of hers and make her swallow her own words.’","After a moment of silence, Yuan turned to ask the woman, \"She will participate, but before we begin, can you give us some time to prepare for the game?\"","\"Since it will prolong your presence here, I will allow it,\" she calmly nodded.","The next moment, Yuan approached Supreme Ruler Dena and extended an arm toward her.","\"Will you accept my blood?\" he asked."]},{"number":2441,"title":"Chapter 2441: True Origin of Demons","paragraphs":["Supreme Ruler Dena stared at Yuan, her eyes widening in surprise. Though she had offered to become his servant of her own accord not long ago, being asked by him now felt entirely different.","She opened her mouth only to close it without a response, repeating this several times, as if dumbstruck by it.","Supreme Ruler Grant and Lev stared at her with puzzled faces, wondering why she was suddenly hesitant on accepting Yuan’s blood when she’d asked for it recently.","After a moment of silence, Supreme Ruler Dena closed her eyes and sighed, \"If I am going to prove myself, I must do it alone, or it’d be pointless. I also don’t want to hear any excuses from her later, so I cannot accept your blood now.\"","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent for a brief moment before a small smile tugged at his lips.","\"For some reason, I knew you’d say something like that,\" he said, not surprised by her rejection in the slightest.","\"Although it’s a reckless—even foolish thing to do, I respect your resolution.\"","Supreme Ruler Dena silently nodded before turning to the woman.","\"I am ready to play your game,\" she said.","\"Good luck, little girl.\"","The woman extended her arm toward Supreme Ruler Dena, and at her command, the overwhelming mass of poison surged forth, instantly engulfing her petite figure.","\"Ahh!\"","Supreme Ruler Dena immediately screamed in agony. While the poison normally caused no pain when absorbed gradually, this was an entirely different matter, as she had just been forced to endure over a thousand years’ worth of the Demon God’s Ordeal in a single instant.","For Lev, who could only survive a few weeks in Death Paradise before his evolution, this amount would’ve instantly killed him... thousands of times, at that.","As for Supreme Ruler Grant, who could easily survive a few hundred years, it would also instantly kill him over a dozen times at once.","Supreme Ruler Dena’s screaming lasted only a few seconds before she fell silent, as if she’d perished.","\"Did she die already?\" The woman wondered aloud in a somewhat disappointed voice. \"I had a little expectation for her, considering her talents as an incomplete being.\"","Soon, the last traces of condensed poison vanished into Supreme Ruler Dena’s body.","Her body went limp, and she began to fall from the sky like a lifeless doll.","Seeing this, Yuan went to catch her body.","Upon examining her body, he was relieved to know that she was still alive. However, the poison also hadn’t been fully consumed, so her life was still in danger.","\"She’s still alive? I guess I had underestimated her a little,\" the woman suddenly remarked. \"But let’s see if she can make it to the end.\"","\"Why are you calling her incomplete?\" Yuan asked her.","The woman stared at him in silence for a brief moment before responding, \"I guess I can entertain you for a bit since you’ll be staying with me for an eternity soon.\"","Then, she continued, \"The vast majority of people in this world haven’t yet fully completed their transformation, hence why they are incomplete.\"","\"And judging by your sense of superiority, I can assume that you are a complete demon, right?\" Yuan asked.","The woman offered a silent smile.","Yuan suddenly recalled his encounter with Demon Emperor Carnage, along with the mention of the so-called ’Ancients.’","Demon Emperors had once been believed to stand at the pinnacle of their race, yet that was far from the truth. Above them existed the Ancient Demons, known in the Demonic Realm as Supreme Rulers.","However, even they were not the true apex. Beyond them were the Ancients—beings fundamentally different in nature, and the undisputed peak of the demon race.","Even Supreme Ruler Dena, who was hailed as the strongest demon in history, wouldn’t be able to hold a candle to a true Ancient.","\"Are you what they call an ’Ancient’?\"","Wanting confirmation, Yuan asked the woman.","\"Is that what they call us these days?\" The woman responded with nonchalance. \"We were once known as Transcendents, perfect beings who have passed God’s trial.\"","\"God’s trial? Are you referring to the Demon God?\"","\"That’s right,\" she replied. \"That unhinged god who is the only being above us Transcendents—and the one who brought about the Great Cataclysm.\"","Unmasked hatred and rage flashed within the woman’s eyes as she mentioned the Demon God and the Great Cataclysm.","\"What is the difference between a demon and a Transcendent? Aren’t you just a demon with a stronger bloodline?\"","\"Hahaha!\"","The woman suddenly burst into uncontrollable laughter, her voice echoing wildly as if she had just heard the most absurd joke.","\"Just a demon with a stronger bloodline? You really know nothing about this world, huh? Well, I can’t really blame you since most people in this world don’t know their own origins, either.\"","The woman stopped laughing and stared at Yuan with a serious expression.","\"Listen carefully, human from another world,\" she said, her voice turning cold and grim. \"I am nothing like a demon.\"","\"Demons are merely humans who failed to ascend—imperfect beings, incomplete... failures.\"","An arrogant smile touched her lips as she continued, \"I, on the other hand, am still human—one who surpassed humanity itself. I am a transcendent... a perfect human!\"","Yuan’s eyes widened at the revelation that demons were originally human. However, it wasn’t entirely unexpected. As he’d come to understand them more, he had noticed subtle hints, such as their humanoid forms, and how those with purer bloodlines bore an even closer resemblance, some nearly indistinguishable from humans.","\"Then—\"","Just as Yuan opened his mouth to speak, Supreme Ruler Dena, who had remained as still as a corpse, suddenly jolted awake.","A violent surge of power erupted from her body, unleashing a shockwave that blew Yuan away.","\"Oh?\"","The woman muttered under her breath, her gaze sharpening as it settled on Supreme Ruler Dena, who hovered just slightly above the sea surface, her face devoid of all expression.","However, the woman frowned a moment later.","\"Something isn’t right...\" she mumbled."]},{"number":2442,"title":"Chapter 2442: The Great Cataclysm","paragraphs":["\"Something is wrong? What is wrong with her?\" Yuan questioned with a frown after hearing the woman’s ominous words.","The woman narrowed her eyes and replied in a puzzled tone, \"As I explained earlier, demons are humans who failed to ascend in the past, and every human born afterward also becomes a demon, as that lineage now flows through their blood. However, it is possible for later generations of demons to ascend if they consume, and survive, the Demon God’s Ordeal.\"","\"With that being said, success is exceedingly rare, and pretty much everyone just dies. These days, no one even dares to attempt it, given how many have perished. In time, the Demon God’s Ordeal’s true purpose was forgotten, its name reduced to that of a deadly phenomenon that simply slaughters demons.\"","\"As for that little girl... she consumed enough Demon God’s Ordeal to ascend. At least, that was how much I had to endure to become a transcendent. But despite enduring all of it, she hasn’t transcended yet.\"","\"What does this mean?\" Yuan asked.","\"This is my first time seeing this, but if we think logically, it simply means that she needs to consume even more of Demon God’s Ordeal!\"","With an intrigued smile on her face, the woman suddenly waved her arm, sending even more Demon God’s Ordeal toward Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"Let’s see how much she’ll need to transcend... or die!\" she laughed madly.","However, Yuan suddenly moved in front of Supreme Ruler Dena, blocking her from the Demon God’s Ordeal and absorbing it himself.","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has activated!>","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has refined Demon God’s Ordeal!>","<Your Demonic Awakening has improved tremendously!>","\"What do you think you’re doing?\"","The woman frowned at his unexpected actions.","\"I should be saying that to you,\" Yuan calmly replied. \"Since she endured the Demon God’s Ordeal and survived, she’s already won your game, regardless if she’s ascended or not.\"","The woman silently glared at him for a moment before speaking again. \"You’re right. She has technically won the game, and I’m not denying her victory. However, now that her ascension has begun, it cannot be halted. Otherwise, she’ll become a Forsaken or die, so we have no choice but to see it through to the end.\"","Without another word, the woman gathered even more of the Demon God’s Ordeal and forced it into Supreme Ruler Dena. This time, Yuan did not stop her and silently watched her small body become enveloped by it again.","\"Ahhh!\" Supreme Ruler Dena began screaming again, her voice raw with agony.","However, unlike before, she didn’t stop screaming.","The woman also continued to pour Demon God’s Ordeal into Supreme Ruler Dena’s body without stopping.","\"What’s going on? She’s absorbing the Demon God’s Ordeal like crazy!\" The woman exclaimed with an excited expression on her face.","Yuan and the others watched with clenched fists and wide eyes, each second stretching into an eternity.","One minute... three minutes... six minutes...","After ten full minutes of enduring the Demon God’s Ordeal, an unfathomable aura suddenly erupted from Supreme Ruler Dena’s body, sending a powerful ripple sweeping across the entire Demonic Realm.","Seeing this, the woman immediately froze and turned her full attention to Supreme Ruler Dena, swallowing nervously in anticipation.","\"How many years of Demon God’s Ordeal did she endure? A hundred thousand years? No, it has to be much more than that!\" she muttered in a dazed voice, quietly comparing herself.","Moments after Supreme Ruler Dena’s aura erupted, her hair began to writhe with a life of its own, coiling around her body and wrapping her in a cocoon that was similar to what Yuan saw before she was woken up by him in the Deprived Crimson Valley.","Time passed quickly, yet even after many minutes there was no change in the cocoon, nor any sign that she would be emerging anytime soon.","\"What’s happening? Has she succeeded in her ascension?\" Yuan asked the woman.","\"No, but she’s in the final stage. Once she emerges—if she does—she’ll become a transcendent,\" she replied.","\"How long will it take?\"","\"Hard to say,\" she shrugged. \"But it took me several million years.\"","\"That long?!\" Yuan exclaimed after hearing this.","\"In the meantime, you can ask me your questions,\" the woman suddenly said.","\"...\"","Yuan decided to set Supreme Ruler Dena’s situation aside for now and focus on wringing every last bit of information he could out of the woman.","\"Let’s start from the very beginning,\" he said. \"You said that every demon was once human. How long ago was that? And what happened that caused them to turn into demons?\"","\"It happened so long ago that no one in this world could tell you the exact time, but it has definitely been over a trillion years,\" she answered calmly.","\"As for what caused the transformation, it was an event we call the Great Cataclysm. At first, it spread like a disease, turning the infected’s skin red before killing them. We initially believed it to be a natural disaster, but we—the Transcendents—eventually discovered it had been deliberately wrought by the Demon God, the overseer of this world.\"","\"Anyway, those killed by the disease would return to life about a week later, but without their memories or former selves, reduced to mindless monsters that attacked and devoured others like wild beasts,\" she continued.","\"In the beginning, they were easy to kill and could be stopped by destroying their head or heart. But as time passed, they evolved and grew stronger, even gaining the ability to regenerate from any non-lethal injury.\"","\"Before we knew it, these beings had grown so powerful they could regenerate even from decapitation or a crushed heart, becoming effectively unkillable. However, they also ceased to be mindless, and those who returned from death began to retain their memories. Eventually, the infected stopped dying altogether and instead simply transformed into what you now know as demons.\"","\"Of course, that didn’t stop the humans from hunting them. But since demons were immortal and people continued to become infected somehow, their numbers continued to grow, and they eventually formed their own factions and society, becoming ever more powerful.\"","\"The humans and demons clashed nonstop for hundreds of years, and then—\"","The woman paused for a brief moment before continuing, \"—the Great Cataclysm happened, changing the entire world forever.\""]},{"number":2443,"title":"Chapter 2443: The Great Cataclysm(2)","paragraphs":["\"The disease, which had appeared only sporadically for countless years, suddenly infected the entire world at once,\" the woman said in a grim voice. \"Panic spread, chaos followed, and the world as we knew it came to an end. This is the Great Cataclysm.\"","\"However, not everyone transformed into the red-skinned demons that now make up the majority of our kind. Some turned grey, others blue, and a few even retained their human appearance.\"","After a brief pause, she continued in a sorrowful voice, \"It wouldn’t have been as bad if everyone turned into demons. Unfortunately, that was not the case, as the majority of the human population perished during the Great Cataclysm, and I watched as my entire family died one by one before me.\"","Yuan silently listened to her story with a pondering expression on his face.","\"After the Great Cataclysm ended and everyone in the world either became a demon or died, an unfamiliar voice rippled throughout the world, giving a brief explanation of what had occurred.\"","\"The Demon God?\" Yuan asked.","The woman nodded. \"That was the Demon God’s first appearance—his introduction to the world. It was then that he revealed we were his creation, and that he had elevated us into what he called superior beings.\"","\"Of course,\" the woman continued in a sighing voice, \"the Demon God deemed most of us failures, claiming that only a select few had truly succeeded in ascending. I... was one of those few.\"","\"Did the Demon God reveal the reason behind his actions?\"","The woman shook her head.","\"No, and that was the last time we ever heard from him again... at least until Supreme Rulers became a thing.\"","After hearing her full story and learning the true history of the Demonic Realm, Yuan finally understood why the woman appeared to despise the Demon God who, for whatever reason, turned every human into monsters incapable of dying normally.","\"I understand how demons came to be, but what about the Forsaken?\" Yuan asked after a moment of silence.","\"They were originally just called ’demons,’\" the woman replied. \"But over time, we adopted that name for ourselves, as there was little difference between us—aside from our ability to retain control over our emotions and actions far better.\"","\"Eventually, the world forgot its true history. ’Demon’ became our identity, while the original ones came to be known as Forsakens and are treated as sick demons that must be kept away from the healthy.\"","\"What about Abominations?\" Yuan then asked. \"They look nothing like demons.\"","\"Abominations...?\" The woman looked at Yuan with a confused face, almost as if she was hearing this name for the first time.","\"You know... those massive, fat and ugly demons?\"","\"Oh... you mean those monstrosities. They are neither human nor demon, but artificial beings created by some madman in the distant past, for reasons that remain a mystery. They’re mostly relics now—repulsive monsters of a bygone era and pretty much extinct in this world,\" she said, shaking her head in disgust.","\"Artificial beings?\" Yuan mumbled.","This was his first time hearing a clear explanation of the Abominations’ existence, as no one had known their true origin when he’d asked as Tian Chenyu. Most had simply assumed they were mutated demons—Forsakens who had offended the Demon God so deeply they were punished with such a hideous form.","However, this wasn’t Yuan’s first time hearing about artificial beings. He just didn’t know Abominations also fell into such a category.","Some time later, Yuan asked, \"Alright, now tell me about Supreme Ruler Umbra and where we can find them.\"","\"Supreme Ruler Umbra?\" the woman suddenly chuckled, almost as if he’d just told a joke.","\"There is no Supreme Ruler Umbra,\" she said a moment later, leaving everyone dumbfounded.","\"What? If you’re going to lie, at least make it believable!\" Supreme Ruler Grant shouted. \"I have met Supreme Ruler Umbra several times, yet you dared to claim he doesn’t exist?\"","\"By Supreme Ruler Umbra, do you mean him?\"","The woman suddenly raised her hand and, with a snap of her fingers, conjured a figure out of thin air.","\"T-That is—?!\" Supreme Ruler Grant’s eyes widened, looking utterly bewildered.","\"Supreme Ruler Umbra doesn’t actually exist. He’s just an illusion we created for our own convenience, and, most importantly, for fun,\" she revealed with a playful smile, \"After all, nobody in this place would be willing to accept the Demon God’s Authority.\"","\"Then who was it that I spoke with before? You? Or the others?\" Supreme Ruler Grant asked with a deep frown on his face.","\"Since we can all use ’Supreme Ruler Umbra’, it could’ve been any of us. However, I definitely have never spoken to you before.\"","Yuan then asked, \"Exactly how many of you are in Death Paradise?\"","\"Take a guess,\" she said.","\"A few hundred?\"","\"Hahaha! A few hundred? We wouldn’t be bored out of our minds if we had so many Transcendants!\" she exploded with laughter.","Then, she extended a hand at Yuan and raised three fingers.","\"Including myself, there are only three Transcendants left now,\" she calmly said.","Yuan fell silent with a stunned look on his face for a moment before speaking, \"You make it sound like there were more in the past.\"","\"Because there were, but not much more. Enough to count with two hands.\"","\"What happened to them? Did they leave this world?\"","\"Leave? If only such a thing was possible,\" she sneered before revealing in a cold tone, \"They all died... killed.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"They were killed? By whom? Don’t tell me they fought against themselves or something along that line.\"","\"Of course not. They were killed by the only existence in this world who can do so—the Demon God.\"","\"What?\" Yuan immediately became puzzled.","\"The Demon God? Why would he kill his own creation?\"","The Demon God has always been adamant about not interfering with his own world, and slaughtering his own creations would be a direct contradiction to that.","The woman shrugged and calmly explained, \"Because we attacked him.\"","\"You what?!\" Yuan exclaimed, his eyes wide with disbelief."]},{"number":2444,"title":"Chapter 2444: Selena","paragraphs":["\"You guys actually attacked the Demon God?\" Yuan stared at the woman in astonishment, as he thought that he was the only human to have fought against Eternals before.","\"It was a pathetic attempt,\" the woman shook her head, looking somewhat ashamed. \"Not only were we unable to hurt the Demon God, but we couldn’t even get close to him. Meanwhile, he killed half of us without any effort. The only reason I, and the other two, were able to survive was because we ran away, and the Demon God didn’t pursue us.\"","\"However, he did punish us for baring our fangs at him by imprisoning us in this place.\"","\"By this place, do you mean Death Paradise?\" Yuan asked.","She nodded.","\"We have been stuck in this place ever since then, unable to do anything but... simply exist without a real purpose.\"","Hearing the woman’s story, Yuan was reminded of the Heavenly War of Immortals and Gods, where countless opponents of the Celestial Emperor had been cast into the Shadow Realm to slowly rot away.","\"I already have a good idea why, but I still want to hear it from you. Why did you fight the Demon God?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"Simply put, for revenge,\" she replied coldly. \"That bastard experimented on us, turned us into monsters against our will, and plunged our entire world into absolute chaos. But more importantly, he killed my family.\"","\"Revenge, huh?\" A faint smile tugged at Yuan’s lips as he saw the raw hatred and anger still burning in her eyes, reminding him of Tian Chenyu’s past self.","He then turned to look at Supreme Ruler Dena, who was still in her cocoon form.","\"I still have some questions.\"","He then asked the woman, \"Do you know someone named Owen? He’s the 10th Supreme Ruler of the Crimson Continent. ’Supreme Ruler Umbra’ should’ve spoken to him before, and he’s the sole reason we even came here in the first place.\"","The woman shrugged, \"I haven’t used ’Supreme Ruler Umbra’ before, so I cannot tell you. However, the other two might.\"","\"Can you tell us where we can find them?\"","\"They are—\"","The woman abruptly closed her mouth mid-speech and smiled.","\"Rather than just telling you, why don’t I bring you to them?\" she suddenly suggested.","\"Don’t worry, I don’t have any ulterior motives. I just want to chat with you a little longer,\" she quickly added, assuring him.","Yuan had no reason to refuse, especially since it was much more convenient, so he nodded.","\"Okay.\"","\"Do you want to go now?\" she then asked.","\"We can do that,\" he said.","\"By the way, what is your name?\"","\"I thought you’d never ask,\" she smiled and said, \"My name is Selena.\"","\"I’m Yuan.\"","\"Follow me, Yuan.\"","Selena said as she turned to a certain direction and started moving toward it.","Yuan quickly followed her while carrying Supreme Ruler Dena. Supreme Ruler Grant and Lev also chased them shortly later.","\"What is your world like, Yuan?\" Selena started inquiring Yuan about his world as they traveled.","\"I came from the Nine Heavens, but I actually originate from another world.\"","\"A third world?\"","\"Well, they are technically the same world. After a certain incident, the Divine Heaven—what we now call Nine Heavens—was split into ten pieces, and I am from the smallest one.\"","\"Why is it called the Nine Heavens if it was split into ten parts?\" Selena questioned in a puzzled voice.","\"Because one of the worlds was extremely small—akin to an ant compared to the other nine, and it even drifted far, far away. Hell, most people in the Nine Heavens weren’t even aware of my world until recently.\"","\"Tell me about your small world first,\" Selena then said, staring at Yuan like a child during a bedtime story.","Yuan nodded and began to speak of Earth, describing its structure, its societies, the shapes of its buildings, the varieties of food, types of entertainment, and every other detail that came to mind.","Meanwhile, Selena listened with a smile on her face the entire time. After countless years confined to Death Paradise, these glimpses of another world—one where humanity still thrived—were endlessly captivating to her, and even the smallest and most boring details were entertaining.","Once Yuan ran out of things to say about Earth, he moved on to the Nine Heavens. Yet despite their vastness compared to Earth, he felt there was somehow less to say about them.","Still, he spoke of the places he’d visited, the kinds of magical beasts he’d encountered, and even fragments of their history, including the Heavenly War of Immortals and Gods.","Of course, he didn’t shy away from revealing to her their history with demons—how they invaded the Nine Heavens and wrought unspeakable horrors, enslaving humans and treating them as mere livestock.","\"I’ve heard about it,\" Selena said after hearing about it. \"How the Crimson Continent tried to get rid of the Forsakens by throwing them into a gateway, that is. However, I was unaware of the consequences or that they’d stopped doing it long ago.\"","After a moment of silence, Selena remarked, \"Although he wasn’t directly responsible, the Demon God had a hand in it. After all, he created the Forsakens. So, if you want to blame someone, you should blame the Demon God.\"","\"I did, hence why I fought him,\" Yuan calmly revealed.","\"You what?!\" Selena exclaimed, her face almost exactly the same as Yuan when he learned the Transcendants had also fought the Demon God.","\"How the hell are you still alive?\" she then asked, looking absolutely bewildered.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Honestly, he could’ve killed me if he wanted to. However, for some reason, he decided to spare me in the end.\"","\"I understand why he’d spare us, his own creation, but you, a human from another world? Truly baffling,\" she mumbled.","Time continued to pass, and after a decade of nonstop journey, Selena suddenly slowed down and said, \"We’ve arrived.\"","Yuan and the others came to a complete halt at her words, and they immediately tried to sense the Transcendent’s presence. Yet, they were unable to sense anything even after expanding their divine sense to their limits."]},{"number":2445,"title":"Chapter 2445: Angela","paragraphs":["\"Where is the Transcendent? I don’t sense anyone,\" Yuan remarked after spending a full minute trying to find the Transcendent.","However, Selena didn’t respond to him, and when he looked at her, she was looking straight up in the sky.","Yuan followed her gaze, and before he could say anything, a shadowy silhouette descended from the sky, landing directly on Selena.","\"It’s been a while, Selena!\" A female’s voice resounded, but it sounded irritated, as if someone had intruded into her home.","Selena raised an arm to block the incoming figure, who had descended with her leg extended, intending to axe kick her.","\"I never thought you’d visit my territory on your own accord, much less bring so many guests!\"","\"It’s been a while, Angela,\" Selena greeted in a calm voice despite being sneak-attacked.","\"It sure has been a while. How long ago did we last meet? A hundred eighty billion years ago?\"","\"You’ve been keeping track?\"","\"Of course! What else is there to do?\" Angela laughed aloud.","Yuan watched their seemingly friendly conversation with a raised eyebrow, his eyes directly on Angela, who was another tall and slender beauty, albeit slightly shorter and skinnier than Selena.","Her face was also a little smaller than Selena, but it was noticeably sharper, giving her a naturally aggressive face.","However, beside these differences, they were identical, from their black hair color, ghost-like skin, and even abyssal eyes.","\"So... about this weird group...\" Angela remarked as she finally turned her attention to Yuan’s group, starting with Supreme Ruler Dena’s odd appearance and ending with Lev, who was the least interesting to her.","\"What kind of game is this?\" she asked a moment later, assuming Selena was playing one.","\"We’ve already played, and I lost,\" Selena replied with a casual shrug.","\"You lost?\" Angela stared at her in stunned silence for a moment before she burst out laughing.","\"Hahaha! You lost to the Demon God’s dogs? That’s hilarious and embarrassing!\"","Selena ignored her mockery and asked, \"What do you know about a demon named Owen?\"","\"Owen? Why are you interested?\" Angela asked with a profound smile.","\"I am looking for him,\" Yuan said.","\"Huh?\"","Angela suddenly frowned in an unpleasant manner.","\"Who gave you permission to speak to me, you dog?\"","Angela’s demeanor abruptly shifted, and she glared at him with killing intent.","Seeing her sudden and drastic change, Yuan recalled what Selena said earlier—how they were lucky to encounter her because the others would’ve killed them on sight.","\"Hey, Selena, if you’re going to bring your animals into my territory, you should have disciplined them first.\"","\"They’re not my animal, though.\"","\"What?\"","Angela turned to Yuan and the others again, but her gaze had changed. It was sharper now, laced with danger and open disdain.","\"Who gave you lot the permission to enter Death Paradise?\" she questioned.","\"Do you own this entire place?\" Yuan questioned back.","\"What...?\" Angela’s eyes widened at Yuan’s response, as if bewildered by his audacity.","Yuan continued, \"As far as I am aware, this entire world belongs to the Demon God, so why must I ask you permission? Perhaps you’re working directly for the Demon God?\"","\"...\"","Selena also stared at Yuan in disbelief.","\"Hey...\" she began, but Angela suddenly exploded in fury, her aura surging skyward and piercing the heavens.","\"I’ll kill you!\"","Without warning, Angela lunged at Yuan with fury.","Despite the situation, Yuan remained utterly calm and even sneered aloud, \"Your emotional control is pathetic. Are you sure you’re an Transcendent and not a Forsaken?\"","\"DIE!\"","Angela lashed out at Yuan, unleashing a tremendous surge of Demon God’s Ordeal that crashed down on him and sealed him within—a quantity far greater than what Supreme Ruler Dena had endured for her own trial.","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has activated>","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has begun refining Demon God’s Ordeal>","Seeing her master attacked, the Demon Annihilation Sword moved on instinct, hurling herself toward Angela.","Angela only sneered in disdain and swatted at her with a casual strike, clearly underestimating her and treating her as nothing more than an insignificant fly.","\"I am going to devour you!\" The Demon Annihilation Sword declared as she swung her sword, unleashing a tremendous amount of Demon Sealing Aura.","\"What is this power?\"","Angela was taken aback by her Demon Sealing Aura that felt similar to Demon God’s Ordeal yet fundamentally different.","She tried to control it like she does with Demon God’s Ordeal but failed, forcing her to destroy it instead.","\"What an interesting toy...\" Angela muttered, staring at her hand, where a faint sting could be felt. \"It’s been a while, so let’s have some fun!\"","Angela and the Demon Annihilation Sword clashed, their blows making the air shudder and the very fabric of space crack around them.","Meanwhile, Selena and the others focused their attention on Yuan.","\"Although he’s human, he’s from a different world and fundamentally different from us... Will the Demon God’s Ordeal even work on him?\" Selena wondered aloud in a low voice.","Inside the cloud of Demon God’s Ordeal, Yuan nearly lost consciousness from Angela’s attack. Although he could’ve dodged or blocked the attack, he purposefully chose not to, as he saw it as an opportunity to train.","<Demonic Awakening activated>","After consuming a certain amount of Demon God’s Ordeal, Yuan automatically entered his demon form.","\"What?!\" Selena’s eyes widened with shock after seeing Yuan’s transformation for the first time.","\"How is he able to take on that appearance?!\" Selena cried out loud, wondering if the Demon God had caused the Great Cataclysm in other worlds.","However, if that were the case, Yuan would’ve mentioned it when he told her about the history of Nine Heavens.","\"And it’s not just his appearance, either! His presence... even his scent has become the same as a demon! Did he really turn into one?!\"","Angela, who was locked in a fierce battle with the Demon Annihilation Sword, sensed Yuan’s impressive aura and shifted her attention to him.","\"That aura... it’s similar to ours, but he’s clearly not one of us... What the hell is he?\"","Since Angela had paid them only the bare minimum attention, she had no idea that Yuan was human.","After his Demonic Awakening activated, Yuan quickly returned to his senses, and he could feel something had started to change in him. However, he’d already refined all of the Demon God’s Ordeal that Angela forced upon him.","\"More... give me more!\" Yuan turned to Angela and demanded with a wide smile on his face.","\"What?\"","Angela frowned, but before she could even comprehend Yuan’s demands, he lunged at her and attacked.","\"Is that all you can do? With that pathetic amount of Demon God’s Ordeal, I barely felt it.\" Yuan suddenly started provoking her.","\"You bastard!\"","Without thinking, Angela instinctively launched even more Demon God’s Ordeal at Yuan, who gladly accepted all of it.","\"Hahaha! More! I want more!\" Yuan laughed like a madman as he devoured the Demon God’s Ordeal like a black hole.","\"What the hell?!\" Angela’s eyes widened with disbelief, and she continued attacking him with Demon God’s Ordeal.","\"Why isn’t he dying or ascending?! He’d already consumed over a million year’s worth of Demon God’s Ordeal! That amount could easily create a dozen Transcendants!\"","Yuan continued shouting, \"Not enough! Not even close!\"","He suddenly turned to look at Selena and said to her, \"Why don’t you help her out and send some more Demon God’s Ordeal my way?\"","\"This crazy—!\"","Selena forcefully pushed aside her bewilderment and immediately began directing even more Demon God’s Ordeal toward Yuan, a wide smile on her face as she watched, immensely entertained by the whole situation.","\"Angela, I know you can do more than that!\" Selena said to her a moment later.","\"Sure thing—\" Angela subconsciously responded but quickly froze with a dumbfounded expression. \"Wait a damn second! Why the hell am I listening to you?!\"","Despite her words, Angela pushed herself to her limit, sending as much Demon God’s Ordeal as she could toward Yuan.","\"Hahaha!\"","Yuan laughed nonstop, his voice echoing in all directions.","\"This feels amazing! More! Give it all to me!\"","Lev stared at Yuan with a stunned look on his face, wondering aloud, \"Did he really go crazy?\"","\"I’m surprised that he’s still alive,\" Supreme Ruler Grant mumbled.","In just a few minutes, Yuan had endured over ten million years worth of Demon God’s Ordeal.","Yet, he still seemed nowhere close to ascending.","\"What am I even doing? Why does it feel like I am helping him instead of killing him?\" Angela eventually realized something was amiss and questioned aloud.","\"You’re thinking too much,\" Selena replied. \"Don’t you want to kill him? Just keep at it and he’ll die sooner or later... probably.\"","Time slipped by, and after several more minutes, Selena and Angela finally stopped—not because Yuan had died, nor because he had ascended.","\"There’s no more Demon God’s Ordeal!\" Angela shouted when she realized they’d completely exhausted the energy in the area.","\"Wow... I didn’t even know such a thing was possible...\" Selena remarked with a stunned face."]},{"number":2446,"title":"Chapter 2446: Helena","paragraphs":["\"More! I want more! Why are you stopping?!\" Yuan roared out loud when the Demon God’s Ordeal stopped flowing toward him, looking like an addict who just ran out of supply.","\"There’s nothing we can do since all of the Demon God’s Ordeal in this area has already been consumed by you,\" Selena remarked.","\"Huh?\"","Yuan’s Demonic Awakening suddenly deactivated, and his demeanor returned to normal.","He looked around with a somewhat puzzled face, almost as if he wasn’t aware of what had occurred.","Then he inspected his body. Although it felt stronger than before, it wasn’t drastically different, nor was there anything new.","\"You haven’t completed your ascension yet,\" Selena said after seeing his actions.","Yuan raised an eyebrow and asked, \"Will it be fine? I thought one could not stop their ascension midway.\"","\"Hard to say. You may be human, but you came from a different world, so things might be different for you.\"","\"What did you just say? He’s a human from another world?\" Angela’s eyes widened in disbelief after hearing this information from Selena.","\"B-But he’s clearly a demon!\"","Selena shook her head, \"Unfortunately, I cannot explain that phenomenon.\"","\"Hey, will the Demon God’s Ordeal replenish itself?\" Yuan suddenly asked them.","\"Yes,\" Selena replied. \"But it will likely take a tremendous amount of time. It’d be faster if we went to another area, where the Demon God’s Ordeal is still abundant.\"","\"Then what are we waiting for? Let’s head to...\" Yuan halted his sentence when he remembered something.","\"Oh, right.\"","He looked at Angela and continued, \"Do you still want to fight? I would prefer it if we didn’t, but I don’t mind entertaining you for a bit. After all, you did help me cultivate.\"","\"Who... who the hell was trying to help you?! I wanted to kill you for disrespecting me!\" Angela shouted while pointing a finger at him, her arm slightly shaking from anger.","Yuan shrugged. \"You started it by treating us like insects. Even if you despise the Demon God, taking your anger out on others is nothing more than childish.\"","\"What did you just say?\" Angela frowned, her killing intent reemerging.\"","\"My, what’s going on here?\"","Suddenly, a new voice resounded.","Yuan and the others turned their heads to see an unfamiliar figure not far away, watching them with an intrigued smile on her face.","\"Helena!\"","Selena and Angela called out her name simultaneously. It was another Transcendent—the third and final one in the entire Demonic Realm.","\"What are you doing here?\" Selena asked.","\"I could ask you the same thing,\" said Helena. \"I was in the area and noticed the commotion, so I decided to check it out. Never expected to see you here, Selena.\"","Helena bore similar facial features to the other two, but her physique was noticeably bulkier and full of muscles.","Seeing how much they resembled each other, Yuan couldn’t help but wonder if they were sisters, or if it was a characteristic of Transcendents.","\"How long have you been watching?\" Angela inquired.","Helena showed a smile as her gaze shifted to Yuan.","\"Right before Selena joined in on the fun,\" she calmly replied.","\"So, what were the two of you doing? And is he really a human from another world?\"","\"They’re here to look for a demon named Owen,\" Selena said.","\"Owen?\" Helena raised an eyebrow, then turned to Angela. Their eyes met, and for an instant it was as if they were silently acknowledging some shared secret.","\"I guess you both know something about Owen,\" Selena remarked after seeing their reaction. \"So, what have the two of you been doing behind my back?\"","\"Behind your back? That’s something you can only say if you were involved from the beginning,\" Angela sneered aloud.","\"Right? And it’s not like we’re purposefully avoiding you, either. Whenever we meet, it’s because we went to visit you. You’ve never visited us on your own accord... ever.\"","Selena sighed at their words and replied, \"It’s not like I am purposefully avoiding you, either. This is just who I am.\"","\"So, what do you know about Owen?\" Yuan finally spoke, asking them.","\"What? Even if we know Owen, why should we tell you? It’s none of your business,\" Helena sneered.","\"You’re right. It’s none of our business. However, we intend to kill him once we find him, so if his death inconveniences you—\"","\"Wait a second. You’re trying to kill Owen? Why?\" Angela interrupted with a deep frown on her face.","\"Sorry, but it’s none of your business.\" Yuan shook his head, refusing to answer.","\"No, it is our business,\" Helena quickly said. \"We have an agreement with him, and that would fall apart if he dies, so we need him alive. I don’t care why you want to kill him, but it’s not going to happen... at least not until we’re done with him, so forget about it.\"","\"And how long would that take?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Hard to say. However, now that we know you’re trying to kill him, we cannot allow you to leave until we’re done with him, so you’ll have to stay here until then. If you refuse... we’ll kill you.\"","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent.","He could likely handle one Transcendent, but two would be pushing even his limits. And it wasn’t as though he could rely on Lev or Supreme Ruler Grant to deal with the other.","Moreover, Supreme Ruler Dena’s situation was still dubious.","’I doubt Selena would help me fight her own allies...’ Yuan sighed inwardly. ’If anything, she might turn on me instead—no, it’s almost certain she would. After all, she wanted me to stay with her forever if we lost the game.’","After pondering for a moment, Yuan spoke, \"Whatever you need from Owen, I doubt I won’t be able to assist you. Hell, I might even do it better than him, so why don’t you tell me about it?\"","\"You? Help us?\" Angela suddenly chuckled.","\"Unless you can contact the Demon God, there’s nothing you, a foreigner from another world, could help us with!\" Helena shouted.","Yuan raised an eyebrow at their words, thinking to himself, ’So it has something to do with the Demon God, huh? Does this mean that Owen is in contact with the Demon God? No... that’s unlikely... So is he lying?’","Seeing the surprised look on Yuan’s face, Angela continued laughing, \"Look at your dumbfounded face! You’re all talk!\"","A smile tugged at Yuan’s lips as he responded, \"But I didn’t even say anything.\"","He continued, \"Although it might not be easy to contact the Demon God, I can definitely do it.\"","\"What?\"","Not just Helena and Angela, but even Selena expressed surprise at his claims.","\"That’s nothing but empty talk!\"","Yuan remained calm and asked, \"The reason you want to contact the Demon God... are you trying to leave this place?\"","\"?!\"","Helena and Angela’s expression and body visibly stiffened.","\"Why do you look so surprised? Who would want to stay imprisoned for eternity? I certainly wouldn’t,\" he shrugged.","\"I don’t know what Owen said to you, but I doubt he has the power to free you from this place.\"","\"But you do?\" Angela sneered with a suspicious face.","\"I can’t guarantee you that I will be able to free you from this place, but I can try, and you’d definitely have better chances with me than that fraud Owen.\"","\"We’ve known Owen for billions of years, but we’ve only met you today, and you want us to trust you over him? Laughable!\" Helena snickered in disdain.","Yuan then asked them, \"In that case, why don’t you tell me about your business with Owen? What did he promise you? What does he want in return?\"","\"He promised us that he’d help us regain our freedom,\" Angela said. \"As for his methods... he didn’t tell us, saying that it wouldn’t work if he revealed it to us because the Demon God is always watching.\"","Yuan raised his eyebrows and asked, \"And you’re not worried about plotting against the Demon God so openly? That seems... quite contradictory.\"","\"We’re not plotting against the Demon God, though.\" Helena said. \"We just want to regain our freedom. If the Demon God has an issue with it, he will intervene. If not, that means he’s allowing it.\"","\"So, the two of you are plotting to regain your freedom... without me?\" Selena suddenly asked.","When they turned to her, they were met with a calm expression. But looking closer, they could see a flicker of anger slowly surfacing in the depths of her eyes.","\"W-We were planning on telling you!\" Angela hastily said, a hint of nervousness in her voice.","\"Really?\" Selena asked in a low voice.","\"Really!\" Helena nodded. \"We were going to tell you once we were certain about everything because we didn’t want to get your hopes up! There’s no way we would leave you here alone, even if you never visit us.\"","Selena nodded, \"Alright.\"","The rising anger in her eyes vanished the next second.","Seeing this, the other two sighed in relief."]},{"number":2447,"title":"Chapter 2447: Weird Energy","paragraphs":["\"So, what does this Owen want from you in exchange for freedom?\" Selena asked the two a moment later.","\"He asked for some of our blood,\" said Helena. \"Despite his outrageous request, we are willing to overlook it if it means regaining our freedom.\"","\"Did you already give him your blood?\" Selena raised her eyebrows.","\"Of course not. We’re not foolish enough to give him our blood before we are certain that—,\" Angela said.","\"Actually...\" Helena suddenly interrupted, \"I was with Owen just before coming here, and I gave him some of my blood.\"","\"You what?!\" Angela looked at her with wide eyes.","\"I know what you’re thinking, but I didn’t give it to him for nothing,\" Helena said as she raised an arm and continued, \"I don’t know what he did, but I was able to partially leave Death Paradise.\"","\"Is that true?!\" Angela exclaimed, her voice full of excitement.","Helena nodded, \"I was able to extend my arm outside of Death Paradise for a full minute.\"","\"That’s... great!\" Angela said.","Due to the Demon God’s punishment, none of them were able to stick even a single hair outside of Death Paradise, so an entire arm was definitely a significant improvement.","Yuan raised an eyebrow at their words and asked, \"What did Owen do to help you, exactly?\"","\"He gave me some weird energy,\" she said.","\"Weird energy?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"Can I examine this energy?\"","\"What?\" Helena frowned with a look of disgust on her face.","\"Are you crazy? There’s no way I’d let you examine my body. Even if I did, that energy is long gone.\"","\"Hmm...\" Yuan narrowed his eyes.","He suddenly raised an arm with his palm pointing to the sky, unleashing some Eternal Essence.","\"Is this the energy you gained from him?\"","\"T-That’s—!\"","Not just Helena, but Selena and Angela expressed surprise, clearly recognizing Eternal Essence.","\"Why can you wield that power?!\"","The three of them suddenly moved away from Yuan and entered into battle stances, their expressions etched with vigilance and fear.","Although it had been countless years since they fought with the Demon God, they’d never forgotten the power he used to completely defeat them, even killing several of their comrades.","\"Answer me! Why can you wield that power, Demon God’s dog!\" Helena roared, her aura oozing with immense killing intent.","Yuan withdrew his Eternal Essence and spoke, \"Do you think this power is exclusive to the Demon God or something? Sorry to tell you, but he’s not the only one who can wield it. In fact, there are dozens of beings out there with this power.\"","\"What the hell are you trying to say?\" Angela frowned.","\"Are you stupid? I already told you. The Demon God isn’t the only existence in this universe that can wield this power, as it is not exclusive to him.\"","\"Then what is that power? And who else could wield it?\" Selena asked.","\"This power is called Eternal Essence, and it can only be wielded by existences known as ’Eternals’. They are god-like beings that live in the boundless void beyond the sky of this world. Of course, the one you know as Demon God is simply one of many Eternals out there.\"","\"There are... many more Demon Gods out there?\" Selena shivered just at the thought, looking utterly bewildered and in disbelief.","\"Yes, there are many Eternals out there. However, they’re not all like the Demon God.\"","\"That doesn’t make me feel any better...\" Selena shook her head.","\"Why are you worried about them? It’s not like they’re all out to get you.\"","Yuan then said, \"Anyway, is this the energy that Owen gave you?\"","Angela and Selena turned to look at Helena, who nodded her head after snapping out of her daze.","\"Yes... and he claims it’s proof that he has direct access to the Demon God, and can even persuade the Demon God to free us...\" Helena revealed.","Yuan fell silent, wondering how Owen, a mere demon, could wield Eternal Essence.","\"How did Owen infuse Eternal Essence into your body?\" Yuan then asked. \"Did he directly give it to you?\"","Helena shook her head.","\"No. It was transferred to me through some needle,\" she replied.","\"So it was given to you indirectly...\"","’However, this means another Eternal could be involved in this situation. Why the hell is another Eternal interfering with the Demonic Realm? I would understand if this was the Nine Heavens and they were trying to use Owen to acquire the Absolute Power, but there’s no such thing in the Demonic Realm!’ Yuan wondered inwardly, as he couldn’t comprehend why another Eternal would work with Owen to free the Transcendents.","\"What are you thinking about?\" Selena suddenly asked Yuan.","\"Oh, just that Owen isn’t capable of wielding Eternal Essence himself and that he’s being assisted by an Eternal.\"","\"You mean an entity like the Demon God is helping Owen? Why would they do such a thing?\"","\"How would I know?\" he shrugged.","\"Anyway, unlike Owen, whose purpose is still unknown, I, on the other hand, can help you regain your freedom as long as you give Owen to me,\" Yuan said.","Helena and Angela exchanged glances with each other, clearly debating about Yuan’s offer through voice transmission.","A few minutes later, Angela turned to look at Yuan and said, \"Since you can wield that power, does that mean you can help us leave Death Paradise now?\"","\"Well, I can certainly try...\"","Angela nodded.","\"Then, if you can grant us our freedom now, we will not only allow you to kill Owen, we will even capture him for you.\"","A smile appeared on Yuan’s face as he replied, \"Let’s do that.\"","\"Then let’s do it immediately!\"","Without warning, Angela used Void Manipulation on everyone there, teleporting them to the edge of Death Paradise.","\"Alright! Inject me with your Eternal Essence and grant me my freedom!\" Angela said.","\"Before we start, I must warn you that I have never directly injected Eternal Essence into another being and that things might not go as you expect.\"","\"Spare me that nonsense and just do it. What’s the worst that can happen?\" Angela hastily said, clearly impatient to regain her freedom.","\"If you say so.\"","Without hesitation, Yuan grabbed her wrist and injected some Eternal Essence into her body.","The very next instant, Angela started to scream in pain, her face twisting with agony.","\"IT HURTS!\" she roared out loud as she yanked her arm from Yuan’s grasp.","\"AHHH!\"","Angela’s arm suddenly expanded like a balloon, and mere seconds later, exploded.","\"Angela?!\"","Selena and Helena cried out loud.","\"Bastard! What have you done to her?!\" Helena rushed at Yuan and grabbed him by the neck, barely holding herself back from crushing it.","\"I did exactly as I said I would—inject Eternal Essence into her body,\" Yuan responded. \"I warned her this might happen, too.\"","\"Bullshit!\" Helena roared. \"How come I didn’t experience anything like this when Owen injected Eternal Essence into my body?!\"","\"I don’t know. It’s likely that the Eternal Essence you accepted had been altered, and what I gave her was Eternal Essence in its purest form, something that can only be endured by Eternals.\"","\"Can you let go of my neck now? If I really wanted to harm her, I wouldn’t have held back on the amount of Eternal Essence I gave her because I feared something like this might happen.\"","\"L-Let him go...\" Angela suddenly spoke in a low voice.","Helena released Yuan and turned to look at her, who had just fully regenerated her arm.","\"He’s telling the truth. I only felt a drop of that energy enter my body, and I was about to complain about it but was interrupted,\" she sighed.","Angela looked at Yuan with her back soaked in sweat and continued, \"That power is definitely the same power used by the Demon God when we fought him. Since you can use it... are you also an Eternal?\"","Yuan shook his head, \"No, my situation is unique.\"","He looked at Helena and said, \"If you want me to help you, I will need to examine your body, even if it’s likely that the energy Owen gave you is no longer there.\"","Helena gritted her teeth and nodded, \"Alright...\"","She extended her arm toward Yuan, who immediately grabbed it and examined her body.","It took some time, but Yuan sensed a tiny trace of Eternal Essence within Helena’s body, and just as he’d expected, it wasn’t pure Eternal Essence.","\"I found it, and I am going to extract that energy right now,\" Yuan warned her before extracting it.","A moment later, Yuan successfully extracted the energy and consumed it himself.","He closed his eyes and became as still as a statue.","The others watched in silence, not daring to interrupt him.","They expected him to finish in a few minutes, but hours passed without any movement from Yuan.","Hours turned into days, and days turned into weeks.","Finally, after half a year, Yuan opened his eyes."]},{"number":2448,"title":"Chapter 2448: Owen","paragraphs":["\"So? Did you learn anything?\" Helena asked the moment Yuan emerged from his cultivation.","Yuan looked at her and slowly shook his head, \"Unfortunately, there was too little for me to extract any meaningful information.\"","\"What the hell? You spent half a year learning nothing?\" Helena frowned.","\"Well, this power is extremely complex. There’s a reason why only Eternals are capable of wielding it, I have only really just begun to study it.\" Yuan shrugged, defending himself.","Moreover, this was his first time encountering Eternal Essence that wasn’t in its purest form. When he fought other Eternals, they would only wield pure Eternal Essence.","’This either means there’s an Eternal involved who’s on an entirely different level from the rest... or that I’ve never truly witnessed an Eternal fighting at their full capacity...’","Since most of his fights with Eternals happened near the Nine Heavens, it was natural they wouldn’t be able to exert their full power.","’Now that I think about it, when I fought Deemo, the Demon God, it was also near the Nine Heavens because he approached me.’","When he really thought about it, Yuan realized that he’d never fought an Eternal that wasn’t near the Absolute Power’s influence.","This made him wonder what sort of hidden powers the Eternals might have.","\"What now?\" Selena asked him.","Yuan looked at Helena and said, \"I can question Owen and ask to speak with the Eternal behind him, but that would require his presence, and I doubt you would let me meet him without any guarantees. How tricky.\"","Selena then said, \"Angela, Helena, I think you can trust him.\"","\"Seriously, Selena? You’re willing to trust a suspicious alien like him?\" Angela muttered with a dumbfounded face.","\"Although the time we’ve spent together wasn’t long, it is enough for me to trust him.\"","Angela looked at Helena, silently asking her what they should do.","Helena fell silent for a long moment before responding, \"I am willing to let you meet with Owen if you swear not to attack him.\"","\"Deal.\" Yuan instantly accepted","\"Don’t even try to attack him, because the moment I sense even the slightest killing intent from you, I will kill you.\"","\"Relax, if I say that I won’t attack him, I won’t.\"","Helena nodded.","\"Then I will contact him right now.\"","She withdrew a communication jade slip—similar in function to those in the Nine Heavens, but forged from different material and bearing a different shape.","\"Owen, come meet me,\" she spoke to him.","A few moments later, she received a respond.","\"I know we just had a meeting, but Angela wants to speak with you. Also, don’t you dare question me again. If I tell you to meet, we meet,\" Helena responded to Owen’s response, sounding irritated.","\"...\"","After several minutes of silence, Helena spoke into the communication jade slip again, \"Owen! How dare you make me wait! I don’t care if you’re busy, I am your priority!\"","Yuan’s jaw dropped at Helena’s aggression, and he couldn’t help but wonder if this was how she usually treated others.","Owen’s reply came a few seconds later. As Helena listened, her entire body went rigid and her face went blank, dazed, as though she couldn’t believe what she’d just heard.","Suddenly, unfathomable killing intent exploded from her, shocking Yuan and the others.","\"HOW DARE YOU! I SWEAR I WILL MAKE YOU WISH YOU WERE DEAD THE MOMENT I GET OUT OF THIS PLACE!\" she roared into the communication jade slip, shattering it the next moment with a clenched fist.","\"Helena?!\" Selena cried out loud.","\"What did Owen say to anger you that much?!\" Angela hastily asked, as only Helena was able to hear Owen’s response.","Helena turned to them and explained, \"That bastard Owen has betrayed us!\"","\"What?!\" Angela’s eyes widened with disbelief.","\"When I asked him to meet, he refused, saying that we’re no longer needed! That bastard even dared to tell us to rot in here for an eternity!\" Helena’s killing intent surged again just recalling Owen’s unexpected betrayal.","\"...\"","Angela stared in stunned silence, as though she couldn’t believe her ears. Then, just like Helena, she erupted in fury and killing intent.","\"That bastard Owen betrayed us the moment he obtained our blood!\" she snarled, clenching her teeth so hard they shattered, blood spilling from her mouth.","Yuan watched the scene unfold, his brows lifting in surprise. Owen’s betrayal itself didn’t shock him, as he’d anticipated it’d happened sooner or later. What caught him off guard was how quickly it had come.","’So Owen’s purpose was not to free the Transcendents but to acquire their blood? What is he—or the Eternal going to do with their blood?’","\"Alien!\" Helena suddenly called out to Yuan.","When he shifted his focus to her, she was already standing directly in front of him with a vengeful look on her face.","\"Let me guess...\" Yuan spoke before she got the chance, and said, \"You want me to help you find Owen and kill him because he betrayed you?\"","\"Kill him? No! That would be too generous and forgiving! I want you to capture him and bring him to us, so we can torture him for an eternity!\"","When Yuan met Helena’s abyssal gaze, her eyes seemed to swirl like black holes in the void, devouring everything around them.","Although Yuan was tempted to throw out a few snarky remarks just to toy with them, he decided against it, as provoking them in their current fury would be far too dangerous.","\"Well, I was already going to find him, regardless. But how am I going to find him in this vast world without your help?\"","\"Don’t worry. While we may be trapped here, we’re not useless. Owen may not know this, but we Transcendents can track even every single drop of our blood, regardless of their distance. Even if you scattered a hundred drops of our blood throughout this world, we would be able to pinpoint them with perfect accuracy.\"","\"What a convenient ability. So, where is Owen right now? I’ll chase after him.\"","\"You don’t need to do that because I can teleport you to him,\" Helena said with a cold smile on her face.","\"That bastard Owen definitely won’t be expecting this!\"","Yuan turned to look at Lev and Supreme Ruler Grant and said, \"I’ll go alone. The two of you stay here and watch over Dena for me.\"","\"Yes!\" Lev immediately responded.","\"Umm... can I go home already?\" Supreme Ruler Grant sighed in an exhausted voice despite not doing much if anything during their entire journey.","\"Well, someone has to entertain them while I am gone, and I doubt Lev, who has spent most of his life inside the Deprived Crimson Valley, has many stories to tell.\" Yuan shrugged.","Without waiting for a response, Yuan turned to Helena and said, \"Take me to Owen, and I will bring him back for you. However, if you touch my people, you can kiss your revenge goodbye.\"","Helena silently nodded and used Void Manipulation on him.","Meanwhile, somewhere on a random island in the Bone Atoll, Owen tossed his communication jade slip into the sea, as it had cracked after the other end was destroyed.","\"Although they may be powerful, they’re useless as long as they cannot leave Death Paradise,\" he laughed out loud.","\"I bet that woman is going crazy with anger right now. Enduring all of their nonsense for so long was definitely worth it. If there’s one I regret, it’s that I won’t be able to witness their reaction.\"","\"Now, I can finally—\"","Owen’s entire body suddenly went rigid as an ominous feeling twisted in his gut.","He subconsciously turned around to see a handsome man hovering above him like a ghost who appeared out of thin air.","\"Who the hell are you?!\" Owen cried out loud as his heart skipped a beat.","\"It’s been a while, Owen.\" Yuan said with a smile.","\"You know me?\" Owen frowned, trying to recall if they had ever met.","Though it didn’t strike him at first, he soon realized Yuan’s features looked strangely familiar.","\"You don’t remember me? Then do you remember Dena?\"","Owen’s eyebrows raised at the sudden mention of Supreme Ruler Dena.","He spent a good chunk of his life by Supreme Ruler Dena’s side as the Supreme Adviser, so there was no way he’d forget about her.","\"Wait a second!\" Owen’s eyes started to widen, almost as if he realized something.","\"Y-You! You can’t be!\"","\"Oh? Have you finally recalled?\"","Yuan descended onto the island, standing only a few meters away from him.","\"You’re that Demon Sealer from the other world! Tian Chenyu! But that’s impossible!\" Owen exclaimed in disbelief, subconsciously walking backwards.","He continued, \"The gateway to your world was sealed, and you definitely returned to your world at that time! How did you come back?!\"","\"Does it really matter how I returned?\"","Owen fell silent. Then, with narrowed eyes, asked, \"No, it doesn’t. However, why are you here? Is it a coincidence? Or are you looking for me?\"","The chances of Tian Chenyu returning to their world and coincidentally running into him were slim to none, so Owen quickly assumed he had come for him on purpose. Yet he couldn’t fathom why someone like Tian Chenyu would seek him out, as they’d barely interacted in the past.","\"You really don’t know? Take a moment to think about it,\" Yuan calmly said.","Owen pondered for a moment before a look of realization flashed across his face.","\"Are you here because of Supreme Ruler Dena? If you’re looking for her, she’s at the Deprived Crimson Valley,\" Owen said, completely unaware that she’d left that place long ago."]},{"number":2449,"title":"Chapter 2449: Owen(2)","paragraphs":["Yuan raised an eyebrow after hearing Owen’s words.","’He’s not aware that Dena left the Deprived Crimson Valley long ago? I guess he hasn’t returned to the Crimson Continent in a long time.’","’Since he doesn’t know anything... let’s try to extract as much information from him as possible.’","\"Dena is in the Deprived Crimson Valley? Isn’t that place meant for Forsakens? Why would she be there?\" Yuan asked with a puzzled face, acting ignorant of the whole situation and pretending like he’d just returned.","\"You really don’t know?\" Owen questioned with a suspicious look.","\"Well, I just came back, and I am kind of lost, as I am still unfamiliar with this world. Fortunately, I ran into you by coincidence... or is this fate?\"","’What a pain in the ass...’ Owen cursed inwardly.","Although he never had much interaction with Tian Chenyu, since he was always by Supreme Ruler Dena’s side, Owen had no choice but to spend several thousand years around Tian Chenyu, so he was familiar with Tian Chenyu’s character and how difficult he was in the past.","\"So, what happened to Dena for her to be exiled to the Deprived Crimson Valley?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"There’s only one... or two reasons why anyone would be sent to that place. Either they’ve turned into Forsaken or committed a grave crime. In her case, she was sent there for both reasons.\"","\"Dena turned into a Forsaken? That’s hard to believe.\" Yuan said with a frown. \"And what kind of crime did she commit?\"","\"The worst kind of crime a Supreme Ruler could commit—the betrayal and murder of her own people. She killed everyone in the City of Blood after becoming a Forsaken.\"","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent for a moment before speaking again, \"How long ago was this? If Dena killed everyone, why are you still alive? And what are you doing in the middle of nowhere?\"","\"This happened billions of years ago. I only survived because I was out on a mission when it happened...\"","After a brief pause, Owen continued, \"As for what I am doing here... that is none of your business.\"","\"None of my business?\" Yuan repeated as a cold feeling started oozing from his presence.","\"Bold words for someone who was nearly beaten to death by me in the past,\" he said, referring to their first encounter.","Before Supreme Ruler Dena arrived to stop him during his massacre, it was Owen who had tried to stop him first.","Of course, Owen had been beaten to the brink of death by Tian Chenyu, forcing Supreme Ruler Dena to intervene.","Owen laughed out loud, \"Don’t think you can scare me anymore, Tian Chenyu! I am no longer afraid of you! After Supreme Ruler Dena was exiled, I took her place and became the next Supreme Ruler! Not only that, but I have the backing of powerful beings that you cannot even begin to comprehend!\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow and remarked, \"Backing from a powerful being? Even though you are a Supreme Ruler? How does that make any sense at all? I thought Supreme Rulers are already the strongest beings in the Demonic Realm.\"","\"Hahaha! This world... no, this universe is much larger than you can imagine! Being a Supreme Ruler may seem impressive at first, but they are nowhere near the peak! Just like you, I was a frog in a well until I was chosen!\"","\"Chosen? By whom? The Demon God?\"","\"Oh?\"","Owen wore a look of surprise on his face.","\"How surprising. I didn’t think you’d actually guess it on your first try.\"","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent, baffled by the turn of events. He was fairly certain the Demon God had no involvement with Owen, so it was likely that another Eternal was impersonating the Demon God to manipulate Owen into doing their bidding.","’To think Owen would betray the Transcendents only to be fooled by an Eternal...’","However, as borderline impossible as it was, Yuan couldn’t ignore the sliver of chance that the Demon God might actually be involved.","\"Why would the Demon God choose you? And to do what, exactly?\" Yuan then inquired.","\"Once again, that is none of your business.\"","\"You’re right. It is none of my business what you do with the Demon God, but I am intrigued, as I have spoken with—and even met the Demon God before.\"","\"What?!\" Owen’s eyes widened with disbelief at Yuan’s words.","\"Lies! Why would the Demon God speak with you, much less meet you in person?! Do you have any evidence of your claims?!\"","\"You make it sound like the Demon God is only allowed to speak to you,\" Yuan shook his head. \"As for evidence... I could ask you the same question.\"","Without hesitation, Owen retrieved an object from his Spatial Ring and displayed it with a proud grin.","\"This! This proves that I am chosen by the Demon God!\" Owen declared.","Yuan’s eyes widened at the sight of this object, but it was not because he recognized the item. Rather, it was the familiar energy it was emitting.","The item in Owen’s grasp appeared to be an ordinary metal coin the size of his palm, but it was exuding what was clearly Eternal Essence.","’That is clearly a treasure, but this is my first time seeing a treasure with Eternal Essence...’ Yuan thought to himself.","Then, he recalled something Shiva had once told him—that most treasures within the Nine Heavens were forged by Eternals, and that all of them were incomplete. A finished treasure simply could not exist there, as the Absolute Power would not allow it.","Upon remembering this information, Yuan realized that the treasure in Owen’s grasp was very likely one of these complete treasures—a treasure that surpassed Celestial-grade treasures.","\"Do you sense the godly energy within this treasure?\" Owen suddenly spoke. \"This is a power that can only be wielded by God! This is what the Demon God bestowed me!\"","After a brief pause, he continued in a grim voice, \"With that said, I was instructed to never reveal this treasure to anyone. Since you’ve already seen it... I have no choice but to kill you now.\""]},{"number":2450,"title":"Chapter 2450: Fighting Owen","paragraphs":["\"Really? Even though I never asked you to show me that treasure and you showed it on your own accord? How unreasonable.\" Yuan said with a slight frown.","\"You asked for evidence, didn’t you?\"","\"I guess so, but you could’ve decided not to show me. Yet, you did. Do you really want to kill me so badly? Besides our initial encounter, I don’t believe I have done anything to offend you.\"","Owen tightly clenched his fists and trembled, his eyes burning with fury as he glared at Yuan.","\"Did nothing to offend me...?\" Owen muttered in a suppressed voice.","After a brief pause, he exploded in fury.","\"Because of you, the reputation I’ve built over billions of years was dragged through the mud! I became a complete laughingstock! Even if no one dared say it to my face... I know they were all laughing behind my back!\"","\"Their mocking gazes... their looks of disdain...\" he growled, his voice trembling with rage. \"They’ve haunted me ever since!\"","\"Is that why you killed everyone in the City of Blood and pinned the blame on Dena?\" Yuan suddenly said, catching Owen off guard.","\"You...\"","Owen stared at him in disbelief, then his expression twisted further as realization dawned. Yuan had been playing with him this entire time.","\"That’s right...\" Owen muttered.","\"That’s right! I was the one who killed everyone in the City of Blood! It’s their punishment for mocking me!\" He burst out laughing like a manic.","\"I doubt you simply killed them. From what I heard, everyone in the city vanished, as if they never existed in the first place. What did you do to them?\" Yuan inquired.","\"Since you’re about to die anyway, I might as well tell you,\" he said coldly. \"Besides... I’ve wanted to get this off my chest for a long time.\"","Owen retrieved a crimson scroll from his Spatial Ring and held it up for Yuan to see.","\"This is the Supreme Immolation Array—an ancient formation capable of converting life itself into power on a massive scale,\" he revealed. \"Every sacrifice made within it becomes fuel for my own strength!\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes and asked, \"What about Supreme Ruler Exosso?\"","\"Oh? You also know about that?\" Owen said in a surprised tone. \"You’ve been busy.\"","He continued with a cold smirk, \"The same goes for Exosso and his men. I converted all of them into my strength.\"","\"A formation that can sacrifice a Supreme Ruler without him being aware until it was too late? That’s quite scary,\" Yuan remarked.","Owen shook his head.","\"To be frank with you, if it weren’t for this treasure, it would have been impossible to kill Exosso since he would have noticed it before the formation could be activated.\"","\"And why did you kill them? Did they also mock you?\"","\"No, I just wanted to acquire their power.\"","\"...\"","Yuan released a deep sigh before saying, \"Did you also acquire that scroll from the Demon God?\"","\"No, I found this scroll by pure chance.\"","\"Then how and when did the Demon God contact you?\"","\"...\"","\"I think that’s enough questions from you,\" Owen said as he put away the ancient scroll and the treasure.","\"You’re not going to use that treasure to fight me?\" Yuan asked with raised eyebrows.","\"Hahaha!\" Owen started laughing again.","\"You’re overestimating yourself too much, Tian Chenyu! I won’t need the treasure to deal with a mere ant like you!\"","Since Yuan’s cultivation was only at the first level of False God, Owen regarded him as nothing more than a joke, hence why he dared to reveal so much, as he was utterly convinced he could kill Yuan without the slightest difficulty.","\"With that said, I won’t be killing you so quickly. Instead, I will slowly torture you—the cause of my humiliation—to death.\"","\"Good luck.\" Yuan calmly nodded.","\"Supreme Blood Art.\"","Owen made a grasping motion toward Yuan, and a crimson sphere of blood instantly formed around him, sealing him within.","Inside the sphere, hundreds of spears materialized and pierced through Yuan’s body, but none of them would hit his vital organs.","\"I guess he really doesn’t want to kill me quickly...\" Yuan mumbled with a smile on his face.","A surge of Demon Sealing Aura erupted from Yuan’s body, blowing away the crimson sphere.","\"Demon Sealing Aura... it’s been so long since I last saw that vile power,\" said Owen, a look of disgust twisting his face.","He raised an arm and pointed his palm at Yuan. The next moment, thousands of bone shards shot out of his palm like bullets.","Yuan activated the Demon Sealing Array, forming a wall in front of himself.","However, the bone shards effortlessly shattered the wall and poked many holes into Yuan’s body.","\"It seems your regeneration has gotten much better than before,\" Owen remarked after seeing how quickly Yuan regenerated from the damage.","An excited smile tugged at his lips as he continued, \"This is great, as it means I won’t have to worry about accidentally killing you too quickly.\"","\"Hmm...\"","Yuan closed his eyes for a moment, as if pondering something.","\"I guess it should be fine as long as I don’t kill you...\" he mumbled.","\"What?\"","Owen raised an eyebrow, but before he could say anything else, Yuan activated Demonic Awakening, entering his demon form.","\"What the hell?! That appearance!\" Owen cried out loud, his eyes popping out of their sockets from shock.","\"This is a new trick I learned recently. Pretty neat, huh?\" Yuan smiled, his aura skyrocketing into the heavens.","’What an immense aura! And to think his cultivation is only at the first level of False God! That’s ridiculous!’ Owen cried inwardly.","\"Is this all you’ve got?\" Yuan suddenly asked. \"It’s not that impressive, considering how many lives you sacrificed.\"","\"Shut the hell up, you rat! Because I didn’t want to accidentally kill you too quickly, I have restricted myself to only ten percent of my full strength so far!\"","After saying that, Owen’s aura surged violently."]},{"number":2451,"title":"Chapter 2451: Fighting Owen(2)","paragraphs":["After being provoked by Yuan, Owen’s aura surged, unleashing at least thirty percent of his strength as an Absolute God.","A light smile tugged at Yuan’s lips when Owen continued to underestimate him, which wasn’t surprising, as he’d purposefully allowed himself to be overwhelmed just now.","Without exchanging any more words, Yuan and Owen clashed shortly later.","Owen used both Blood Manipulation and Bone Techniques, a power he’d acquired after absorbing many Bone Demons through the Supreme Immolation Array.","Not wanting to alarm Owen too early, Yuan deliberately restrained himself—matching Owen’s strength just closely enough to appear slightly inferior.","’What the hell is happening?! How is a mere first level False God rivaling me, an Absolute God who has been empowered through the Supreme Immolation Array?!’ Owen cried inwardly, feeling shocked even though his face didn’t show it.","Even though he was still holding back the majority of his strength, it still didn’t make sense.","A False God was so insignificant that even a True God could easily kill one without any effort, much less an Absolute God like Owen, who could kill True Gods with five percent of his true strength.","Yet, Yuan, who was a mere first level False God, was barely keeping up with him.","’No...!’ Owen’s pupils shrank as the realization struck him. ’I’ve been steadily increasing my strength, yet he’s still barely keeping up—as if he’s growing stronger alongside me!’","’This bastard... he’s still mocking me!’","Suddenly, Owen drastically increased his output to seventy percent of his true power.","Owen’s sudden surge in power quickly overwhelmed Yuan, and it became obvious that he could no longer keep up.","\"Hahaha! What’s wrong, you damn bastard?!\" Owen jeered. \"Having trouble matching me?! Matching strength is a privilege reserved for the stronger one—you insignificant ant!\"","\"I guess this is the limit of my Demonic Awakening... alone.\" Yuan mumbled after seeing his limit.","After absorbing so much Demon God’s Ordeal, Yuan’s demon form had strengthened significantly even if it didn’t fully ascend—to the point where even he couldn’t tell how strong he’d become with it alone until just now.","Sure enough, Yuan had been relying on nothing but his Demonic Awakening this entire time, and he was able to match Owen using around fifty percent of his strength as an Absolute God.","In other words, Yuan, as a first level False God in his Demonic Awakening and with the Demon Annihilation Sword out, was as strong as an Absolute God demon using half of their strength.","Even though the Demon Annihilation Sword was far away, as long as it was out in the world, Yuan would still receive its effects.","It should also be noted that Owen in his current state was much stronger than Supreme Ruler Grant without his fake Eternal Essence. However, when compared to Supreme Ruler Dena, he was still slightly behind.","The next moment, Yuan activated Absolute Dragon Awakening and True Phoenix Awakening, causing his aura to skyrocket even higher.","\"What?!\" Owen’s eyes widened in shock after seeing how much stronger Yuan’s presence got out of thin air even though his cultivation remained the same.","However, Yuan wasn’t done and also used Chaotic Essence to further strengthen himself.","\"Let’s fight for real this time, shall we?\" he said with a calm smile on his face.","They continued their fight the next moment.","Meanwhile, in Death Paradise, Helena and Angela were getting impatient.","\"Damn it! What the hell is taking him so long?! Don’t tell me that he ditched us, too?!\" Helena cried out loud.","\"Let’s not jump to conclusions so quickly,\" Selena said while shaking her head. \"He’d just left, and I doubt he’d abandon his friends.\"","\"T-That’s right! He wouldn’t abandon us—at least not Supreme Ruler Dena!\" Lev said in a nervous voice. \"After all, I personally watched him risk his life just to meet her.\"","\"Oh? Tell me more about it,\" Selena said, sounding interested in it.","\"Well, I didn’t follow him all the way since it was too dangerous for me, but what happened was...\" Lev explained the kind of place the Deprived Crimson Valley was before talking about Supreme Ruler Dena’s condition, what she’d done there, and how Yuan went to meet her despite the danger.","\"Are they lovers?\" Selena asked with an excited smile on her face.","\"Uh... I don’t think so, but I also cannot say for sure, so you’ll have to ask him when he returns.\"","Time passed quickly, in the blink of an eye, several days had gone by since Yuan was sent to capture Owen.","\"How?! How the hell is a False God like you fighting an Absolute God like me?!\" Owen roared out loud, sounding irritated and confused at the same time.","He was certain Yuan’s cultivation was only at the first level of False God, and that he wasn’t suppressing it, but that only made things more perplexing.","Yuan wasn’t exactly overwhelming in battle, yet their strengths seemed evenly matched, as neither could kill the other, leaving them locked in a stalemate.","Suddenly, in the middle of their battle, Yuan’s aura suddenly started to change.","\"This bastard! He’s having a breakthrough in the middle of our fight?!\" Owen cried out loud when he realized that Yuan’s cultivation was slowly soaring to the next level.","After consuming the True Emperor of the Seas’ and the Primal Sovereign of the Seas’ Blood Essence, Yuan had actually accumulated enough energy to enter the next realm. However, he purposefully suppressed it and kept his cultivation at the first level of God Ascension, as he hadn’t encountered a threat that required him to really push his cultivation further.","<You have entered the Second Level of God Ascension!>","Suddenly, Yuan felt a strange sensation, as if he were recovering forgotten memories, except what returned wasn’t memory at all, but his strength.","<Your Soul Strength has drastically increased!>","After entering the Second Level of God Ascension, some of the Soul Strength that Yuan gained during his ascension but lost after exiting it returned to him.","One might expect it to be a little, but in a split second, Yuan’s Soul Strength increased by leaps and bounds, becoming at least a dozen times stronger in an instant."]},{"number":2452,"title":"Chapter 2452: Fighting Owen(3)","paragraphs":["<Demon Sealing Zone>","After his breakthrough, Yuan immediately activated Demon Sealing Zone, forming a barrier around himself and Owen.","\"This trick again?! How many times do I have to destroy it before you learn that it won’t contain me?!\" Owen sneered as he struck the barrier, expecting it to shatter as easily as before.","But when his Bone Technique slammed into the Demon Sealing Zone, it didn’t collapse in a single blow. Instead, it only produced a thin crack—one that mended itself in the blink of an eye.","\"What?!\"","Owen’s eyes widened with surprise. He couldn’t fathom how the difference of a single level could be this vast, and he was beginning to doubt whether Yuan was actually going all out before.","However, even though Yuan’s Soul Strength witnessed a tremendous growth from his breakthrough, it was the only thing that really had a drastic difference, as everything else was lackluster in comparison.","’I guess Dena was right—that I will slowly regain the Soul Strength I gained during the phenomenon as my cultivation increases,’ Yuan thought to himself.","And since his Demon Sealing Aura was tied to his Soul Strength, his Demon Sealing Techniques had become powerful enough to truly affect Absolute Gods, where before, they were barely effective.","However, even though his Demon Sealing Techniques were finally effective, he was still nowhere near strong enough to overpower Owen without using Eternal Essence.","Owen, realizing this, no longer wanted to slowly torture Yuan to death and decided to try and finish Yuan as quickly as possible.","Now that he had no further interest in keeping Yuan alive, Owen abandoned all restraint and unleashed his full cultivation as he clashed with him.","\"Demon Annihilation Sword,\" Yuan muttered.","In the next instant, the Demon Annihilation Sword, who was with Lev and the others, abruptly vanished into thin air, before reappearing at Yuan’s side.","\"Who the hell are you and where did you come from?!\" Owen halted his movement to analyze the newcomer.","\"You’re not a living being but a treasure...?\" Owen could hardly believe his eyes after realizing her true form, as he’d never seen a treasure take the form of a human before.","\"Master, can I devour him?\" The Demon Annihilation Sword asked as she pointed at Owen.","\"Not entirely, but you can take some small bites out of him,\" Yuan said. \"Just make sure you don’t kill him.\"","The Demon Annihilation Sword nodded, but before she went to confront Owen, she extended her arm toward Yuan and handed something to him.","\"This is...?\"","Yuan looked at the object she handed him with raised eyebrows.","It was a small, round object resembling a marble. Moreover, it was something he knew very well, as he had consumed many of them before.","\"Where did you get this Demon Core?\" Yuan asked her. \"And who does it belong to?\"","The object she handed him was a Demon Core, and it contained an immense amount of energy—far more than any Demon Core he’d consumed before. Of course, this included the Demon Emperors’ Demon Cores.","\"This belongs to the one I just finished consuming,\" she said.","\"The one you just consumed? That would mean it belongs to... Supreme Ruler Exosso...?\" Yuan stared at her with wide eyes.","As far as he was aware, Supreme Ruler Exosso didn’t leave behind a Demon Core after his death, so how did she acquire it?","Unfortunately, Yuan didn’t have the time to ponder about it, and the Demon Annihilation Sword went to confront Owen before he could ask any more questions.","Although Yuan had planned on fighting Owen with the Demon Annihilation Sword, he decided to let her handle him for the beginning.","\"Take care of him for a bit,\" Yuan said to her.","\"Yes, Master!\"","The next moment, Yuan lifted the fingers clutching Supreme Ruler Exosso’s Demon Core to his lips and swallowed it without the slightest hesitation.","<You have consumed Supreme Ruler Exosso’s Demon Core!>","<You have learned Bone Manipulation!>","Yuan immediately felt his bones reforming, growing denser and tougher.","However, that wasn’t all, as his cultivation also started to climb again, swiftly approaching the third level of God Ascension.","Even though he had just entered the second level of God Ascension, the sheer amount of spiritual energy he’d obtained from the Blood Essences was enough to push his cultivation close to the third level right after his breakthrough.","Soon, he’d acquired enough spiritual energy to enter the third level.","Yuan considered keeping his cultivation at the second level, but if he wanted to capture Owen, he’d need to seal him, and in order to do that, he must strengthen his Demon Sealing Aura—his Soul Strength.","Thus, he decided to have the breakthrough now.","After taking a deep breath, Yuan immediately made his attempt, and thanks to his past experience, he succeeded on the first try with ease.","Within moments after consuming the Demon Core, Yuan stepped into the third level of God Ascension, mere minutes after entering the second level.","<You have entered the Third Level of God Ascension!>","Once again, Yuan felt the same sensation from his previous breakthrough.","<Your Soul Strength has drastically increased!>","Immediately after his breakthrough, Yuan wasted no time joining the Demon Annihilation Sword’s battle with Owen.","<Demon Annihilation Array!>","Yuan unleashed the Demon Sealing Zone’s true potential.","\"Not this bullshit again!\"","Owen unleashed his strongest attack against the barrier, but to his shock, he couldn’t even produce a single crack this time.","However, Yuan wasn’t done.","<Sword of Eternal Torment!>","Millions of glowing swords materialized in the sky, covering it like a blanket.","\"Have some of my Demon Sealing Aura,\" Yuan said aloud as he started transferring his Demon Sealing Aura to the Demon Annihilation Sword, fueling it with even more power.","\"This is insane... How can a single being possess so much power...?\" Owen muttered in a daze, as the fear he once held for Tian Chenyu—buried deep within his soul—began to resurface.","But he quickly snapped out of his daze and retrieved a small, round object from his spatial ring."]},{"number":2453,"title":"Chapter 2453: The Eternal Behind Owen","paragraphs":["\"Oh?\" A smile tugged at Yuan’s lips when he saw what Owen pulled out of his spatial ring.","\"I thought you didn’t need to rely on that thing to deal with me,\" he said with a mocking smile.","\"Shut the hell up, you damn monster!\" Owen roared as he controlled the treasure, causing it to hover before him.","\"I wouldn’t use that treasure if I were you,\" Yuan said while shaking his head.","\"And why the hell not?! If you think you can fool me—\"","\"Because I will have to fight you seriously, and I don’t want to accidentally kill you.\"","Owen stared at him with wide eyes and in stunned silence.","\"Hahaha!\" He burst out laughing a moment later.","\"Even if you are somehow hiding more power, you will never match—\"","Owen abruptly halted his speech and even nearly choked on his own laughter when an unfathomable aura suddenly exploded from Yuan’s body.","\"Y-You!\"","His gaze shifted between Yuan and his treasure nonstop.","\"That power! Impossible!\"","While Owen was in a daze, Yuan controlled the millions of glowing swords in the sky, combining them into a single, behemoth sword.","<Divine Judgment!>","The sword descended toward Owen with immense speed, but the target himself was too shocked to even realize it.","By the time he realized, it was already too late.","The massive sword plunged into Owen from the top of his head and continued to fall until it pieced through the entire island.","However, while it appeared as if his body had been cleanly cleaved in two, the blade did not actually sever him and only left him pinned in place instead.","An immense amount of Demon Sealing Aura rushed into Owen’s body, and despite his desperate attempt to fight back, he was sealed almost instantly.","When Owen was sealed and turned into a stone statue, his control of the treasure was disrupted, and it fell to the ground with a soft thud.","Yuan picked up the treasure and muttered, \"As much as I want to see the power of this thing, I have a promise to keep.\"","After putting away the treasure, Yuan grabbed Owen’s petrified body and jumped into the crimson sea together.","<Water Tunnel!>","Yuan used Water Tunnel for the first time, traversing through the Bloody Expanse and returning to Selena and the others in the blink of an eye.","\"Here’s Owen, as promised,\" Yuan said as he emerged from the crimson sea, rising from its depths in a manner similar to the Primal Sovereign of the Seas.","\"He’s not dead... right?\" Helena looked at Owen’s petrified body with a deep frown.","\"No, he’s just sealed. I can unseal him right now if you want.\"","\"Do it.\" Helena said with a cold smile on her face, even cracking her knuckles in excitement.","\"I’m unsealing him now.\"","Yuan unsealed Owen the next moment.","\"You bastard! I will—\"","Owen immediately began hurling curses loudly, but the moment he saw Helena and Angela hovering before him, his entire body stiffened.","\"H-How? How the hell are you outside Death Paradise?!\" Owen screamed in disbelief, still thinking that he was in Bone Atoll.","Although the sky was dark, a prime characteristic of Death Paradise, Owen’s mind was too occupied with Helena and Angela’s presence to notice it.","’I need to run!’ Owen subconsciously began to run, but his attempt was halted before it could even begin.","\"Don’t even think about leaving, you little traitor.\"","Helena suddenly grabbed him by his neck before his body could even move.","\"W-Wait! I can explain!\" Owen hastily said.","\"I’ll listen to you... once I exhaust some of this anger!\"","However, before Helena could start her torture session, Yuan said to her, \"Before you kill him, let me ask him some questions.\"","Then he said to Owen, \"If you answer my questions, I will ask them to spare you.\"","\"I-I will answer them! All of them!\" Owen quickly replied.","\"What was your master’s goal? Why did you want the Transcendents’ blood?\"","\"I don’t know! The Demon God didn’t tell me anything besides to acquire their blood!\"","\"What?! You are working with the Demon God?!\" Selena and the others were immediately alarmed by his words.","However, Yuan quickly explained, \"He just thinks that he’s working with the Demon God. I highly doubt the Demon God is really behind him. If the Demon God really needed your blood, he wouldn’t resort to such schemes.\"","\"Where is my blood, anyway?\" Helena glared at him.","\"I-It’s in my spatial ring...\"","\"What were you going to do after acquiring it?\" Yuan asked after snatching his spatial ring.","\"I need to deliver it to my master in the Boundless Expanse...\" he said.","\"And how are you going to do that?\" Angela asked.","\"I was going to contact my master to update him, but before I could do that, he appeared before me.\" Owen said, pointing at Yuan with his eyes.","\"How do you contact him? Through this?\" Yuan showed Owen his own treasure.","He silently nodded.","\"Is that so? Well, that’s all I need to know.\"","Yuan turned around, as if ready to leave.","\"Wait! What about your promise?!\"","\"Oh, right. I almost forgot.\" Yuan turned to face Helena and asked, \"Can you spare him?\"","\"No.\" Helena instantly refused.","Yuan looked at Owen and shrugged in a nonchalant manner, \"I tried.\"","\"B-Bullshit! You didn’t even put in the slightest effort!\" Owen roared loudly.","\"Why should I? I only said I’d ask them, and that’s exactly what I did. Whether they are willing to spare you or not is not up to me.\"","\"I’ll excuse myself now. If you need anything from me, you can let Selena or Angela know. As for the blood I gave him... you can keep it,\" Helena said to Yuan, preparing to drag Owen away.","\"N-No! Spare me!! Please!!!\" Owen started begging for mercy.","\"You can ask Selena because I will also join Helena,\" Angela then said.","Without another word, the two of them vanished into the void, dragging Owen away with them.","\"What are you going to do now?\" Selena suddenly appeared beside Yuan and asked him.","Yuan looked at Supreme Ruler Dena, who was still in her cocoon, and then looked at Owen’s treasure in his grasp.","\"I am going to see who’s behind this whole thing,\" he said.","\"You’re going to contact the one supporting Owen?\" Selena’s eyes widened at his words, even swallowing nervously.","After all, he was going to contact someone who might be on equal terms with the Demon God.","Some time later, Yuan began examining the treasure in detail.","[???]","[?????]","[??????????]","Unsurprisingly, the system had no information on the treasure.","However, just from his own examination, Yuan could tell that it was mostly a communication treasure with some offensive function.","Eventually, Yuan activated the treasure and tried to contact the Eternal behind everything.","Soon, a voice entered Yuan’s head.","\"What do you want?\"","\"?!?!\"","Yuan’s eyes widened with shock and disbelief after hearing this voice because he actually recognized it.","\"Why are you staying silent?\" The voice returned moments later when Yuan didn’t respond, sounding annoyed.","\"Hahaha!\" Yuan suddenly burst out laughing.","\"Have you gone insane?\"","\"I knew we’d meet again one day, but I never expected it would be in this manner, Zaaran!\" Yuan said.","The Eternal behind Owen was none other than Zaaran, who had turned Kulas into a giant and started the first major war in the Nine Heavens.","\"How the hell do you know my name?!\" Zaaran exclaimed in shock.","\"Wait! You are not Owen! Who the hell are you?!\"","\"I know it’s been a while since we last spoke, but have you really forgotten my voice already?\" Yuan said.","\"We’ve met before...?\" Zaaran muttered before falling into a pondering silence.","Eventually, he spoke again, \"You! I remember! You are the bastard who killed Kulas! Tian Yang!\"","\"Took you long enough, you son of a bitch!\" Yuan laughed out loud.","\"I should be the one laughing! I thought you had perished long ago, but it seems like I am fated to end you with my own hands!\" Zaaran also burst out laughing.","\"What happened to Owen, you little bastard?\" Zaaran asked a moment later.","\"I will tell you, but under one condition,\" Yuan said.","\"You are in no position to make any demands!\" Zaaran roared.","\"Even though I have what you want? The blood of a Transcendent?\"","\"How the hell do you know that?\"","\"What do you think?\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Zaaran asked, \"What do you want?\"","\"I want to fight you!\" Yuan passionately announced. \"Come meet me at the Demonic Realm and fight me!\"","\"...\"","Zaaran fell silent again, seemingly stunned speechless by Yuan’s request.","But before Zaaran could respond, Yuan continued, \"Why are you so quiet? Don’t tell me you’re afraid of me, an insignificant human? Worried that I might defeat you again, you pathetic little worm?\"","\"I ACCEPT YOUR CHALLENGE, YOU ARROGANT LITTLE BASTARD! SEVEN DAYS! I WILL BE THERE TO END YOUR INSIGNIFICANT LIFE IN SEVEN DAYS!\""]},{"number":2454,"title":"Chapter 2454: Sheltered by the Absolute Power","paragraphs":["\"I’m so scared,\" Yuan replied in a sarcastic tone after hearing Zaaran’s words.","\"Just you wait! I will kill—no! I will turn you into my puppet and have you serve me for the rest of your life, just as Kulas had done!\"","\"You talk too much, Zaaran. Hurry up and get your ass here so I can finally punch that ugly face of yours!\" Yuan laughed madly.","Zaaran offered no response. In the next instant, Owen’s treasure detonated, releasing a violent surge of Eternal Essence that blasted outward like a bomb.","Zaaran probably thought it would harm Yuan a little, but he could’ve never anticipated that his actions would actually benefit Yuan, who absorbed all of the Eternal Essence and turned it into his own strength.","Though it wasn’t much, Yuan needed as much Eternal Essence as he could before fighting Zaaran.","Even though he was the one who picked the fight, Yuan realized that he might have rushed things a little too much out of passion and anger.","Not only does he not know Zaaran’s prowess, but he wasn’t sure he could defeat an Eternal in his current state, especially when the Absolute Power wasn’t there to suppress the Eternal’s powers.","However, even if he wasn’t confident he could defeat Zaaran, and there was a chance things might turn out badly for him, Yuan had no intention of backing away from a fight he started, especially when his opponent was Zaaran, one of the first Eternals to offend him.","\"You... what have you done?\" Selena asked, staring at Yuan with a dumbfounded expression.","Though she hadn’t heard their conversation, the look on Yuan’s face—and the fact that the treasure had exploded right in his face—was more than enough to tell her things had gone very, very wrong.","\"Oh, it’s nothing serious. I just picked a fight with the bastard, and he agreed, so we’ll be fighting in seven days from now.\"","\"What?!\" Selena exclaimed in shock. \"Why would you do that? This being is potentially as powerful as the Demon God, no?\"","\"Who knows? I will find out when I fight him.\" Yuan casually shrugged.","\"But why?\" Selena asked again.","\"Because I already know this Eternal, and I have a grudge with it.\"","\"What about us?\" Lev suddenly asked.","Yuan turned to look at them and said, \"This is a battle you won’t be able to participate in, so just stay here and wait for my return.\"","\"Supreme Ruler Grant... you can return to the Crimson Continent if you want, as your presence is no longer necessary—even though you haven’t been of any use at all.\"","\"Really?!\" Supreme Ruler Grant’s face immediately brightened with delight and relief.","\"Just make sure you remember never to invade my world because I won’t spare you for a second time.\"","Supreme Ruler Grant vigorously nodded his head.","\"I swear upon the Demon God’s name that I won’t even think about invading your world! Then, I will leave now!\"","Without hesitation or waiting for another moment, he turned around and started flying away at maximum speed, as if he were worried that Yuan might suddenly change his mind.","In the blink of an eye, Supreme Ruler Grant vanished from their sights.","\"That’s not the direction to the Crimson Continent, though.\" Selena eventually remarked.","\"I’m sure he’ll figure it out.\" Yuan said.","\"Anyway... I have something I must do before Zaaran gets here...\"","Yuan slowly lifted his head, his gaze rising toward the heavens, but his focus wasn’t the sky itself. Instead, he seemed to be looking at something beyond it.","\"Deemo! I know you’re watching this! How long do you intend to stay quiet?!\" Yuan roared out loud.","\"Deemo?\" Selena raised an eyebrow at this unfamiliar name, unaware that it was the Demon God’s true name.","In the very next moment, an unfathomable presence descended—one that did not merely engulf Death Paradise, but spread across the entirety of the Demonic Realm.","\"This presence...?!\" Selena’s entire body stiffened as she instantly recognized it, her expression turning deathly pale as fear overtook her features.","Lev trembled as well, but his fear was instinctive—an involuntary reaction to the overwhelming presence. In contrast, Selena’s terror was born from experience, making it far more profound.","Selena turned to look at Yuan, who remained as calm as before. In fact, he was probably the only person in the world who could remain calm at this moment.","Before she could utter a single word, a silhouette materialized a few meters in front of Yuan like a phantom.","It bore the shape of a human, yet its entire form was pitch black—like a figure carved from the void itself. Its head was smooth and round, devoid of hair, and its face... was completely featureless.","\"What do you want from me now?\" Deemo spoke first.","\"Are you seriously asking me that? As if you don’t already know the situation,\" Yuan replied.","\"...\" Deemo fell silent for a moment before speaking again, \"Once again, you are putting my world in danger—\"","\"Now hold it right there.\"","Yuan suddenly interrupted.","\"Let’s not act like I started this, okay? An Eternal was scheming in your world long before I even entered the stage.\"","\"Hell, do you even know what’s happening? Don’t tell me you are actually oblivious to something that is occurring in your own world?\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes at Deemo, his brows lifting slightly. He had always assumed that Deemo was aware of everything happening within his own world—but perhaps that wasn’t entirely true.","\"This may be my world, but I do not pay attention to it every second. There are things even I am unaware of,\" Deemo finally responded.","His words left not only Yuan stunned. Even Selena stood there in shock at the revelation.","\"Why are you so surprised? It’s not like this world is the only thing that requires my attention. In fact, it’s the least of my concerns right now.\"","Deemo shook his head.","\"Anyway, fill me in. I know that another Eternal is involved, but I do not know the details.\"","However, Yuan didn’t immediately respond, as he didn’t want to give up such information for free.","\"...\"","Seeing Yuan remain silent, Deemo sighed.","\"If you tell me, I will consider the favor you owe from repaid,\" he said a moment later.","Yuan nodded and explained the situation to him, revealing that Zaaran had been scheming in his world.","\"That’s the gist of it. Do you know why Zaaran would want to acquire their blood?\"","Yuan wasn’t expecting anything, but to his surprise, Deemo actually nodded his head and said, \"I have an idea.\"","\"Why?\"","\"Why do you care? It’s not something you need to worry about, anyway.\"","\"Because if Zaaran wants something, I want to take it away from him.\"","Although Deemo did not have any facial features, if he did, his eyebrows would lift at Yuan’s words.","\"Are you going to do anything about Zaaran scheming in your world?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"I want to, but I also want to watch you fight him, so I will wait until you are done,\" he said.","\"By saying that, you think I will lose to Zaaran?\" Yuan frowned slightly.","\"Don’t tell me you actually think you can beat Zaaran?\"","\"To be frank, I have no idea how strong Zaaran even is.\" Yuan shook his head.","\"What do you think? How strong is that bastard? Don’t tell me that he’s even stronger than you.\"","\"Hahaha!\" Deemo burst out laughing. \"Stronger than me? He’s nowhere near as strong as me!\"","\"What about Saaruk? Is he stronger than Saaruk?\"","\"I haven’t fought Saaruk, but I think they’re close.\"","\"So he’s pretty powerful...\" Yuan mumbled.","\"Anyway, I will be fighting him in seven days.\"","\"Seven days? There’s no way he’ll arrive at this place in such a short time with his real body, so he’ll probably come here as an avatar.\"","\"Is that so?\"","Yuan felt a little relieved upon learning this, as it meant that Zaaran likely won’t be fighting at his full strength.","\"Have you fought an Eternal before? Besides me, that is.\" Deemo suddenly asked.","\"I have, but I have never fought one that didn’t have their strength restricted by the Absolute Power.\"","\"Then you’ll be in for a surprise,\" Deemo chuckled.","\"But I fought with you?\"","Deemo shook his head.","\"While that may have been a life-or-death battle for you, it doesn’t even qualify as a fight—a spar for me. If anything, it was no different from playing with a child. I said this before, but if I really wanted to kill you, I could’ve done so with a single breath. You’re underestimating Eternals a little too much, mortal.\"","\"However, I can’t blame you, given you’ve spent most of your life sheltered by the Absolute Power.\"","\"Spent most of my life sheltered by the Absolute Power...?\" Yuan repeated in a low voice.","As much as he wanted to rebuke such a claim, Yuan knew that it was the truth, so he had no choice but to silently accept it."]},{"number":2455,"title":"Chapter 2455: Deemo’s Assistance","paragraphs":["\"Whether I can defeat Zaaran or not... we will find out in seven days,\" Yuan said after a moment of silence.","\"Seven days? You will have at least seven years to prepare since time flows differently on this side of the universe, and as far as I am aware, Zaaran’s territory is on the other side,\" Deemo suddenly said.","\"Really? That’s great news.\"","Yuan immediately turned to look at Selena and said, \"Can you bring me to the other territory, where there is more Demon God’s Ordeal?\"","However, Selena remained silent, her gaze fixated on Deemo, almost as if she was afraid to speak in his presence.","\"If you want that energy, I can make some for you,\" Deemo suddenly said.","But instead of thanking him, Yuan glared at him with a suspicious gaze.","\"Why would you do that for me? I don’t want to owe you another favor,\" Yuan swiftly said.","Deemo shook his head and explained, \"Relax, I won’t ask you for anything in return since I am doing this for my own curiosity.\"","He then wondered inwardly, ’A human that is fundamentally different from the ones in this world... what would happen if he ascended? Will he achieve what I have tried to create in the past?’","Although Yuan only became more suspicious of Deemo’s ulterior motives, there was really no reason for him to refuse since he already planned on absorbing more Demon God’s Ordeal.","\"If you’re really doing it for free, then I have no reason to refuse,\" Yuan nodded his head a moment later, accepting Deemo’s assistance.","\"Whenever you are ready.\"","Yuan took a deep breath before declaring in a resolute voice, \"Ready.\"","In the next instant, Deemo raised his arm and pointed at Yuan, creating Demon God’s Ordeal out of thin air and enveloping him within it.","Yuan automatically entered his demon form and started absorbing the energy like a black hole.","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has begun refining Demon God’s Ordeal!>","<Your Demonic Awakening has strengthened!>","’Watching it up close is definitely more entertaining,’ Deemo thought to himself as he analyzed every change occurring within Yuan.","Selena watched in silence for several months before suddenly speaking aloud, \"Demon God... I should have probably asked you this question before, but why did you turn everyone into monsters?\"","The Demon God did not even react to her, much less respond, almost as if she was nonexistent in his eyes.","\"Demon God! I need to know why! I deserve to know the truth!\" Selena continued trying to seek answers. \"I’m even willing to give you my life after learning the truth!\"","At last, the Demon God replied, still keeping his gaze fixed on Yuan.","\"What use would I have for your life? You’re one of the very few who have transcended humanity. You ought to value your life far more than that.\"","However, upon hearing those words, Selena instantly flew into a rage.","\"HOW DARE YOU EVEN UTTER SUCH WORDS! DON’T ACT LIKE YOU KNOW ABOUT THE VALUE OF OUR LIVES WHEN YOU’VE KILLED SO MANY OF US!\" she roared, her voice blazing with fury.","At that moment, Selena was so consumed by rage that she could barely restrain herself from attacking Deemo.","Deemo spoke again, his voice as calm as a still pond, \"I am merely speaking about the lives of you as a Transcendent. Those who failed to ascend are worthless and deserve to perish.\"","\"Bullshit! If that were true, why did you kill more than half of us?! I know we attacked you first, but still—!\" Selena clenched her fists so hard her bones shattered, blood gushing from her hands.","Deemo finally turned to look at her with his featureless face and said, \"Who said I killed them?\"","\"What...?\" Selena’s eyes widened with disbelief, doubting her own ears.","\"You’re telling me that they’re still alive? Even though I—and the others watched you vaporize them?\"","However, Deemo did not respond and returned to focusing on Yuan, who was absorbing his Demon God’s Ordeal with an increasingly faster pace.","’How is his body able to absorb so much energy? Are the humans from his world truly that different from the people in this world? Or is the energy simply not as effective on them?’","Ever since Yuan—Tian Chenyu—appeared in the Demonic Realm and fought him, Deemo’s interest in the humans of the Nine Heavens had grown.","No, it would be more accurate to say that Tian Chenyu was the very reason Deemo began paying attention to the humans of the Nine Heavens at all. However, because of the Absolute Power, and the vast distance between them, Deemo had yet to actually act on that interest. Otherwise, he would have long since begun experimenting on them.","Suddenly, a thought flashed in Deemo’s head.","’Even after my experiment succeeded and I have created beings that transcended humanity, I was not satisfied by the outcome and continued to create more energy in the pursuit of creating a perfect being...’","The Demon God’s Ordeal that Deemo was supplying Yuan suddenly changed, becoming something entirely different. Not only was it more powerful than the original energy, but it was several times more chaotic.","\"AAAAH!\" Yuan began screaming in agony almost immediately, his voice sending chills down even Selena’s spine.","\"Master...\" Lev swallowed nervously.","\"Hahaha!\" Deemo burst out laughing like a maniac. \"Let’s keep at this until either you succeed or die!\"","\"Deemo... you... bastard!\"","Even as he was experiencing unimaginable pain, Yuan still somehow managed to curse at Deemo.","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has activated>","<Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has begun refining ???>","Time continued to pass, and five years had gone by since Yuan began his ascension. Although that span passed in the blink of an eye for Deemo, it felt like an eternity for Yuan, as the pain did not diminish even after all those years.","After another year, Yuan’s screams abruptly ceased, as if he had died. Seeing this, Deemo halted the flow of energy and examined Yuan with narrowed eyes.","\"This bastard... he’s survived it!\" he exclaimed with excitement as Yuan’s aura started to change."]},{"number":2456,"title":"Chapter 2456: Zaaran’s Arrival","paragraphs":["Although Yuan’s entire presence had vanished—just like his screams—his aura returned moments later. It was faint at first, but it was clearly evolving, transforming into something otherworldly.","\"He’s... ascending?\" Selena muttered in a dazed voice after realizing this.","Unlike Supreme Ruler Dena, who had wrapped herself in a cocoon, a thin veil of semi-transparent golden aura now covered Yuan’s entire body like a shimmering blanket.","\"Show me... what kind of being you’ll become after this. Will you ascend... or will you perish at the final step?\" Deemo muttered, staring at Yuan with unrestrained excitement, his body trembling nonstop like that of an eager child.","Deemo wanted to witness Yuan’s ascension from beginning to end, but unfortunately, he had no choice but to divert his attention.","Mere days after Yuan began his ascension, Deemo sensed a familiar presence approaching his world. It was none other than Zaaran, who had finally arrived to fight Yuan.","\"Haaa...\" Deemo let out an irritated sigh before his faceless figure vanished into thin air.","After leaving the Demonic Realm and Yuan’s side, Deemo confronted Zaaran, blocking his advances.","\"D-Deemo!\" Zaaran instantly halted before him.","\"Uh... this is...\" Zaaran, who had spent his entire journey to the Demonic Realm consumed by rage and fantaising how he would torture Yuan, froze in confusion, as he forgot to think of an excuse to give Deemo for his sudden appearance. Although nearly seven years had passed in the Demonic Realm, only seven days had gone by for him.","\"I am here to...\"","\"Save your breath, Zaaran. I know what you’re doing here,\" Deemo interrupted him with a cold sneer.","\"You do?!\" Zaaran exclaimed in shock.","He thought he had managed to escape Deemo’s surveillance while he schemed within the Demonic Realm, after all.","\"I knew you were ambitious, but to scheme in my own territory... Do you have a death wish?\" Deemo’s voice was solemn, heavy with the urge to strangle Zaaran’s neck.","\"I... have no idea what you’re talking about!\" Zaaran chose to play dumb.","\"Oh? You don’t? So you’re saying you didn’t try to fool one of my own people into stealing blood from my creations by pretending to be me?\"","\"That’s absurd! What proof do you have?! Even as a Prime Eternal, you can’t just hurl baseless accusations! Are you trying to start a war?!\" Zaaran shouted.","\"The one you traveled all this way to fight told me himself, so there’s no point in playing dumb, Zaaran,\" Deemo said with a shake of his head.","\"What?! Don’t tell me you’re working together?!\"","\"Working together? To achieve what? If I wanted to kill you for taking a shit in my territory, I could easily achieve that by myself!\" Deemo declared, his voice booming with arrogance.","\"Then why are you blocking me? It was that bastard who challenged me to a fight first.\"","\"He’s not ready to fight you right now—or more specifically, he’s not in the condition to.\"","\"What are you talking about?\"","\"I’m saying that I will not interfere in your fight with him. However, you must wait until he is ready. That is your punishment for scheming in my world and trying to steal my hard work,\" Deemo elaborated.","\"...\"","Zaaran fell silent. He wasn’t exactly afraid of Deemo, but he was definitely nervous in his presence. And since he’d already offended Deemo, it would be wise not to anger him further.","Although there was a chance that Yuan might not survive his ascension and fight Zaaran, Deemo did not reveal such information to him.","\"How long will this take?\" Zaaran eventually asked.","\"Who knows?\" Deemo shrugged.","\"You...!\" Zaaran wanted to complain but decided against it.","After several weeks of silence, Zaaran couldn’t endure his curiosity any longer and asked, \"Why are you helping that bastard, anyway? What is your relationship with him?\"","\"You’re misunderstanding the situation. I am not helping him,\" Deemo said.","\"What?\"","\"He is currently undergoing an experiment of mine, so I cannot allow you to disturb him,\" Deemo admitted.","\"He willingly agreed to be your experiment...?\"","\"Something like that.\"","\"...\"","Zaaran didn’t respond, but he definitely doubted Deemo’s claim.","\"How are your experiments progressing?\" Deemo suddenly asked, changing the subject. \"Will you have anything worthwhile to show at the upcoming event, or are you going to squander the opportunity like last time?\"","\"That’s—\"","\"Oh, you don’t actually have to answer me. After all, if your experiments were going smoothly, you wouldn’t resort to trying to steal my work.\" Deemo interrupted Zaaran before he could even say anything.","\"You...\" Zaaran trembled in anger, but he unfortunately did not have any comebacks.","After a brief silence, Zaaran forced himself to calm down before asking in a tense, curious tone, \"Don’t tell me... you’re planning to use him as your subject in the event?\"","\"Hm?\" Deemo let out a surprised noise, as if he just realized something. \"That’s actually not a bad idea. If it’s him, he’ll definitely make things entertaining. He has all the qualifications to participate, too.\"","Zaaran’s jaw dropped at Deemo’s words, and he even felt like kicking himself for having given him the idea.","However, Deemo shook his head a moment later and said, \"Unfortunately, since he came from ’that’ place and technically not mine, I won’t be able to use him.\"","\"...\"","’No, he’s definitely usable...’ Zaaran thought to himself. ’After all, how would the others know his origin if I don’t mention it? And if I make him my slave, he’ll become my property!’","\"I wouldn’t do that if I were you,\" Deemo suddenly commented, almost as if he could read Zaaran’s thoughts.","\"Why would you say—\"","In the middle of Zaaran’s question, Deemo suddenly shifted his attention back to Yuan.","\"He’s almost done!\"","Without another word, Deemo left Zaaran and returned to Yuan’s side to witness his ascension up close.","Zaaran stayed in the starry sky, not daring to enter Deemo’s territory without permission. But since he could see everything from his location, it made no difference.","Meanwhile, Yuan slowly opened his eyes.","<Your Demonic Awakening has successfully evolved!>"]},{"number":2457,"title":"Chapter 2457: Path to Eternity","paragraphs":["When Deemo altered the energy flowing into Yuan, his consciousness flickered, and he blacked out for a brief moment before slipping into a half-conscious state, akin to being caught between sleep and wakefulness.","Although Yuan screamed in agony, he wasn’t even aware of it, and his cries were nothing more than a raw, instinctive response to the overwhelming pain.","’Where am I...?’ Yuan wondered to himself as it felt like his soul was aimlessly drifting in space, similar to when he was in the phenomenon during his ascension to the God Ascension realm.","However, unlike back then, he couldn’t control where he was going.","’Damn... what the hell did that bastard do to me? Did I die?\" Yuan started to wonder if he had died and his soul was traversing through the river of reincarnation, where those who died with their souls intact must go to begin their cycle of reincarnation.","Unfortunately, even if he really died, there was nothing he could do but wait for his reincarnation.","After drifting for what felt like millions of years, Yuan suddenly sensed a presence in the distant void. Though it had only just entered his awareness, its power was unfathomable—growing ever more overwhelming the closer he drifted toward it.","However, the moment he reached a certain distance, Yuan was abruptly halted, as if he had run headfirst into an invisible wall.","There was an invisible barrier before him, one that was similar to the ones he had to break through during his ascension. Yet, it felt fundamentally different and not something he could forcefully bypass.","<You have discovered the Path to Eternity>","A familiar sound suddenly resounded inside Yuan’s head.","’Path to Eternity...? As in the path of becoming an Eternal?’ Yuan wondered to himself.","After receiving the notification, Yuan’s consciousness began to sharpen, and he could suddenly sense the presence beyond the barrier with far greater clarity.","’This presence! It’s the same as the one beyond the 1,000th layer during my ascension to the God Ascension Realm!’ Yuan quickly recognized this presence.","Suddenly, Yuan felt his consciousness being dragged back to his body.","<Your Demonic Awakening has evolved, becoming Transcended Demon Awakening>","<You have begun walking the Path to Eternity>","<Progress: 10%>","Yuan opened his eyes, a vicious, ruthless light flickering within them, giving him an aura of infinite malice.","He glanced down at himself, and the first thing he noticed was that the crystal that was embedded in his chest had vanished. Yet he could still feel its energy coursing through him, as though its power had been released and merged entirely into his body.","His skin grew paler, resembling Selena and the others. His hair returned to black, but it became so dark it seemed to devour any light that touched it. As for his eyes, he had to use his divine sense to see them, and they had turned almost entirely black, with golden pupils.","’I look even more demonic than before... No, I look exactly like Selena and the others. Does this mean I have turned into a Transcedent? I don’t feel much different, though,’ he thought to himself, not feeling any different than before.","Then he lifted his head to look at Deemo, who was hovering a few meters away from him. Despite Deemo’s featureless face, Yuan could somehow tell that he was smiling at this moment.","\"Looks like you have succeeded in your ascension,\" Deemo remarked.","\"However...\" Deemo continued after a brief moment of silence, \"Something feels different. You look like a Transcendent, but you do not have any of their powers. In fact, besides your appearance, I cannot tell if anything has changed.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes at Deemo and said, \"Maybe it has something to do with you changing the energy. What the hell was that, anyway?\"","\"It’s fundamentally similar to the original energy but would theoretically create something even stronger—more perfect than Transcendents.\"","\"I thought Transcendents are already perfect beings!\" Selena suddenly said.","\"While you are above humans, I would not call you perfect beings. In fact, you are quite far from it.\"","\"Then what the hell are we?!\"","\"A being beyond humanity, yet not a god—an existence that exists between the two,\" Deemo said calmly. \"You are also a successful experiment, but not necessarily an ideal one.\"","\"That doesn’t make any sense!\" Selena shouted angrily.","\"I’m not surprised. This is beyond your understading, after all.\" Deemo shook his head before turning to look at Yuan again.","\"Anyway, we can figure this out later... once you survive your fight against Zaaran—if you can.\"","Yuan’s body trembled after being reminded of his fight with Zaaran.","\"Is he here?\"","Deemo nodded.","\"I will take you to him now.\"","Without any warning, Deemo teleported Yuan into the starry sky to where Zaaran was waiting.","\"Tian Yang!\" Zaaran unleashed a deafening roar after seeing Yuan and snapping out of his daze.","\"Zaaran... I was expecting you to come here with your real body, not your avatar. I hope it’s not because you are underestimating me,\" Yuan narrowed his eyes at Zaaran, who took the form of an avatar.","\"Don’t give yourself too much credit, you bastard. It would take too long and too much effort for me to come here in my real body, so I came here in my avatar. Although I won’t be able to use my full strength in this form, it will be more than enough to deal with an insignificant ant like you!\" Zaaran explained.","Yuan silently analyzed Zaaran to the best of his abilities. From what he could tell, Zaaran’s avatar was definitely stronger than Saaruk when he fought him. However, he couldn’t tell by how much.","Meanwhile, Zaaran was also examining Yuan. Although it did not show on his face, Zaaran was shook to the core by what he saw.","’This bastard! It hasn’t even been that long since we last fought, and he’s grown this much?!’","It had been at least several hundred million years since Tian Yang fought Zaaran, who had taken full control of Kulas’ body. While that span was enough for many eras to rise and fall and for the cultivation world to advance tremendously, it was little more than a fleeting moment to an Eternal, who had existed for billions—if not trillions—of years.","When Tian Yang fought Zaaran back then, he’d just entered the recently discovered God Ascension Realm, and while Yuan was at a similar cultivation right now, his actual prowess was countless times stronger, so much so that he could easily kill a thousand Tian Yangs in the blink of an eye.","Not only that, but Yuan’s aura was entirely different.","’It’s not the same, but he has a scent that is similar to us Eternals! How is that possible?!’ Zaaran cried inwardly as he continued to discover new things about Yuan through his examination.","’Don’t tell me he’s acquired an Eternal’s body—or is in the process of completing one?!’","\"So... when are you two going to fight?\" Deemo suddenly spoke aloud, interrupting their thoughts.","\"What’s the rush?\" Zaaran coldly sneered. \"It won’t take even a minute for me to kill him.\"","Yuan pretended to clean his ear with his pinky as he responded to Zaaran’s provocation, \"You talk too arrogantly for someone who’d already lost to me once.\"","\"That doesn’t count!\" Zaaran shouted. \"I was not only in someone’s body, but I couldn’t even use a single percent of my prowess back then!\"","Yuan shrugged, \"A loss is a lost, regardless of the circumstances. Once you lose to me again in this fight, you won’t be able to make any more excuses.\"","\"And once you lose, I will turn you into my slave and force you to fight for me for the rest of your pathetic life!\" Zaaran bellowed as his aura surged with an overwhelming amount of Eternal Essence.","\"We’ll see about that!\" Yuan laughed as he made the first move, striking at Zaaran with Eternal Essence and nearly eighty percent of his full strength from the very start. He knew he couldn’t afford to hold back against an Eternal, especially not without Absolute Power’s protection.","\"This is—!\" Zaaran’s eyes widened in shock and disbelief.","He’d known Yuan could wield Eternal Essence from the very beginning, but he hadn’t imagined he was capable of commanding so much of it. In fact, he’d initially planned to meet Yuan’s strike head-on, yet abandoned the idea at the very last second and dodged instead.","It wasn’t just Zaaran who was stunned by Yuan’s Eternal Essence either, as even Deemo visibly flinched when Yuan revealed it.","’He’s wielding about a trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence, but his soul is nowhere near that old!’ Deemo cried inwardly.","Unlike humans, who measured cultivation in levels and realms, Eternals measured their strength in terms of time—how long they’d cultivated Eternal Essence. In most cases, the older an Eternal was, the stronger they were, simply because they’d had more time to cultivate. Moreover, unlike humans, most Eternals were born equal in talent and thus advanced at roughly the same pace."]},{"number":2458,"title":"Chapter 2458: Fighting Zaaran","paragraphs":["\"Bastard, how did you acquire so much Eternal Essence as a mere mortal?!\" Zaaran questioned Yuan after hastily avoiding his attack.","Although the attack wasn’t powerful enough to destroy his avatar, it would have undoubtedly damaged it had he attempted to block it.","\"Does it really matter how I acquired it?\" Yuan calmly responded.","\"A trillion years worth of Eternal Essence isn’t a massive amount, but it’s not insignificant, either! There’s no way a human can acquire so much without the help of another Eternal! Who is the one helping a bastard like you?!\" Zaaran shouted.","\"Your mom,\" Yuan replied with a serious look on his face.","\"My... what?\"","Yuan’s unexpected answer left Zaaran stunned speechless.","Since Eternals were born from the void, the very concept of \"parents\" didn’t apply to them, so Yuan’s remark would have gone over the heads of most of their kind.","However, Zaaran—familiar with humans and their customs—recognized the insult almost immediately. His body trembled with fury, and his aura erupted like a volcano.","\"You little bastard! How dare you insult me as if I am a mortal!\"","An immense amount of Eternal Essence that surpassed Yuan’s trillion year’s worth gushed from Zaaran’s avatar.","\"About a trillion and a hundred billion years, huh?\" Deemo muttered to himself.","Once an Eternal’s accumulation of Eternal Essence surpassed a certain threshold—typically around a trillion years—differences of a few thousand, or even a few million years, became negligible.","Although Eternal Essence was immensely powerful, allowing Yuan to overwhelm higher-level opponents with even a small amount, it was only possible against mortals and beasts, and the same did not hold true when facing Eternals.","After unleashing his Eternal Essence, Zaaran made his move, releasing a devastating wave of energy that surged toward Yuan like a tidal wave... one that was massive enough to easily consume an entire world or two.","Yuan confronted Zaaran’s attack with an attack of similar fashion, releasing more Eternal Essence than before since he hadn’t gone all out yet.","\"He was still hiding more Eternal Essence?!\" Zaaran exclaimed in shock when Yuan’s attack completely cancelled out his own.","Of course, Zaaran wasn’t worried that he might lose since he was also holding back plenty of Eternal Essence, as he did not want to kill Yuan by accident.","Meanwhile, Deemo felt a shiver in his real body when he watched a human who wasn’t even a True God clash against an Eternal without losing.","’This is it! This is what a perfect being should be capable of!’ He trembled with excitement after seeing what he envisioned to be the perfect being existing befoe his very eyes.","To Deemo, a perfect being was someone that surpassed common sense—someone who could achieve the impossible.","Although the Transcendents he created were immensely powerful in their own right, none of them could wield Eternal Essence and fight Eternals like Yuan, who was still very far from being a True God.","\"There’s still so much room for improvements!\" Deemo suddenly shouted loudly.","’What would happen once he reaches True God? What about Absolute God? What if someone who could wield Eternal Essence without being an Eternal becomes one? Oh, the possibilities!’","Deemo, who had spent a lot of effort and time trying to create perfect beings, could barely restraint himself from experimenting on Yuan at this moment.","In fact, Deemo saw potential in Yuan—in Tian Chenyu long ago, hence why he didn’t kill Tian Chenyu or destroy his soul, as he was capable of doing both with ease.","However, it wasn’t just Deemo who was excited about Yuan. Even his opponent, Zaaran, could hardly contain his excitement.","In his eyes, Yuan was guaranteed to lose to him and become his subject, and the thought of having such an extraordinary slave sent chills throughout his entire being.","’Once I make him into my slave and have him participate in the upcoming event, I will no longer be a laughing stock! The only issue here is...’","Zaaran glanced at Deemo with the corner of his eyes.","’Will Deemo allow me to take him, or will he try to snatch that brat away from me?’","Zaaran was aware that he had no way of defeating Deemo, even if he was currently there with his real body, so if Deemo stole Yuan away from him, there was nothing he could really do but cry about it.","’Not only am I unable to defeat him, but we are currently in his territory, so he technically owns Tian Yang...’","Among Eternals, there existed a widely accepted rule that everything within one’s territory belonged to its owner. The only exception was the Nine Heavens, a space that could not be claimed.","Although anyone could declare ownership over it, with the Absolute Power residing there, such claims held no weight and would only be laughed at. In practice, it was a lawless domain—a free-for-all until someone seized the Absolute Power.","As he clashed with Yuan, Zaaran pondered excuses and justifications he could use to stop Deemo from taking Yuan away, should it come to that.","\"You’re slowing down, Zaaran! Something on your mind?!\" Yuan suddenly shouted, halting Zaaran’s thoughts.","\"Yes! I am thinking about how boring this is!\" Zaaran laughed in a mocking fashion before continuing, \"We both know that you won’t be able to defeat me, so why don’t you stop wasting my time and submit to me already? I will make your life a little less miserable if you willingly submit!\"","\"Are you still dreaming right now?\" Yuan sneered coldly. \"Why don’t I wake you up a little then?!\"","Yuan suddenly pointed at Zaaran and unleashed another wave of Eternal Essence, but this time, it was different.","The energy carried a bone-chilling cold, so absolute that everything in its path froze solid—even the very fabric of space itself seemed to halt and crystallize under its touch.","\"This power is?!\" Zaaran’s eyes widened with shock and disbelief as Shiva’s Eternal Frost created an icy path toward his direction.","Had he been paying attention, he might have avoided it,","but not only was he distracted, Yuan’s sudden use of a technique belonging to another Eternal caught him completely off guard.","In the end, Zaaran was unable to avoid all of the attack and was struck in the arm.","\"Arg!\" Zaaran released a painful cry.","\"Oh?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow after seeing Zaaran’s reaction.","He knew that Zaaran’s curse that had affected Kulas was weak to Yin elements, but he didn’t know the being himself was also weak to it.","\"You! That power!\" Zaaran roared, his voice trembling in anger and disgust.","\"That is Shiva’s power! Why the hell can you wield her power?!?!\"","\"Why do you care? Don’t tell me she’s your lover or something?\" Yuan mocked.","\"Bastard!!!\" Zaaran’s aura exploded as he unleashed his full strength, his Eternal Essence almost two trillion years, nearly double that of Yuan’s Eternal Essence.","’Shit!’ Zaaran immediately regretted attacking with his full strength out of anger because he didn’t believe Yuan would be able to survive it.","When Deemo saw this, he instinctively moved in to protect Yuan. After all, it would be far too wasteful to let him die there.","However, Deemo halted himself almost instantly after he started moving when he noticed the calm look on Yuan’s face."]},{"number":2459,"title":"Chapter 2459: Spirit Tree’s Awakening","paragraphs":["Moments before Zaaran unleashed his deadly attack, a notification appeared before Yuan.","<Spirit Tree has awakened>","<Spirit Tree has completed its evolution>","<Spirit Tree has evolved into Tree of Eternity>","’Tree of Eternity?’ Yuan raised an eyebrow at the unfamiliar name.","The Spirit Tree was originally acquired by Tian Yi, but it was not something he found. Rather, it was given to him by one of the Nine Divine Supremes.","When it was given to him, the Divine Supreme explained to him its name and purpose. Yet, it was not the Tree of Eternity, but the Tree of Beginning.","According to the Divine Supreme, the Tree of Beginning was not only the first living organism in existence, but also the origin of spiritual energy.","The Tree of Beginning was meant to grant Yuan an inexhaustible supply of spiritual energy once fully matured. Moreover, it served as a crucial component for forging an entirely new physique—one that had never been discovered by the humans of the Nine Heavens.","Tian Yi had prepared the Tree of Beginning for his future reincarnation, and as far as Yuan understood, if things were no longer unfolding as intended... then it meant his fate itself had shifted.","’My fate has changed, and I can no longer rely on what my previous incarnations had prepared for me. Yet, I don’t feel nervous for some reason...’ Yuan thought to himself.","The next moment, Yuan taunted Zaaran, causing him to unleash a devastating attack that was nearly double Yuan’s full prowess.","Even though there was a good chance this attack could kill him, Yuan felt oddly calm, almost as if he could instinctively tell that he would survive it.","<Tree of Eternity senses a tremendous amount of Eternal Essence>","<Tree of Eternity spreads its roots throughout your body>","The next moment, two trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence clashed against Yuan’s body.","Knowing that he couldn’t block or avoid the attack, Yuan didn’t even bother attempting anything.","<Your Eternal Constitution(Incomplete) has temporarily evolved, turning into Eternity Constitution>","<Eternity Constitution has activated, absorbing the Eternal Essence>","Before Zaaran’s Eternal Essence could even touch Yuan, it was already being absorbed.","\"That is?!\" Deemo’s real body trembled upon witnessing the scene of Yuan absorbing Zaaran’s Eternal Essence.","<Eternity Constitution has absorbed two trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence>","<The absorbed Eternal Essence has been stored inside the Tree of Eternity>","<The Tree of Eternity has begun refining its Eternal Essence>","In the blink of an eye, Zaaran’s attack was swallowed by Yuan.","The Eternal Essence disappeared so fast that it seemed as if it vanished into nothingness.","Normally, when Yuan absorbed energy, it was a gradual process, like slowly filling an empty tank with water. But this time, it was as if the entire contents had been dumped in at once, filling it instantly.","\"What the fuck?! Where did my Eternal Essence go?!\" Zaaran exclaimed in shock and disbelief, looking like he’d just witnessed a ghost.","He thought it might have been absorbed, but when he examined Yuan, he could not sense two trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence within him.","\"What is going on?!\" Zaaran turned to look at Deemo, wondering if he had anything to do with it.","However, Deemo shook his head and spoke in an adamant voice, \"I had nothing to do with it, so you can stop looking at me.\"","\"Then what the hell happened?! There’s no way my attack vanished into thin air!\" Zaaran shouted angrily, feeling utterly confused.","While Zaaran was confused, Yuan unleashed his attack.","However, he didn’t just attack with his trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence.","<Tree of Eternity has activated>","<You have tapped into the Tree of Eternity’s storage>","<You have consumed two trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence>","<Shiva’s Eternal Frost!>","\"Where the hell is this power coming from?! Don’t tell me you used my power—ARGH!\"","Zaaran cried out in pain as three trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence crashed into his avatar.","\"It hurts! It burns!! Aaaahhh!!!\"","The attack was so powerful that it shattered Zaaran’s avatar moments later.","\"I... lost...?\" Zaaran’s voice, which was full of disbelief, echoed in the void.","\"This cannot be happening...\"","He never imagined that he would lose to Yuan, much less be defeated in such a fashion.","\"This is... impossible...\" Zaaran’s voice dwindled to a faint whisper, growing weaker with each passing moment—until it vanished entirely, along with his very presence.","\"...\"","Silence lingered in the void long after Zaaran’s defeat.","Yuan remained still, quietly trying to comprehend the nature of his newfound power while Deemo observed him in silence.","Eventually, Deemo’s voice resounded, \"Congratulations on defeating Zaaran.\"","Yuan turned to face him and said, \"There’s nothing to celebrate. I merely defeated his avatar. I doubt that was even half of his true prowess.\"","\"So what? It doesn’t change the fact that you, a mere mortal, have defeated an Eternal. That is not something anyone can achieve. In fact, this may be the first time since the beginning of time that a human has defeated an Eternal.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes and revealed, \"This is not my first time fighting and defeating an Eternal. In fact, I put several of them to sleep before.\"","\"That is entirely impossible,\" Deemo shook his head, speaking in a firm tone.","\"So you are calling me a liar?\" Yuan frowned.","\"No, I am saying that you have misunderstood the situation. Even with that attack you used to defeat Zaaran, it would be impossible to defeat an Eternal in their real body. In fact, you’d need at least ten trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence to even injure the weakest Eternal out there.\"","\"What? But I know I put those Eternals to sleep!\" Yuan exclaimed.","\"You can believe what you want, but I have no reason to deceive you.\"","After a brief pause, Deemo continued, \"As for Zaaran... that avatar was only about ten percent of his true capability.\"","\"What?! There’s no way!\" Yuan cried out in disbelief before explaining his reasoning. \"I fought with Saaruk’s avatar before, and he claimed to be using twenty percent of his true prowess, and he was much weaker than Zaaran just now!\""]},{"number":2460,"title":"Chapter 2460: Human Clones","paragraphs":["\"Did you just say Saaruk?\" Deemo muttered in a somewhat surprised voice.","Then, he burst out laughing, \"Saaruk is a compulsive liar. Everything he says has to be taken with a grain of salt.\"","Yuan raised his eyebrows at this new information and asked, \"Isn’t he a powerful Eternal? Even Shiva said Saaruk was one of the more powerful Eternals.\"","\"Shiva... I haven’t heard that name in a long time,\" Deemo murmured, a hint of nostalgia in his tone.","\"Anyway, Shiva’s information is probably outdated, as she was sealed away ages ago. Saaruk was indeed quite strong once, but he’s grown lazy and has long since been surpassed by many others.\"","\"Is that so...\" Yuan fell silent, unsure what to think about this information.","\"You...\" Deemo suddenly started talking, but abruptly halted, as if he was hesitant on something.","Eventually, he continued, \"How would you like to become my subject—\"","\"I refuse.\" Yuan rejected Deemo before he could even finish his sentence.","\"Let me finish,\" Deemo said in an annoyed tone. \"If you become my subject and allow me to experiment on you, I will help you complete your Eternal Constitution, and I am even willing to be your backing, so no Eternal will dare to mess with you.\"","\"I refuse,\" Yuan rejected again without an ounce of hesitation in his voice.","\"I want to hear your reasoning,\" Deemo demanded.","\"It’s quite simple, really. I don’t want to serve anyone, especially not someone who experimented on an entire world, treating human lives as nothing more than sacrificial lambs.\"","Even though Yuan knew that his refusal could offend Deemo and potentially get himself killed, his voice was as calm as a still pond and without an ounce of fear.","Deemo fell silent to ponder again, as he was reluctant to give up on someone as valuable as Yuan.","\"No matter what you offer me, I will not become your experiment,\" Yuan realized what Deemo was trying to do and said aloud.","\"Fine, I won’t experiment on you, nor am I asking you to become my subject for real. Instead, I want you to become my subject in name and participate in a certain event for me,\" Deemo said.","\"What?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows, looking bewildered.","\"In return, I will owe you a favor,\" Deemo continued.","\"Wait a second. I don’t understand what you want from me. What do you want me to participate in? And why must I be your subject?\" Yuan asked.","\"Allow me to elaborate.\"","Deemo pointed a finger at Yuan, pouring images and information directly into his mind.","\"This all began many years ago... We Eternals, with nothing to do but cultivate and bored out of our minds, decided to create something to ease that boredom,\" Deemo began.","\"That was when we chose to create our own worlds and humans, nurturing them just to see what would happen. As time passed, more and more Eternals joined the game, each crafting their own world. Eventually, it turned competitive, everyone claiming their world and their humans were superior to the rest.\"","\"To prove their humans were superior, the Eternals made them fight, and thus began what we call the Eternals’ Reckoning—\"","\"Wait, wait, wait!\" Yuan suddenly shouted with a bewildered look on his face.","\"What do you mean Eternals created humans and are making them fight each other?!\"","\"Does this mean there are other worlds out there with humans besides the Nine Heavens and the Demonic Realm?!\"","\"Well...\" Deemo paused briefly before continuing, \"there used to be. However, over time, as the Eternals experimented on humans in pursuit of something stronger... humanity gradually went extinct.\"","\"That doesn’t make any sense. If Eternals created humans in the first place, can’t they just make more?\"","\"I guess it would be more accurate to say that we had cloned them instead of creating them.\"","\"What in heaven’s name...?\" Yuan’s face became even more confused.","\"Although Eternals are powerful, we are not omnipotent, and creating humans is beyond our capabilities. The best we were able to do was clone the humans that already existed.\"","\"Why can’t you just clone them again? Did something happen to them?\" Yuan then asked.","Deemo nodded.","\"They were a miracle created by the universe, existing long before even my world. Unfortunately, they were all wiped out in a certain incident.\"","\"Why don’t you just clone the human clones?\"","\"You think we haven’t tried that? It’s simply impossible, as they would always come out inhuman. In fact, you have seen them before.\"","Yuan tilted his head with a pondering expression. Then, his eyes widened with realization.","\"Don’t tell me... magical beasts?!\" He cried out loud.","Deemo calmly nodded.","\"Wait... then what about me? What about the humans in the Nine Heavens? Are we also clones?\"","\"That... I am unsure.\"","\"How is that possible?\"","\"The Divine Heaven’s origin is not known... or more precisely, nobody but one being knows.\"","\"The Absolute Being.\" Yuan muttered.","\"Correct, as it was the Absolute Being’s property, and nobody is foolish enough to stick their nose into his business. However, if we think logically, it is unlikely that any ’true’ humans are left in this universe, including the ones from your world. As I said, they were all killed, and not even the Absolute Being can create humans out of thin air.\"","\"This is... a lot for me to digest.\" Yuan muttered before closing his eyes and taking several deep breaths.","\"Anyway, that is the reason I experimented on my humans and treated them as if they were worthless,\" Deemo continued. \"Because they are not authentic humans, merely fakes we created for our entertainment.\"","\"That doesn’t make it okay,\" Yuan quickly replied. \"It doesn’t change the fact that they have a soul and are conscious. Even if they are clones, they have emotions, can feel and think.\"","\"...\" Deemo fell silent.","Suddenly—","<You have discovered the existence of ’Humans’ and ’Human Clones’>","<You have discovered the true origin of ’Magical Beasts’>","<Your progress toward Path to Eternity has increased>","[Progress: 15%]"]},{"number":2461,"title":"Chapter 2461: Ending The Transcendents’ Punishment","paragraphs":["\"Haaa...\" Yuan let out a long sigh, then muttered in a low voice. \"The more I learn about you Eternals, the more I despise your kind. Whether it’s treating humans as tools or using us for your own amusement... I hate all of it.\"","\"Don’t talk as if we’re the only ones who do such things,\" Deemo said, shaking his head. \"I’ve watched humans for longer than you’ve been alive. They also treat their own kind like tools, kill each other over trivial matters, even enslave one another. In what way are you any better than us Eternals? It’s nothing but hypocrisy.\"","\"Not only are you humans not any better than us, but I’d even argue that you’re worse than us in many ways,\" Deemo sighed. \"I bet you’ve killed plenty of humans yourself.\"","\"That’s...\" Yuan opened his mouth but could not think of any comebacks.","Sure enough, Yuan had taken many lives—both in his past and current life. Whether they deserved it or not was another matter entirely; it didn’t change the simple fact that he had killed.","\"Or what? Are you saying that only humans can kill humans? In that case, then what about magical beasts being hunted by humans? What about the animals enslaved by humans? Humans also play god when they have the chance. At the end of the day, our kind doesn’t matter. The strong make the rules, and the weak obey. That is all that truly matters.\"","Yuan closed his eyes and sighed.","\"There’s no point in arguing philosophy. What truly matters to me is what is right and what is wrong. Humans... Magical beasts... Eternals... Regardless of their identity, the wrong should be punished.\"","\"What is right and what is wrong...? The strong are always right, and the weak are wrong. That is the rule of this world—this universe!\" Deemo declared.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Deemo spoke again, \"Let’s cease this debate that will go nowhere. Let me hear your answer. Will you become my subject and fight for me?\"","Yuan sneered. \"How does fighting for you benefit me at all? A mere favor from you hardly seems worth it.\"","\"Of course it will benefit you. The winner of the event will receive an enormous amount of Eternal Essence—at least ten trillion years’ worth. If we win, I’ll give that Eternal Essence to you, which will surely help you fight against Eternals.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow. \"What’s the point of you participating if you’re just going to hand over all the rewards to me? And who’s providing the Eternal Essence, anyway? It’s not some treasure you can just toss around.\"","\"Reputation and bragging rights,\" Deemo replied calmly. \"As for the Eternal Essence, it comes from all participating Eternals. Each one must pay a trillion years’ worth of Eternal Essence just to enter.\"","\"When is it going to start?\" Yuan asked after a moment of silence. \"I swear, if you say something stupid like a billion years—\"","\"It will start in a hundred years—ninty nine years and three hundred days to be exact.\"","\"I will think about it,\" Yuan then said.","\"If you’re thinking about finding another Eternal to fight for, don’t bother. You’ll only be wasting your time,\" Deemo suddenly said.","\"And why is that? Not saying that’s what I was thinking. I am just asking out of curiosity,\" Yuan said.","\"Sure you are...\" Deemo shook his head.","Yet, he still entertained Yuan and explained, \"It’s because we are only allowed to use our ’creation’ to participate. Since you can transform into a demon, I can claim that you’re one of my creations.\"","\"Is that so?\" Yuan mumbled.","\"Anyway, I’ll let you know later. I still need some time to think about it.\"","Deemo nodded, \"Take as much time as you need, as long as you decide before the event.\"","\"By the way, is this event the reason Zaaran wanted the Transcendents’ blood?\" Yuan suddenly asked, recalling Zaaran.","\"Yes, he probably wanted to use their blood to strengthen his own creation.\"","\"Zaaran’s creations... I have a good guess about what they might be...\" Yuan mumbled, recalling the existence of the Giant Race.","As far as he knew, the Giant Race possessed immense strength and durability, but lacked the regeneration that demons had.","’If the Giant Race also had the demons’ ridiculous regeneration, they’d become quite the terrifying existence,’ Yuan thought to himself.","\"I’m done answering your questions,\" Deemo suddenly declared. \"If you want to know more, you can ask me after you agree to become my subject.\"","\"Wait! One last thing! And it’s not a question!\" Yuan hastily said.","\"What is it?\"","\"Can you give back the Transcendents their freedom?\"","\"How is that not a question?\"","\"It’s a request. If you free them, it’ll definitely change my opinion of you... for the better, which will make me more likely to help you,\" Yuan said with a sly smile.","\"...\"","Deemo silently glared at Yuan with his featureless face. He understood perfectly well what Yuan was trying to do. Although he disliked being taken advantage of, he was willing to tolerate it for the sake of his goal.","\"Very well. I will end their punishment for attacking me. It has been long enough, and I had planned to do so soon even without your request,\" he said.","\"Then I’ll send you back now.\"","The next moment, Deemo teleported Yuan back to the Demonic Realm.","\"Master Yuan!\" Lev cried out loud after seeing Yuan’s return.","Selena looked around, clearly searching for the Demon God. However, Deemo didn’t go with Yuan.","\"Where is the Demon God?\" Selena asked him a moment later.","\"He’s gone,\" Yuan said.","\"How long have I been gone?\" he then asked.","\"Not long. You’ve only been gone for three years,\" Lev answered.","\"Three years? It didn’t feel longer than a few days...\" Yuan muttered.","\"Anyway...\"","Yuan turned to look at Selena and said with a smile, \"I have some good news for you.\"","Selena raised an eyebrow, a puzzled look on her face.","\"The Demon God has agreed to end your punishment. You’re no longer confined to Death Paradise, so you’re free to leave.\"","\"What...?\" Selena’s jaw instantly dropped at his words."]},{"number":2462,"title":"Chapter 2462: Ending The Transcendents’ Punishment(2)","paragraphs":["\"C-Can you repeat that for me?\" Selena muttered with a dazed look on her face, unable to believe what she’d just heard.","\"I said the Demon God has ended your punishment, so you can leave Death Paradise,\" Yuan repeated.","\"Why would he do that? Did you...?\" Selena’s eyes trembled as they stared at him.","Yuan nodded, \"I just tried asking him, and it somehow worked out.\"","\"Th-thank you! Truly!\" Selena subconsciously bowed her head to him, something she hadn’t done since becoming a Transcendent.","\"There’s no need to thank me. I didn’t really do anything.\"","Yuan turned to look at the crimson cocoon nearby and approached it.","\"Dena...\" Yuan had considered asking Deemo to assist Dena with her ascension, but ultimately decided against it, feeling that doing so would wound her pride.","\"Knowing her, she’d rather die trying than succeed with help. If I asked Deemo to assist her, she’d probably hate me for life, even if it was for her own good,\" Yuan sighed softly.","He then turned to Lev and said, \"I intend on leaving this place soon.\"","\"You mean Death Paradise? Where will you go next? I will follow you wherever you go!\" Lev declared as he proudly patted his chest.","However, Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, I will be leaving this world to return to my own. I have been here for long enough.\"","\"Back to your own world...? Then what about me?\" Lev stared at him with a dumbfounded face.","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"Do you want to follow me back to my world?\"","\"Can I really follow you?!\" Lev’s eyes widened with surprise.","Yuan silently nodded.","\"I want to!\" Lev quickly agreed. \"I no longer have a family or home in this world, so it doesn’t matter where I go.\"","\"What about your revenge?\" Yuan suddenly reminded him of his reason for wanting to leave the Deprived Crimson Valley.","\"That’s...\" Lev closed his eyes and became silent.","A minute later, he opened them again, his eyes flickering with resolve.","\"It happened so long ago that I doubt that the bastard is still alive. Unless I encounter him, I will just consider him dead.\"","\"Alright.\" Yuan nodded.","\"Then what about her?\" Lev suddenly pointed at Supreme Ruler Dena.","\"Well... In that state, I don’t think we’ll be able to bring her with us.\"","Suddenly, as if reacting to his words, the cocoon trembled.","\"Hm?\"","Noticing the subtle movement, Yuan raised an eyebrow and approached the cocoon.","\"Dena? Can you hear me?\" he called out to her.","\"...\"","The cocoon remained motionless.","\"I guess you don’t want to come with me, after all.\"","The cocoon trembled again.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Remember our promise? I said that I’d show you my world the next time I came back to the Demonic Realm.\"","The cocoon did not stop trembling, even growing more active.","Yuan then said, \"There’s no need to rush your ascension, Dena. It’s not like I am going to leave right now.\"","\"We’re not?\" Lev muttered. \"Then what are we going to do now?\"","Yuan turned to him and said, \"To leave this world and return to mine, we first need to remove the seal blocking the gateway that connects our worlds.\"","\"Although I don’t know if it can be removed from this side, I have to try.\"","Yuan turned to look at Selena and asked her, \"What are you going to do now that you have regained your freedom?\"","Selena smiled and said, \"I’m going to spend some time exploring this world before visiting yours.\"","Yuan’s jaw dropped.","\"You... want to visit my world?\" he swallowed nervously.","He didn’t believe Selena would necessarily wreak havoc there—but neither could he fully trust that she wouldn’t. With her immense power, she could easily cause unimaginable destruction.","\"What’s with that reaction? You don’t want me to visit your world? Or do you not trust me?\" Selena approached him and said, sounding a bit offended.","Yuan sighed, \"To be frank, I cannot trust anyone besides Dena and Lev to visit my world.\"","\"Is that so? Then how do I gain your trust?\" Selena then asked.","\"Uh... give me some time to think about it.\"","Selena nodded and said, \"In that case, I will leave you alone for now. Then tell me where you’re going, so I can find you once—\"","Selena suddenly stopped talking and asked, \"Do you still have Helena’s blood?\"","Yuan nodded.","\"Keep it with you. I’ll find you once I am done.\"","\"Done? With that?\" Yuan asked.","\"I need to speak with my sisters and let them know that we’re free,\" she said.","\"Are you actually real sisters?\"","She shook her head.","\"No, my entire family died during the Great Cataclysm. With that said, we’re pretty much family after everything we experienced.\"","\"I see...\"","\"Then I’ll see you guys later. It was fun being with you guys.\"","Without another word, Selena vanished into thin air like a ghost.","\"Where are we going now?\" Lev then asked.","\"Back to Crimson Continent.\"","Shortly later, Yuan used Void Manipulation to travel, bringing Supreme Ruler Dena and Lev with him.","Meanwhile, somewhere in Death Paradise, Selena arrived at the portal leading to Helena’s personal world.","The instant she stepped inside, a bone-chilling scream of agony tore through the air and assaulted her ears, followed by laughter from another voice.","Selena calmly followed the direction of the screams.","\"Please! Spare me and kill me! I was wrong!\" Owen cried out loud.","\"Hahaha! It’s too soon to be begging for mercy, you traitorous bastard!\" Helena laughed madly as she continued to torture Owen with unimaginably cruel methods.","Suddenly, she halted and turned around.","\"Selena!\"","\"Selena?\" Angela, who was also there, approached her.","\"What are you doing here? What happened to that human brat?\" she asked.","\"It’s a long story...\"","\"We have nothing but time. Come, let’s have some fun torturing him.\" Angela grabbed Selena’s hand and dragged her toward Owen, who was nailed to a tree, his body blood-soaked and twisted like a spiral."]},{"number":2463,"title":"Chapter 2463: Dethroning Qian Chu","paragraphs":["Selena calmly gazed at Owen, who was treated like some kind of testing dummy, and said, \"I have some news for you. Once you hear it, I doubt you will still want to waste your time on him.\"","\"Wasting our time on him?\" Angela raised her eyebrows, looking confused.","Angela and Helena then exchanged glances with each other. They have known her for the majority of their lives, so even though Selena wore a calm expression on her face right now, they could tell that she was extremely delighted for some reason.","\"What happened, Selena? I have never seen you so happy before,\" Helena eventually questioned.","Hearing her words, Selena could no longer contain her excitement and smiled brightly.","\"The Demon God has ended our punishment. We’re free to leave Death Paradise now,\" she revealed.","\"What?!\"","Both Angela and Helena exclaimed simultaneously, not daring to believe their ears.","\"How is that possible?!\" Helena questioned after snapping out of her daze.","Selena proceeded to explain the situation to them.","\"That human brat asked the Demon God to free us, and the Demon God just agreed?! That sounds too good to be true!\" Helena said afterward.","\"I have to agree with her, Selena,\" Angela shook her head and sighed. \"Did you even confirm that we are free before you came here to tell us?\"","\"Uh...\" Selena fell silent for a moment before responding in a stiff tone, \"I didn’t.\"","\"What?! You came here to tell us this news without even confirming it yourself?!\" Helena exclaimed in disbelief.","\"Because I wanted to experience it together...\" Selena sighed.","\"That’s...\"","The two fell silent as they examined Selena’s calm yet emotional expression.","\"Alright... Let’s go and see whether that brat was telling the truth or not,\" Angela said a moment later.","Helena nodded, and they all left the world shortly later, leaving Owen behind.","Soon, they arrived at the border of Death Paradise.","\"So... who wants to try leaving first?\" Angela asked out loud.","Due to the Demon God’s punishment, if they tried to leave Death Paradise even for a second, they would experience unfathomable pain nonstop for a million years.","One might think they could simply endure the pain, but they wouldn’t get far out of Death Paradise before being teleported back to their prison.","\"I will go first since I am the one who’s telling you to trust him,\" Selena said with a resolute face.","However, as Selena moved toward the border, Helena suddenly grabbed her hand and said, \"No, let’s do it together.\"","Helena followed Selena, leaving Angela behind, silently staring at them.","Eventually, Angela sighed and said, \"Wait, I’ll go with you.\"","Moments later, the three of them hovered right at the edge of Death Paradise.","\"Here we go...\"","After taking a deep breath, they took the final step and left Death Paradise for the first time in billions of years.","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","The three of them froze outside Death Paradise, their hearts racing with the expectation that they would soon experience unimaginable pain for defying the Demon God’s punishment.","Yet, even after a full minute, none of them felt any pain.","They exchanged gazes with each other, their faces looking completely dazed.","\"We’re... outside?\"","\"I’m... not experiencing any pain...\"","\"Me neither...\"","After they fully digested the situation and a long moment of silence, they celebrated with joy.","\"It’s true! We’re no longer confined within Death Paradise!\" Helena cried tears of joy.","\"Hahaha! That damn brat! I shouldn’t have doubted him!\" Angela said.","\"Un.\" Selena nodded, causing the river of tears from her eyes to fall faster.","Once they calmed down, Angela asked, \"How did he do it? I find it hard to believe that he simply asked the Demon God to free us, and the Demon God agreed.\"","Selena shook her head and said, \"There’s no point dwelling on it. It doesn’t matter how he did it. The only thing that matters is that we owe him for helping us regain our freedom.\"","Helena and Angela nodded their heads in agreement.","\"So, what should we do now that we’re free?\" Angela then asked.","\"We can do whatever we want,\" Helena said. \"I am going to continue torturing that traitor for a little longer then explore the world.\"","\"I am also going to explore the world,\" Angela said.","Selena then said, \"Me too, but once I am bored of this place, I intend on visiting the other world, where humans still exist.\"","\"The other world...?\" Helena and Angela stared at her with wide eyes. \"You mean that brat’s world? Are you sure that’s a good idea?\"","\"I don’t plan on going without receiving his permission,\" Selena shook her head. \"If he doesn’t allow it, then I will just go elsewhere.\"","She lifted her head to look at the sky.","\"When we left this world and went to confront the Demon God, I realized just how small our world truly was. That vast, boundless space that exists beyond our world... I want to explore as much of it as I can.\"","\"Then I will go with you,\" Angela said.","Helena nodded, \"Wherever you go, we’ll go with you.\"","\"Alright.\"","Meanwhile, at the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library, two distinct groups of people stood before each other, looking like they were prepared to go to war.","\"Qian Chu! I am here today to claim what is rightfully mine!\" Yan Hara loudly declared.","\"What is rightfully yours? What could you possibly be talking about?\" Qian Chu sneered.","\"I am talking about your position as the Demon Sealing Clan’s leader!\"","\"Hah!\" Qian Chu coldly laughed. \"My position rightfully belongs to you? Based on what? You didn’t even qualify to be a Supreme Demon Sealer, yet you want to become the leader? You must be out of your mind!\"","\"The Leader’s right. What qualifications do you have to even dare make such a claim?!\"","Those on Qian Chu’s side shouted.","\"Haven’t you heard?! Senior Yan has inherited the Divine Paragon’s legacy!\" Those supporting Yan Hara began shouting back.","\"That’s right! If anybody should be the leader, it should be her! Not some cold-hearted bastard like Qian Chu!\""]},{"number":2464,"title":"Chapter 2464: Dethroning Qian Chu(2)","paragraphs":["\"The Divine Paragon’s legacy?! That’s just a baseless rumor you’ve been spreading as a part of your scheme to usurp the Clan Leader’s position!\"","\"I even saw those bastards at the Demon Sealing Grotto spreading this bullshit! There’s no way it’s real!\"","Qian Chu’s group exclaimed angrily, refusing to believe the rumors.","\"Why the hell would we make up something that can easily be disproven?! It’s a fact that Senior Yan has acquired the Divine Paragon’s techniques through his legacy!\"","\"That’s right! We have witnessed it ourselves! Senior Yan has definitely received the Divine Paragon’s legacy! Not only that, but she has been fixing the relationship between the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto!\"","\"Meanwhile, Qian Chu has done absolutely nothing for the Demon Sealing Clan since he acquired his position! Even worse, when we needed him, he vanished for years without a word! How can we trust someone like that?!\"","\"With the demons and demon worshippers growing more active lately, we need someone we can trust to lead us! And that person is Senior Yan!\"","Yan Hara’s group and Qian Chu’s group argued back and forth while the two of them silently stared at each other.","\"Enough.\" Qian Chu eventually spoke, blanketing the place with his powerful presence.","\"What do you think you’re doing? Threatening us now that your position is in danger?\" Yan Hara muttered, fighting his presence with her own.","\"In danger? My position was never in danger!\" Qian Chu let out a cold chuckle.","\"So what if you’re the Divine Paragon’s successor? Even if it were true, there’s no rule stating that the Divine Paragon’s successor will automatically become the Clan Leader!\" he said.","Yan Hara opened her mouth, but no words came out.","’He’s... right...’ she thought inwardly.","Although the Divine Paragon was the first leader of the Demon Sealing Clan and created for him, it wasn’t as though he founded the organization, and most of the clan’s rules were actually established only after his disappearance.","In other words, the Demon Sealing Clan did not truly belong to the Divine Paragon, but the Demon Sealers that followed him.","Qian Chu continued speaking a moment later, \"If you want my position as the Clan Leader, you must challenge me properly.\"","\"What are you trying to say?\" Yan Hara asked with narrowed eyes.","Qian Chu smiled and said, \"As one of our elites, you should know very well what I’m trying to say.\"","\"There are two ways to become—or rather, replace—the current Clan Leader. The first is by gaining the support of at least seventy percent of the Demon Sealing Clan’s members. And while you’ve managed to gather a fair number of followers, it’s nowhere near enough.\"","\"The second method is—\"","\"The Demon Slaying Parade,\" Yan Hara cut in.","The Demon Slaying Parade she mentioned was an event where the Clan Leader and their challenger compete in a race to hunt a group of demons, and victory belongs to whoever seals all of the demons first.","Of course, they would not be hunting real demons but artificial demons.","\"So, are you challenging me through the Demon Slaying Parade?\" Qian Chu questioned her.","\"D-Don’t do it, Senior Yan!\"","Yan Hara’s support group quickly said.","\"I bet it’s a trap!\"","Yuan Hara closed her eyes and said, \"Although I may not have enough support at my side, that is only true for the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","\"What?\" Qian Chu raised an eyebrow.","\"The Demon Sealing Grotto. I have the majority of the Demon Sealing Grotto’s support, including their top Demon Sealers,\" she clarified.","\"Hahaha!\" Qian Chu burst out laughing. \"The Demon Sealing Grotto?! Are you that desperate? So what if you have their support? Even if the entire Demon Sealing Grotto is supporting you, since they do not belong to the Demon Sealing Clan, it does not matter!\"","\"Nothing to do with the Demon Sealing Clan?\" Yan Hara muttered. \"So what if they’re from a different organization? It doesn’t change the fact that they are Demon Sealers and many of their original members came from the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","After a slight pause, Yan Hara continued, \"I intended on revealing this once I become the leader of the Demon Sealing Clan, but I might as well say it now.\"","She took a deep breath and said, \"The Demon Sealing Grotto has agreed to merge with the Demon Sealing Clan, becoming one again.\"","\"What? The Demon Sealing Grotto? I thought we were at war with them?\"","The members of Qian Chu’s group started mumbling to each other. Even amongst Yan Hara’s group, there were many who were surprised by this information.","Suddenly, a loud voice rang out from outside. \"W-We have a problem! We have a huge problem!\"","Everyone in the library turned toward the sound just in time to see a guard rushing in.","\"What’s the matter?\" someone asked.","\"Th-The Demon Sealing Grotto! The Demon Sealing Grotto is invading us! And it’s not just a few of them! It looks like they brought everyone!\" The guard exclaimed.","\"What?!\"","Everyone there turned to look at Yan Hara.","\"B-But you just said that they planned to merge with us?! What is the meaning of this, Yan Hara?!\"","\"I knew it! You were just spewing lies!\"","However, Yan Hara remained calm and asked the guard, \"Are you sure they’re here to invade us? Did they say they were going to do so?\"","\"T-That’s...\" The guard opened his mouth, but was utterly speechless.","In truth, he escaped in fear the moment he saw the Demon Sealing Grotto.","Without saying a word, Yan Hara turned around and started walking outside.","Qian Chu and the others watched in silence for a moment before following her.","Outside, Zhou Yanfei and the entire Demon Sealing Grotto had gathered, encircling the gates of the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library.","Some time later, Zhou Yanfei and the others could see a massive group of people coming out of the library.","\"What is the meaning of this, Zhou Yanfei? Are you looking to start an all-out war with us today?\" Qian Chu’s voice resounded before they could even see his face."]},{"number":2465,"title":"Chapter 2465: Dethroning Qian Chu(3)","paragraphs":["\"An all-out war?\" Zhou Yanfei chuckled at Qian Chu’s words. \"I’m sure that’s what you want, considering that you have been scheming against our Demon Sealing Grotto ever since you came into power.\"","\"That’s slander!\" Qian Chu’s supporters shouted angrily.","\"Slander?\" Zhou Yanfei calmly shook his head. \"It’s a fact that our Demon Sealing Grotto has suffered far more casualties and abnormalities ever since Qian Chu became Clan Leader—missing members, random ambushes, and more.\"","\"How can you blame Leader Qian for any of that?!\"","\"Right?! It’s just that the members of the Demon Sealing Grotto are lacking in ability!\" Qian Chu’s supporters retorted.","\"I heard that the Demon Sealing Grotto’s headquarters was recently attacked by demons. Are you going to blame that on Leader Qian, too?!\"","\"You’re too much, Demon Sealing Grotto! Look at how lowly you’ve fallen!\"","\"...\"","Zhou Yanfei and the rest of the Demon Sealing Grotto remained silent as Qian Chu’s supporters hurled insults at them.","Eventually, Zhou Yanfei stared at Qian Chu and said, \"I—We did not come here today to argue with you or the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","\"Then why are you here today?\"","Zhou Yanfei walked to stand in front of Yan Hara and suddenly lowered his head, bowing to her respectfully.","The members of the Demon Sealing Grotto behind him followed his gesture, bowing to her.","\"We are here today to show our support for Yan Hara, who will lead the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto in the near future.\"","\"?!?!\"","The entire place fell silent.","Even though Yan Hara had already mentioned the Demon Sealing Grotto’s desire to merge with the Demon Sealing Clan, many of them did not actually believe her, most of them being Qian Chu’s supporters.","Yan Hara turned to face Qian Chu and said, \"Since we are already here, I no longer see a reason to hide this any longer.\"","\"Qian Chu, although I do not know what you’re scheming, I am certain that you do not care about the Demon Sealing Clan or have any interest in sealing demons. As a matter of fact, I know that you’re working for the demons!\"","\"What?!\"","Zhou Yanfei and most of the people there expressed shock after hearing Yan Hara’s outrageous claim.","However, for some reason, many of Qian Chu’s supporters did not have such a reaction, most of them looking eerily calm.","\"Me? Working for demons?\" Qian Chu mumbled before bursting out in laughter. \"Yan Hara, your claims are getting more and more outrageous! You must truly be out of your mind! What evidence do you have that I am working for demons?! If you really think you can force me out of my position with such slander, think again!\"","Yan Hara remained calm and said, \"Unfortunately, I do not have any solid evidence that you’re working for the demons, but even so, I never intended to rely on this information to bring you down.\"","\"Then why even bother mentioning it?! If anything, it puts your credibility to question!\"","\"I mentioned it just purely to let you know that I know about it,\" said Yan Hara.","A smile suddenly tugged at her lips and said, \"Qian Chu, I challenge you to the Demon Slaying Parade. If you lose, you will have to give up being the leader of the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","Qian Chu smiled and said, \"Then if you lose, you will hand over the Divine Paragon’s demon sealing techniques.\"","\"What?! Don’t do it, Yan Hara! We don’t need to do something so risky when we can just remove him by force!\" Zhou Yanfei exclaimed.","\"Senior Zhou is right, Senior Yan! The Divine Paragon’s legacy can’t be handed to someone who might be colluding with demons! They’ll definitely try to destroy them!\" her supporters echoed.","Yan Hara shook her head and sighed.","\"If I’m going to lead the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto in the future, I need to prove myself properly. As much as I hate to admit it, Qian Chu is right that merely inheriting the Divine Paragon’s legacy doesn’t automatically qualify me to be the Clan Leader. That is why I will challenge him for his position.\"","She turned to face them and asked loudly, \"Or do you think that I will lose him?!\"","\"That’s not it, Yan Hara.\" Zhou Yanfei said. \"It is not that we doubt your abilities. We just don’t want anything to go wrong and lose you. After all, the Demon Slaying Parade isn’t exactly a safe event.\"","\"Don’t worry, I will be fine.\" Yan Hara said with a confident smile on her face.","She turned to stare at Qian Chu in the eyes the following moment and said, \"I agree to your terms.\"","\"Then we will commence the Demon Slaying Parade exactly one month from now!\"","After saying that, Qian Chu turned around and disappeared back into the library with his supporters.","\"Why would you make a wager involving the Divine Paragon’s legacy, especially with that hateful bastard Qian Chu of all people?\" Zhou Yanfei asked Yan Hara with a worried face.","After learning of Qian Chu’s return, Zhou Yanfei arrived at the library alongside the entirety of the Demon Sealing Grotto. Though he had no intention of starting a conflict, he was fully prepared to help Yan Hara force Qian Chu to step down if necessary.","Yet all of his efforts had been for nothing, and to make matters worse, even the Divine Paragon’s legacy was now in jeopardy.","\"I am confident that I can beat Qian Chu,\" Yan Hara said.","\"What if he plays dirty?\"","\"Play dirty? And how exactly would he do that?\" Yan Hara raised an eyebrow.","\"The Demon Slaying Parade won’t just be witnessed by the Demon Sealing Clan—many factions and outsiders will also be present. Furthermore, once the event begins, only Qian Chu and I will be allowed inside the arena.\"","\"I don’t know, but Qian Chu is a crafty bastard. I just think it’s better if we play it safe.\"","Yan Hara shook her head and sighed, \"Qian Chu is also a stubborn bastard who won’t give up his position without a fight. If we try to force him, there will be many casualties, and I want to avoid that if possible.\""]},{"number":2466,"title":"Chapter 2466: Returning to the City of Blood","paragraphs":["\"No matter what Qian Chu is planning, I will beat him at his own game and become the leader!\" Yan Hara confidently declared, and her supporters loudly cheered.","Zhou Yanfei sighed.","\"In any case, let’s start preparing for the Demon Slaying Parade. There is also something I need to talk to you about.\"","\"Is it regarding the Demon Sealers that have gone missing lately?\" Yan Hara asked with a solemn face.","He nodded and said, \"Our members have been disappearing in the same manner as those women abducted by the demons. As much as we’d like to keep everyone within the safety of our headquarters, we cannot simply ignore the chaos caused by the demon worshippers.\"","Yan Hara then said, \"It’s not just the Demon Sealing Grotto. Our members have also started disappearing recently.\"","\"And they’re mostly members who support Senior Yan!\" One of her supporters said.","\"Is it a coincidence, or is he...\" Zhou Yanfei mumbled.","\"Let us discuss this elsewhere,\" Yan Hara interrupted.","Zhou Yanfei nodded.","Moments later, Yan Hara and Zhou Yanfei went somewhere private to continue their discussion while the others went to prepare for the Demon Slaying Parade.","It didn’t take long before news of Yan Hara challenging Qian Chu to the Demon Slaying Parade spread.","Although the Demon Sealing Clan had long since faded from relevance, the recent return of demons and the growing activity of demon worshippers had caused their name to surface once more.","\"Fuck! Why the hell are the Demon Sealers messing around when the demons have returned?! If they want to fight, they should do it after dealing with the demons!\"","\"These Demon Sealers have completely forgotten their purpose after so many years of being inactive!\"","\"The Demon Worshippers destroyed my village recently! If the Demon Sealers weren’t fighting amongst themselves, my family might have survived!\"","Because of the ongoing chaos, many outsiders questioned why they were fighting amongst themselves during such a critical time, with most of the criticism being directed toward Yan Hara for initiating the conflict.","Somewhere within Ninth Heaven, a tall, slender woman with long black hair approached a towering, broad-shouldered figure and asked, \"Master, is it true that something is happening at the Demon Sealing Clan?\"","\"You also heard about it? Are you interested in the drama? How unusual for you, Meixiu.\"","Meixiu showed a slight smile and said, \"I know someone who is closely related to them, after all. What is the Demon Slaying Parade that I heard about?\"","\"Sorry, but I don’t know anything about the Demon Sealing Clan. However, I heard that it’s an event which will be open to the public. Do you want to go? You have been training nonstop with barely any breaks for many years now,\" said Keling, her master.","Meixiu pondered for a moment before nodding her head, \"I want to go.\"","In the Demonic Realm, after leaving Death Paradise, Yuan used Water Tunnel to travel to a part of the Blood Expanse that was closest to their destination.","\"Where are we going, anyway?\" Lev asked once they returned to the Crimson Continent.","\"Blood Monastery,\" Yuan calmly replied.","\"What? Isn’t that the place where previous Supreme Rulers are honored? We’re basically returning to the City of Blood. Do you think Supreme Ruler Grant has made it back yet?\"","\"I guess we’ll find out once we get there.\"","Some time later, they returned to the City of Blood.","Before they’d left, their battle had reduced the entire city to ruins, filling its land with massive craters.","After they left, the Supreme Adviser brought its residents back and had them repair the city. With tens of millions of residents—many of them being in the Immortal Realm and False Gods—working on restoring the city at once, it didn’t take long before they filled all of the craters and rebuilt the houses.","Yet, the city looked nothing like it had in the past and basically had become an entirely new city.","\"Hm? What are they doing?\" Yuan asked out loud when he used his divine sense to sweep the city and noticed that pretty much the majority of its residents were gathered at the Supreme Ruler’s headquarters.","Lev examined the situation for a moment before responding, \"I believe it is a funeral... for the Supreme Ruler.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"Supreme Ruler Grant is dead? But he was alive when we parted,\" he muttered.","\"Either they think he’s dead, or it’s actually meant for the Supreme Ancestor,\" Lev then said.","\"Oh, right. I forgot about him,\" Yuan remarked with a chuckle.","\"I don’t want to disturb them, so let’s wait until they are done.\"","\"But the funeral usually lasts for a hundred ye—\"","\"We don’t have time for that,\" Yuan interrupted before entering the city.","At the Supreme Ruler’s headquarters, the Supreme Adviser was giving a speech to those gathered.","\"We are gathered here today to honor and remember the Supreme Ancestor, our 13th Supreme Ruler—\"","Shortly after the Supreme Adviser began his speech, two figures descended before him.","\"Y-You are—!\" The Supreme Adviser fell back on his buttocks from shock and fear after seeing Yuan’s face.","\"I’m back,\" Yuan calmly said.","\"You may be back, but where is Supreme Ruler Grant?!\" The Supreme Adviser began frantically looking around for Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"Don’t tell me you killed him!\" When the Supreme Adviser could not find Supreme Ruler Grant, he instantly turned to Yuan and accused him of murdering the Supreme Ruler.","Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, he should be on his way back here as we speak.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, the Supreme Adviser asked him, \"Then why have you returned? Can’t you see that we’re in the middle of a funeral?\"","\"Relax, we’re not here to cause trouble. I am just here for the key to the Blood Monastery,\" Yuan replied.","\"The Blood Monastery?! Are you trying to desecrate the resting place of our Supreme Rulers?!\" the Supreme Adviser exclaimed, staring at Yuan with a look of disbelief."]},{"number":2467,"title":"Chapter 2467: Bloody Monastery","paragraphs":["\"Not only have you completely destroyed our city, but you even kidnapped our Supreme Ruler! Even if you have the prowess to kill us all, I won’t let you desecrate the Blood Monastery!\" The Supreme Adviser stood tall before Yuan, acting tough. Unfortunately, his body betrayed him by trembling uncontrollably.","Yuan shook his head and calmly spoke in a reassuring tone, \"You can calm down because I have no intention of desecrating the Blood Monastery. I am only trying to get home—to my own world.\"","\"What?\" The Supreme Adviser raised his eyebrows in a puzzled manner.","\"The gateway that connects our world is located in the Blood Monastery, and in order to get home, I have to use that,\" Yuan elaborated.","\"How did you get here in the first place? Can’t you just return using that method?\" The Supreme Adviser questioned.","\"No, because that is a one-way traveling method.\"","\"...\"","The Supreme Adviser fell silent for a moment before speaking again, \"Do you swear on your soul that you’ll not destroy the Blood Monastery and leave this world as soon as possible?\"","Yuan nodded, \"I swear I won’t purposefully destroy the Blood Monastery and will leave as soon as possible.\"","’Won’t purposefully...?’","The Supreme Adviser noticed Yuan’s specific choice of words but decided not to pursue it.","\"Come with me. I’ll take you to the Blood Monastery.\"","The Supreme Adviser said a few words to the people there before leaving with Yuan and Lev.","Some time later, the Supreme Adviser brought them to a location situated outside the City of Blood—a small and modest building that was built with bricks that appeared to have been dyed with blood.","The Supreme Adviser walked to the door and retrieved a crimson key from his spatial ring before unlocking it.","If the key hadn’t been used and someone were to try to force their way inside, a powerful formation that protected the area would have activated, unleashing Demon God’s Wrath upon the offender.","Yuan and Lev followed the Supreme Adviser inside, where a crimson statue of an unfamiliar figure loomed at the far end, and directly before it, a portal stood open.","Without saying a word, the Supreme Adviser entered the portal, with Yuan and Lev entering a moment later.","Since Yuan had been to the Blood Monastery before, he wasn’t worried about any traps.","Upon entering the portal, they were teleported to the real Blood Monastery that existed somewhere within the Crimson Continent.","A massive, cathedral-like structure loomed just ahead, its doors already open, as though it had been expecting them.","Surrounding them was nothing but empty air, making it seem as though they stood upon an island adrift in the sky.","The Supreme Adviser walked to the entrance before halting his movements and speaking in a solemn voice without turning around, \"Is the Supreme Ruler really alive?\"","\"Yes, we didn’t touch him. In fact, he was barely useful and just followed us around.\"","\"I understand.\"","The Supreme Adviser nodded and continued walking, disappearing into the dark halls ahead.","After walking in complete darkness for several minutes, they emerged into a dim, spacious chamber. At its center stood the same statue as before, encircled by fourteen coffins positioned in a deliberate pattern, as though they were bowing in reverence before it.","\"Why are there fourteen coffins? I thought only the deceased were honored here,\" Lev couldn’t help but ask aloud.","Since Supreme Ruler Dena and Supreme Ruler Grant were both still alive, it made no sense to have so many coffins, especially when Supreme Ruler Grant was the fourteenth Supreme Ruler.","Yuan answered in the Supreme Adviser’s stead. \"A coffin is created shortly after someone becomes a Supreme Ruler and placed here, whether they’re dead or still alive.\"","\"In fact, all of these coffins are empty, as not a single Supreme Ruler died of natural causes.\"","Since demons could only die if they were completely annihilated, it was essentially impossible for them to have a corpse to put into these coffins.","\"We are here. Where is the gateway that you speak of?\" The Supreme Adviser turned to Yuan and questioned.","Yuan turned to look at the statue in the middle of the room and pointed at it before suddenly shooting out some Demon Sealing Aura.","\"What do you think you are doing?!\" The Supreme Adviser cried out loud, thinking that Yuan was trying to destroy the statue.","However, when the Demon Sealing Aura struck the statue a moment later, it suddenly vanished into the statue rather than dispersing from the impact.","After a brief moment of eerie stillness, the Bloody Monastery suddenly began to tremble.","At the same time, the space above them rippled violently, unveiling a massive portal that stretched across the entire ceiling.","\"My god!\" The Supreme Adviser stared at the portal in shock and disbelief, wondering how long it had been there.","Meanwhile, Yuan did not immediately enter the portal. Instead, he stood still, silently examining it.","’Since the seal was created from the Nine Heavens’ side, I can barely see it from this side...’","Fortunately, it was likely that he could still remove the seal from this side. Unfortunately, it would take much longer than necessary.","Yuan turned to the Supreme Adviser and said, \"Thanks. You can leave now.\"","\"Hell no!\" The Supreme Adviser immediately shouted. \"Who knows what you’re going to do here during my absence? I will stay here until you are gone!\" He declared.","Yuan gave a nonchalant shrug and said, \"Suit yourself.\"","The next moment, Yuan approached the portal and started working on the seal.","Meanwhile, somewhere within the Seventh Heaven—where the sealed gateway to the Demonic Realm lay hidden—one of the guards stationed there noticed the seal beginning to crack ever so slowly.","\"L-Look! The seal to the Demonic Realm is breaking!!!\"","The guard who noticed it first immediately shouted to alert the others. However, they only slowly turned toward him with unimpressed expressions, clearly not believing a single word he said.","\"I swear on my soul! Just look!\" the guard frowned, hurriedly pointing toward the seal.","Yet the others still remained unconvinced. Shaking their heads, they began lecturing him instead.","\"I know you’re bored, but this isn’t the kind of joke you should be making.\""]},{"number":2468,"title":"Chapter 2468: Demon Slaying Parade","paragraphs":["\"Fuck! I am not joking! Just look! There are cracks on the seal! If I am joking, I will give you guys my paycheck for the next decade!\" The guard shouted angrily.","Hearing this, the other guards finally turned toward the entrance to the Demonic Realm—a pair of enormous gates bound by nine golden chains and surrounded by a semi-transparent barrier.","At first glance, the barrier itself appeared perfectly intact. However, the moment they inspected the golden chains more closely, their expressions changed.","One of the chains had developed visible cracks, despite having remained flawless for millions of years.","\"I-It’s true! There are cracks on one of the seals!\" The guards immediately began to panic.","There were ten guards stationed at the entrance, yet not a single one of them was a Demon Sealer. Instead, they had been jointly hired by the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto, as neither side trusted the other to safeguard the entrance properly on their own.","\"Fuck! What should we do?!\"","\"There’s only one thing to do! Contact the Demon Sealers!\"","Two of the guards swiftly retrieved communication jade slips from their Spatial Rings and contacted their respective superiors—one reaching out to the Demon Sealing Clan, while the other informed the Demon Sealing Grotto.","\"We have an emergency! One of the seals on the entrance to the Demonic Realm has been damaged!\"","\"What do you mean it has been damaged?! Are you under attack?!\"","\"No! It just cracked by itself!\"","\"Damn it! Why does something like this have to happen while the Stairway to Heaven is still missing?! And with the Demon Slaying Parade approaching, no less!\" the Demon Sealer sighed in frustration.","\"Fortunately, this is likely nothing more than minor deterioration caused by age,\" he continued. \"The seal has existed since the Demonic Era, and we already knew it had been gradually weakening over time.\"","\"So what should we do?\" asked the guard.","\"Nothing. Just keep doing your job and watch over it.\"","\"I understand...\"","In the end, both guards received nearly identical responses and were instructed to simply remain vigilant and continue monitoring the seal.","As for the Demon Sealers, neither bothered informing their superiors about the situation, deeming it insignificant. Besides, everyone was already overwhelmed with preparations for the Demon Slaying Parade and the growing activities of the demon worshippers.","Time continued to pass, and as the days drew closer to the Demon Slaying Parade, more and more cracks began appearing across the seal.","\"Hey... what did the Boss say? Are you sure we can ignore it?\" One of the guards asked when he saw that one of the chains was covered in cracks and appeared to be on the verge of shattering.","\"It’s fine,\" said the guard who contacted the Demon Sealers.","\"The Boss assured me that it’s normal and that they are already aware of—\"","Clang!","Suddenly, one of the golden chains shattered, startling everyone there.","\"Uh... I think you should contact the Boss again.\"","The guards contacted the Demon Sealers for the second time shortly later.","\"Senior, one of the seals has shattered!\"","\"What? It shattered? What about the other seals? There should be nine of them.\"","\"The other eight are fine.\"","\"Then ignore it. We will deal with it once the Demon Slaying Parade ends.\"","\"I understand...\"","After closing the call, the guard said to the others, \"He said to ignore it.\"","\"Mine said the same,\" said the other guard.","The guards looked at the eight remaining seals in silence.","\"I guess it will be fine as long as the others are—\"","Before the guard could even finish his sentence, two more seals began to crack simultaneously.","\"...\"","The guards exchanged silent glances with each other, wondering if they should contact their Bosses again.","Meanwhile, people from across the Nine Heavens began gathering at the venue for the Demon Slaying Parade, which existed within its own independent world and functioned similarly to the Myriad of Techniques, allowing visitors from across the Nine Heavens to enter without relying on the Stairway to Heaven.","\"Any news on the Stairway to Heaven? It’s been gone for a few years now.\"","\"I don’t know about the Stairway to Heaven, but I heard that the Celestial Emperor has already hired the God of Creation to forge us a new one.\"","The visitors chatted with each other while they waited for the event to begin.","\"And how long would that take? If it’s even possible to make a new one. There’s a reason why the Stairway to Heaven has remained our only realm-traversing treasure since its creation.\"","\"To think the Stairway to Heaven was created millions of years ago. Whoever made it was way ahead of their time!\"","A different topic was being discussed in another area.","\"When was the last time the Demon Slaying Parade occurred?\"","\"Several thousand years ago, I think.\"","\"The Demon Slaying Parade has happened seven times since the Demon Sealing Clan’s creation, most of them happening shortly after their founder suddenly disappeared without announcing a successor.\"","\"Who is this Yan Hara? I have never heard of her until today.\"","\"From what I’ve heard, she’s a Master Demon Sealer, not even a Supreme Demon Sealer.\"","\"And she’s challenging the leader? Why would she do that?\"","\"According to rumor, she holds a grudge against Qian Chu because she blames him for her failure during the Supreme Demon Sealer Qualifications.\"","\"What? If that’s true, how pathetic.\"","\"Women, am I right?\"","\"...\"","A few days before the Demon Slaying Parade was scheduled to begin, Yan Hara received news of the seal on the Demonic Realm weakening.","\"What?! Since when did it start?!\" Yan Hara exclaimed after hearing the news.","\"About two weeks ago.\"","\"And why am I just hearing about this now?!\" she continued shouting in disbelief.","\"The one in charge of communication thought it was normal and insignificant because the seals had already been weakening for many years now... until six of the nine seals shattered in just two weeks.\"","\"That’s absurd! Who put someone so brainless in charge of something so important?!\" Yan Hara facepalmed."]},{"number":2469,"title":"Chapter 2469: Demon Slaying Parade(2)","paragraphs":["\"What should we do, Senior Yan? Quite frankly, I don’t think the seal will last long enough for us to even do anything about it, let alone fix it.\"","\"Fix it?\" Yan Hara sneered. \"If we could fix it, we would have done so long ago! If the seal breaks, we can only try to ward off the demons that will come pouring out until he comes to reseal it!\"","\"He? Who is this person that can reseal the Demonic Realm?\" The Demon Sealer looked at Yan Hara with his eyebrows raised in a puzzled manner.","\"...\" Yan Hara remained silent for a moment before responding in a nonchalant tone, \"Don’t worry about it.\"","Then, she continued, \"Have all of the Demon Sealers in the Seventh Heaven head to the entrance to the Demonic Realm in case the seal really breaks. Unfortunately, there’s nothing we can do right now.\"","\"What if the seal really breaks and demons come pouring out?\" The Demon Sealer asked in a nervous tone.","\"Although Demon Sealers have gotten weaker compared to before, the rest of the world has become stronger, so even if the Demon Clan invades, we won’t be as powerless as before.\"","\"But just in case, have someone notify the Celestial Emperor of the situation. He is the only one who can traverse the Nine Heavens without the Stairway to Heaven right now.\"","\"I understand.\"","Once the Demon Sealer left, Yan Hara looked at the communication jade slip in her grasp with a slightly worried face.","\"Where are you right now, Yuan?\" she mumbled in a low voice.","Yan Hara tried to contact Yuan, but her message would immediately bounce back to her, meaning that the other end could not receive it, and this would only happen if they were in a place too far away, or in a place that blocked communications.","\"The only thing I can do now is focus on the Demon Slaying Parade and take down Qian Chu! If I don’t do so, the Demon Sealers will never be able to work together!\"","Meanwhile, at the Bloody Monastery, Yuan was still working on the seal.","\"How much longer is this going to take?\" asked the Supreme Adviser.","\"I should be done in a few more years,\" Yuan calmly replied.","Although only two weeks had passed in the Nine Heavens, it had been over a decade since Yuan started working on removing the seal.","Suddenly, the Supreme Adviser turned to face the entrance, where a silhouette could be seen entering the chamber.","\"S-Supreme Ruler!\" The Supreme Adviser cried out loud when he realized it was Supreme Ruler Grant.","\"Oh? Looks like you made it back safely,\" Yuan remarked without looking back.","\"You... Why are you here? I thought you were at Death Paradise?\" Supreme Ruler Grant asked with a puzzled frown on his face.","He returned to the City of Blood very recently, but immediately came to the Bloody Monastery after learning about Yuan’s presence.","\"I was, but now I am here.\"","\"What happened after I left?\"","\"Why do you care? It’s none of your business, anyway.\"","\"...Then why are you here? And what the hell are you doing?\"","Supreme Ruler Grant looked at the massive portal on the ceiling.","\"Don’t you dare say that it’s none of my business because this is very much my business!\"","\"Explain it to him, Lev.\"","Lev nodded and quickly said, \"What you are looking at is the gateway between our world and his world. However, it is sealed from the other side, and he is trying to undo the seal so that he could return to his world.\"","\"The gateway to his world...?\" Supreme Ruler Grant muttered in a low voice with a pondering expression on his face.","Yuan suddenly said, \"If you are thinking about invading my world...\"","\"No, I am not!\" Supreme Ruler Grant quickly cut him off.","\"I was just wondering how long this gateway has been here since this is my first time hearing of such a thing.\"","\"Since Dena was in power, I suppose.\"","\"...\"","\"Speaking of Dena...\" Yuan continued after a brief moment of silence. \"I want you to remove the law that prevents us from uttering her name, as well as mine. Nobody should be killed over uttering a name.\"","Supreme Ruler Grant then said, \"But I wasn’t the one who created this rule.\"","\"Why does it matter? I just want you to remove it.\"","\"Not until the one who made it is dead.\"","\"Is that so? Then who made the rule? Owen?\"","Supreme Ruler Grant nodded.","\"How troublesome,\" Yuan sighed. \"That bastard probably won’t die for a long time...\"","\"Why is that?\"","\"He’s being kept alive so that he could be tortured.\"","\"Don’t tell me the ones torturing him are...\" Supreme Ruler Grant swallowed nervously.","\"Oh, right. Speaking of the Transcedents, don’t be surprised if you see them around. They’re no longer imprisoned within Death Paradise.\"","\"WHAT?!\" Supreme Ruler Grant exclaimed in shock.","Even though he was the Supreme Ruler, he was terrified of the Transcendents’ unfathomable prowess.","\"Relax, it’s not like they are unreasonable serial killers. As long as you don’t offend them, nothing will happen.\"","\"That’s right. As long as you don’t offend us, we won’t kill you.\"","A familiar voice suddenly resounded behind Supreme Ruler Grant, greatly startling him.","\"?!?!\"","Supreme Ruler Grant swiftly turned around to see three pale beauties standing behind him, appearing out of nowhere like ghosts.","\"H-How?! How did you get in here?! I know I locked the doors behind me!\" Supreme Ruler Grant exclaimed.","\"Oh, that? It broke when we tried to get inside. It was by accident. I swear,\" Selena said in a calm voice.","Yuan turned around and asked them, \"What are you guys doing here? I doubt you explored the entire world already.\"","\"We decided to put that on hold for now,\" Selena said. \"Have you thought about what we could do to gain your trust?\"","\"We?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"Yes, since we want to visit your world together.\"","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent with a solemn expression."]},{"number":2470,"title":"Chapter 2470: Demon Slaying Parade(3)","paragraphs":["Yuan fell silent to ponder about the Transcendents visiting the Nine Heavens.","Since Cultivation God was the apex in the Nine Heavens, suddenly throwing an Absolute God into it would undoubtedly cause mayhem.","However, it wasn’t necessarily entirely bad, as it could help advance the cultivation world since it proved that Cultivation God wasn’t the peak.","’If it was just one of them, I would be able to manage, but all three of them?’ Yuan sighed inwardly.","The risks were too high, especially considering their chaotic nature.","\"What are you even worried about?\" Angela suddenly asked aloud.","\"I’m worried that you might cause havoc and I won’t be able to stop you in time,\" Yuan responded with his true feelings and worries.","\"Why would we cause havoc? We’re not barbarians or demons.\" Helena sneered, feeling a little offended.","\"Well... you didn’t exactly give me a good first impression...\" Yuan sighed.","Angela and Helena immediately fell silent after hearing such words, as neither of them could deny that they were aggressive to him in the beginning.","Meanwhile, Selena had been staring at Lev this entire time, seemingly lost in thought.","\"Hmph! Why do we even need your permission to visit your world?\" Angela suddenly sneered. \"It’s not like you own that world, after all.\"","\"It may not be my world, but if I allow you to enter it and you start slaughtering people, then every life lost there will be my fault,\" Yuan said, shaking his head.","\"Can you swear that you won’t harm anyone while you are there?\" Yuan asked.","\"That’s...\"","None of them could bring themselves to make such an oath outright. After all, beings at their level could accidentally kill someone with something as trivial as a sneeze.","Selena suddenly stepped forward and said, \"What if I agree to be your servant while I am there? If you have complete control over me, you wouldn’t need to worry about me being unpredictable.\"","\"What are you saying, Selena?!\" Angela and Helena snapped their heads to stare at her in shock and disbelief.","Even Yuan looked at her with raised eyebrows, surprised by her proposal.","\"There’s no need to lower yourself to the point of becoming his servant just to visit his world!\" Helena said, trying to convince her that it was a terrible idea.","\"If this is how you think you can repay him for freeing us...\" Angela spoke with a frown, \"This isn’t it.\"","Yuan then said, \"She’s right. You don’t have to repay me.\"","Selena shook her head and said, \"This isn’t just about repaying you.\"","\"Then what is it about?\"","Selena opened her mouth but closed it a second later without uttering a word.","\"It’s a secret,\" she eventually said.","\"Is that so?\" Yuan muttered before closing his eyes to ponder.","\"If you become my servant, I will definitely be more at ease with you traveling my world, but I don’t know if that will help me trust you.\"","\"Then what do you want from me?\"","\"Help me clean up some trash,\" Yuan then said, dumbfounding her.","\"You want me... to clean up trash?\" she muttered in a daze.","\"Hey! You’re going overboard! There’s no way—\" Angela said.","\"I don’t mean literal trash—the kind you see lying on the streets,\" Yuan said, shaking his head. \"My world was invaded by Forsaken in the past, bringing unimaginable terror with them. Things are far better now after I wiped out most of them, but some still remain.\"","He then looked at Selena and continued, \"You may visit my world, but while you’re there, you must eliminate every last Forsaken. How does that sound?\"","\"Deal!\" Selena agreed to his request almost instantly.","\"Ah, what about them?\"","Her gaze pointed at Angela and Helena.","\"I will be frank with you,\" Yuan spoke. \"I do not trust them one bit.\"","\"Wha—\"","Angela and Helena’s jaw dropped at his words.","But Yuan wasn’t finished speaking, and he continued, \"Not only do they clearly have bad tempers, but they are the type that believes violence solves everything.\"","\"How could I sleep peacefully knowing that not just one, but two of them are loose in the world?\"","\"Bastard! You’re treating us like rabid dogs!\" Helena shouted while pointing at him.","\"If you’re going to treat us like that, I will bite you like one!\" Angela stomped her feet angrily.","\"You see what I mean?\" Yuan sighed as he shook his head.","\"...\"","Selena gazed at the two with a disappointed yet understanding gaze.","\"As much as I appreciate you trusting me, I cannot leave them behind and explore alone, so unless you trust all of us, I will stay here with them.\"","\"Selena...\"","They looked at her with softened expressions, appearing as though they were on the verge of tears.","After a moment of silence, Angela turned to face Yuan and spoke with a resolute face, \"Then I will also agree to become your servant—at least for as long as we are there.\"","\"Angela?!\" Helena’s eyes widened with surprise.","Angela shrugged and explained her decision, \"It’s not like we are going to be his servants for real, and it will only last until we leave. It will be over by the time we even realize it.\"","Helena took a moment to digest Angela’s reasoning.","After finding it to be quite logical, Helena nodded and said to Yuan, \"Just like Angela, I am willing to be your servant for as long as I am there.\"","\"I think you’re forgetting about something else,\" Yuan said.","\"We’re still...\"","Angela had to think for a second before realizing what Yuan wanted from them and spoke out loud, \"I swear on my soul that I won’t purposefully kill anyone, and I will try to avoid causing trouble as much as possible.\"","Hearing Angela’s words, Helena quickly repeated the same words.","\"Alright.\" Yuan nodded in acknowledgment.","The next moment, he began drawing his blood, creating three watermelon-sized spheres and hovered them before the Transcendents.","Angela and Helena hesitated at first, but when they saw Selena drinking all of it without hesitation, they exchanged glances with each other before following suit."]},{"number":2471,"title":"Chapter 2471: Demon Slaying Parade(4)","paragraphs":["<Selena has accepted your blood>","<You have turned ’Selena’ into a Demonic Servant>","’So they are still considered a Demonic Servant, huh?’ Yuan thought inwardly after seeing the notification, wondering if everyone in the Demonic Realm was classified as one, regardless if they are a Transcendent or not.","<Angela has accepted your blood>","<You have turned ’Angela’ into a Demonic Servant>","<Helena has accepted your blood>","<You have turned ’Helena into a Demonic Servant>","\"Satisfied now, you pervert?\" Angela suddenly remarked.","Yuan looked at her with a raised eyebrow, looking stunned by her random comment.","\"Ahem.\" He cleared his throat before asking them, \"When do you plan on visiting my world?\"","Selena turned to the others and asked, \"What do you two think?\"","\"I will let you decide,\" Helena said.","\"If I have to be honest, I am more interested in his human world than our own,\" Angela said.","Selena nodded, \"I agree, so let’s save the best for last.\"","Yuan then said, \"I still have a couple of years left here, but I doubt that will be enough for you.\"","\"If I have to be honest, besides the Crimson Continent, there isn’t much to explore. I know Death Paradise like the back of my hands, and the Bone Atolls are mostly water.\"","’Exploring the Crimson Continent?’ Supreme Ruler Grant swallowed nervously at her words.","Yuan then said, \"It’ll be easier if you follow me now because once I leave and return to my world, I intend on sealing the gateway again.\"","\"Why don’t you just leave it open? If you’re worried that demons might invade your world, we can make it so that nobody beside us can approach this place,\" Selena said.","\"Um... this is the Bloody Monastery, where we honor our Supreme—\" The Supreme Adviser opened his mouth to speak but hastily shut his mouth after hearing Supreme Ruler Grant’s voice echo inside his head.","\"Shut the hell up, you imbecile! Do you know who they are?! If we offend them, the Bloody Monastery being destroyed will be the least of our worries!\"","Fortunately for them, the Transcedents didn’t even spare a glance for the Supreme Adviser, treating him as if he were invisible.","\"I am not just worried about demons invading my world,\" Yuan shook his head. \"I also don’t want my people to accidentally visit this world—at least not until we clean up all of the Forsaken in my world and explain the truth to them, which will take some time.\"","Selena pondered for a moment before responding, \"In that case, I will go with you now and help you clean up the trash to speed things up. In the meantime, I will explore this place as much as possible.\"","\"No rush.\"","Selena and the others left shortly later while Yuan continued working on the seal.","Meanwhile, two years later—or two days in the Nine Heavens, the Demon Slaying Parade officially began.","A Demon Sealer appeared on the platform before hundreds of thousands of spectators and announced, \"The Demon Sealing Clan welcomes everyone gathered here today. Before we begin the Demon Slaying Parade, we will briefly explain its purpose and offer some insight for those unfamiliar with the details.\"","He continued, \"The Demon Slaying Parade was created after our founder, the Divine Paragon, suddenly vanished. In the past, Demon Sealers would fight one another for his position, and the event was established to make the process less violent and ensure that only those truly qualified could become leaders.\"","\"During the Demon Slaying Parade, the participants—the current leader of the Demon Sealing Clan and the challenger—are given one week to seal as many demons as possible. In order for the challenger to become the next leader, they must seal more demons than the current leader.\"","\"The current leader of the Demon Sealing Clan is Qian Chu, who...\"","The Demon Sealer then went on to recount some of Qian Chu’s background and accomplishments for the spectators.","\"The one challenging Leader Qian for his position is Master Demon Sealer Yan Hara, who...\"","He proceeded to list a few of Yan Hara’s deeds as well, but as one of Qian Chu’s supporters, he presented them in a way that made it seem as though she had accomplished very little.","Shortly afterward, Qian Chu stepped onto the stage to a wave of applause. Yan Hara appeared soon after, only to be met with loud boos from the crowd.","\"Yan Hara, stop messing around and do your job properly!\"","\"While you are trying to usurp a position you don’t qualify for, the demon worshippers are running amok!\"","\"You have already failed to become a Supreme Demon Sealer, so what makes you think you can become the leader?!\"","Some of the spectators even started cursing at her.","\"Ignore these ignorant bastards, Senior Yan!\"","\"You got this, Yan Hara!\"","\"Take down that fraud, Qian Chu!\"","\"Show them the prowess of Divine Paragon’s successor!\"","Of course, there were also some who supported her.","\"What did you just say? Divine Paragon’s successor?\"","When those who were unaware of her identity inquired about it.","\"That’s right! The Divine Paragon was the founder of the Demon Sealing Clan and the very reason we aren’t living as slaves to demons today! Senior Yan is his rightful successor!\" her supporters exclaimed.","\"How is that possible? I thought the Divine Paragon vanished without a successor during the Demonic Era.\"","\"Senior Yan found his legacy, recovering his lost techniques.\"","\"Just because she found his legacy doesn’t mean she’s a legitimate successor.\"","\"Except the Divine Paragon himself left behind a record stating that whoever finds his legacy first will become his successor.\"","While the audience argued back and forth, Yan Hara and Qian Chu stood before a portal that would lead them to the battlefield.","\"I hope you’re ready to lose, Yan Hara. You, who is neither in the God Ascension Realm nor a Supreme Demon Sealer, will never win against me!\"","Yan Hara coldly sneered, \"When it comes to dealing with demons, it’s our Demon Sealing Aura and techniques that truly matter. I will show you the prowess of the Divine Paragon’s techniques, so you better keep your eyes open, you traitor.\""]},{"number":2472,"title":"Chapter 2472: The Demon Slaying Parade Begins!","paragraphs":["\"The Divine Paragon’s techniques? Oh, right. I never thanked you for retrieving them,\" Qian Chu spoke with a cold smile. \"Thanks to you, I will be able to enjoy them after this.\"","\"Speaking as if you’ve already won, huh?\" Yan Hara shook her head.","After a brief moment of silence, a mysterious smile tugged at Yan Hara’s lips before she spoke, \"Oh, right... I heard that you’re neither human nor a demon.\"","The smile on Qian Chu’s face instantly faded at her words, replaced by a deep frown.","\"Where... and whom did you hear that from?\" he muttered in an enraged voice.","Even though she’d deliberately provoked him, Yan Hara was taken aback by Qian Chu’s reaction.","She had never seen him so furious before.","His face twisted so violently with rage it looked as though he were watching his entire family being slaughtered before his eyes—as if Yan Hara had just touched his reverse scale.","But rather than answering Qian Chu’s question, Yan Hara pressed further, \"Seeing your reaction, I guess that information was genuine. If you’re neither human nor demon, just exactly what are you? An artificial demon? A doll? A golem? A zombie? A—\"","\"SHUT THE HELL UP!\" Qian Chu roared, his voice rippling through the entire arena.","His outburst was so sudden and loud that it instantly silenced the crowd, and everyone turned to stare at him with dumbfounded faces.","\"...\"","For a brief moment, the entire arena fell so silent that even a whisper could have been heard from miles away.","Many moments passed, but Qian Chu didn’t say another word, much less explain his outburst. Once it became clear he had no intention of doing so, the crowd pretended it had never happened and resumed talking—only in noticeably quieter tones. In fact, everyone was essentially whispering now, mistakenly assuming Qian Chu had been irritated by their earlier noise.","As for Yan Hara, she let the matter drop and stayed quiet until the Demon Slaying Parade began a few minutes later. Though an amused smile lingered on her face the entire time.","Eventually, the announcer declared, \"Thank you all for your patience! The Demon Slaying Parade will now officially begin! The one-week will start once the participants enter the battlefield!\"","Without another word, Qian Chu moved first, stepping into the portal.","Yan Hara took a deep breath and followed.","When she emerged on the other side, she found herself in a familiar place—the Demons’ Valley, also known as the Valley of Demons, a site the Demon Sealing Clan often used for examinations and training.","Yan Hara looked around, but Qian Chu, who had entered just seconds earlier, was nowhere to be seen.","But she wasn’t surprised, as she knew in advance that they would be separated from the start.","After taking a few seconds to examine her surroundings with divine sense, Yan Hara wasted no time and immediately chased after the nearest demon.","Of course, the demons used for the event weren’t real, but artificial demons. However, that didn’t mean Yan Hara could relax either, as these artificial demons were created specifically for the Demon Slaying Parade and had been tuned to their maximum difficulty.","Barely five minutes after the Demon Slaying Parade began, Yan Hara encountered her first demon and started on sealing it.","\"Looks like Yan Hara has encountered her first demon—a Lower Demon!\" The announcer spoke with enthusiasm for the spectators.","\"There are a total of one hundred and one demons dwelling within the Valley of Demons, but not all of them are equal! There are seventy Lower Demons, twenty Elite Demons, seven Superior Demons, three Demon Generals, and a single Demon Emperor!\"","\"There are five different ranks of demons, and each of them grants a variety of points! Lower Demons grant one point, Elite Demons grant three points, Superior Demons grant ten points, Demon Generals grant twenty points, and last but not least—two hundred points for the Demon Emperor!\"","\"There are two strategies to the Demon Slaying Parade! The participants can either farm all of the weaker demons and slowly amass points, or go straight for the strongest ones for the most points! Of course, if one has the capability, then it would be wiser to go for the latter strategy!\"","\"Oh! Looks like the Clan Leader is going for the second strategy as he completely ignores the Lower Demons and goes straight for the Superior Demon!\"","Half an hour later—","\"The Clan Leader has finally caught up to the Superior Demon and begun sealing it, but in the meantime, Yan Hara has already hunted seven Lower Demons and in the middle of fighting her eighth! And it’s even an Elite Demon!\"","\"Good lord, look how fast that woman is sealing those demons! Is it really as easy as she makes it seem?\" The spectators were left in awe by Yan Hara’s swift hunting, only needing two to three strikes before completely sealing the demons.","\"Of course it’s not as easy as it seems! Even a Supreme Demon Sealer would need a dozen strikes to seal a Lower Demon! And the demons are all at the first level of God Ascension while she’s a mere Immortal, so she’s at a disadvantage!\"","\"Are the techniques she’s using the Divine Paragon’s lost techniques?\"","\"Of course not! She’s not even using any demon sealing techniques and merely using her demon sealing aura to seal the demons!\"","\"What’s the difference?\"","\"Using demon sealing techniques will make one’s demon sealing aura stronger while being more efficient. It works exactly like spiritual energy and martial techniques.\"","The Demon Sealers among the spectators took the opportunity to educate the uninformed audience—while subtly boasting about their own practices and expertise.","\"At this pace, I doubt they will need an entire week to seal all of the demons,\" one of the spectators remarked.","\"I would be surprised if they manage to kill even half of them in a week,\" said a Master Demon Sealer.","\"The higher-ranking demons will not only take much more effort but time to seal. Look at the Clan Leader for example. He’s been fighting the Superior Demon for nearly an hour now, yet he still hasn’t managed to seal it.\"","\"Is that so...\""]},{"number":2473,"title":"Chapter 2473: Two Seals Remaining","paragraphs":["\"What do you think, disciple? Is it up to your expectations?\" Keling, who was sitting in the crowd with Meixiu, asked her.","Meixiu responded, her gaze focused on Yan Hara, \"I think they are still underestimating Yan Hara’s prowess.\"","\"Really? How can you tell?\"","\"From experience,\" she spoke with a dazzling smile that instantly attracted multiple gazes from nearby.","\"I know someone who is an expert, and Yan Hara is giving me similar vibes.\"","\"An expert? You mean that one guy named Yuan?\" Keling muttered with a raised eyebrow.","\"How do you know? I never mentioned that he was a Demon Sealer,\" Meixiu remarked with slightly widened eyes.","Keling rubbed her eyes and sighed aloud, \"My dear disciple, for the last several years, whenever you mention someone, it’s mostly this Yuan fellow.\"","Meixiu blushed at her words and fell silent.","Keling continued, her voice tinged with intrigue, \"My useless brother also mentions him a lot. I cannot wait to meet him myself to see just what the hype is about. When do you think I will be able to see him?\"","\"Hard to say... he’s got a lot on his plate.\"","\"Hmph. I bet that’s just an excuse. If I had a boyfriend, I would visit him as much as possible.\" Keling spoke with her large, muscular arms crossed in front of her chest.","\"You should just find a new partner, disciple—someone who will truly value you. I bet I can easily find a dozen just from this crowd alone.\"","Meixiu shook her head and calmly said, \"He is the only one for me, even if I had to wait another lifetime for him.\"","\"Haaaa...\" Keling sighed again, heavier this time. \"I’m jealous. Truly jealous. If only I could find a boyfriend who cares about me as much as you care about him.\"","Suddenly, Keling noticed someone speaking to Meixiu using voice transmission and intercepted it.","\"Excuse me for bothering you, but I cannot help but—\"","\"Scram, you damn toad! My disciple is too good for you! And she’s already taken!\" Keling interrupted before shooting them away.","\"...\"","The voice immediately stopped, but that did not stop others from trying to speak with Meixiu.","\"Just ignore them,\" Meixiu calmly said, as if she was used to it. \"I have already put up a barrier, so their voices won’t even reach me.\"","Meanwhile, the Demon Slaying Parade continued.","\"After just two hours, the Clan Leader has finally sealed the Superior Demon! As expected of Leader Qian—only he could accomplish it so quickly! Normally, it would take a dozen Master Demon Sealers several days to seal one!\" The announcer continued to glaze Qian Chu without shame.","\"Meanwhile, Yan Hara has moved onto her 20th Lower Demon! Although she has more points than the Clan Leader at this moment, what will she do once she runs out of weak demons to earn points?!\"","Of course, the announcer didn’t forget to subtly mock Yan Hara.","\"Haha! She’s only going for the weakest demons! I wouldn’t want someone so cowardly to be the Clan Leader!\"","\"What a coward! It was impressive at first, but she’s clearly nowhere near the Clan Leader’s level!\"","The crowd began mocking Yan Hara out loud.","\"Who dares to badmouth Senior Yan?! So what if she’s going for the easier points first?! This is a legitimate strategy!\"","Her supporters immediately shot back with their own rebuttals.","With the two groups clashing, it didn’t take long for fights to break out in the audience—though each scuffle was quickly quelled and ended almost as soon as it began.","\"Is she really purposefully just going for the weakest demons?\" Meixiu mumbled in a puzzling voice.","\"What do you mean?\" Keling asked with a puzzled face.","\"It might just be my imagination, but she looks a bit irritated to me,\" Meixiu explained.","\"Is that so...?\" Keling focused on Yan Hara’s face.","\"Looks normal to me. Isn’t that how we all look when we’re seriously focused on something?\" she commented a moment later.","Meanwhile, within the Valley of Demons, Yan Hara was silently cursing.","’I knew these sons of bitches would play dirty! They actually dumped me in the area with the highest number of Lower Demons! Aside from that one Elite Demon, I haven’t seen a single demon that isn’t a Lower Demon!’","It wasn’t that Yan Hara was purposefully hunting Lower Demons. In reality, there were only Lower Demons in her vicinity.","Of course, she could have ignored them and searched for higher-ranking demons, but with plenty of time remaining—and these being easy points—she decided she might as well wipe out all the Lower Demons first.","Unbeknownst to Yan Hara, they hadn’t just thrown her into the area with the most Lower Demons, and they had actually concentrated nearly all of them there. But she would soon come to realize this.","The first day of the Demon Slaying Parade passed in a blur. Yan Hara had hunted thirty Lower Demons and eight Elite Demons, earning fifty-four points. Qian Chu, meanwhile, had hunted three Superior Demons, four Elite Demons, and four Lower Demons, for a total of forty-six points—slightly behind Yan Hara.","Although they encountered demons quite fast in the beginning, it quickly slowed down.","Meanwhile, an entire year had passed in the Demonic Realm, and Yuan had made significant progress on the seal. In just a year, he had broken another seal, leaving only two remaining before the gateway’s seal would be fully removed and the Nine Heavens and Demonic Realm reconnected.","\"Heavens! Another has broken!\"","\"There’s no way it’ll hold until the end of the Demon Slaying Parade!\"","\"We can only hope it holds out until some Demon Sealers arrive at least...\"","The guards, who had done nothing but stare at the seal with bated breath, felt their hearts lurch the instant another layer shattered.","A few hours later, they finally breathed a sigh of relief as Demon Sealers began arriving at the scene.","However, that relief quickly vanished when every Demon Sealer who appeared wore an expression of sheer terror at the situation."]},{"number":2474,"title":"Chapter 2474: The Final Seal to the Demonic Realm","paragraphs":["\"W-What the hell is this?! Why are there only two seals left?!\" The first Demon Sealer to the scene exclaimed in shock after seeing the situation.","\"There should be nine! Nine! What the hell happened here?!\"","The Demon Sealer’s first suspicion fell upon the guards. After all, for seven seals to suddenly vanish without a trace this quickly was simply impossible unless someone had tampered with them.","\"Tell me the truth! Are you imbeciles responsible for this?!\" The Demon Sealer pointed at the guards and shouted.","\"What kind of nonsense is that?!\" The guards exclaimed, looking absolutely bewildered by the Demon Sealer’s random accusation.","\"If we were responsible, why the hell would we even report it?!\" They started defending themselves with logical takes.","\"Moreover, none of us could even get through the barrier to reach the seals!\"","\"You’ve gone too far with that baseless accusation, Demon Sealer!\"","After hearing their words, the Demon Sealer realized his mistake and quickly apologized, \"I’m sorry for jumping to conclusions.\"","\"That was more than just jumping to conclusions! You were being straight delusional!\"","\"Enough of this. I only care about one thing right now—whether you can fix the seals or not,\" one of the guards asked the Demon Sealer, who immediately wore a dumbfounded look on his face.","\"Me? Fix the seals?\" The Demon Sealer pointed at himself and repeated out loud in a dazed voice.","\"If you cannot even fix it, why are you here?\" asked another guard.","\"To hold off the demons until we receive help—if they come!\" The Demon Sealer said in a terrified voice.","\"What?! So we’re really just going to let the demons return and invade our world again?!\"","\"There must be something we can do!\"","The Demon Sealer shook his head and said, \"Unfortunately, only the Divine Paragon can seal the Demonic Realm, and he’s long gone.\"","\"Why does it have to be the Divine Paragon? There are plenty of powerful Array Masters out there who are capable of sealing things,\" asked one of the guards.","\"Do you really think you’re the first one to think of that? We’ve had multiple level 9 Array Masters try, but not a single one of them could keep the Demonic Realm sealed for longer than half a day! Meanwhile, the Divine Paragon’s seal has remained intact for multiple eras!\" The Demon Sealer explained in a loud voice, sounding offended.","\"T-The seal! It’s starting to shatter again!\" One of the guards suddenly shouted.","\"What?!\"","The Demon Sealer snapped his head to look at the seals, and sure enough, one of the two remaining seals had begun to crack.","\"Damn it! The situation is far worse than I was told!\" he gritted his teeth as he retrieved a communication jade slip before talking into it.","\"We need all of the Demon Sealers in the Seventh Heaven to make their way to the entrance to the Demonic Realm as soon as possible! There are only two seals remaining, and one of them is breaking as I am speaking!\"","\"Tell the guys at the Demon Sealing Grotto to come as well! This isn’t the time to fight amongst ourselves! If the Demonic Realm is unsealed, we’re looking at another war with the demons!\"","Once the Demon Sealers understood how dire their situation truly was, every single one of them within the Seventh Heaven dropped whatever they were doing and headed over to the Demonic Realm’s entrance.","Of course, this included those spectating the Demon Slaying Parade.","\"What’s going on? Why are so many of them suddenly leaving? Are they already bored?\"","The Demon Sealers’ sudden, mass departure immediately drew the crowd’s curiosity, not to mention all of them had deep frowns on their faces as they left. This caused many to wonder if something had happened that required their urgent attention.","\"I bet it’s the demon worshippers again. They’ve been so active lately.\"","\"Hey, where are you going? Did something happen?\"","Someone decided to ask, but they were completely ignored.","\"Rude bastards.\"","Although they were curious, they soon put it out of their minds and turned their attention back to the Demon Slaying Parade.","The second day of the Demon Slaying Parade came to end in the blink of an eye.","\"Once again, Yan Hara has decided to completely ignore the higher-ranking demons in favor of hunting the Lower Demons for easy points! However, she won’t be able to keep up with this tactic once they are all gone and only the high-ranking demons remain!\" The announcer said out loud, his voice laced with open disdain.","Meanwhile, Yan Hara finally realized the situation.","’These dirty, foul bastards! If you’re going to cheat, at least make it less obvious! To think they’d try and waste my time like this!\"","Although Yan Hara was annoyed by Qian Chu’s antics, she wasn’t worried in the slightest—in fact, she felt excited.","’I can’t wait to see their faces when I win even with all their cheating,’ she laughed inwardly as she continued sealing demons at a remarkable pace.","As the second day came to an end, so did one of the last two seals to the Demonic Realm.","\"O-One! There is only one seal remaining!\" One of the guards started screaming in terror.","\"Shut the hell up! We can see that!\" The Demon Sealer angrily shouted.","\"Screw this!\" Another guard suddenly shouted, \"I didn’t sign up to fight demons! I quit!\"","Without another word, he flew away, disappearing from the others’ sight.","Once the first guard ran away, the others quickly followed, and in the blink of an eye, only the Demon Sealer remained at the site.","\"These cowardly bastards...\"","Although the Demon Sealer was angry at the guards for running away, he also understood their feelings, as the urge to flee was gnawing at him as well.","\"I didn’t become a Demon Sealer just to run from demons! Besides... if they invade our world again, it won’t matter where we flee, as nowhere will be safe!\" The Demon Sealer clenched his fists so hard that blood began to drip from them."]},{"number":2475,"title":"Chapter 2475: The Full Unsealing of the Demonic Realm","paragraphs":["\"What’s the situation here?!\"","The Demon Sealers that appeared shortly later asked.","\"As you can see for yourselves, there is only one seal remaining, and even that has begun to crack,\" explained the one who arrived first.","\"What?! One seal?! I was told there were two seals!\" One of them exclaimed in shock.","\"There was. Now there is one. That’s just how dire the situation is.\"","\"What should we do?\"","\"What is there to do but brace ourselves for the worst?\"","\"To think we will have to fight demons on a wide scale again...\"","\"At least the world isn’t as weak as it was during our first war with demons.\"","\"And do you think the demons have just been sitting around all this time? There’s a good chance they’ve been cultivating in seclusion, waiting for the day the seal finally breaks!\" one of them sighed aloud.","\"How many demons could possibly remain? If I remember correctly, the Demonic Realm was originally created by the first demon as a hideout. I’d wager most of them were already eradicated by the Divine Paragon long ago.\"","It was still common knowledge that the Red Tyrant had created the Demonic Realm in the Nine Heavens, but that belief was merely an ancient assumption.","Very few people knew the actual truth—that the Demonic Realm was not created at all, but was an entirely separate world where demons had originally come from.","\"Demons are incapable of procreation, right?\"","\"I have never heard or seen a demon child before, so...\"","Unbeknownst to them, that claim was only half true. While demons were indeed capable of reproducing, such a thing only applied to those who had not yet become Forsaken.","And since only the Forsaken had ever invaded the Nine Heavens, it wasn’t strange that no one had ever seen a demon child before.","\"Heavens!\" Someone suddenly shouted. \"The last seal is breaking!\"","\"What?!\"","Everyone turned toward the entrance to the Demonic Realm. Although they had long expected the seal to eventually break, none of them had anticipated it happening so soon, as not even half a day had passed since the last one broke.","\"Is everyone here yet?! Is this every Demon Sealer in the Seventh Heaven?!\"","The Demon Sealers hastily gathered in front of the entrance to the Demonic Realm, preparing to fight at any moment.","However, while the Demon Sealers’ attention remained fixed on the seal, numerous silhouettes silently closed in from the distance, gradually surrounding them without their knowledge.","By the time someone noticed their presence, it was already too late.","\"D-DEMONS! DEMONS ARE HERE!\"","The Demon Sealer who noticed their presence alerted the others.","\"What?!\"","The Demon Sealers quickly spread their divine sense to see hundreds—if not thousands of demons surrounding them.","\"W-What the hell?! Why are there so many demons?!\"","\"Where the hell did they come from?!\"","\"Hahaha! Look over there! The intel was right—the seal to the Demonic Realm really is on the verge of breaking!\"","Meanwhile, the demons were jumping for joy at the sight of the failing seals. Not only were they fully aware of the situation, someone had clearly informed them in advance. Yet the only ones who should have known about the weakening seals were the Demon Sealing Clan, the Demon Sealing Grotto, and the guards who had fled.","\"Someone tipped the demons off about the seals!\"","\"Damn it! Which bastard did this?!\"","\"Whoever informed them betrayed all of humanity!\"","The Demon Sealers quickly grasped the situation and exploded with rage.","\"Kill them all and open the seal to the Demonic Realm! We’re finally going home!\"","The demons didn’t waste any time and began attacking the Demon Sealers shortly after their arrival.","Not only did the demons outnumber the Demon Sealers, but they were also all in the Immortal Realm with a few God Ascension sprinkled within.","In the blink of an eye, the area turned into a battlefield.","\"Instead of killing them, we should turn them into livestock!\"","\"There’s no need for livestock! Once the Demonic Realm is opened, we’ll dominate this world again! There will be no shortage of food, and we’ll be able to feast as much as we want!\"","There were just over three hundred Demon Sealers at the site, but they were falling at a terrifying pace. Within minutes, nearly half had been killed or devoured by the thousands of demons.","Suddenly, the final seal to the Demonic Realm shuddered—then shattered into countless fragments that dissolved into the air.","A powerful ripple swept across the battlefield, briefly halting the demons’ slaughter as it drew all of their attention.","However, even though all of the seals were gone, there was still a powerful barrier that prevented others from approaching the entrance itself.","Without a word, one of the demons abruptly attacked the barrier, throwing its full strength against it—only for the barrier to remain utterly unmoved.","Seeing this, the others followed suit, hurling their attacks at it with all their might.","Gradually, fine cracks began to spread across its surface.","The Demon Sealers desperately wanted to stop them, but they could do nothing except watch, as every ounce of their strength was already spent just trying to stay alive.","Eventually, the barrier shattered, revealing an open, unobstructed path to the Demonic Realm.","\"Home! I can finally go home!\" the demons cried as they surged toward the entrance.","Hundreds of demons swarmed toward the entrance, but they all froze as a human hand suddenly emerged from within, clamping around the throat of the foremost demon, who was just a single step away from crossing over.","That demon instinctively clawed at the hand around its neck, but no matter how much strength it used to break free, the human hand remained unmoving.","At the same time, the hand slowly emerged from the entrance, revealing an arm, then a shoulder. Eventually, a human figure stepped out of the portal, his expression perfectly calm.","\"Y-You are—!\" The demons’ eyes widened in shock and disbelief when they saw his familiar face.","No matter how many years had passed, none of them could ever forget the terror one man had once inflicted on them all.","After a brief, stunned silence, a piercing shriek of terror tore through the air.","\"D-Divine Paragon?!\""]},{"number":2476,"title":"Chapter 2476: The Divine Paragon’s Resurrection","paragraphs":["After leaving the Demonic Realm and returning to the Nine Heavens, Yuan swept the scene with a calm gaze.","\"Huh...\" he muttered before speaking out loud.","\"I wasn’t expecting such a magnificent crowd to welcome my return. Did you stinking fiends really miss me that much?\"","\"D-Divine Paragon?! Are you really the Divine Paragon?! I thought you were dead!\" One of the demons there suddenly cried, his voice trembling with fear and disbelief.","A cold smile tugged at Yuan’s lips as he responded, \"I guess life must have been quite comfortable for you bastards to have forgotten about this handsome face of mine.\"","The demon in Yuan’s grasp suddenly turned into a stone statue.","\"Listen carefully, you cockroaches.\" Yuan began speaking again, his voice cold and deliberate.","\"I, the Divine Paragon, have returned!\"","Then, he tightened his grasp that was choking the sealed demon, shattering it into countless pieces.","After a brief moment of silence, the demons snapped out of their daze and, without hesitation, turned to flee as if their lives depended on it, their faces twisted with absolute terror.","\"Where do you think you’re going?! Didn’t you come here for me?!\"","<Demon Sealing Zone!>","In an instant, a massive barrier was erected around them, imprisoning all of the demons before they could escape.","However, Yuan didn’t completely seal them, merely restricting their movements.","The Demon Sealers stared at Yuan with gawking expressions on their faces, seemingly unable to believe what they were witnessing,","\"D-Divine... Paragon...? Is it really you?\" one of them finally asked, looking as though he were dreaming.","Yuan turned to him in silence.","During the time he was unsealing the Demonic Realm, he had wondered whether the ’Divine Paragon’ should truly return after so long—especially when, in reality, that man had already died.","In the end, Yuan decided to resurrect the Divine Paragon, as it would help him achieve his goals with the most efficiency.","’If I want the Demonic Realm and the Nine Heavens to live in harmony in the future, the Divine Paragon must return...’ Yuan thought inwardly.","As the pioneer of Demonic Sealing Techniques, the first leader of the Demon Sealing Clan, and the savior of the human race during the Demonic Era, there was nobody more qualified to unite demons and humans than the Divine Paragon.","After a moment of silence, Yuan nodded his head with a gentle smile on his handsome face.","\"Sorry it took so long, but I have returned,\" he said.","Unsure of what to say or how to react to the Divine Paragon’s return, the Demon Sealers could only weep in silence, their faces smeared with tears and snot.","Eventually, one of them shouted at the top of his lungs, \"The Divine Paragon has returned!\"","The others quickly followed.","\"The Divine Paragon has returned!\"","\"The Divine Paragon has returned!!\"","\"The Divine Paragon has returned!!!\"","Suddenly, one of the demons spoke in a puzzled tone, \"Why... Why are you coming out of the Demonic Realm?! I thought you sealed it after coming out of the place! So how the hell are you coming out of it now when the seal just broke?!\"","It was a valid question, and even the Demon Sealers fell silent to listen to Yuan’s explanation.","Yuan closed his eyes, giving the feeling that he was reminiscing about a distant past.","He spoke a few seconds later, \"Indeed, I sealed the Demonic Realm. However, after wandering around, I realized that a second entrance existed when I accidentally stumbled upon it.\"","\"Is that why you suddenly vanished and have never been seen since then?!\"","\"Does this mean you’ve been in the Demonic Realm this entire time?!","The Demon Sealers asked with dumbfounded faces. Nobody could’ve ever imagined that the Divine Paragon would disappear to the Demonic Realm after sealing it.","\"W-Wait! What about your legacy?! A Demon Sealer by the name of Yan Hara had claimed to have found your legacy! Does this mean she’s a fraud?!\" One of the Demon Sealers from the Demon Sealing Grotto asked.","Yuan looked at him and asked, \"Does one have to be dead to leave behind their legacy?\"","\"Uh... no?\"","\"After sealing the Demonic Realm, I hid some of my techniques behind just in case something were to happen to me before I could eradicate all of the demons, or if the demons were to return long after I perish. That must have been found by this Yan Hara person,\" Yuan said, pretending not to know her.","\"I see...\"","\"Your Reverence, what about the Demonic Realm? Now that the seal has been undone, more demons will invade our world soon. We should reseal it as soon as possible.\"","Yuan nodded, \"I was the one who undid the seal in the first place, so I will reseal it soon.\"","\"Anyway, let’s go somewhere else to talk. I have a lot of questions about the current state of the world,\" Yuan then said.","\"What about the demons?\" asked one of the Demon Sealers.","Yuan snapped his fingers, and every demon trapped within the Demon Sealing Zone instantly turned to stone, then crumbled into dust.","\"What demons?\" he remarked with a smile after casually eradicating thousands of demons in the blink of an eye, erasing any doubt that he was the Divine Paragon in the process.","The Demon Sealers could only stare in awe, looking like a bunch of children before their idol.","A moment later, Yuan created a temporary barrier around the Demonic Realm before leaving with the Demon Sealers.","Shortly after they left, more figures emerged from the Demonic Realm. It was Lev and the others.","\"So this is his world, huh...?\" Selena muttered, her eyes flickering with excitement and intrigue.","Helena and Angela also took in their surroundings, wearing the same mix of curiosity and wonder.","\"Let’s not linger and leave before more people show up,\" a certain voice spoke, snapping the Transcedents out of their daze.","\"Right, but where do we go?\" Selena asked.","\"Follow me,\" said the Demon Annihilation Sword, leading five figures away from the entrance after opening a hole in the barrier."]},{"number":2477,"title":"Chapter 2477: The Divine Paragon’s Resurrection(2)","paragraphs":["After departing with the surviving Demon Sealers, Yuan was brought to the headquarters of the Demon Sealing Clan located there.","Throughout the entire journey, the Demon Sealers couldn’t stop staring at him.","To them, the Divine Paragon was a legendary figure from the distant past—one of the most important individuals in all of history.","Seeing him with their own eyes was like discovering a priceless treasure thought to have gone extinct long ago.","\"He looks just like the statue in the Grand Library...\"","\"Of course he does!\"","Inside the headquarters, the Demon Sealers treated Yuan as though he were an emperor himself—personally opening doors for him and even dusting off chairs before he sat down.","\"So, how long have I been gone? And how has the world been doing since my disappearance?\" Yuan questioned as sipped on the most valuable tea the Demon Sealers had prepared for him.","\"Your Reverence, it has been millions of years since your disappearance, and the world has changed quite drastically since your era.\"","The Demon Sealers proceeded to recount all of the major events that had occurred since the Demonic Era—from the splitting of the Divine Heavens to the countless incidents that had drastically reshaped their world.","\"Nine Heavens, huh...\" Yuan muttered, pretending to be surprised by the revelation.","\"So, how do people travel between the realms these days?\" Yuan asked afterward.","\"Well...\" the Demon Sealers explained, \"we used to have something called the Stairway to Heaven, which allowed passage throughout the Nine Heavens. Unfortunately, after certain individuals attacked it, the Stairway vanished without a trace and hasn’t reappeared since.\"","\"Does that mean traveling between realms is not possible right now?\"","\"That is correct for the time being, as nobody but those with flying treasures capable of traveling in the starry sky can leave their realm. However, the Celestial Emperor has recently reassured us that they are working on resolving this issue soon with a new treasure.\"","\"Is that so...\"","Although no one knew what had happened to the Stairway to Heaven, Yuan knew exactly where it had gone and how to bring it back.","When he had created the Stairway to Heaven as the God of Creation, he had embedded a defensive mechanism within it.","Whenever the structure came under a sufficiently powerful attack, it would conceal itself and retreat to a hidden location. Minor attacks that couldn’t even scratch it would simply be ignored, but anything capable of potentially damaging the Stairway to Heaven would automatically trigger the mechanism.","Not only that, but it would not reappear until its owner deactivated the mechanism, so if Yuan were dead, the Stairway to Heaven would remain gone forever.","One might think someone could stumble upon it by accident, but the Stairway to Heaven possessed another safeguard, and it would immediately relocate itself whenever it sensed a presence other than its master’s nearby.","And beyond that, a third mechanism rendered the entire structure completely invisible and undetectable.","If all of these mechanisms were to fail... there would be more of them just in case.","Although this much caution may seem overboard, the Stairway to Heaven wasn’t just a treasure meant for traveling the Nine Heavens.","It also functioned as his personal storage, containing countless priceless and even extinct treasures that he’d acquired throughout multiple lifetimes.","\"How’s the Demon Sealing Clan doing?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","An awkward silence quickly filled the room as the members of the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto exchanged uneasy glances with one another.","No one wanted to be the one to tell the Divine Paragon that his Demon Sealing Clan had become disarray—splitting into two factions that were now openly at war with each other.","\"What’s wrong? Why aren’t any of you speaking?\" Yuan pressed when nobody responded.","\"That’s...\"","In the end, the Demon Sealers revealed the truth to him, as nobody dared to lie to him, even if the revelation wasn’t good and could potentially anger him.","\"I see,\" Yuan murmured, closing his eyes, his expression calm and unreadable.","\"I can’t say I didn’t expect it. The Demon Sealing Clan was never an official organization—just something pieced together by a bunch of random people who followed me on their own accord,\" he said a moment later.","\"However, it still saddens me that Demon Sealers are spending more time fighting amongst themselves than demons, defeating their purpose.\"","Hearing his words, the Demon Sealers there all fell to their knees and apologized in union, \"We were wrong! Please punish us as you see fit!\"","Yuan shook his head and sighed. \"What good would punishing you do now? It’d just be a waste of time and effort. Just stop fooling around and focus on being a Demon Sealer. That said, you might not have to stay a Demon Sealer for much longer, as you’ll no longer have a reason to be one.\"","\"By saying that... Do you mean you’ll eradicate all of the demons once and for all?\"","He nodded.","\"Yes, I intend on killing every single demon in this world,\" he declared.","However, he decided not to reveal the truth about the Demonic Realm until he achieved his goal.","The Demon Sealers swallowed nervously at hearing what was essentially their dream. Had anyone else said such words, they wouldn’t have believed it so readily, but coming from the Divine Paragon himself, they accepted it without hesitation.","\"What are the other Demon Sealers doing right now?\" Yuan then asked.","\"That’s...\"","When Yuan mentioned the others, the Demon Sealers immediately realized that they had been so occupied by his presence that they forgot to notify the others of the situation.","\"T-They are currently...\"","They told him about the situation and about the Demon Slaying Parade.","\"Demon Slaying Parade?\" Yuan muttered this unfamiliar name and inquired for more information, and the Demon Sealers provided the information.","\"I see...\" He mumbled. \"So this Yan Hara—who has received my legacy—is fighting for the Clan Leader’s position...\"","Yuan suddenly stood up and said, \"Let’s go.\"","\"Umm... where to...?\"","\"Where else? I want to take a look at my successor and the current leader of the Demon Sealing Clan!\""]},{"number":2478,"title":"Chapter 2478: Yan Hara’s Prowess","paragraphs":["At the Demon Slaying Parade, the spectators and the other Demon Sealers continued watching the event without being aware of the Divine Paragon’s return, as the Demon Sealers in the Seventh Heaven had forgotten to pass on the information.","Although they eventually realized, Yuan asked them to keep his return a secret so as to not cause a major disturbance, and they all obliged without question.","Meanwhile, the Demon Slaying Parade entered its fourth day of the event. By now, all of the Lower Demons and even Elite Demons have been sealed, leaving only the higher-ranking demons.","Although Yan Hara had the advantage during the first three days, Qian Chu quickly caught up when she couldn’t find any demons on the fourth day.","’What is going on?! I cannot find a single demon!’ Yan Hara cried inwardly.","While their event field was massive and would take several days of nonstop traveling to cover, the demons shouldn’t be so hard to find, especially since the demons were programmed to approach the participants. Yet, in Yan Hara’s case, it was more like the demons had been programmed to avoid her!","As for Qian Chu, it was needless to say that he did not have such an issue, and he would encounter demons one after another with barely any down time.","\"What’s Yan Hara doing?! She’s been avoiding demons for half a day now after sealing the Lower and Elite Demons!\"","\"Is she really avoiding them? It looks like she’s trying to find them but is failing to do so in my eyes...\"","\"She probably doesn’t know that all of the weakest demons have been sealed.\"","\"That doesn’t make any sense at all. There’s no way she’d challenge Qian Chu if that’s all she’s capable of.\"","\"She would if she’s mentally challenged!\"","The spectators had split opinions on Yan Hara.","\"Qian Chu, you crafty bastard!\" Yan Hara suddenly shouted out loud, \"I can’t believe that you’re so terrified of losing that position to me that you’d cheat like this!\"","Her voice rippled throughout the Valley of Demons, reaching Qian Chu, who was on the other side.","However, there were no sounds for the displays watched by the spectators, so they were unaware of what she said except for a few that managed to read her lips.","Yet, even knowing what she said, nothing was done, as nobody could prove that she was being genuine or just slandering Qian Chu out of anger.","Of course, in order to not make things too obvious, the demons didn’t avoid Yan Hara for too long, and near the end of the fourth day, they started appearing for her.","After nearly an entire day of acquiring zero points, Yan Hara was ecstatic when she finally encountered a demon, even if it was just a Superior Demon.","\"Die!\"","She lunged at it with enthusiasm, unleashing not only her Demon Sealing Aura but, for the first time in the Demon Slaying Parade, a full Demon Sealing Technique.","A terrifying surge of Demon Sealing Aura—nearly triple what she’d shown thus far—erupted from Yan Hara’s body, revealing to everyone that she had been holding back this entire time.","\"Divine Demon Sealing Strike!\"","Sha!","With just a single strike, Yan Hara completely sealed a Superior Demon that had the cultivation of second-level God Ascension, shocking all of the Demon Sealers watching.","\"Heavens! Did she just seal a Superior Demon with one strike?!\"","\"That amount of Demon Sealing Aura is far superior than the Clan Leader’s! And there’s a good chance that she’s still hiding more of it!\"","Yan Hara’s supporters could hardly contain their excitement after witnessing Yan Hara’s prowess for the first time.","Many of them initially followed her because of her status as the Divine Paragon’s successor, but after seeing her in action for the first time, their support for her became even more resolute and justified.","Meanwhile, all of Qian Chu’s followers wore deep, worried frowns on their faces. None of them have anticipated Yan Hara being this powerful.","\"Hm? Isn’t that a Superior Demon? The same kind that took the Clan Leader two full hours to seal? And she did it in a single strike—faster than when she dealt with the weakest demons?\"","When they saw this, the spectators—at least those who weren’t paid by Qian Chu’s supporters—immediately realized that something was amiss.","After all, Yan Hara had just proved that she could deal with the high-ranking demons as easily as the low-ranking ones, so it made no sense for her to avoid them in the beginning.","Eventually, those who read her lips when she cursed at Qian Chu understood the situation—that Yan Hara never purposely avoided the high-ranking demons and that only low-ranking demons were available for her.","\"Unbelievable! Is the Clan Leader really cheating during the Demon Slaying Parade?!\"","It didn’t take long before Qian Chu became a target for the audience.","\"There’s no way! I bet it’s Yan Hara who’s cheating!\"","Of course, Qian Chu’s supporters fiercely fought back, even if their defenses made no sense.","\"How could she be cheating?!\"","\"She definitely snuck a treasure inside! I bet she won’t be able to repeat what she just did!\"","Yet, Yan Hara proved them wrong again during her next encounter with a Demon General.","\"Demon Sealing Zone!\"","\"Swords of Eternal Torment!\"","Yan Hara unleashed the Divine Paragon’s lost techniques for the first time to the public.","Although Yan Hara couldn’t seal the Demon General with a single strike, she was able to face it without any trouble, and several minutes later, the Demon General turned into a stone statue.","\"Hahaha! Do you see that?! That is the Divine Paragon’s true successor!\"","After witnessing her overwhelming prowess, her supporters could not contain their excitement and rose to their feet, applauding loudly for her.","Qian Chu’s supporters exchanged silent gazes with each other, looking like they’d just fell face-first into a pile of dog shit.","\"Looks like we have to do ’that’...\" one of them sighed in a low voice."]},{"number":2479,"title":"Chapter 2479: Yan Hara’s Prowess(2)","paragraphs":["\"Yan Hara... she’s become so powerful that I don’t even recognize her anymore...\"","The Demon Sealers familiar and close with Yan Hara were stunned speechless by her overwhelming prowess, feeling like they were witnessing the birth of a new legend.","Meanwhile, the public spectators and Qian Chu’s supporters were left in awe by the Divine Paragon’s techniques.","\"So those are the techniques that made the Divine Paragon into the legend that he is, huh?\"","\"Of course not! The Divine Paragon would still be legendary even if he didn’t have any techniques! It was his obsession with slaying demons and his fearless demeanor that truly made him so awesome!\"","\"Hmph.\" Someone sneered in disdain before saying, \"I think the stories of Divine Paragon were exaggerated and blown way out of proportion. How can a single mortal create Demon Sealing Aura and single-handedly defeat the demons? It makes no sense!\"","When the Demon Sealers heard his words that were no different than blasphemy in their ears, they cursed at him, including Qian Chu’s supporters, which didn’t surprise Yan Hara’s supporters in the slightest.","After all, regardless who they supported right now, none of them would be there if it weren’t for the Divine Paragon.","Inside the Valley of Demons, Yan Hara continued her domineering display of Divine Paragon’s techniques and her fearsome Demon Sealing Aura by sealing every demon with ease, quickly catching up to Qian Chu’s points, and by the fifth day, she’d surpassed him again.","However, she would not encounter another demon again until the end of the fifth day. Yet, at the pace she was sealing demons, her points were still in a safe position.","As the sun began to rise on the sixth day, Yan Hara sensed a powerful presence quickly approaching her direction.","\"What a powerful presence!\" Yan Hara muttered in surprise.","There was no doubt that this presence belonged to the one and only Demon Emperor in the Demon Slaying Parade.","However, Yan Hara wasn’t sure what to think of its appearance.","\"Did Qian Chu send the Demon Emperor to me because he thinks it would be able to stop me?\" she wondered out loud.","\"And this presence... why does it feel familiar?\"","Soon, the Demon Emperor arrived before her.","\"...\"","Yan Hara did not immediately attack and silently observed it with narrowed eyes.","The Demon Emperor did the same, almost as if it were waiting for Yan Hara to act first.","Even without exchanging blows or words, Yan Hara could sense that something about the demon before her was different... unsettlingly so.","Artificial demons, while realistic and capable of radiating intense malice and bloodlust, always felt hollow in some indescribable way. Yet the demon standing before her felt disturbingly alive, as though it were a genuine demon.","’A real Demon Emperor...? No, there’s no way...’","Even though Yan Hara believed Qian Chu would stoop to any low to preserve his position, she never imagined he would be capable of commanding a real Demon Emperor, much less smuggling one into the Demon Slaying Parade with so many spectators.","It was almost as if he no longer cared about keeping his image.","\"So you are the Divine Paragon’s successor, huh? Where is the Divine Paragon right now?\" The Demon Emperor suddenly spoke to Yan Hara through voice transmission, startling her.","\"W-What are you talking about?\" Yan Hara subconsciously responded.","\"There’s no need to play dumb. I know that the Divine Paragon is still alive,\" said the Demon Emperor, dumbfounding Yan Hara even more.","\"You are...\" Yan Hara snapped out of her daze and finally realized why the demon’s presence felt so familiar.","\"You are the Demon Emperor I fought during the Supreme Demon Sealer’s Qualification!\" Yan Hara exclaimed in disbelief.","\"Oh? You recognize me even though I have changed my appearance? Not bad...\" Demon Emperor Carnage remarked with a calm smile.","\"Why are you—\" Yan Hara wanted to ask what he was doing there but cut herself off when she realised that she already knew the answer to that question.","\"So even a Demon Emperor like you is working for Qian Chu, huh? Makes me even more curious about his true identity!\"","\"Working for Qian Chu?\" Demon Emperor Carnage burst out laughing. \"I am a Demon Emperor! I have no need to work for anyone, nor have I ever worked for Qian Chu!\"","\"Then what are you doing here?\" Yan Hara frowned.","\"I wanted to meet the Divine Paragon’s successor and... devour them!\" Demon Emperor Carnage said with a cold smile.","\"Devour me...?\" Yan Hara echoed, a similar smile tugging at her lips. \"Ever since that disastrous incident, I’ve wanted to fight you again and erase that humiliation. To think I would get the chance so soon!\"","\"You may be the Divine Paragon’s successor, but you are far from being my match!\" Demon Emperor Carnage launched the first strike.","\"Rain of Carnage!\"","\"Demon Sealing Zone!\"","As Yan Hara and Demon Emperor Carnage began their clash, Qian Chu stopped his hunt and turned to look in their direction.","\"So it has started...\" he mumbled before returning to his hunt.","Meanwhile, the spectators stirred with renewed excitement, the arena buzzing with hype.","\"Looks like Yan Hara has encountered the Demon Emperor! Let’s see whether she can deal with it like she did with the others!\"","\"Once she defeats the Demon Emperor, her victory will be secured, even if Qian Chu seals the remaining demons!\"","Shortly later, the Demon Sealers from the Seventh Heaven returned to the venue.","\"Huh? Why are you guys back already? What happened to the Demonic Realm?\" The other Demon Sealers questioned them with puzzled faces.","\"Uhh...\" The Seventh Heaven’s Demon Sealers hesitated for a moment before responding, \"The Demonic Realm is secure, so we returned.\"","\"What? How is that possible? Unless you managed to fix the seals, there’s no way it’s secure! Tell us what really happened!\"","\"Wait... what happened to the rest of you? And who is that guy with the mask?\"","They finally noticed Yuan, who was following them while wearing a mask that concealed his face."]},{"number":2480,"title":"Chapter 2480: Too Dangerous to Be Left Alive","paragraphs":["When the Demon Sealers pointed at Yuan, the Seventh Heaven’s Demon Sealers began sweating profusely, not knowing how to introduce him without sounding suspicious.","However, Yuan completely ignored them and walked away, acting like they weren’t together.","\"Huh? He wasn’t with you guys?\"","They silently shook their heads.","\"Anyway, what happened to the Demonic Realm and the others?\"","After a moment of silence, one of them finally gave in and revealed, \"We were ambushed by demons.\"","\"What?!\"","\"Why would the demons appear now of all times?!\"","\"I don’t know, but it definitely wasn’t a coincidence that they attacked at such a crucial time. Someone in the clan must have told them.\"","\"Y-You—! Are you saying that a Demon Sealer has betrayed humanity, being a spy for the demons?! That’s a grave accusation!\"","\"I’m aware, but aside from the Demon Sealers and the Celestial Emperor, no one else even knows about the situation concerning the Demonic Realm. Or are you suggesting that the Celestial Emperor—\"","Before he could finish, someone hastily covered his mouth and hissed in a lowered voice, \"Bastard! Are you trying to offend the Heavens?! There’s no way the Celestial Emperor would ever aid the demons!\"","\"So what happened afterward?\"","\"Although we had a lot of casualties, we managed to stop the demons from destroying the seal.\"","\"I see... It’s unfortunate that we lost so many Demon Sealers during such a critical period, but you’ve done well.\"","The Demon Sealers merely shook their heads and sighed, not even bothering to ask how many demons had appeared. In their eyes, if the Demon Sealers of the Seventh Heaven had been capable of handling the situation, then the number of demons couldn’t have been too significant.","Unbeknownst to them, the number of demons that had appeared was in the thousands—a force so overwhelming that even the full strength of the Demon Sealing Clan would have struggled to contain it.","\"So what about the Demonic Realm itself? What about the seals?\"","They proceeded to ask about the most important subject again.","After a moment of silence, the Demon Sealers of the Seventh Heaven responded, \"The seal was fixed.\"","\"Fixed?! By whom?\"","\"Sorry, but we don’t know. He appeared out of nowhere, fixed the seal, and then vanished again like a ghost.\"","The Demon Sealers lied without batting an eye, clearly willing to say anything necessary to keep the Divine Paragon’s return a secret.","Meanwhile, the other Demon Sealers stood frozen like statues, bewildered expressions on their faces as they struggled to process the nonsense they’d just heard.","Who could possibly fix the seals besides the Divine Paragon? And how reliable were the seals?","\"How—\"","\"OOOOH!\"","Suddenly, a loud commotion burst from the spectators’ stands behind them, startling everyone present.","Inside the Valley of Demons, after several hundreds of exchanges between Yan Hara and Demon Emperor Carnage, it was clear who had the advantage.","Demon Emperor Carnage looked at his right arm, which had just been sealed, with a deep frown on his face.","\"What’s wrong, you fiend? I thought you were going to devour me,\" Yan Hara remarked with a mocking smile on her face.","\"I see that I have underestimated you—\"","\"You won’t be able to defeat me,\" Yan Hara interrupted.","\"What was it called? Demon Emperor Nightmare? That demon was much stronger than you.\"","\"Demon Emperor Nightmare?!\" Demon Emperor Carnage’s eyes widened at this nostalgic name.","\"You’ve fought against Nightmare?! That’s impossible! He was sealed by the Divine Paragon ages ago!\"","Yan Hara shrugged, not willing to put in the effort to explain.","Demon Emperor Carnage narrowed his eyes.","\"I have changed my evaluation of you,\" he said in a low voice. \"Although you’re not as ridiculous as the Divine Paragon, you’re still too dangerous to be left alive.\"","He retrieved a crimson-colored marble and crushed it, shattering it into countless fragments.","\"What the hell are you...\"","Yan Hara’s body stiffened when she sensed multiple powerful presences suddenly appearing nearby.","One... five... ten...","In the blink of an eye, over a hundred demons surrounded Yan Hara, all of them at least a Superior Demon.","\"W-What is happening?! Why are there suddenly so many high-ranking demons?!\"","The spectators were left utterly stunned by the sheer number of demons that had appeared—far exceeding what should have existed within the event.","\"A trap! It’s a trap! Those bastards are trying to kill Senior Yan!\"","Her supporters shouted in disbelief as they grasped the situation. Without hesitation, they drew their weapons and charged toward the portal leading to the Valley of Demons.","However, Qian Chu’s supporters swiftly reacted and blocked their path to the portal.","\"Stop! What do you think you’re doing?!\"","\"I should be asking you that! Why are you blocking us?!\"","Yet, Qian Chu’s supporters offered no explanation and continued to block them.","Realizing that the others had no intention of allowing them to assist Yan Hara, her supporters immediately made their move, attacking without hesitation.","Meanwhile, the audience could only watch in stunned bewilderment, utterly unprepared for such an abrupt turn of events.","Before long, the audience began fleeing the venue, afraid that the situation would spiral out of control and drag them into the conflict as well.","\"Meixiu, we should leave as well. There’s no telling what will happen from here,\" Keling said to her.","Meixiu remained silent for a moment before giving a small nod. \"Let’s go.\"","However, just as she rose to leave with her master, her entire body suddenly stiffened, her gaze locking onto a certain masked figure wearing full black in the crowd.","Although many people there wore masks, something about this individual inexplicably stood out to her.","\"Meixiu? What’s wrong?\" Keling stopped after taking a few steps upon realizing that Meixiu had suddenly frozen in place.","However, Meixiu gave no response, her eyes fixed ahead as though lost in a trance.","Seeing this, Keling followed her line of sight toward the masked individual, who stood there calmly watching Yan Hara on the display with an almost eerie stillness."]},{"number":2481,"title":"Chapter 2481: Masked Figure","paragraphs":["Keling narrowed her eyes at Yuan the moment she noticed him—or rather, noticed the lack of presence surrounding him, as though she were staring at a ghost instead of a living person.","’Who the hell is that? Even though I cannot sense his presence, my instincts are screaming at me to not approach him!’ Keling swallowed nervously when she realized that she felt fearful toward this individual that she wouldn’t have even noticed if it weren’t for Meixiu.","Keling was a renowned cultivator, famed for her unshakable will. Those who knew her often claimed she was incapable of fear—that she could face even the most terrifying trials with a smile.","Yet at this very moment, she felt a fear so instinctive and overwhelming that she didn’t even dare probe the unknown figure with her divine sense.","\"W-We need to leave immediately...\" Keling mumbled in a low voice, as if not wanting to attract the masked man’s attention.","She grabbed Meixiu’s arm and forcefully dragged her away.","\"Master, what are you...?\" Meixiu muttered in surprise at her odd behavior.","As if reacting to the sound of Meixiu’s voice, the masked figure suddenly turned to look in their direction—or more specifically—at Meixiu.","\"?!?!\"","Keling’s eyes trembled the moment the masked figure’s gaze met hers... or so she thought.","Without the slightest hesitation, she grabbed Meixiu and fled at full speed, her entire body drenched in cold sweat.","However, before they could get far, the masked man suddenly vanished from his spot and appeared directly before them, blocking their path.","’Void Manipulation?!’ Keling hastily stopped herself, nearly tripping over in the process.","Then, before they could even exchange a word, Keling withdrew her weapon—a massive bow that was larger than her own tall frame and pointed it at him.","\"What do you want from us?!\" Keling roared, sounding like a cornered mother desperately trying to protect her helpless daughter.","Despite being an expert at the sixth level of God Ascension while the masked man before her was only at the third level, she felt not the slightest trace of confidence facing him.","On the other hand, Meixiu felt no sense of danger from his presence. If anything, she felt strangely reassured, as though she instinctively knew he would never harm them.","\"SPEAK!\" Keling demanded in a forceful voice.","\"I...\"","\"Yuan?\"","Meixiu suddenly stepped around Keling and approached the masked man. Even though it had been years since they last met, she would never forget his eyes or how he would look at her with love.","Yuan smiled behind his mask and calmly nodded, \"It’s me.\"","\"W-Wha—?\" Keling’s jaw dropped to the ground.","\"Yuan!\"","Meixiu leapt forward without hesitation, arms wide, and wrapped herself around him in a fierce embrace.","\"I’ve missed you...\" she mumbled in a low voice.","\"Me too.\"","A long moment of silence later, Yuan asked, \"What are you doing here? Are you the only one here?\"","\"I heard the Demon Sealing Clan was doing something important and wanted to take a look,\" she replied. \"And I came here alone with my master.\"","\"Your master, huh?\" Yuan adjusted his gaze slightly to look at Keling, who was staring at them with a bewildered face.","’Why does she look so familiar?’ Yuan wondered inwardly after seeing her face more closely.","Then he noticed her large physique and bulging muscles, reminding him of a certain individual.","\"What’s your relationship with Kelan?\" he asked.","However, Keling was too stunned to respond, so Meixiu responded in her stead, \"She’s Keling, Kelan’s elder sister.\"","\"I see...\"","Eventually, Keling regained some of her composure and put away her weapon.","\"So you’re Yuan... I have heard a lot about you from my useless brother and my disciple,\" she said.","\"I apologize for pointing my weapon at you just now. You look too suspicious with that mask.\"","Yuan shook his head.","\"It’s fine. I can tell that you just wanted to protect Meixiu. Thank you for caring for her.\"","\"It’s my responsibility as her master,\" she said, her chest slightly raised.","\"Yuan... about this situation...\"","Meixiu finally spoke about the elephant in the room.","Yuan turned to the Demon Sealers tangled in combat and sighed, \"I’ll deal with it.\"","The very next moment, Yuan leaped directly into the center of the action, where Yan Hara’s supporters and Qian Chu’s supporters were clashing with the intent to kill.","\"That’s enough.\" Yuan spoke in a calm voice that echoed throughout the area.","Even if the Demon Sealers wanted to continue fighting, Yuan’s voice carried an immense amount of Soul Strength that shook their souls to the extent of stunning them, which temporarily restricted their movements.","\"Who the hell are you?!\"","\"This is none of your business, so keep your nose out of it!\"","\"If we stop now, they will kill Senior Yan!\"","The Demon Sealers angrily shouted at him after being interrupted.","To their surprise, Yuan started chuckling, as if he found the situation amusing.","\"What the hell is so funny, you bastard?!\"","Yuan turned to look at Yan Hara’s supporters and said, \"You have been so busy fighting that you failed to notice Yan Hara’s brilliance.\"","\"What...?\"","Yuan gestured toward the display and said, \"Take a look for yourself—whether Yan Hara is in trouble or not.\"","Everyone present turned toward the display at the same time.","\"T-This is—!\"","To everyone’s shock—especially Qian Chu’s supporters—Yan Hara was not only holding her ground against over a hundred demons by herself, but she was even beginning to gain the upper hand as she sealed the demons one by one.","\"How is that possible?! Even if she possesses the Divine Paragon’s techniques, how can she use them so frequently?! Where the hell is she getting so much Demon Sealing Aura from?!\"","At this moment, Yan Hara appeared to possess an inexhaustible supply of Demon Sealing Aura, unleashing the Divine Paragon’s techniques one after another without the slightest pause.","It was common knowledge that, unlike spiritual energy, Demon Sealing Aura could not be enhanced through treasures and external resources. The only way to strengthen it was through painstaking effort and time.","Yet somehow, Yan Hara had managed to improve her Demon Sealing Aura to such a terrifying extent within an impossibly short period of time.","\"Is that really the Yan Hara I know, or someone else disguised as her?!\""]},{"number":2482,"title":"Chapter 2482: Trusting Yan Hara","paragraphs":["Inside the Valley of Demons, Yan Hara laughed madly as she sealed one demon after another.","\"Is this all you’ve got, Demon Emperor?!\"","\"Swords of Eternal Torment!\"","\"Demon Sealing Zone!\"","In the blink of an eye, over half of the demons that ambushed her turned into stone statues.","\"What the hell is going on?! Why is she so powerful?!\"","\"How come I have never heard of her name before? Where did this monster come from?!\"","The demons were left utterly dumbfounded by Yan Hara’s overwhelming prowess, reminding them of the Divine Paragon.","\"What should we do, Emperor Carnage?\"","\"At this rate, we’ll all be sealed by that woman!\"","The remaining demons turned to Demon Emperor Carnage for guidance.","\"Tch...\" Demon Emperor Carnage sucked his teeth with an irritated frown on his face.","He could’ve never anticipated that the woman who was powerless before him not long ago would become so disgustingly powerful.","\"We’re leaving!\" Demon Emperor Carnage said before turning around to flee.","\"Where do you think you’re going?\" Yan Hara’s eyes widened with surprise when the demons suddenly turned to flee, and she immediately gave chase.","Even when the demons scattered in different directions, Yan Hara continued chasing without any hesitation or pause, her target being Demon Emperor Carnage from the very start.","\"I will seal you even if it’s the last thing I do!\" Yan Hara shouted, her voice echoing loudly through the valley.","After nearly an entire hour of chasing, Demon Emperor Carnage came to a sudden halt and turned around to face Yan Hara.","\"Have you finally accepted your fate?!\" Yan Hara laughed as she attacked without the slightest delay.","However, just as she struck at Demon Emperor Carnage, Yan Hara sensed a faint presence materialize behind her like a ghost.","Before she could fully react, a burst of spiritual energy exploded at her back, and a searing pain tore through her.","*Cough*","Yan Hara crashed to the ground, coughing up a mouthful of blood.","\"Which bastard—?!\" Yan Hara whipped around to face her assailant, and to her utter shock, she found herself staring at a familiar face.","\"Qian Chu!\" she growled, her voice low and venomous, as though she were facing her archenemy.","Meanwhile, outside the Valley of Demons, the Demon Sealers and spectators that didn’t leave were puzzled when the display suddenly vanished.","\"What the hell?! What happened to the broadcast? It was just getting to the good part!\"","The display had turned off right when Demon Emperor Carnage stopped to face Yan Hara, so nobody there knew about Qian Chu’s sneak attack.","\"What is the meaning of this?!\" Yan Hara’s supporters immediately questioned Qian Chu’s supporters.","\"W-We have nothing to do with this!\" one of them said.","\"How can we trust you at this point!\"","\"Open the portal! We’re going inside!\"","\"What are you all so worried about? It’s not like she can’t handle a Demon Emperor. I’m sure it’s only temporary, and the display will be fixed soon.\"","Hearing this seemingly reasonable explanation, Yan Hara’s supporters calmed down slightly—though they couldn’t completely shake the unease gnawing at their hearts.","Ten minutes slipped by, yet the display did not return. Then half an hour passed—still nothing.","After a full hour without any sign of the projection coming back, Yan Hara’s supporters could no longer endure it and demanded the portal be opened.","However, Qian Chu’s supporters refused, insisting that interfering would invalidate the Demon Slaying Parade and that they had to wait until the event concluded before entering.","\"There’s only one day left... we should have some more faith in Senior Yan.\"","\"Once the Demon Slaying Parade is over tomorrow, Senior Yan will become the next leader of the Demon Sealing Clan!\"","\"Right! Let’s trust Senior Yan!\"","Not far away, Meixiu and Yuan sat side by side, watching events unfold.","\"What do you think?\" Meixiu asked, leaning into him, her head resting on his shoulder.","\"She will be fine,\" he responded.","\"How can you be so sure?\" Keling, who was sitting behind them, asked.","\"I just do.\"","While everyone anxiously awaited the end of the Demon Slaying Parade’s final day, Yan Hara continued fighting both Demon Emperor Carnage and Qian Chu at the same time, all while still injured from the earlier sneak attack.","\"What happened to your energy from before, huh?!\" Demon Emperor Carnage laughed out loud as he bombarded Yan Hara with powerful blood techniques.","Although Yan Hara could deal with Demon Emperor Carnage, Qian Chu’s attacks were a different story. Not only was Qian Chu not affected by Demon Sealing Aura, but his cultivation was also superior.","\"Do you have no shame, Qian Chu?! Not only did you ambush me, but you’re working alongside a Demon Emperor!\" Yan Hara shouted angrily as blood covered nearly every inch of her body.","Qian Chu calmly stared at her and responded in a nonchalant voice, \"You can blame nobody but yourself for stepping out of your boundaries, Yan Hara. Had you not coveted my position, you wouldn’t be in this situation right now.\"","\"Is this really about your position, or is this about something else?\" Yan Hara glared at him.","\"Hmph.\" Qian Chu coldly sneered. \"I have no time to chat nonsense with you. Hand over the Divine Paragon’s legacy and we’ll give you a painless death.\"","\"...\"","Yan Hara fell silent, blood dripping from her face.","\"The Divine Paragon’s legacy... you can forget about it because I will never hand it over,\" she muttered a moment later.","\"Then I will just retrieve it from your corpse.\" Qian Chu sneered. \"There are plenty of methods to retrieve memories from a corpse, after all.\"","\"You will never get away with this!\" Yan Hara roared.","\"I have no intention of running away,\" Qian Chu calmly revealed.","\"Once I open the Demonic Realm, I will plunge this—and that world into complete chaos!\"","\"What...?\" Yan Hara frowned at his puzzling words, even wondering if she’d heard him correctly.","As if he could read her mind, Qian Chu suddenly said, \"You heard me correctly.\"","\"But why—\"","Yan Hara opened her mouth to ask, but Qian Chu attacked before she could finish, unleashing a technique that was too massive to avoid.","\"Damn it...\" Yan Hara cursed in a low voice, closing her eyes as she silently accepted her fate."]},{"number":2483,"title":"Chapter 2483: End of the Demon Slaying Parade","paragraphs":["\"DIE, YAN HARA!\" Qian Chu laughed maniacally as he unleashed a massive technique toward her.","In the next instant, millions of crimson shards shot toward Yan Hara’s bloodied figure like a devastating storm.","Yan Hara slowly closed her eyes, accepting her fate.","Yet at that very moment, a certain figure suddenly surfaced in her mind—calmly gazing at her with a reassuring smile on his face.","’Yuan...’","The moment Yan Hara saw his face in her mind, she gritted her teeth and abruptly reopened her eyes.","A powerful surge of Demon Sealing Aura erupted from her body, and just before Qian Chu’s attack could reach her, a flag suddenly materialized out of thin air.","Its fabric wrapped around her in a protective embrace, shielding her as countless crimson shards crashed against it.","\"What?!\" Qian Chu exclaimed in shock, his eyes widening in disbelief at the sudden appearance of the Demon Sealing Flag.","\"Hey... isn’t that your...\" Demon Emperor Carnage looked at him with a puzzled face.","\"No! It can’t be the Demon Sealing Flag!\" Qian Chu hastily responded.","After all, the Demon Sealing Flag was in a secure location that only he knew. There was simply no way Yan Hara could have stolen it without him knowing.","Yet, the treasure that protected Yan Hara looked identical to the Demon Sealing Flag, and it was unlikely that a replica would be able to block his attack perfectly.","Once the attack ended, the Demon Sealing Flag unwrapped Yan Hara, revealing that she was completely unharmed.","\"This is...\" Yan Hara stared at the Demon Sealing Flag with a surprised face, looking as puzzled as Qian Chu.","Before she could even open her mouth to speak, Qian Chu gestured at it, commanding it to return to his possession.","If it was truly the Demon Sealing Flag, it would listen to his command.","The Demon Sealing Flag trembled slightly in response, but it did not move an inch.","Seeing this, Yan Hara subconsciously copied his movements and gestured at it with a grasping motion, and to Qian Chu’s bewilderment, it flew directly into her grasp.","\"How dare you...\" Qian Chu trembled in anger.","Even if the Demon Sealing Flag was a fake, the fact it responded to Yan Hara rather than Qian Chu was an immense insult to his pride.","Qian Chu was so furious that his skin turned a vivid crimson, making him resemble a demon himself.","Then, without the slightest warning, he lunged at Yan Hara, murderous intent pouring from every inch of his body.","Yan Hara instinctively tried to defend herself, but her body was too battered and exhausted to respond. She could only will herself to move in her mind.","Yet, as though it had sensed her thoughts, the Demon Sealing Flag suddenly reacted on its own, shooting toward the incoming Qian Chu.","\"Scram, you useless fake!\" Qian Chu roared, attacking it with Celestial Qi.","Since the Demon Sealing Flag had been created specifically to combat demons, it lacked the power to completely suppress someone like Qian Chu, who wasn’t one and was even at the fourth level of God Ascension.","After the clash, the Demon Sealing Flag was sent flying to the side, while Qian Chu continued charging straight toward Yan Hara.","\"Your life is mine!\"","A cold smile curled on Qian Chu’s lips as his claw-like hand reached within inches of Yan Hara’s throat.","However, just before contact, his body suddenly froze in place, as though an invisible hand had seized him entirely.","\"What—?!\"","Qian Chu’s face twisted with disbelief and confusion, utterly unable to comprehend what had stopped him.","Meanwhile, Demon Emperor Carnage’s eyes widened as he noticed the two objects that had suddenly appeared above Qian Chu just before he was halted.","\"The Demon Sealing Scroll and the Demon Sealing Talisman!\" he cried out loud.","\"Impossible!\" Qian Chu exclaimed after finally noticing the two treasures above him.","The next moment, his body was pulled back and pushed further away from Yan Hara.","By the time Qian Chu steadied himself, the three Demon Sealing Treasures were already by Yan Hara’s side, circling her like three guardians.","\"What the hell is going on?! Why are the Demon Sealing Treasures in your possession?!\" Qian Chu roared, demanding for answers.","Unfortunately, not even Yan Hara herself knew the answer.","\"Why should I tell you?\"","Yet, Yan Hara refused to tell him.","Qian Chu gritted his teeth so hard that they cracked.","Then, he turned to Demon Emperor Carnage and shouted, \"What are you doing, standing there like a bystander?! Stop being useless and help me get rid of her!\"","\"You want me to fight her while she has all three Demon Sealing Treasures in her possession?! You might as well tell me to kill myself!\" Demon Emperor Carnage exclaimed.","\"Do you want me to help you summon the Ancients or not?! In this entire world, only I am capable of doing so!\" Qian Chu shouted back.","\"That’s...\" Demon Emperor Carnage gritted his teeth upon hearing those words.","A moment later, he released a defeated sigh before joining the battle. However, he did not join alone, as the demons that had fled earlier reappeared as well.","Meanwhile, outside at the venue, the Demon Sealers anxiously awaited the conclusion of the Demon Slaying Parade, which had entered its final day.","\"One more hour... just one more hour to go...\"","Yan Hara’s supporters paced back and forth endlessly, while others nervously stomped their feet, resembling a crowd gathered outside an emergency room awaiting life-or-death news.","Eventually, the final hour passed, and the Demon Slaying Parade officially came to an end.","\"It’s over! Let us inside now!\"","Yan Hara’s supporters immediately rushed toward the portal.","Yet, Qian Chu’s supporters continued to block their path for some reason.","\"What is the meaning of this?!\"","\"Nobody is allowed inside until the Clan Leader gives permission,\" one of them said.","\"That’s bullshit!\"","Once again, the Demon Sealers began arguing with each other.","Suddenly, a tall, masked figure in full black stood up and approached the portal.","\"Hey, what do you think you’re doing?\" One of Qian Chu’s supporters stood in front of him, blocking his path.","\"I am going inside,\" Yuan replied in a calm voice.","\"Look, buddy, I don’t know who the hell you think you are—\"","Pap!","A loud slap suddenly echoed through the area, cutting him off mid-sentence.","Before the Demon Sealer could even finish speaking, Yuan’s arm flickered, his palm crashing across the man’s face.","\"???\"","Everyone present stopped moving to stare at Yuan in shock.","Nobody there could’ve expected a stranger that wasn’t even a Demon Sealer to throw the first strike.","The man that had been slapped slowly turned to look at Yuan, his eyes burning with rage.","Then, he clenched his hand into a fist and swung it.","\"BASTARD—\"","PAP!","A second slap resounded, sounding much sharper than the first. At the same time, the man was sent flying to the side.","However, it wasn’t Yuan who threw the second strike, but another Demon Sealer—one from the Seventh Heaven.","Before anyone present could even react, Yuan raised his hand and removed his mask, revealing his handsome face for all to see.","Countless gasps instantly rang out across the area as the Demon Sealers’ eyes widened in shock and disbelief, their jaws practically dropping to the ground.","The spectators watched the scene with raised eyebrows, puzzled by their reaction.","Eventually, one of the Demon Sealers muttered in a dazed voice, \"Divine Paragon...?\""]},{"number":2484,"title":"Chapter 2484: Divine Paragon!","paragraphs":["\"Divine Paragon?\"","\"...\"","Yuan remained silent despite being called out to, his gaze fixed solely on the portal just a few steps away.","Without uttering a single word, he began walking toward it.","Seeing this, the Demon Sealers standing in his path instinctively moved aside, their eyes locked onto his face without blinking.","Once Yuan reached Qian Chu’s supporters, he lowered his gaze to the person standing before him.","The man immediately began sweating profusely, his clothes darkening within moments as cold sweat drenched his body.","\"Three...\"","Yuan suddenly started counting down, sending shivers down everyone’s spine.","\"Two...\"","\"Y-You can’t fool me!\" the Demon Sealer suddenly shouted, his voice cracking at the very beginning.","\"The Divine Paragon has long since died! How dare you use his face for such a shameless stunt?!\"","The moment the other Demon Sealers heard those words, they finally snapped out of their stupor, as though abruptly regaining their senses.","\"Wait a second... there’s no way the Divine Paragon could be here!\"","\"Shameless bastard! What are you trying to achieve by disguising yourself as the Divine Paragon?!\"","They began shouting in anger, even surrounding him like an enraged mob closing in on its target.","Suddenly, the Demon Sealers from the Seventh Heaven jumped in while shouting, \"This is not a stunt! He is really the Divine Paragon!\"","\"What?\"","The others halted their movements to stare at him.","\"We were ambushed by over a thousand demons when we went to check on the seals for the Demonic Realm! If the Divine Paragon hadn’t appeared, all of us would have died!\"","\"It was also the Divine Paragon who removed the seals, as he had been trapped inside the Demonic Realm and needed to return to our world!\"","\"Wait a second... What do you mean the Divine Paragon had been trapped inside the Demonic Realm? He was the one who sealed it when he returned last time, and it hasn’t been unsealed since then, so how did he get back to the Demonic Realm?\"","\"He accidentally discovered another entrance to the Demonic Realm, but it only functions one way.\"","\"So he came out of the Demonic Realm? How are you so certain that is the real Divine Paragon and not some demon disguised as him?\" asked one skeptical Demon Sealer.","\"Because he got rid of all the demons by himself, using the ’Divine Paragon’s lost techniques’ showcased by Yan Hara!\"","\"No way...\"","The Demon Sealers slowly turned to look at Yuan.","\"Huh? Where did he go?\"","However, to their surprise, Yuan’s figure had vanished without a trace.","Unbeknownst to them, while their attention had been diverted by the Seventh Heaven’s Demon Sealers, Yuan had already slipped into the Valley of Demons.","\"I-I think I saw a shadow enter the portal...\" the Demon Sealer closest to the portal suddenly said.","\"He must have entered the portal already! Let’s follow him and see for ourselves whether he’s truly the Divine Paragon or just a fake!\"","The next moment, nearly every single Demon Sealer rushed into the portal, leaving just a few behind to ensure the other spectators didn’t follow them.","Inside the Valley of Demons, Yan Hara tried her best to survive the demons’ onslaught.","Fortunately for her, the Demon Sealing Treasures functioned without her control and would protect her as needed, as if they had a will of its own.","\"She’s exhausted herself and won’t be able to last much longer! Kill her! Quickly!\" Demon Emperor Carnage shouted at the other demons while he and Qian Chu focused on the Demon Sealing Treasures.","\"Come at me, you fiends! I’ll seal every last one of you, even if it costs me my final breath!\" Yan Hara shouted, her eyes blazing with unwavering resolve—the resolve to die.","Yan Hara paid no heed to conserving her strength, sealing demons one after another without pause.","In the end, she managed to seal nearly every demon present before exhausting the very last bit of her energy.","The Demon Sealing Treasures, which had been operating solely on their reserve energy, also began to run dry and soon ceased functioning altogether.","Qian Chu and Demon Emperor Carnage slowly approached Yan Hara, who knelt weakly on the ground, barely conscious as faint, shallow breaths escaped her lips.","\"I have to admit, Yan Hara... you far exceeded my expectations, even startling me a little just now...\" Qian Chu muttered.","A cold sigh escaped his lips before he continued, \"If only you had stood on my side instead... you could have gone much farther.\"","\"Any last words?\"","Yan Hara spat out the blood in her mouth and spoke in a low voice, \"Go... fuck yourself... you damn... puppet...\"","Qian Chu’s eyes twitched at her words.","Then, without another word, he raised his arm and brought it down toward the back of her neck in a chopping motion.","The Demon Sealing Flag, which had been lying motionless on the ground after exhausting its energy, suddenly erupted with an unfathomable amount of Demon Sealing Aura.","It rose into the air on its own and shot toward Qian Chu, aiming directly for the back of his head.","Sensing the deadly attack behind him, Qian Chu abruptly turned and redirected the strike meant for Yan Hara toward the incoming flag, attempting to block it.","In the next instant, a piercing scream tore from Qian Chu’s lips as the Demon Sealing Flag not only reflected his attack, but completely obliterated his arm in the process.","\"?!?!\"","Seeing this, Demon Emperor Carnage immediately leaped backward, putting distance between himself and the others.","However, he abruptly stopped when his back slammed into something hard. Assuming he had collided with a tree, he instinctively swung around to cut it down—only for his arm to be caught mid-motion by another hand.","\"Y-You are—?!\"","Demon Emperor Carnage’s eyes nearly bulged out of their sockets as he realized that what he had collided with was not a tree, but a human—one he was very familiar with, no less.","\"DIVINE PARAGON?!?!\"","He screamed at the top of his lungs, so forcefully that his lungs actually burst from the strain."]},{"number":2485,"title":"Chapter 2485: Homunculus","paragraphs":["\"DIVINE PARAGON?! WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING HERE?!\" Demon Emperor Carnage screamed in terror before instinctively yanking his arm trying to break free from Yuan’s grasp, pulling so hard that he ripped his own arm out.","Blood gushed everywhere for a second before another arm regenerated, sealing the wound.","\"Divine Paragon...?\" Qian Chu and Yan Hara turned to look at Yuan with a dumbfounded face.","\"That’s impossible! The Divine Paragon is dead! There’s no way he could be here right now!\" Qian Chu did not believe for a second that the Divine Paragon was still alive, much less appear before them right now.","Demon Emperor Carnage had tried to spread news of the Divine Paragon’s return shortly after their encounter, but nobody believed him, so he gave up on trying.","Meanwhile, Yan Hara released a relieved sigh.","\"Yuan...\" she murmured softly before collapsing onto the ground from sheer exhaustion.","Her body instinctively recognized his presence as safety, causing the last bit of strength sustaining her to finally give out.","The Demon Sealing Flag wrapped its cloth around Yan Hara before carrying her away.","\"So, have you managed to summon an Ancient yet?\" Yuan suddenly asked Demon Emperor Carnage.","\"That is none of your business!\" Demon Emperor Carnage shouted.","\"It isn’t? Even though you used their existence to threaten me before?\" Yuan remarked with a calm smile.","\"That’s...\" Demon Emperor Carnage gritted his teeth.","\"What’s going on here, Carnage?!\" Qian Chu suddenly approached him and questioned.","\"I just told you! He’s the Divine Paragon!\" Demon Emperor Carnage shouted angrily.","\"You expect me to believe that?! The Divine Paragon is dead! He may look like the Divine Paragon, but that’s all!\"","Qian Chu said.","Then he remembered something and smiled coldly, \"You must be that newcomer I have heard a lot about. The one who resembles the Divine Paragon—Little Founder.\"","\"I must admit, you are a splitting image of the Divine Paragon. Unfortunately for you, I am not foolish enough to fall for such trickery!\"","Yuan looked at Qian Chu for a second before returning to Demon Emperor Carnage and saying, \"Working together with a homunculus? I thought you hated their kind.\"","\"?!?!\" Qian Chu’s eyes widened in disbelief after hearing Yuan’s words.","Then, without warning, swung at Yuan while exuding an immense amount of killing intent.","\"How do you know about my kind?!\" he roared.","Yuan casually dodged the attack and replied, \"How? I was present during the purge of your ’kind’, even offering some assistance. To think one would still stand before me right now...\"","Homunculus were artificial beings created through a forbidden technique that has existed even before the Great Cataclysm, brought into existence for a single purpose—to satisfy the twisted curiosity of a mad demon.","During Tian Chenyu’s first visit to the Demonic Realm, Homunculus existed in great numbers, wreaking havoc across the Crimson Continent. In response, he had aided Supreme Ruler Dena in eradicating them from existence by killing the mad demon and destroying his research.","\"You...\" Qian Chu suddenly started walking backwards in small steps, his face twisted with disbelief.","Yuan then said, \"I heard something quite entertaining earlier. You can help him summon an Ancient, is that right?\"","\"So what if I can?\" Qian Chu subconsciously responded.","\"I really want to see one—an Ancient. So, I am willing to let you live until then.\"","\"What?!\" Qian Chu exclaimed in shock.","Demon Emperor Carnage wasn’t as surprised since he was also allowed to escape before for the same reason.","\"What are you waiting for? If you want to die right now, I can fulfill your wish.\"","Yuan released some of his Demon Sealing Aura, instantly shocking them, as it was countless times stronger than what Yan Hara displayed.","Without hesitation, Demon Emperor Carnage turned around and fled, not even waiting around for Qian Chu to act.","Qian Chu gritted his teeth and also ran away.","But before he could get far, Yuan’s voice resounded, \"You forgot something.\"","The next moment, the three Demon Sealing Treasures chased after Qian Chu.","Qian Chu’s entire face turned as red as a tomato after experiencing such humiliation for the first time in his life.","’I don’t care who you are! Even if you really are the Divine Paragon, I will make you pay for humiliating me!’ he swore inwardly.","Shortly after they escaped, the other Demon Sealers appeared.","\"Where’s Senior Yan?!\"","\"She’s safe,\" Yuan said. \"Let me take you to them.\"","He turned around and flew away, leading them to where he placed Yan Hara.","\"Senior Yan!\" Her supporters exclaimed in terror after seeing her condition.","\"Calm down, she’s fine.\"","One of the Demon Sealers with a medical background approached Yan Hara and examined her condition.","\"Besides some external injuries, she’s mostly just unconscious from exhaustion,\" he said.","Her supporters sighed in relief.","\"What happened here, Senior Divine Paragon?\"","Yuan pointed at her and said, \"You can ask her once she wakes up.\"","The Demon Sealers fed Yan Hara some medicine, and it didn’t take long before she opened her eyes.","\"Yuan...?\" Yan Hara muttered in a daze as she woke up.","\"Senior Yan! Are you okay?! What happened during the Demon Slaying Parade?\"","Yan Hara turned to look at Yuan, who silently nodded his head.","Although she was still a bit dazed, Yan Hara explained the situation to everyone present, from Qian Chu’s betrayal and cheating to the appearance of a real Demon Emperor.","\"What?! The Clan Leader is in cahoots with a Demon Emperor?! The same one during the Supreme Demon Sealer’s Qualification?! How the hell are we supposed to believe that?\"","\"Why are we asking her when we can ask the Divine Paragon?\" Someone said aloud.","Suddenly, everyone there turned to look at Yuan.","Rather than affirming Yan Hara’s claims, Yuan only revealed what he saw with his own eyes—that Qian Chu and the Demon Emperor were working together to fight Yan Hara.","\"If I hadn’t arrived in time, she wouldn’t be alive right now,\" he said while shaking his head."]},{"number":2486,"title":"Chapter 2486: A Legend’s Return","paragraphs":["The entire place became deadly silent after Yuan revealed what he witnessed to the others.","Even if Qian Chu’s supporters refused to believe Yan Hara, there was no way they would dare accuse the Divine Paragon of lying.","\"Qian Chu, that traitor! How dare he betray humanity and work with the demons?!\"","\"A Demon Emperor, no less!\"","\"I knew there was something off about the Supreme Demon Sealer Qualifications! I bet he wanted to get rid of the participants from the beginning!\"","Yan Hara’s supporters shouted out loud as they angrily stomped their feet.","Meanwhile, Qian Chu’s supporters—at least those who weren’t spies and were genuine Demon Sealers stopped supporting him at that point and switched sides.","\"What happened to Qian Chu and the Demon Emperor?\"","\"Isn’t it obvious? The Divine Paragon killed them!\"","However, Yuan shook his head and said in a calm voice, \"No, I didn’t kill them.\"","\"What?\"","They all turned to look at him with puzzled faces.","\"I let them go,\" Yuan continued, admitting that he’d purposefully let them escape.","\"W-Why would you let them go...?\" Someone suddenly asked.","Yet, Yuan narrowed his gaze and coldly muttered, \"Are you asking me to explain myself?\"","Pap!","Another Demon Sealer slapped the guy who just spoke in the back of his head and shouted loudly, \"Who the hell do you think you are?! The Divine Paragon doesn’t need to explain anything! If he wants us to jump off a bridge, we will obey without a word!\"","\"...\"","Yuan sighed inwardly before turning around and walking away.","\"I want every Demon Sealer present at the Grand Library in three days. I have some important information to share with everyone,\" Yuan said as he left the Valley of Demons.","Nobody stopped him.","The Divine Paragon’s return was so sudden and unforeseen that even now, none of them could fully process it, their minds struggling to keep up with reality.","\"The... Divine Paragon has truly returned to us...?\"","After a moment of silence, they started chanting like a bunch of cultists, \"The Divine Paragon has returned!\"","Outside the Valley of Demons, Yuan approached Meixiu and said to her, \"I will spend some time at the Myriad of Techniques. If you have time, let’s catch up.\"","Meixiu turned to look at Keling.","\"You don’t have to say anything,\" Keling spoke up before Meixiu could. \"If you want to extend your break for a little longer, I have no issues.\"","\"Thank you, master.\"","Keling looked at Yuan and smiled, \"In exchange, I would like a friendly exchange with you.\"","Yuan calmly nodded, \"I had a feeling you would ask for a spar. Alright.\"","\"See you at the Myriad of Techniques.\"","Yuan left the venue altogether shortly after.","Meixiu and Keling followed him, but since they entered from the Ninth Heaven, they were separated the instant they walked through the portal.","While Yuan made his way to the Myriad of Techniques, news of the Divine Paragon’s return spread throughout the Nine Heavens like an uncontrollable wildfire, reaching every nook and cranny in the blink of an eye.","\"Divine Paragon? Who is that?\"","\"You don’t know who he is?! He’s the founder of the Demon Sealing Clan and the reason that demons are no longer a threat to civilization!\"","\"The Divine Paragon first appeared while the demons were running rampant, enslaving humans and treating us like livestock!\"","\"What do you mean he returned? It’s been a long time since the Demonic Era. Where did he go? And what is so significant about his return?\"","\"He disappeared near the end of the Demonic Era. Nobody knew where he’s gone until recently and assumed that he’d died. However, it turns out he was in the Demonic Realm—the home to demons—this entire time.\"","\"Where is the Divine Paragon right now?\"","\"I heard that he’s resting at the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library, a place only accessible to Demon Sealers.\"","\"I don’t understand the hype. He may have been an important figure in the past, but that era is long gone,\" someone remarked, unable to comprehend why the Divine Paragon’s return was causing such a massive uproar.","\"You imbecile! He’s the savior of humanity! Even a single strand of his hair is worth more than your entire legacy!\"","\"Not to mention the demons’ increased activity recently. With the Divine Paragon’s return, they won’t dare to act so openly any more!\"","Eventually, the news reached the Celestial Emperor’s ears.","\"The Divine Paragon, hm?\" the Celestial Emperor muttered, seemingly uninterested in the matter.","In his eyes, regardless of the Divine Paragon’s past accomplishments, it had nothing to do with him.","And as many had already said, that era was long gone.","However, as the Celestial Emperor, he couldn’t just sit still and do nothing.","\"Send a messenger to the Divine Paragon and tell him that I’d like to meet him, even reward him for his past achievements,\" said the Celestial Emperor, pretending to care even if he didn’t.","\"Yes, Your Majesty!\"","Upon arriving at the Myriad of Techniques, Yuan headed directly to Senior Bai’s personal world.","As expected, Meixiu and Keling were already there. However, there was one additional person present—someone he had not anticipated seeing.","\"Senior Bai...\"","A stiff smile surfaced on Yuan’s face when he saw the familiar old man, whose appearance seemed even older than before—or more accurately, far wearier, as though he had been working nonstop since their last encounter.","Even without exchanging a single word, Yuan already had a rough idea why Senior Bai was there.","Before anyone else could speak, Senior Bai broke the silence.","\"It has been a long time, little friend... though you are no longer the young man I first met.\"","After a brief pause, he continued, \"I would like to have a conversation with you... once you are finished with your business with them.\"","Without giving Yuan a chance to respond, Senior Bai turned around and flew away.","Seeing this, Yuan sighed inwardly.","\"Do you know what happened to Senior Bai? He looks... and feels different,\" Meixiu asked him a moment later with a worried frown."]},{"number":2487,"title":"Chapter 2487: A Legend’s Return(2)","paragraphs":["\"I have also never seen Senior Bai in such a condition before,\" Yuan remarked with a sigh.","\"You should talk to him now. I can wait,\" Meixiu then said.","Yuan nodded and quickly chased after Senior Bai.","\"Senior Bai!\" Yuan used Void Manipulation to appear before him.","\"V-Void Manipulation?!\"","Senior Bai’s face twisted with shock for a moment before he gradually calmed himself.","\"You’ve grown tremendously since our last encounter...\" he muttered with a weary sigh. \"But then again, this seems to happen every single time, so perhaps I shouldn’t be surprised anymore...\"","\"Senior Bai... is everything okay?\" Yuan asked him with a worried frown.","\"We can talk about this later—\"","Yuan shook his head and interrupted.","\"I don’t think I will be able to enjoy my reunion with Meixiu like this...\"","He continued before Senior Bai could respond, \"Is this... about the Celestial Overlord’s sudden drop in karma?\"","\"So it really was you, after all...\" Senior Bai released a deep sigh.","Even though he had already suspected it was Yuan, hearing the confirmation directly from him carried an entirely different weight.","\"Although I trust that you had a good reason, I still need to hear it myself. Why did you clash with Heaven’s Mandate—the Celestial Emperor’s soldiers?\"","Yuan fell silent, pondering how to explain the situation to Senior Bai without sounding ridiculous.","\"You already know that the Celestial Emperor and I share some sort of hostility toward each other, right?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"Yes,\" Senior Bai nodded. \"Though I still can’t understand how that’s even possible. There should’ve been no way for you to have met the Celestial Emperor in the first place, much less offend him.\"","\"That’s because I haven’t met him in this life yet... but I have met him in the past... in my past life.\"","Yuan faced Senior Bai with a solemn expression.","\"Your... past life?\" Senior Bai swallowed nervously as he muttered in a daze.","Yet despite the shocking revelation, there was no true bewilderment in Senior Bai’s gaze, almost as though he had already anticipated such a possibility to some extent.","\"The founder of the Celestial Overlords...\" Senior Bai suddenly muttered.","Yuan nodded, confirming in a calm voice, \"Indeed, one of my past lives was Tian Yingzhe, the founder of the Celestial Overlords.\"","He continued, \"Remember when I handed over his techniques—his legacy to Xu Jiaqi, saying that I’ve found it? In truth, I regained some of Tian Yingzhe’s memories and recovered the technique in that manner.\"","\"I see...\" Senior Bai fell silent for a moment to digest this information.","Then, he spoke, \"But that doesn’t explain the Celestial Emperor’s hostility towards you.\"","Yuan sighed before responding, \"To be honest, I don’t think I can fully explain the situation to you without sounding crazy. Moreover, I will have to reveal some forbidden information that requires sacrificing your longevity.\"","\"Information that requires longevity?\" After a brief moment of silence, Senior Bai continued, asking, \"Is this related to the ’Gods’ in the Starry Sky?\"","Yuan’s eyes widened with surprise.","\"How did you learn about that?\"","A prideful smile tugged at Senior Bai’s lips as he replied, \"There is a reason some call me the Sage of Knowledge. Throughout my life, I did not merely collect techniques to expand the Myriad of Techniques—I also gathered countless ancient records covering all manner of subjects.\"","The Myriad of Techniques was not merely the largest collection of cultivation techniques within the Nine Heavens. It also functioned as a vast hub of information.","Of course, very few people were aware of this, as most visitors only came seeking techniques.","\"Although I admittedly do not know much about them, I am at least aware of their existence. I also did not pursue such knowledge, as I became afraid of the consequences after losing a tremendous amount of longevity just learning of their existence.\"","\"Well, since you already know about them, it will make explaining things much easier,\" Yuan said afterward.","\"While I cannot reveal too many details, these so-called ’Gods’ are my enemies. Since the dawn of time, they have been responsible for countless major incidents that led to innumerable deaths... all in pursuit of their own goals.\"","\"As for how they’re related to the Celestial Emperor... well, the first Celestial Emperor was their creation, and the current Celestial Emperor is nothing more than their puppet.\"","Senior Bai’s jaw dropped at the heaven-shattering revelation.","Ignoring his shock, Yuan calmly continued, \"And I have been fighting the Celestial Emperor and these Gods since the very beginning... across multiple lifetimes.\"","Senior Bai suddenly fell back onto his buttocks, his eyes wide with disbelief.","After a long minute of silence, Senior Bai remained on the ground as he asked in a nervous voice, \"What... What am I supposed to do with this information?\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"You don’t need to do anything. I simply want you to understand my situation. Not only are you Xu Jiaqi’s most trusted aide, but you’ve also helped me countless times since the very beginning.\"","\"Is that so...\"","Senior Bai no longer spoke afterward.","Seeing this, Yuan asked, \"How are the Celestial Overlords and Xu Jiaqi doing?\"","Senior Bai sighed deeply. \"Terribly. The others are aware that Lady Xu recruited you, and even without concrete evidence, they’re blaming her for the lost karma. Not only has she lost many of her followers, but she’s also been pushed to the sidelines entirely. At this rate, forget becoming the next leader—she may even end up exiled from the faction.\"","\"That’s...\" Yuan was left speechless, the situation turning out far worse than he had imagined.","Senior Bai slowly rose to his feet and stood before Yuan, staring at him with a solemn expression.","\"Yuan... you must do something to help Lady Xu.\"","He nodded.","\"I will. Just give me a little more time. I have some unfinished business with the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","\"Speaking of the Demon Sealing Clan... Are you actually the Divine Paragon, or are you simply pretending to be him?\" Senior Bai then asked."]},{"number":2488,"title":"Chapter 2488: Sparring with Keling","paragraphs":["Hearing Senior Bai’s question, a calm smile appeared on Yuan’s face.","\"Just like Tian Yingzhe, the Divine Paragon is another of my past lives,\" he replied.","Senior Bai opened his mouth, but no words came out.","\"Any other questions? I’ll answer as much as I can,\" Yuan said.","\"The Celestial Emperor recently released an official statement regarding your incident, claiming that the perpetrator—you—smuggled the Asura Clan out of the Primordial Realm. As far as I am aware, they are the most dangerous criminals imprisoned there.\"","Senior Bai paused for a moment before asking in a solemn voice, \"Is... that true? If so, why the Asura Clan? I understand that they fought against the first Celestial Emperor before, so you might want to cooperate with them, but they are simply too dangerous! Because they—\"","\"Because they once served the Evil God, correct?\" Yuan interrupted, easily seeing through Senior Bai’s concerns.","Senior Bai nodded with a deep frown on his face.","\"The Evil God was one of the cruelest individuals in history. The number of lives he slaughtered reached into the tens of millions. Even if the first Celestial Emperor was in the wrong for starting the war, it still does not justify the senseless massacre of innocents.\"","Yuan sighed, and the atmosphere around him suddenly grew heavy as he responded, \"You’re right. It does not justify what I did.\"","\"Wait... what?\" Senior Bai’s eyes widened with disbelief as he doubted his hearing.","Yuan stared at him dead in the eyes and explained, \"The Evil God... the God of War was also one of my incarnations.\"","\"WHAT?!\" Senior Bai exclaimed, falling back to the ground with a heavy thud.","\"T-The Evil God?! You?!\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"Although it won’t justify the rampage I went on, allow me to explain why I did it.\"","He then turned to look at Meixiu in the distance before revealing the truth behind why the Evil God had gone on a killing spree and become the most blood-soaked figure in history.","He revealed to Senior Bai that the Celestial Emperor had assassinated his wife—who had been pregnant with his child—simply because he refused to serve the Celestial Emperor during the Heavenly War of Immortals and Gods.","\"That’s...\"","Since he had never had a wife, let alone children, Senior Bai could not truly comprehend Yuan’s pain. However, that did not mean he couldn’t understand how such a tragedy could change even the kindest of men.","Eventually, Senior Bai spoke, \"I will neither support nor condemn what you did in the past—especially when it happened in another life altogether. Let us leave the past where it belongs and focus on the present instead. As long as you don’t go around killing innocent people, I will continue to trust and support your decisions.\"","\"Thank you.\" Yuan nodded.","\"Any... any other incarnations of yours that I should...\" Senior Bai paused there and shook his head, \"Forget it. I don’t want to know.\"","He then said, \"About Lady Xu... do you want me to tell her?\"","\"No, I will tell her myself.\"","\"I understand. Then I’ll leave you alone for now. Don’t make her wait too long.\"","Without another word, Senior Bai left the world.","Yuan returned to Meixiu afterward and explained the cause of Senior Bai’s worries to her, but she wasn’t familiar with Xu Jiaqi or the Celestial Overlords in general, so her understanding of the situation was superficial.","\"The Celestial Overlords’ significant drop in ranking was caused by you?\" Keling remarked with a dumbfounded look on her face. \"Wait... so you were responsible for slaughtering Heaven’s Mandate and the one who released the Asura Clan from the Primordial Realm?\"","Keling swallowed nervously after realizing that Yuan was the culprit behind those incidents, and she wondered whether she should really spar with such a dangerous person.","She looked at Meixiu with the corner of her eye, and to her surprise, Meixiu did not seem the slightest surprised or disturbed by the fact that her partner was essentially a wanted criminal that even the Celestial Emperor wanted dead.","At that moment, she decided to try to talk some sense into Meixiu later.","\"Let’s catch up. I have a lot I want to tell you,\" Yuan said to Meixiu, who nodded before following him away.","\"Um... what about me?\" Keling suddenly asked.","Yuan pondered for a second before speaking to Meixu, \"Can you wait a few more minutes?\"","She nodded.","Yuan then turned to Keling and said, \"You wanted to spar, right? Let’s do it right now since you’ll need some time to recover afterward.\"","\"...\"","Keling narrowed her eyes, feeling as though Yuan was looking down on her. However, the moment she recalled that he had defeated Heaven’s Mandate Second Squad by himself, her irritation quickly subsided.","\"Don’t worry, I will go easy,\" Yuan added.","When Keling heard that, she felt something snap inside her head, and her aura surged violently.","\"Let’s fight, you bastard!\"","Yuan calmly gestured at her with a beckoning motion, \"Whenever you’re ready.\"","In the next moment, Keling drew her arm back before unleashing a punch, her fist shooting toward Yuan like a cannonball.","Without even glancing at her, Yuan casually raised an arm before his face, effortlessly catching her fist just centimeters before it could collide with him.","’What ridiculous strength!’ Keling’s eyes widened in shock.","Although her giant bloodline was not as pure or powerful as Kelan’s, she still possessed the blood of giants, granting her physical prowess far beyond that of ordinary humans. Furthermore, as a bow wielder, she had tempered her arms to extreme degrees, allowing her to draw bows that required enough strength to move mountains.","Despite all of that, Yuan had managed to stop her full-strength punch with seemingly effortless ease.","\"Not bad,\" Yuan muttered as he gently pushed her fist aside. \"But if you want me to fight you properly, then you’ll need to fight as though your life depends on it.\"","Keling gritted her teeth and reached for her Spatial Ring.","\"Disciple Meixiu, don’t blame me if I accidentally kill your sweetheart!\"","Keling shouted as she retrieved her weapon—a massive purple bow nearly twice her size—and aimed it at Yuan, her muscular arm already pulling back the bowstring."]},{"number":2489,"title":"Chapter 2489: Sparring with Keling(2)","paragraphs":["\"This is your last chance to apologize and fight me seriously,\" Keling warned Yuan, the muscles in her arm bulging like thick roots as she held the massive bowstring drawn back.","\"I’ll apologize if you can make me bleed even a single drop of blood,\" Yuan replied with a provocative smile on his face.","Keling’s eyes widened at his words, and without the slightest hesitation, she released the bowstring.","Even without an arrow nocked, the sheer force unleashed by the string alone generated a terrifying shockwave that was powerful enough to effortlessly vaporize even an Immortal.","However, when the shockwave struck Yuan, the most it managed to do was stir his hair and clothes. To him, it felt no different from a gentle spring breeze.","Seeing this, Keling drew the bowstring once more. As she pulled it back, an arrow began materializing out of thin air, already nocked in place and ready to be fired.","The arrow was formed entirely from Celestial Qi and spiritual energy, compressed to such an extreme degree that it had become visible to the naked eye.","Not wanting Meixiu to get caught up in their fight, Yuan used Void Manipulation to teleport both him and Keling far away.","’He can use Void Manipulation with such mastery?!’ Keling cried inwardly after being teleported with him.","Unfortunately, she had no time to dwell on it. In the very next moment, she released the bowstring, launching the arrow forged from pure Celestial Qi straight at Yuan.","The arrow traveled at nearly the speed of sound, and wherever it passed, it left behind a thin trail of fractured space.","\"Is that it?\" Yuan muttered as he slightly raised his arm, effortlessly avoiding the arrow altogether.","Since Keling had no genuine intention of killing him, she had only aimed for one of his limbs.","Keling had already anticipated that Yuan would evade her first attack, so she immediately unleashed several more arrows in rapid succession without the slightest pause.","She fired them so quickly that it appeared as though a dozen arrows had been released at the same time, all of them flying at Yuan with perfect accuracy.","A smile tugged at Yuan’s lips as he muttered, \"Now that’s what I’m talking about!\"","In the next instant, he activated Heavenly White Tiger Transformation. Then, with a single swing of his clawed hand, he completely shredded every incoming arrow.","\"?!?!\" Keling’s eyes widened with disbelief.","\"Are you even human?!\" she cried out loud.","\"How rude!\" Yuan laughed as he charged straight at Keling, throwing a simple punch toward her.","\"Che!\"","Keling reacted swiftly, but instead of trying to dodge, she raised her bow to block the incoming fist, instinctively realizing that she lacked the speed to evade it.","Clang!","A sharp metallic clang rang out through the area as Yuan’s fist collided with Keling’s bow.","Keling tried to withstand the impact, but the force behind the blow was so overwhelmingly powerful that she was instantly sent flying backward.","\"Cough!\"","After barely steadying herself, Keling coughed up a mouthful of blood, her arms trembling numbly from the impact.","’What monstrous strength! That single exchange alone shattered the bones in my arms! Could he also possess a giant’s bloodline?’","Keling could not help but suspect that giant blood flowed through Yuan’s veins as well, as it was the only explanation she could think of for such absurd physical power.","\"What are you waiting for?\" Keling asked Yuan a moment later when Yuan stopped moving entirely.","\"Sorry, I didn’t expect your arms to break so easily,\" Yuan said calmly. \"I’ll wait until you’ve recovered.\"","\"This bastard...\"","Keling trembled in fury as veins bulged across her forehead. In her entire life, she had never encountered anyone even remotely as irritating as Yuan.","Of course, Yuan did not intentionally belittle Keling and was genuinely surprised by how \"fragile\" she was.","What Yuan didn’t know was that Keling was actually renowned for possessing a nearly indestructible body.","\"Stop looking down on me!\" Keling roared as she poured a tremendous amount of Celestial Qi into her bow, causing it to transform and rapidly grow in size.","\"Is that really still a bow...?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow at its new form, which now resembled a massive ballista more than an actual bow.","\"Arrow Stream!\"","In the very next instant, arrows began firing from the massive ballista like a turret, thousands of projectiles hurtling toward Yuan every second.","In response, Yuan raised his index and middle fingers, surrounding them with Supreme Sword Aura. Then, using his fingers as though they were a sword, Yuan began slicing through the incoming arrows.","His arms flickered at such incredible speed that countless afterimages appeared, making it seem as though he possessed multiple arms at once.","\"Blink Arrow!\"","Keling swiftly retrieved another bow and fired it at Yuan.","The moment the arrow left the bowstring, it vanished from sight. Then, as though it had teleported through space itself, it suddenly reappeared behind Yuan and shot toward his head.","However, just as the arrow was a mere millimeter away from piercing through Yuan’s head, it suddenly vanished once again.","\"Agh!\"","Keling screamed in pain as a burning sensation erupted from her right thigh. When she looked down, her eyes widened to find a clean hole pierced through her leg.","’He used Void Manipulation on my technique?!’","Keling cried inwardly, fear surfacing in her eyes as she realized that Yuan’s mastery of Void Manipulation had reached a realm she had never even heard of before.","\"Let’s stop here. I’d feel bad for Meixiu if I beat her master up too badly, and you still need to preserve some dignity.\"","Yuan spoke casually, but instead of calming Keling down, his words only enraged her even further.","Keling’s eyes turned crimson as her body rapidly expanded in size until she resembled a true giant.","Seeing this, Yuan smiled and said, \"Alright, I’ll give you one final chance to injure me.\"","Keling gathered every bit of Celestial Qi she could muster and poured it into her bow. Then, she spat a mouthful of blood onto it, causing a crimson arrow to slowly take shape shortly afterward.","\"DIE!\" she roared.","The crimson arrow shot forth from the bow with unstoppable force.","Yet, despite the terrifying attack hurtling toward him, Yuan remained perfectly still, showing no intention of dodging or even attempting to block it."]},{"number":2490,"title":"Chapter 2490: Visiting the Grand Library as the Divine Paragon","paragraphs":["’What the hell is he doing?!’ Keling cried inwardly when Yuan made no attempt to react to her attack.","Even if she wanted to withdraw the shot now, it was already far too late. Almost the instant the arrow left the bow, it arrived directly before Yuan’s forehead.","Yet, the moment the arrow struck Yuan’s forehead, it did not pierce through his skull as Keling had imagined. Instead, the arrow shattered into countless fragments before dispersing into thin air.","Meanwhile, Yuan remained completely unharmed, not even a scratch appearing on his forehead.","\"No... way...\" Keling’s eyes widened with bewilderment, looking as though she’d just witnessed the impossible—something incomprehensible.","Her attack just now possessed enough power to destroy even a star, yet Yuan had taken it head-on with his forehead and emerged completely unscathed.","Such a thing should have been utterly impossible.","\"You... what kind of physique do you have? And how in heaven’s name did you temper it?\" she asked after a long moment of silence.","Yuan shrugged and calmly replied, \"Normally.\"","Keling fell to her knees and released a deep sigh, \"It’s my loss.\"","Yuan approached her afterward and said, \"Sorry for belittling you. If I hadn’t done that, you wouldn’t have fought me seriously.\"","\"It’s fine,\" Keling replied with a bitter smile. \"I’ll just consider it the price I had to pay to broaden my horizons today.\"","She proceeded to consume a recovery pill, quickly healing her injuries and exhausted spiritual energy.","\"I’ll go spend some time with Meixiu now. Here’s a little something you can do in the meantime,\" Yuan suddenly tapped her forehead, transferring several techniques directly into her mind.","\"Wha-What are you...?\" Keling stared at him in a daze.","\"A little something to thank you for taking care of Meixiu.\"","After saying that, Yuan teleported to Meixiu using Void Manipulation.","\"Are you done already?\" Meixiu asked when she noticed that Yuan had returned.","He nodded, \"Yes, we’re done.\"","Shortly later, they disappeared into one of the guest houses available there to catch up.","While Meixiu recalled her training with Keling to him, Yuan told her everything he’d experienced within the Demonic Realm, as well as the truth behind demons and humans.","\"So demons were once humans... and we... we might be clones?\" Meixiu wore a dazed look on her face as she tried to digest this shocking revelation.","\"I’m not sure how to react—if I even can—to this sort of information...\" She shook her head, utterly speechless.","\"However, it does make me wonder what the original humans were like, and why they went extinct.\"","\"...Forget it. There’s no point dwelling on something like this.\"","In the end, the information was so far beyond her comprehension that Meixiu decided it would be easier to pretend she had never heard it at all. After all, it wasn’t as if there was anything she could do with this sort of information.","\"How are the others doing?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Sorry, but I don’t know. We haven’t been in contact since we went our own way.\"","\"I see...\"","In the blink of an eye, three days passed.","\"I know our reunion this time has been brief, and honestly, I would rather spend a few years with you before continuing my journey,\" Yuan said as he prepared to leave. \"Unfortunately, the Demon Sealing Clan is waiting for me, and there is still far too much left for me to do.\"","\"I know,\" Meixiu said with a gentle smile on her face.","They embraced, and after a passionate kiss, Yuan departed the world and returned to the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library, which could be accessed through the Myriad of Techniques.","Meanwhile, Meixiu went to Keling after Yuan left.","\"Master...?\" Meixiu raised her eyebrows when she saw Keling cultivating with a weird smile on her face.","\"Hm? Do you need something from me?\" Keling opened her eyes and asked after sensing Meixiu’s presence.","\"Yuan left,\" she said.","\"So soon? Would it have killed him to spend a little more time with you?\" Keling sighed aloud.","Although it sounded as though she was sympathizing with Meixiu, in reality, she simply wanted more time to study the techniques Yuan had given her.","\"Don’t blame him, Master. It really can’t be helped, considering how many responsibilities he carries,\" Meixiu said, defending him.","\"I’m not. I’m just saying,\" Keling shrugged before standing up.","\"Alright. Let’s continue your training... with some slight changes.\"","\"What sort of changes?\"","\"I will be training with you,\" she said with a smile.","At the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library, Yan Hara greeted Yuan the moment he entered the place.","She lowered her head, greeting him with a casual but respectful nod.","\"How are your injuries?\" Yuan immediately asked.","\"I’m pretty much fully recovered,\" she replied with a smile.","\"Good. Let’s go. I have a lot to tell you all.\"","\"I’ll lead you to the others,\" said Yan Hara as she turned around and began walking.","Inside the Grand Library’s courtyard, every Demon Sealer from both the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto had gathered together, anxiously awaiting the Divine Paragon’s arrival.","\"You witnessed the Divine Paragon fighting demons, right? What was it like?\"","\"It felt like a dream.\"","The Demon Sealers chatted amongst themselves as they waited.","\"I wish I could’ve been there...\"","\"Don’t be ridiculous. As incredible as it must’ve been to witness the Divine Paragon slaughter hundreds of demons, it was still a life-and-death situation where many Demon Sealers lost their lives.\"","\"I wonder why he gathered all of us.\"","\"I bet it’s to reprimand us...\"","\"That’s... very possible.\"","The Demon Sealers swallowed nervously, realizing how much they had strayed from their purpose.","Suddenly, someone shouted, \"The Divine Paragon has arrived!\"","Hearing this, everyone immediately stopped talking and straightened their backs.","In the next moment, Yan Hara and Yuan entered the courtyard together.","The Demon Sealers instantly dropped to their knees and bowed toward him with utmost reverence.","\"We greet the Divine Paragon!\"","They shouted in unison with such overwhelming excitement that even the air seemed to tremble."]},{"number":2491,"title":"Chapter 2491: Lecturing the Demon Sealers","paragraphs":["\"We greet the Divine Paragon!\"","Yuan could feel the very air vibrating from their voices alone, yet he offered no response and calmly walked down the path they had left open for him, eventually arriving before a raised platform where a majestic chair awaited.","He calmly took his seat while Yan Hara stood beside him like a loyal aide.","After briefly sweeping his gaze across the scene, Yuan finally spoke, \"Be at ease.\"","The Demon Sealers raised their heads at command and stood up a moment later.","\"Before I begin,\" Yuan started speaking shortly after, \"Allow me to introduce myself, even if all of you already know me to some extent.\"","\"My name is Tian Chenyu, the first leader of the Demon Sealing Clan. Many of you know me as the Divine Paragon, but quite frankly, I don’t like it. It is too grand for someone like me. So from now on, if you wish to address me directly, use my name.\"","\"...\"","The Demon Sealers listened with dazed expressions, their eyes flickering with awe as they subconsciously examined Yuan’s appearance and compared it to the statue of the Divine Paragon that had stood within the Grand Library for as long as they could remember.","\"First and foremost, let me address the current state of the Demon Sealing Clan and you Demon Sealers,\" Yuan continued.","\"Although the Demon Sealing Clan has always been somewhat disorganized—even during my era—it was never this chaotic. Demon Sealers respected one another and would willingly risk their lives for each other, regardless of whether they had argued or even fought the day before.\"","He paused briefly before his gaze sharpened.","\"Meanwhile, compared to them, all of you are like a group of children pretending to be Demon Sealers. Frankly speaking, it is both deeply disappointing and disgraceful.\"","\"...\"","A heavy atmosphere instantly descended upon the Grand Library as every Demon Sealer subconsciously lowered their heads like children being scolded, none daring to meet Yuan’s gaze any longer.","\"Even if demons are no longer the overwhelming threat they once were, that does not mean they are harmless or incapable of threatening the world again. As long as you bear the title of Demon Sealer, your highest priority should always be dealing with demons.\"","Yuan’s gaze turned colder as he continued, \"Yet all of you are too busy fighting amongst yourselves, treating the Demon Sealing Clan like some sort of joke.\"","\"Not only did you bastards turn the Demon Sealing Clan into a complete mess, but you even allowed someone like Qian Chu to become your leader. Are none of you ashamed of yourselves?\"","Despite his harsh criticism, not a single Demon Sealer dared to speak up.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan continued, \"Why are you all staying silent? I want you to say something, even if it’s just excuses. You’re not mute, after all.\"","Eventually, one of the Demon Sealers who used to be Qian Chu’s supporters raised his hand, requesting to speak.","Yuan shifted his gaze to the man and said, \"Speak.\"","\"N-None of us could’ve anticipated Qian Chu would work with the demons like this. He was an exemplary Demon Sealer in the past, working harder than anyone to reach his position.\"","\"An exemplary Demon Sealer?\" Yuan sneered.","\"Had any of you even bothered to examine him, we wouldn’t have this situation. After all, Qian Chu is not human.\"","\"W-What?!\"","The Demon Sealers exclaimed in shock at Yuan’s claims.","\"He was a demon this entire time?! That’s impossible! He can wield Demon Sealing Aura, and it can only be wielded by humans!\"","Yuan shook his head and explained, \"Qian Chu is not a demon, but neither is he human. He is similar to the artificial demons you created, though far more advanced and sophisticated—a product born from the Demonic Realm itself.\"","\"As for why he can use Demon Sealing Aura...\" Yuan closed his eyes and released a low sigh before continuing, \"He did not learn it through normal means, but through sacrifices. His kind cultivates by consuming others, turning their powers into their own like parasites.\"","\"That’s...\"","The courtyard fell silent once again as the Demon Sealers pondered this information.","\"Now that I think about it, Demon Sealers have started disappearing around the time he joined,\" muttered one of the more senior Demon Sealers, who had been there even before Qian Chu.","\"Did you investigate their disappearance?\" Yuan asked.","The Demon Sealer lowered his head and replied in a shameful voice, \"No... I simply assumed they had given up on being Demon Sealers, since anyone is free to join or leave whenever they wish.\"","The Demon Sealing Clan was more akin to a volunteer organization, its members consisting mostly of people who willingly chose to fight demons. Although recruitment did occur occasionally, it was exceedingly rare.","However, even outside of this situation, people disappearing or dying was not uncommon. Such incidents were not exclusive to the Demon Sealing Clan and occurred throughout the world all the time—especially within sects, where death was practically an everyday occurrence.","\"I won’t blame you for failing to investigate,\" Yuan said as he shook his head, \"but had you exercised even a little diligence, perhaps you could have exposed Qian Chu before he became the leader of the Demon Sealing Clan and began slaughtering his own people behind the scenes.\"","\"I will also broaden all of your understanding today,\" he continued with a solemn expression. \"Demons... are actually capable of wielding Demon Sealing Aura.\"","\"...Huh?\"","The Demon Sealers’ eyes widened with shock and disbelief at the sudden revelation. Had those words come from anyone else, none of them would have believed it for even a moment. However, because it was the Divine Paragon speaking, not a single person questioned it and accepted it immediately.","\"Before I explain that, I should first reveal the truth behind the demons’ existence—where they came from, why they invaded us, and the current situation within the Demonic Realm.\"","Yuan’s gaze swept across the silent crowd before he continued, \"Today, I will reveal everything to you.\""]},{"number":2492,"title":"Chapter 2492: Revealing the Truth of the Demonic Realm","paragraphs":["Yuan took a deep breath before speaking, \"What you learn today will change your entire perspective of demons, and some might not even believe me because of how ridiculous it sounds. Unfortunately, everything I say from now on is the truth.\"","The Demon Sealers swallowed nervously after seeing the grave expression on Yuan’s face.","After a moment of silence, Yuan began, \"When demons first appeared, no one knew where they had come from, and most assumed they originated from the Starry Sky. In reality, however, they came from the Demonic Realm—a place long believed to have been ’created’ by the first demon, the Red Tyrant, as a sanctuary for demonkind.\"","\"Not only did the Red Tyrant not create the Demonic Realm, but their world has existed long before the Nine Heavens. As for the demons that came to our world... they did not come here by choice and were chased away from their own home.\"","The Demon Sealers’ eyes widened with surprise at this revelation, but they remained silent.","\"As you all probably know by now, I have been inside the Demonic Realm since my disappearance, and I have learned a lot about their kind and history while I was there. I thought I learned a lot about them during my first visit to the Demonic Realm, but it turns out that I was still a frog in a well and that I didn’t know them as much as I thought.\"","\"Anyway, within the Demonic Realm, there exist two kinds of demons. The first kind is the one all of you are familiar with—bloodthirsty, cruel, and heinous fiends that bathe themselves in the blood of innocents. They are the ones who enslaved our world during the Demonic Era, and they are the ones that must be annihilated.\"","\"Then there is the second kind of demons...\"","After a brief pause, Yuan continued, \"To be frank, I do not know how else to describe them aside from ’human,’ because aside from their demonic appearance, they are no different from us. These demons possess emotions, reason, and self-control just like humans do.\"","\"WHAT?!\"","Multiple people cried out in shock and disbelief upon hearing such a revelation.","However, Yuan ignored the commotion and continued, \"The first kind of demons are known as ’Forsaken’ within the Demonic Realm. They terrorize their own people just as they once terrorized us, which is why they are all captured and confined within a place similar to the Primordial Realm—forever imprisoned and separated from the rest of the population.\"","\"Quite frankly, Forsakens are not all that different from the criminals and monsters that we, as a normal and peaceful society, must deal with. No matter how many good apples there are, there will always be rotten ones who steal, murder, and commit all sorts of heinous acts.\"","Yuan sighed before continuing, \"In our world, those who commit crimes are either imprisoned or executed. However, the peaceful demons only truly have one option... imprisonment, since demons, especially powerful ones, are not so easy to kill.\"","\"Furthermore, any demon—regardless of how peaceful or righteous they may be—has a chance of turning into a Forsaken. It is somewhat akin to an incurable disease.\"","\"Although the Demonic Realm is vast—far larger than the Nine Heavens—their immortality has led to severe overpopulation and a shortage of resources. Because of this, they chose to send the Forsaken far away beyond their world... unknowingly sending them to ours.\"","Yuan paused briefly before continuing, \"Before my first visit to the Demonic Realm, they were completely unaware of our existence, just as we knew nothing about them.\"","\"I will now give you some time to digest this information before I continue,\" he said before falling silent.","\"There’s still more?!\" The Demon Sealers were bewildered.","Soon, they started chatting amongst themselves.","\"So demons are not that different from us...\"","\"Shit... what the hell are we supposed to do with this sort of information?\"","Someone raised their hand and asked, \"Divine Paragon, I have a question!\"","Yuan looked at the man and muttered, \"Who?\"","\"...Senior Tian! I have a question!\"","Yuan nodded with a smile, \"Ask away.\"","\"What is the... your purpose for telling us this information? It feels like you are trying to change our perception of their existence, as if there is a chance we might co-exist in the future.\"","\"Oh?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow, looking somewhat surprised by their question. \"How perceptive of you. What is your name?\"","\"This humble junior is named Zhou Yanfei, the current leader of the Demon Sealing Grotto! We are—\"","\"I am aware of the Demon Sealing Grotto,\" Yuan interrupted.","\"As for your question... I will get straight to the point. I cannot say what may or may not happen in the future, as I am no fortune teller. However, I do have a feeling that our interactions with the Demonic Realm will become far more frequent moving forward. After all, during my time trapped within the Demonic Realm, I met and spoke with their leaders personally.\"","Another Demon Sealer raised their hand and asked, \"Even if there are ’human-like’ demons, I don’t think it’s possible for us to coexist with them—especially after everything that has happened. And if ordinary demons can become Forsaken at any moment, wouldn’t that make them even more dangerous?\"","Yuan then said, \"Only time will tell whether or not we can truly accept them. As for the Forsaken... if they appear, then we simply slay them.\"","He paused briefly before continuing, \"After all, we already coexist with magical beasts, even though the vast majority of them lack intelligence and act purely on wild instinct—much like the Forsaken.\"","When Yuan compared the Forsaken to magical beasts, many of the people present could immediately see the resemblance.","However, while magical beasts had always existed within their world, demons were essentially foreign beings from another realm, making them far more difficult to accept.","\"If you need another reason to accept them...\" Yuan closed his eyes and took a deep breath before revealing the biggest revelation yet.","\"Demons... were originally humans.\""]},{"number":2493,"title":"Chapter 2493: The True Origin of Demons","paragraphs":["\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...Huh?\"","Everyone present wore expressions of bewilderment and disbelief as they struggled to process what Yuan had just revealed to them, and even Yan Hara stared at him with wide eyes.","Yuan cleared his throat and repeated, \"You heard me correctly. The demons from the Demonic Realm used to be human just like us, but after a certain incident that I will not delve into for reasons, they have all turned into the demonic beings they are today.\"","The Demon Sealers exchanged glances with one another, yet not a single person uttered a word, as they were all far too shocked by this revelation.","Eventually, someone nervously raised their hand and asked, \"S-Senior Tian... why won’t you explain something this important in greater detail? You can’t just drop such a massive revelation on us and leave it at that!\"","\"I also think so! If you’re going to tell us this, you might as well tell us everything! We can handle the truth!\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"This is not a matter of accepting the truth. I am not revealing it for a good reason.\"","Seeing the stubborn look on Yuan’s face, the Demon Sealers quickly gave up on learning more.","Some time later, Yuan continued, \"Now that I have revealed the truth about demons, allow me to tell you more about the Demonic Realm and their society.\"","\"The Demonic Realm is separated into three major regions. The Bone Atoll, Death Paradise, and Crimson Continent, with the vast majority of demons dwelling within the Crimson Continent.\"","\"Each region is ruled by its own ruler—the Supreme Ruler. If you want a comparison, they are akin to the Celestial Emperor, but there are three of them.\"","After revealing as much as he could about the Demonic Realm, Yuan asked everyone there, \"Do I have any questions?\"","\"...\"","After a long moment of silence, someone spoke up.","\"Um... What is going to happen now?\"","Yuan turned his head to the side to look at Yan Hara.","\"What are you referring to?\"","\"The Demonic Realm... and the Forsakens that are still running rampant in our world. Are you going to reseal the Demonic Realm?\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"I will replace the seal on the Demonic Realm for now—at least until the entire world knows the truth about them. As for the Forsakens still in our world... I will hunt each and every single one of them until there is none left.\"","After a brief pause, he continued, \"That said, I will not be hunting them personally. During my time in the Demonic Realm, I have made some unexpected friends, and they will be the ones to hunt them.\"","\"D-Demons...?\" someone asked in a nervous voice.","Yuan looked directly into his eyes and calmly replied, \"Yes.\"","Multiple audible gulps echoed throughout the area as the Demon Sealers swallowed nervously at his response. None of them could have ever imagined that the Divine Paragon—the very person most obsessed with slaying demons—would one day befriend them instead.","Even if these demons were different from Forsakens, it was still shocking.","\"Can they be trusted?\" another questioned in a stiff voice.","\"I trust them, but if they harm even a single innocent human, I will personally slay them,\" Yuan replied in a cold voice.","\"W-Where are they right now?\"","\"They are already working hard to clean up the Forsaken in our world.\"","\"Already...?\"","After a few more questions, Yan Hara spoke again, \"What about the Demon Sealing Clan? Will you return to being our leader?\"","The entire Grand Library instantly fell silent as everyone turned to stare at Yuan with anticipation written all over their faces, clearly hoping he would lead them once more and allow them to experience what it was like serving under a living legend.","However, Yuan sneered disdainfully and said, \"Why the hell would I take on something so troublesome?\"","\"Eh?\"","Yan Hara and many others stared at him in shock, clearly caught off guard by his unexpected response.","\"Even back then, I never wanted to become the leader of the Demon Sealing Clan. That position was practically forced onto me by the other Demon Sealers. Although I have returned, my era is long gone. If anyone is going to be the leader, it should be you, who fought with your life on the line.\"","\"B-But...\"","\"There is no but,\" Yuan interrupted. \"Not only have you received my legacy, but you are more than qualified to lead the Demon Sealing Clan with your skills.\"","\"...\"","Yan Hara turned to look at the crowd, uncertain whether they would truly accept her as their leader while the Divine Paragon himself was sitting right beside her.","\"To the new leader of the Demon Sealing Clan, Yan Hara!\" someone suddenly shouted, triggering an immediate chain reaction throughout the crowd.","\"Leader Yan! Leader Yan! Leader Yan!\"","Tears streamed down Yan Hara’s cheeks as the majority of the Demon Sealers present began chanting her name.","Of course, there were still a few who opposed her—mostly those who had once supported Qian Chu.","Suddenly, Yuan slightly raised his hand.","In an instant, the entire crowd fell deathly silent.","\"I wanted to deal with this at the beginning, but I somehow forgot.\"","He slowly swept his gaze across the crowd before speaking in a cold voice, \"Those of you who are not true Demon Sealers and are merely on Qian Chu’s payroll—or his spies—I’ll give you five seconds to get the hell out.\"","\"If you leave of your own accord, I will pretend you never existed. However, if you continue contaminating this sanctuary with your presence, I will personally seal you for a thousand years...\"","A chilling smile appeared on Yuan’s face as he continued, \"...if I don’t forget about you and leave you sealed for eternity.\"","Almost everyone present felt a chill run down their spine after hearing those words.","Even though it was common knowledge that Demon Sealing Aura only worked on demons, not a single person there doubted Yuan’s threat for even a moment.","\"Your timer starts now...\""]},{"number":2494,"title":"Chapter 2494: Dealing With Qian Chu’s Spies","paragraphs":["\"Five...\"","The moment Yuan began counting down, several individuals within the crowd immediately started scrambling toward the exits, shoving their way through the others in panic.","\"Four...\"","Seeing this, even more people hurriedly followed after them.","\"Three...\"","By the time Yuan reached three, over a hundred Demon Sealers had run out of the Grand Library.","\"Two...\"","\"One...\"","As Yuan finished the countdown, everyone present swallowed nervously and waited in tense silence, eager to see what he would do next—and how exactly he intended to distinguish the spies from the genuine Demon Sealers.","Without any warning, Yuan activated Swords of Eternal Torment, causing around seventy swords to materialize high above the crowd.","Before the people present could even fully raise their heads to look at them, the swords suddenly descended, shooting toward specific individuals within the crowd.","The swords caused no pain despite piercing deep into their bodies. However, their bodies rapidly began to turn to stone, the petrification spreading so quickly that they could not even scream or utter a single word before becoming stone statues.","The Demon Sealers trembled in fear as they witnessed humans being sealed for the very first time, and they slowly turned to look at Yuan, as though expecting an explanation from him.","However, Yuan offered none. Instead, he coldly commanded, \"Move them somewhere far from my sight.\"","Those standing near the sealed spies immediately began dragging them away, moving almost entirely on instinct.","A few moments later, Yuan continued, \"Although Demon Sealing Aura is not particularly effective against humans, that does not mean we are completely immune to it. And as you all just witnessed, if the Demon Sealing Aura is powerful enough, it can even seal humans.\"","\"With that being said, unless you are me, you won’t be able to seal anyone.\"","\"...\"","After another brief moment of silence, Yuan turned to Yan Hara and asked, \"I heard I’ve received several invitations?\"","She nodded and replied, \"After news of your return spread, countless people and organizations throughout the Nine Heavens sent invitations requesting you to visit them. They claim they wish to personally thank you for everything you did in the past. Are you going to respond to them?\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding with a faint smile, \"Sure, let’s give them a response.\"","\"Who do you wish to reply to? Even the Celestial Emperor has sent an invitation,\" Yan Hara said.","The smile on Yuan’s face widened slightly as he replied, \"Instead of responding to just one of them, why not answer all of them at once? In the end, they all want to meet me, don’t they?\"","He leaned back in his chair before continuing, \"Then let’s do exactly that. Spread the word throughout the Nine Heavens that I will be hosting a banquet, and anyone who wishes to attend may come.\"","Yan Hara’s jaw dropped at his words, and she hastily asked, \"W-Where and when should we hold this banquet? With the Stairway to Heaven gone, it’ll be difficult for everyone to arrive.\"","Yuan stood up and said, \"I’ll leave everything to you, Leader of the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","Then, he stepped off the platform and began walking toward the exit.","\"I have somewhere I need to go. I’ll return in a few weeks.\"","The Demon Sealers silently watched Yuan’s departing figure. However, just as he reached the doorway, he suddenly stopped and spoke once more without turning around.","\"Oh, right. For the time being, refrain from revealing what I told you all today to the public. It will be far more believable coming from me, and I intend to announce everything during the banquet.\"","With that said, Yuan left the Grand Library.","Everyone present slowly turned to look at Yan Hara, who remained standing atop the platform with a stunned expression on her face.","After taking a moment to gather her thoughts and calm her emotions, Yan Hara cleared her throat before speaking aloud, \"Although I may still be inexperienced, I will do my utmost to fulfill my role as the Leader of the Demon Sealing Clan. So... please bear with me for the time being.\"","\"Hahaha! What are you talking about, Senior Yan? We’re the ones who’ll be troubling you from now on!\" Zhou Yanfei suddenly burst into laughter.","\"Since we’re all gathered here already, I might as well announce this right now. Listen well, everyone! Starting today, the Demon Sealing Grotto will officially disband and reintegrate into the Demon Sealing Clan once again!\"","The Demon Sealing Grotto’s Demon Sealers cheered loudly to declare their support.","Yan Hara then spoke with a determined look on her face, \"Although the Divine Paragon has returned, that does not mean we can afford to become complacent. Not only are there still demons lurking out there, but demon worshippers continue to run rampant as well.\"","She raised her voice with renewed resolve, \"So let’s get back to work and show the Divine Paragon that we are not useless!\"","The entire Grand Library rumbled as the Demon Sealers roared in unison, their voices filled with excitement, passion, and newfound resolve.","Shortly afterward, the Demon Sealers departed from the Grand Library and returned to their respective realms to continue their duties.","Meanwhile, Yan Hara responded to every individual and organization that had sent Yuan an invitation, informing them about the banquet he intended to host.","\"This Divine Paragon is more arrogant and daring than I expected...\" the Celestial Emperor muttered after receiving the response.","\"Are you going to personally attend?\" someone asked.","\"I’ll think about it.\"","While Yan Hara did not mention a date for the banquet, almost everyone started preparing for it.","Meanwhile, after leaving the Grand Library, Yuan went to meet with Lev and the others, who had been waiting for him at a specific location.","\"Y-Yuan! What have you done?!\"","A tall and muscular man confronted Yuan the moment he arrived.","\"Relax, Kelan. I’ve already explained the situation to Senior Bai.\"","Since he was in the Seventh Heaven, he decided to send Lev and the others to the Super Perfect Physique Tempering Sect."]},{"number":2495,"title":"Chapter 2495: Change of Plans","paragraphs":["Kelan rubbed his eyes in frustration for a moment before speaking, \"I’m glad you spoke with Senior Bai, but that doesn’t change the situation. Do you even realize how much trouble you’re in right now?\"","\"I don’t.\" Yuan calmly shook his head.","\"Then listen carefully! Almost everyone within the faction blames you for what happened to our karma, so nearly everyone who isn’t on Celestial Overlord Xu’s side is hunting you down right now!\"","\"Is that so?\"","Despite being hunted by one of the most powerful factions in the Nine Heavens, Yuan showed neither surprise nor fear, appearing unnaturally nonchalant about the entire situation.","\"I don’t know if you’re just pretending not to care or if you’re genuinely that fearless, but your actions don’t only affect you—they also affect Celestial Overlord Xu and everyone who supports her—\"","\"I am aware, and I will fix it as soon as possible.\"","\"And how are you going to do that?\"","\"...\"","Yuan remained silent, causing Kelan to frown.","A moment later, realizing that Yuan had no intention of explaining himself, Kelan released a helpless sigh.","\"I am eternally grateful to you for giving me the Great Mammoth Body Refinement Technique, so I sincerely hope you’ll be able to resolve this situation somehow. For now, I’ll just continue to trust you and see how things turn out.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Thanks.\"","\"Anyways, your friends are waiting for you at your old residence.\"","\"...\"","\"What?\" Kelan asked when Yuan stared at him in silence.","\"You’re not going to ask any questions about them?\"","A grin suddenly appeared on Kelan’s face as he replied, \"What kind of questions? Even if they’re your new lovers, it is none of my business. That being said, do Meixiu and the others know about them?\"","Yuan shook his head and sighed, \"They’re not my lovers. I mean, aren’t you going to question why I have demons following me around?\"","\"What did you just say?\"","The grin on Kelan’s face immediately disappeared when he heard the word ’demon’.","Yuan raised an eyebrow and questioned in a somewhat awkward voice, \"You... didn’t know? Did you not see their appearance?\"","\"I did! But they didn’t look like demons to me! Aren’t demons supposed to have red skin?!\"","Kelan continued in disbelief, \"That group’s skin was as pale as a sheet of paper! Sure, I suspected they weren’t human, but I never would’ve thought they were demons!\"","\"Not all demons have red skin,\" Yuan explained. \"Anyways, they are demons, but don’t worry—they’re friendly.\"","\"Demons? Friendly?\" Kelan stared at him with a strange look on his face. \"That’s quite the absurd thing to say, even coming from you.\"","\"It may sound absurd now, but soon, you’ll understand.\"","\"This isn’t a matter of understanding...\" Kelan said with a worried expression. \"Didn’t you hear? The Divine Paragon—the founder of the Demon Sealing Clan and a lunatic who devoted his life to hunting demons—has returned after being missing for millions of years. If he discovers that you’re working with demons, this definitely won’t end well for you...\"","\"Worst-case scenario, you’ll be branded as a traitor to humanity.\"","Yuan burst out laughing, dumbfounding Kelan.","\"The Divine Paragon won’t come after me,\" he said in a confident voice. \"Once again, you’ll understand it soon enough.\"","\"We can continue chatting later. I need to speak with my friends now.\"","Without another word, Yuan flew away, leaving Kelan behind with a dazed look on his face.","\"That crazy bastard...\" Kelan sighed in a low voice.","Meanwhile, inside the residence Yuan had stayed at during his previous visit, Lev and the others had been waiting ever since leaving the Demonic Realm, guided by the Demon Annihilation Sword, which was capable of receiving Yuan’s instructions even from afar.","\"Master.\"","The Demon Annihilation Sword greeted Yuan at the door.","Once inside, Lev and the others greeted him.","\"About time. If you had been any slower, I would’ve explored the world on my own,\" Angela remarked.","Yuan looked at her and replied, \"Aren’t you an immortal who has lived for hundreds of billions of years? Yet you can’t sit still for a mere few days?\"","\"I can’t help it! I’ve just gotten my freedom back after so long, after all!\"","\"I understand her feelings,\" Selena said, joining in on the conversation.","Yuan sighed and said, \"Since you want to leave so badly, I will keep this short and get straight to the point.\"","\"I want the three of you to fulfill your duty and eradicate every single Forsaken in this world. Until that task is complete, you are not allowed to wander around and fully enjoy this world.\"","Yuan smiled faintly and added, \"So the faster you finish, the sooner you’ll be free to explore this world at your own pace.\"","\"It’s only a matter of cleaning up some trash. We’ll be done in no time,\" Helena said confidently.","\"How long do you think it’ll take?\" Yuan asked.","Selena answered, \"Over the past few days, I’ve searched for the Forsaken’s presence throughout this world and detected a total of around two hundred thousand, with seventy thousand, five hundred and twenty-one within this realm alone, most of them concentrated in the same region.\"","She paused briefly before continuing, \"If we take this seriously, I estimate it will take roughly two weeks—three at most—to eradicate them completely.\"","\"That fast?\" Yuan stared at her with a stunned expression.","Angela shrugged and said, \"Since this world is divided into nine separate realms and traveling between them takes time, most of that time will be spent on that alone. Otherwise, wiping them out would only take us a single day.\"","\"Quite frankly, I expected it would take at least a few years. However, if it’ll only take a month at most, I’ll have to push my schedule up a bit, perhaps even change it entirely.\"","After pondering for a moment, Yuan asked, \"Are you capable of controlling the Forsaken?\"","\"We are.\"","They nodded.","A profound smile tugged at Yuan’s lips upon hearing this, and he quickly said, \"Change of plans. Rather than killing all of them, I want you to round them up for me.\""]},{"number":2496,"title":"Chapter 2496: Pseudo Eternal","paragraphs":["\"Round them up? So you want us to capture them?\" Selena asked with a raised eyebrow.","\"No. I want the three of you to become their new leaders.\"","\"Does that mean you no longer intend to kill them?\" Angela then asked.","\"Of course not,\" Yuan replied calmly. \"They will definitely die eventually, but before that, I want them to actually serve some purpose.\"","He then added, \"Once you’ve gathered all of them together, wait for my instructions.\"","The Transcendents exchanged glances with one another. Although capturing the Forsaken would undoubtedly be far more troublesome than simply slaughtering them outright, they could not care less about the extra effort.","As long as it allowed them to explore this new world and truly enjoy their newfound freedom, they were willing to do it.","\"Is there anything else before we begin?\" Angela asked.","\"Oh, right.\" Yuan suddenly recalled something. \"Among those demons should be a homunculus. Don’t touch him.\"","A faint smile appeared on his face as he continued, \"He intends to summon an ’Ancient,’ and I want to see how exactly he plans on accomplishing that.\"","\"Summoning one of us?\" Helena muttered in a puzzled voice, hearing about such a thing for the first time.","She then shook her head and said, \"That’s impossible. Especially for something like a mere homunculus.\"","\"Whether he is capable or not doesn’t matter. I just want to see what he does. Besides that, avoid contact with other humans and try not to reveal your cultivation, as the realm of Absolute God doesn’t exist in this world yet.\"","They silently nodded in acknowledgment.","Shortly afterward, the three Transcendents departed to carry out their duties.","Yuan then turned to look at Lev and the other individual beside him.","\"What should I do?\" Lev asked.","\"Quite frankly, I’m not sure,\" Yuan admitted. \"At first, I intended to have you assist with the cleanup, but that no longer seems necessary.\"","\"If you’d like, you can explore this world for the time being.\"","While Lev wasn’t as excited to explore the Nine Heavens, it didn’t mean he had no interest in it.","\"In that case, I’ll take a look around until you need me.\"","\"What about me?\" another voice asked.","Yuan turned to look at the crimson-haired beauty standing before him and said, \"The same applies to you, Dena.\"","Right before they departed from the Demonic Realm, Dena had emerged from her seclusion and successfully ascended, becoming a Transcendent herself.","\"I want your blood,\" she said.","\"Even though you’re now a Transcendent?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows in surprise.","\"What does that have to do with me wanting your blood? You promised to give it to me after I finish my ascension. Moreover, I might become even stronger afterward.\"","\"Are you sure...?\" he asked again.","\"Save your breath. My answer will remain the same no matter how many times you ask.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan released a defeated sigh and said, \"Very well.\"","He then opened a wound on his palm and gathered enough blood to make a fist-sized sphere before offering it to Dena.","\"Whenever you are ready.\"","Dena closed her eyes and spread her arms wide in a welcoming manner.","\"Ready,\" she mumbled softly.","Upon hearing her confirmation, Yuan gestured toward her, causing the sphere of blood to surge forward and penetrate her skin before flowing directly into her veins.","Dena accepted the blood without flinching or making a sound, quietly savoring the strange sensation of foreign blood flowing through her veins for the very first time.","Although it might not seem particularly significant at first glance, this moment marked the very first time in history that a Supreme Ruler had willingly accepted another person’s blood in such a manner.","Furthermore, Dena was not just any Supreme Ruler, but the strongest one in history.","Suddenly, Dena spoke in a strained voice, \"It’s not enough... I need more blood!\"","Even though he had already given her several times more blood than he’d given Lev and the others, Yuan did not hesitate for even a moment and continued pouring more of his blood into her body.","\"N-Not enough! No matter how much blood I absorb, it still feels like something is missing!\" Dena shouted in frustration.","’Something is missing...?’","Yuan frowned slightly, not immediately understanding what she meant.","Then, Yuan began carefully examining her body to determine what exactly was happening within her.","’This is...’","A hint of surprise appeared in Yuan’s eyes when he discovered something inside her body that had not existed before.","’Did this appear after her ascension?’ he wondered inwardly.","Although Yuan was not entirely certain what it was, the discovery helped him understand what Dena meant by something being ’missing’.","Without any hesitation, he immediately began infusing Eternal Essence into the blood he was feeding her.","Almost immediately, Dena began reacting to it.","The mysterious thing within Dena’s body began absorbing Yuan’s Eternal Essence, steadily filling itself with the energy.","Once it became completely saturated, it suddenly transformed, branching out into vein-like structures that intertwined with her existing veins and heart without fully merging with them.","<’Supreme Ruler Dena’ has accepted your blood!>","<You have turned ’Supreme Ruler Dena’ into your Demonic Servant!>","\"How do you feel?\" Yuan asked afterward.","However, Dena did not respond. She merely stood there with her eyes closed, motionless and silent, as though she had suddenly fallen asleep.","Suddenly—","<Congratulations! You have successfully created a Pseudo Eternal!>","\"A what?\" Yuan’s eyes widened at the notification before him.","Dena slowly opened her eyes the next moment.","As she took a deep breath, Yuan immediately sensed a faint trace of Eternal Essence exuding from her body.","’No way...’","\"This feeling coursing through my body...\" Dena mumbled. \"It feels exactly the same as that thing I consumed in the past...\"","\"...\"","Yuan stared at her with a dumbfounded expression, wondering what exactly differentiated a Pseudo Eternal from an incomplete one.","Dena raised her arm and stared at her hand with a curious expression before suddenly releasing Eternal Essence from her palm.","Seeing this, Yuan’s expression changed drastically, and he hurriedly shouted, \"Stop!\""]},{"number":2497,"title":"Chapter 2497: Pseudo Eternal(2)","paragraphs":["\"?!?!\" Dena was taken by surprise when Yuan abruptly grabbed her hand, stopping her from using Eternal Essence.","\"This isn’t a power that you should wield within the Nine Heavens,\" Yuan quickly explained.","\"Why not—\"","Just as Dena opened her mouth to inquire more details, she suddenly felt a painful sensation course through her body, as if assaulted by an invisible power.","\"Cough!\"","She coughed up a mouthful of blood the following moment.","\"What just happened...?\" She stared at the bloodied floor with a dazed look on her face.","Seeing this, Yuan released a helpless sigh before explaining, \"To keep things simple, this world is protected by an otherworldly force known as the ’Absolute Power.’ Within its influence, Eternal Essence—the power you just used—cannot be freely wielded without paying a tremendous price.\"","He narrowed his eyes and continued, \"Even godly beings such as the Demon God are powerless before it.\"","\"Even the Demon God...?\" Dena swallowed nervously as she wiped the blood from her lips, her pupils trembling at the thought of such a mysterious and unfathomable power.","\"But to be honest, that’s not why I stopped you,\" Yuan admitted. \"Since Eternal Essence is incredibly powerful, I was worried you might accidentally blow this place apart.\"","He then looked at her with a puzzled expression and added, \"In fact, I didn’t expect the Absolute Power to affect you at all.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Dena asked with her head tilted.","\"I thought the Absolute Power only affected Eternals since I can wield Eternal Essence within the Nine Heavens without any issue,\" he said. \"Perhaps it’s because you’re now a Pseudo Eternal.\"","\"Pseudo Eternal? Me?\" Dena pointed at herself with a dumbfounded face.","Yuan nodded and explained, \"I’m not sure how, but after accepting my blood, you became one.\"","Dena pondered for a moment before responding, \"Maybe it has something to do with that thing I consumed.\"","\"Are you injured?\" Yuan then asked.","\"No, I am fine.\"","\"Fortunately, you didn’t use much Eternal Essence.\"","\"But I didn’t even use that much... In fact, I barely used it.\"","\"That’s why you got off easy with a warning.\"","After a brief moment of silence, Dena spoke again, a hint of curiosity in her voice, \"What is its purpose? What is it trying to protect?\"","Yuan shrugged and replied, \"I’d like to know as well. All I know is that it was left behind by the most powerful existence to ever exist—the Absolute Being—and that countless Eternals are attempting to obtain it.\"","\"You can obtain it?\" Dena’s eyes widened upon hearing this new information.","\"That’s what I’ve been told,\" Yuan replied. \"Although nobody has actually seen it before, since it’s completely invisible.\"","\"What’s the benefit of acquiring it?\"","\"Again, from what I’ve heard, you become the most powerful being in the universe.\"","\"...\"","After another moment of silence, an excited smile tugged at Dena’s lips.","\"I know what I want to do now,\" she said.","Yuan rubbed his eyes and sighed out loud, \"Don’t tell me you want to look for the Absolute Power...\"","\"Is it that obvious?\"","\"I can understand why Eternals would seek to obtain it... But you?\" Yuan looked at her with a puzzled expression. \"What would you even do with that much power?\"","\"I don’t know,\" Dena replied calmly. \"Nor do I need a reason to pursue it. Ever since my birth, I’ve always strived for greater power. I suppose it’s simply in my nature to seek strength.\"","A faint smile appeared on her face as he continued, \"And what better goal is there than becoming the most powerful being in the universe?\"","Yuan wanted to convince her otherwise, but he knew Dena better than anyone out there. Once she set her mind on something, changing it was nearly impossible.","Moreover, after thinking about it for a moment, he realized it was not necessarily a bad thing. Not only would it keep her occupied, but there was even a chance she might actually find it.","Yuan then turned to Lev and asked, \"Do you want to accompany her? It would ease my worries a little if the two of you traveled together, considering you’re both still unfamiliar with this world.\"","Lev immediately nodded his head and said, \"Yes, I can go with her. I would also feel much safer with someone as powerful as her by my side.\"","\"Good. Then it’s decided. The two of you can search for the Absolute Power, and while you’re at it, explore this world.\"","\"Do you have any clues for us?\" Lev then asked.","\"Nope,\" Yuan replied without hesitation. \"The Absolute Power is completely invisible to both senses and treasures, so you’d basically be searching for a ghost.\"","He then added, \"The only thing I can tell you is that it won’t be located within an artificial world and that it’s somewhere within this world.\"","\"Then how are we supposed to know if we come across it?\" Dena asked.","\"Beats me.\" Yuan simply shrugged.","\"Are you messing with me?\" Dena frowned, suspecting that he was being deliberately unhelpful because he disapproved of her decision to search for it.","\"There’s a reason nobody has managed to find it yet. If it were that easy, the Eternals would have already obtained it long ago,\" Yuan said with a sigh.","\"That being said, the Absolute Power possesses the ability to weaken the influence of Eternals. Since you’re now a Pseudo Eternal yourself, there’s a chance you might sense something if you get close to it.\"","\"Is that so...\"","\"Before you go... remember the rules I gave Selena and the others? They also apply to you two, so don’t go around picking fights with people.\"","\"What if someone picks a fight with us?\" Dena asked with a serious expression.","\"The vast majority of people in this world haven’t even lived for a million years. Compared to you, they’re basically infants,\" Yuan replied calmly. \"So try your best to ignore them.\"","After a brief pause, he added, \"And if they refuse to be ignored... then do what you think is right... without blowing things out of proportion.\""]},{"number":2498,"title":"Chapter 2498: Yan Hara’s Question","paragraphs":["\"I understand. I will try my best not to kill anyone,\" Dena said with a nonchalant expression.","Yuan then turned to Lev and smiled, \"I know you’ll probably be too intimidated to stop her, but since you’re the more reasonable one, I expect you to talk some sense into her if she starts going overboard.\"","\"I... will try,\" Lev responded after swallowing nervously.","Some time later, Lev and Dena left together.","\"Looks like I am alone once again...\" Yuan muttered with a smile.","\"What about me?\" A voice suddenly resounded.","Yuan turned to look at the Demon Annihilation Sword and fell silent for a moment.","Then, he asked, \"Can you return to your sword form? Or is that human form permanent?\"","In response to his question, the Demon Annihilation Sword suddenly started glowing throughout her body, and in the next moment, reverted back to her sword form.","\"That’s good—\"","Before Yuan could even finish his sentence, the Demon Annihilation Sword immediately transformed again, returning to her human form.","\"I like this form better,\" she said.","\"...\"","Yuan fell silent. It wasn’t that he disliked her walking around in a human form. The real issue was her appearance, as she had taken on the form of Ai Rong—Tian Chenyu’s childhood sweetheart.","\"I don’t mind if you want to remain in that form, but can you change your appearance?\"","\"Why?\" she asked while tilting her head, looking genuinely confused by his request.","After all, she had taken on the appearance of the person most precious to him—to Tian Chenyu—so she could not comprehend why he would want her to abandon it.","\"Because that appearance belongs to someone else, and you are not that person,\" Yuan explained calmly. \"Since you possess a will of your own, you should take on an appearance that you personally like instead.\"","\"...\"","Admittedly, the Demon Annihilation Sword could not fully understand Yuan’s logic. However, when she noticed the faint trace of pain hidden within his eyes, she felt an unfamiliar sensation stir within her heart.","Then, without a word, she changed her appearance. However, since she didn’t know what sort of appearance she liked, she decided to just revert to her sword form to save herself the trouble.","Seeing this, Yuan immediately felt a little guilty since it wasn’t as though the Demon Annihilation Sword was purposefully taunting him with Ai Rong’s appearance, and he knew that she’d done it to please him.","’Ai Rong... where are you now?’ Yuan sighed inwardly.","He had already reunited with the reincarnations of several lovers from his past lives, yet he still had not encountered Ai Rong. This made him wonder whether she was still somewhere out there... or if something else had happened to her entirely.","After a moment of silence, Yuan spoke again, \"After giving it some thought, I suppose it won’t hurt if you continue using that appearance for a little while longer—at least until you become more familiar with humans and discover your own preferences.\"","The Demon Annihilation Sword immediately returned to her human form and then asked, \"What about you? I can tell that you feel pain whenever you look at me.\"","Although she did not say it outright, she had long noticed that Yuan had been deliberately avoiding looking directly at her ever since she first assumed Ai Rong’s appearance.","\"Sure, it’s a little painful,\" Yuan admitted. \"But that’s because I haven’t seen that face for so long. I’ll quickly get over it.\"","\"Anyways, you can remain in that appearance for now. End of discussion.\"","The Demon Annihilation Sword quietly nodded.","Some time later, Yuan left the building and met up with Kelan again.","\"I’ll be leaving now.\"","\"What about your friends?\"","\"They’ve also left.\"","\"I see. What are you going to do now? Visit the others?\"","\"I will... after I am done with my current business.\"","\"Alright.\"","\"By the way, I met your sister.\" Yuan suddenly remarked.","\"Which one?\"","\"You have multiple?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"Four... since I last visited. It’s been a long time since I visited my family, so I might have more now,\" he sighed.","\"Is that so? I met Keling, Meixiu’s master.\"","\"I figured. What did you talk about?\"","\"Nothing much. I did give her a few techniques as a thank-you for training Meixiu. That’s about it,\" he said, not mentioning their spar.","\"D-Did you give her ’that’ technique?\" Kelan swallowed nervously.","\"What technique?\" Yuan asked, playing dumb.","\"You know what I mean!\" Kelan cried out loud.","\"Who knows?\" he shrugged.","\"Y-You...!\" Kelan was speechless.","\"Anyway, I have to leave now. See ya later.\"","Before Kelan could say anything else, Yuan vanished into thin air like a ghost.","\"Void Manipulation!\" Kelan exclaimed. \"And to such a terrifying degree! Just how much stronger has he grown since our spar?\"","After leaving the Super Perfect Physique Tempering Sect, Yuan returned to the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library to look for Yan Hara.","Inside her private office, Yan Hara was busy dealing with the countless responsibilities that came with becoming the Leader of the Demon Sealing Clan.","\"That bastard Qian Chu! I can’t believe how much work he left behind for me!\" she cursed out loud while scratching her head.","Not only did she have to deal with Qian Chu’s unfinished work, but she also had to deal with the Demon Sealing Grotto’s businesses now that they had combined, as well as Yuan’s banquet.","\"I don’t think I have ever seen you so busy.\"","A familiar voice suddenly resounded, halting Yan Hara’s thoughts.","When she looked up, she saw Yuan walking into her office with a calm smile on his face.","\"Y—Senior Tian...\"","Yuan closed the door behind him and said, \"Just call me Yuan when we are alone.\"","\"Yuan...\"","After a moment of hesitation, Yan Hara asked, \"I have been wanting to ask you this ever since your return, so I will get straight to the point... Just what are you planning by coming back as the Divine Paragon? What about your current identity—your life as Yuan?\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan replied with a calm smile, \"There appears to be a misunderstanding here.\""]},{"number":2499,"title":"Chapter 2499: The Time and Location of the Banquet","paragraphs":["\"A misunderstanding?\" Yan Hara raised her eyebrows.","\"What is there to misunderstand?\" she sighed. \"Since you’ve come back as the Divine Paragon, you’ll have to live his identity starting now. Or do you think you’ll be able to switch between the Divine Paragon and Yuan like a switch whenever you want? It might work for some time, but sooner or later, you’ll be exposed.\"","\"So what if I am exposed? It’s not like I am pretending to be the Divine Paragon,\" Yuan calmly shrugged.","\"That being said...\"","He suddenly approached Yan Hara and leaned toward her shoulder, whispering a few words directly into her ear.","At first, Yan Hara blushed from the warmth of his breath and the gentle closeness of his voice. However, the more she listened, the wider her eyes became, quickly filling with shock and disbelief after realizing what he was planning.","\"That’s insane!\" she exclaimed loudly.","Yuan said nothing and merely stood still with a profound smile on his face.","\"Are you really going to...?\" Yan Hara asked in a saddened voice.","He nodded, remaining silent.","After another moment of silence, Yan Hara sighed again before speaking, \"Let’s talk about your banquet. I have notified everyone about it. The only issue right now is the venue and time. As I’d already mentioned, without the Stairway to Heaven, gathering everyone will be difficult, unless we host the banquet in the Grand Library. As for the time... this is something you must decide since I don’t know when you’ll be available.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"The banquet will happen two months from now in the Seventh Heaven... right beside the Demonic Realm.\"","\"What...?\"","Yan Hara’s jaw dropped, her eyes widened with disbelief.","\"If I am going to tell everyone about the Demonic Realm, we might as well do so right beside it, right? As for the Stairway to Heaven... it will return by then, so everyone will be able to make it there. More people will be able to show up in the Seventh Heaven than the Ninth Heaven, too.\"","Yan Hara then said, \"Then we’ll need to start working on creating the venue. Fortunately, there’s plenty of space over there. As for the size... I guess I’ll just make it as big as I can make it in two months.\"","\"Thanks for helping me out.\"","\"Don’t mention it. You’re busy, right?\"","He nodded with a smile.","\"What are your plans until the banquet?\"","\"Bringing the Stairway to Heaven back.\"","Yan Hara raised her eyebrows.","\"Bring it back? How? Nobody even knows where it disappeared to, unless...\"","She rubbed her eyes and sighed, \"Of course you do. Why did I even bother asking?\"","Yuan chuckled at her reaction and revealed, \"I own the Stairway to Heaven, after all.\"","\"Huh? Since when?\"","\"Since its creation,\" he calmly replied.","\"Wait... that would mean...\" Yan Hara’s eyes widened again with shock.","However, Yuan didn’t elaborate this time and turned around, walking to the exit.","\"I’ll see you in two months, Leader Yan!\"","Before Yan Hara could reply, Yuan walked out of the room, leaving her utterly speechless.","\"He’s also the creator of the Stairway to Heaven...?\" Yan Hara muttered to herself long after Yuan left.","Meanwhile, after leaving the Demon Sealing Clan’s Grand Library, Yuan went to look for the Stairway to Heaven.","However, there was one issue. Although he knew where it was located, he didn’t know how to access it. After all, this was the first time the Stairway to Heaven had used this defensive mechanism.","A few moments later, Yuan retrieved Number One Under Heaven and spoke to it.","\"Zi Xuan, you should be awake by now, right?\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"Zi Xuan? Are you angry?\" he asked with a stiff smile.","\"What gave you such an impression?\" Zi Xuan finally responded.","\"Because... I haven’t been using you recently?\"","\"Not just that, but you’ve been cheating on me with another sword!\"","Zi Xuan suddenly materialized in her spirit form and pointed at the Demon Annihilation Sword.","\"Who is that?!\"","Since the Demon Annihilation Sword had disappeared alongside Tian Chenyu, none of Yuan’s later incarnations had ever wielded it. As a result, Zi Xuan had never heard of its existence before.","\"This is the sword wielded by Tian Chenyu, who existed before Tian Qiyuan...\" Yuan quickly explained.","\"That doesn’t explain why you’re using her instead of me!\"","Yuan sighed and said, \"You know the reason very well. I have been in the Demonic Realm, and she’s literally a demon-sealing sword. It was far more effective to use her in such a situation. Moreover, I wanted you to rest properly.\"","He continued, \"Now that we’ve returned to the Nine Heavens, I will start using you again.\"","\"What about me?\" the Demon Annihilation Sword suddenly asked. \"Am I going to become useless now that we’re no longer in the Demonic Realm?\"","\"That’s...\" Yuan hesitated for a moment before continuing in an awkward tone, \"I wouldn’t call you useless... but once all the demons in this world have been dealt with, your purpose will technically be fulfilled.\"","Even as he said those words, Yuan felt unsure how to explain it without sounding like a complete asshole.","\"Of course, that doesn’t mean you’ll become useless,\" Yuan quickly added. \"At the end of the day, as long as the Demonic Realm continues to exist, your presence will always be needed.\"","\"As for you...\" Yuan returned to Zi Xuan. \"You know where Tian Qiyuan’s personal world is, right? I still cannot remember, so I’ll need you to take me there.\"","\"Hmph,\" she coldly snorted, clearly still upset.","Yuan rubbed his eyes and said, \"If you don’t tell me, I won’t be able to upgrade you...\"","\"What did you just say?\" Zi Xuan’s ears immediately twitched the moment she heard a certain word.","She slowly turned to look at him with sparkling eyes, resembling a dog that had just heard its favorite word.","\"I said that I’m going to upgrade you,\" Yuan repeated as he retrieved a certain material from his spatial ring and showed it to her."]},{"number":2500,"title":"Chapter 2500: Returning to the Primordial Chaos(End of Divine Paragon’s Return Arc)","paragraphs":["Zi Xuan stared at the material in Yuan’s grasp with a dumbfounded look on her face.","\"I thought Number One Under Heaven was your perfect masterpiece. I cannot imagine it becoming any stronger than it already is—not to mention that you still haven’t fully unlocked all of its abilities.\"","A faint smile appeared on Yuan’s face as he replied, \"There is no such thing as true perfection. Although Number One Under Heaven was my greatest creation as Tian Qiyuan, at the end of the day, it is still merely a mortal treasure.\"","He then continued, \"Furthermore, after learning about Eternals and the treasures they created, I realized there was still an enormous amount of room for improvement. That being said, since I still haven’t learned their techniques, I can only do some slight upgrade for now.\"","\"Even if it’s just a little, I am already shivering with excitement,\" Zi Xuan remarked with a weird smile on her face.","\"So, where is Tian Qiyuan’s world?\"","\"It is located in the hottest place in the Nine Heavens—the Apocalyptic Chasm, which exists deep within the Primordial Chaos.\"","\"The Primordial Chaos again, huh?\" Yuan muttered, recalling when he went there to enter the Primordial Realm.","However, he’d only gone far enough to reach the Primordial Realm the last time, which was barely inside the Primordial Chaos.","\"Let’s head to the Primordial Chaos now,\" he said a moment later.","Meanwhile, word of the banquet started spreading again, this time with the time and location revealed.","\"The Divine Paragon’s banquet will be held in the Seventh Heaven beside the Demonic Realm in two months!\"","\"What? Beside the Demonic Realm? I know he’s the Divine Paragon, but that’s a little...\"","\"What is there to be afraid of? With the Divine Paragon present, no demon will even dare to get close, much less attack.\"","\"I am not worried about our safety... It just feels... like a weird location to have a banquet.\"","\"I think it’s the perfect location to celebrate the return of someone like the Divine Paragon, though.\"","\"How are we going to get to the Seventh Heaven, anyway? Even if we travel through the Starry Sky, we won’t make it there in time for the banquet.\"","\"I thought the Celestial Emperor was working to replace the Stairway to Heaven. Do you think it’ll be done in time for the banquet?\"","\"Only time will tell...\"","Somewhere in the Ninth Heaven...","\"You heard about the upcoming banquet, right? Are you going to attend?\" Keling asked Meixiu.","\"No,\" Meixiu responded without hesitation, shaking her head. \"I highly doubt Yuan is hosting a banquet just for the sake of it, and whatever he has planned, I do not want to become a burden.\"","\"Is that so? Then let’s continue our training.\"","A few days later, Yuan arrived at the entrance to the Primordial Chaos, a vast expanse resembling an enormous floating slab of rock suspended in the endless void.","\"Just like before, this place is filled to the brim with Chaotic Essence,\" Yuan muttered after examining the place, and the longer he looked, the more it reminded him of the Primal Expanse.","\"This place hasn’t changed one bit, huh?\" Zi Xuan remarked with a nostalgic look on her face.","She then looked at Yuan and continued with a smile, \"Did you know that this is where I earned most of the money I used to buy your swords back then? Since very few people dare to approach this place, it’s filled with treasures.\"","\"Not only that, but the magical beasts here are incredibly unique, and the materials from their bodies can sell for a fortune.\"","\"Still, it’s incredibly dangerous, and I would have several near-death encounters every time I came here.\"","\"Are you bragging right now?\" Yuan smiled.","Zi Xuan shook her head and said, \"If it weren’t for your swords fueling my desire to survive, I definitely wouldn’t have lasted long enough to become your Sword Spirit.\"","Some time later, they entered the Primordial Chaos.","\"The Primordial Chaos is divided into seven levels, and the deeper one goes, the more dangerous it becomes. Our destination—the Apocalyptic Chasm—is located within the fifth level,\" Zi Xuan explained.","\"Also, it’s highly advised not to use Void Manipulation while inside. The spatial distortions within the Primordial Chaos are extremely unstable, and you could easily end up being teleported somewhere you never intended to go.\"","\"Is there anything else I should be wary of?\" Yuan asked.","\"Well...\" Zi Xuan pondered for a moment before continuing, \"If you were an ordinary cultivator, I’d warn you to conserve your spiritual energy as much as possible, since it’s impossible to recover it naturally inside the Primordial Chaos, and even recovery pills have their effects drastically weakened here.\"","Sure enough, because of his unique physique and Chaotic Hearts, Yuan had no issue recovering his spiritual energy with the Chaotic Essence there.","Upon entering the first level of the Primordial Chaos, Yuan did not waste any time observing his surroundings and immediately flew straight toward the second level, completely ignoring the magical beasts chasing after him.","Even though he had only just entered the Primordial Chaos, the weakest magical beasts there were already at the first level of God Ascension.","Not wanting to waste time and energy fighting them, Yuan released a portion of his aura in an attempt to scare the magical beasts away.","However, they did not even flinch and continued chasing after him relentlessly.","\"The magical beasts here do not fear death. They’ve suppressed their instincts to such an extent that even their natural fear can be completely ignored,\" Zi Xuan explained.","\"What a pain in the ass...\" Yuan sighed aloud before casually cutting them down with Supreme Sword Aura, not even bothering to stop and collect their materials afterward.","However, it did not take long before even more magical beasts began chasing after him once again.","\"I’ll take care of them for you,\" Zi Xuan suddenly said. \"I need to prepare for my upgrade, after all.\""]}]);
